<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="PSA" style="id" />
  <para style="h">Meng Lai</para>
  <para style="toc1">Meng Lai</para>
  <para style="toc2">Meng Lai</para>
  <para style="mt1">Meng Lai</para>
  <para style="imt">Rik tekah mih laiklow</para>
  <para style="ip">Mami bowih rui miia dow akawmchow chekhai: David ruiah mih 73 buk, Asaf ruiah mih 12 buk, Kora kowh chauüa ruiah mih 10 klüng, Sawlawmawn ruiah mih 2 buk, Mosi ruiah mih 1, Ethan ruiah mih 1, Hemawn ruiah mih 1, now Ezra ruiah mih 1 chekhai. Nami klen kowi arui miia ming tukah dowi mih meng uowi 49 klüng tak chekhai. Mami bowih rui mih khin dow 1,400-400 BC takra kowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="ip">Meng Lai bowih kowi kowh arui uowi mih dow Thurai kiowri meng hai Thurai chup lawnguan kowi kowh meng chekhai. Mami bowih kowi kowh meng maten arui mih dow akawmchow chekhai. Mami bowih kowi kowh meng hai prasi lük laiklow dow alai hownia takua talawmra hai tatüng tasangra kowi Israeluüa tawngkengah reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mami bowih kowi kowh kawngmu meng dow Thurai kiow müa, Thurai rowsi müa, Thurai chup müa, prasi lük müa, khowng lük müa, lawt lük müa, lawngra lük müa, awmrawm lai tek müa hai ransu-uüa kowi naripah kown mih lük müa kowi kowh tawngah kengah kown mih meng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mami bowih kowi kowh prasi lük dow kowmatia vüi hai chenchap vüi kowi nowngia tawng chekhai. Mami bowih kowi kowh meng lai dow Sangbowk Laitawm Sar kowi Isu Krista paw tawngla khai. Now mami bowih dow Krista lang haw miuüa kowh Thurai chup müa dawngthawnguan uang chowng khai.</para>
  <para style="is">Auan tuk takla mih laiklow</para>
  <para style="ili">Süngdum: Süngdum pami dow sata dawnglang kowi kowh uowi mih süng chekhai. Naiawng mih süng dow aiukma paw ia uowi, now asowmchow mih paw ia uowi. Tawngbak mih dow naiawng mih süng kowi changla pren mih paw uowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="ili">Aprek: Aprek pami dow changta angak mih sung, tawita mata mih sung iaw mih hai ka ripra mih kowi kowh tekah mih chekhai.</para>
  <para style="ili">Arup aren: Arup aren pami dow changla thurai kownkow hua, singh, lawngha, kri, kuh hai tai hown kowh thawpah mih arup chekhai. Akeng kawngmu maru-uüa dow naiawng mih arup kowi changla thurai rakowi chupah iiaah reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="ili">Makowng nimkrüa: Makowng nimkrüa pami dow phih uang takhu hüah mih dawng kowi uowi mih khin kowi kowh tekah chekhai. Naiawng makowng nimkrüa kowi uowi mih dow nakowng ngengche kown mih anim khita hüah chekhai.</para>
  <para style="iot">Mami bowih dow 5 bak changah khai.</para>
  <para style="io1">Mami bowih kowi dow bowkbowk kowi meng uowi 150 klüng chekhai, now naiawngün meng maten kowi dow maiawng hai 5 bowih changah khai:</para>
  <para style="io2">Bowih 1 1:1-41:13</para>
  <para style="io2">Bowih 2 42:1-72:20</para>
  <para style="io2">Bowih 3 73:1-89:52</para>
  <para style="io2">Bowih 4 90:1-106:48</para>
  <para style="io2">Bowih 5 107:1-150:6</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="PSA 1" />
  <para style="ms">BOWIH 1</para>
  <para style="mr">(<ref loc="PSA 1-41">Meng Lai 1-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="s">Maru iung hai maru ngak kowh tiama</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 1:1" />Maiawng chowm uowi mih maru dow prasira uowima chekhai:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 1:1">aia dow maru ngakuüa prengia pek iawng chang dowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 1:1">maru ngakuüa tiama kowi mang dowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 1:1">
    <char style="w">prawngren</char> Thurai miuüa pu kowi tawi chowm dowi.<verse eid="PSA 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 1:2" />Naiawng lak-e CHAKRAMANG rirow chün mih kowi aia lang awmrawm reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 1:2">CHAKRAMANG rirow mih ni-ni uar-uar aia lang tuak reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 1:3" />Aia dow akhin towng uih reng mih hai aram keu now prua naklak dowi mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 1:3">aw pang kowi kowh chowkah mih singh iawng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 1:3">Aia dow lowra lup chang kowi phaw reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 1:4" />Nachenganchepaw maru ngakuüa dow naiawng nadowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 1:4">amatni dow li hown kowh rown mih chapli iawng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 1:5" />Naiawng rakowi tara chetra ni kowi maru ngakuüa dow khalat dowi tham,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 1:5">amatni dow Thurai kowi ringkaw miuüa thum kowi natawi ka uowi kown nadowi.<verse eid="PSA 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 1:6" />Thurai kowi ringkaw miuüa kowi dow CHAKRAMANG mingkhetah reng;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 1:6">tawkchedow maru ngakuüa kowh tiama dow amatni piakra chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 1:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="PSA 2" />
  <para style="s">Nümnapah mih mang chowm mang mih</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 2:1" />Tawngplawng kowchow chenchapuüa tuk kunmarau urlur khai?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 2:1">Tawngplawng kowchow mrawkra uowi dowi mih sangkrangra ngak enni tuk chang khai?<verse eid="PSA 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 2:2" />Lusa manguüa mih CHAKRAMANG hai aia nümnapah mih mang kowi kingküaah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 2:2">pren kruitown miuüa maten paw kukpa kukpa cham talawp talai khai.<verse eid="PSA 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 2:3" />Amatni tatek mih, “Chu, kowiüah kowh lawngha leng a-i raita pe bowt lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 2:3">kowiüah tawmla a-i mih leng a-i pratta bowt lah,” pakhai.<verse eid="PSA 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 2:4" />Nami khi hanow CHAKRAMANG dow aia mang chowm rah hownia iu renah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 2:4">aia dow amatni sangkrangta mih lawnguan kowi mukuang hownia iu changla rensi khai.<verse eid="PSA 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 2:5" />Aia dow amatni luk kowi mapaw sak-ih dowi rakowi naiu nangah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 2:5">maih iawng lün pluplup mih aia kowh kunmaraura hown nape takrow takraiah kown.<verse eid="PSA 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 2:6" />CHAKRAMANG natek kown mih, “Ang kowh mang kowi dow ang khowm bowkta khowk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 2:6">aia kowi dow ang kowh chimsaima mih Zaiawn hungh kowi ang towta khowk,” pakhai.<verse eid="PSA 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 2:7" />Nami mang natek kown mih, “CHAKRAMANG kamrütta khowk mih ang naphuang kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 2:7">aia tek ang mih, ‘Ang chapa chowbowt en; ani hownia now en pa chowbowt ang.<verse eid="PSA 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 2:8" />En nau mih sia ang tut-e lü diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 2:8">nahanow en nachangla dawngthawnguan kownkow chenchap maten ang nape en kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 2:8">palusama kowi kowh maru maten dow en low kowi ang nape uowiah bowk kown.<verse eid="PSA 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 2:9" />Amatni kowi dow lawngha klowk hown en nahupah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 2:9">amatni kowi dow bawn kawng teu iawng en nadita nak kown,’ pah ang khai,” pakhai.<verse eid="PSA 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 2:10" />Naiawng rakowi manguüa low, chanlaima hown uowiah büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 2:10">lusa kowi kowh kruitown miuüa low, uowiah kaneu büa diah.<verse eid="PSA 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 2:11" />Ringkawma hown CHAKRAMANG kowi chupiia büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 2:11">piaw chepaw sakdawng hownia aia kowi kramla büa diah.<verse eid="PSA 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 2:12" />CHAKRAMANG kowh chapa kowi ringkawah büa reng diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 2:12">nadowi now aia nasak-ih enni kown nadowi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 2:12">Now enni changah mih lup rakowi enni napiak kown chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 2:12">Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia dow linlanma nakunmarau enni chepaw naia kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 2:12">Nachenganchepaw aia tut-e tatung tanim mih maru dow prasira uowima chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 2:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="PSA 3" />
  <para style="s">Aw CHAKRAMANG, uang lawng ang diah</para>
  <para style="d">Aia chapa Absalawm hownia powt khe kowh mang David kowh meng.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 3:1" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, ang ransu-uüa kawm krang mü madiah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 3:1">kingküa ang mih maru mün khowt chow hu mih sam mü madiah.<verse eid="PSA 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 3:2" />Maru kawmuüa ang lawnguan kowi tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 3:2">“Aia kowi Thurai lawngah kown nadowi bowt,” pakhai. [Sela]<verse eid="PSA 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 3:3" />Nachenganchepaw aw CHAKRAMANG, en dow ang kowh kawngma chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 3:3">en pe awng ang hanow ringkawra dow en pe ang khai.<verse eid="PSA 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 3:4" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, atünma ang haw en khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 3:4">en kowh hungh chimsaima mih hownia en uang klang ang khai. [Sela]<verse eid="PSA 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 3:5" />Ang müi chepaw ang plan rü khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 3:5">Tawngplawng kowchow panow en khet ang reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 3:6" />Athawng aiawng mih ransu-uüa dow umta ang lut khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 3:6">Nachenganchepaw ang kramah dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 3:7" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, uang now uang lawng ang diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 3:7">ang ransu-uüa kowh kammow hown iüng dow uang letta pe diah.<verse eid="PSA 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 3:8" />Lawngra lup dow CHAKRAMANG kowh chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 3:8">en prasi dow en maru-uüa luk kowi pacham uang ting lah. [Sela]<verse eid="PSA 3:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="PSA 4" />
  <para style="s">Aw CHAKRAMANG, uang klang ang diah</para>
  <para style="d">Mami dow David kowh meng chekhai. Mami meng dow aiang uowi mih tünteu chang müa hown tekah kown mih chekhai.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 4:1" />Aw ang kowh tachi tanawmra CHAKRAMANG, ang haw en khe uang klang ang diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 4:1">en low iawng ang uowi pami en tüng ang reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 4:1">Ang kla phih khe en uang khowng ang khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 4:1">Saksing sana ang diah, now ang awr lü mih hawt sünta ang diah.<verse eid="PSA 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 4:2" />Aw lusa maru, mün ni tak chow enni ringkaw ang dowi kown?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 4:2">Mün ni tak chow dai lai kowi enni ngown hai nakrawi cham kown?<verse eid="PSA 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 4:3" />CHAKRAMANG mih aia kowi sakrau miuüa kowi aia vüi lang krata hüah khowk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 4:3">ang hawah hanow aia mih nasünta ang kown pami tukah büa reng diah.<verse eid="PSA 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 4:4" />Enni kunmarau chepaw hangkow changla angak büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 4:4">phangbek kowi mawk se ririmma paw tuak phülü diah.<verse eid="PSA 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 4:5" />Achinawmma mih saktuak hown chang phuchua büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 4:5">CHAKRAMANG luk kowi neplawng nesak reng büa diah.<verse eid="PSA 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 4:6" />Tawngbak mih maru tek mih, “Mia chow nowng pe anging iungra kown?” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 4:6">Aw CHAKRAMANG, en kowh sanara dow anowi iawng anging luk kowi pauang uowi lah.<verse eid="PSA 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 4:7" />Luprak hai grep tui sar ahuma ka hanow maru awmrawm reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 4:7">nami lak-e awmrawmra hu ang sak kowi en pe ang khai.<verse eid="PSA 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 4:8" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, en chowtaih kramra uowi dowi iawng tow ang reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 4:8">Naiawng rakowi ang mawk hanow thaulangma ang nowng müi reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 4:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="PSA 5" />
  <para style="s">Tiama nowm kowi krui ang diah</para>
  <para style="d">Mami dow David kowh meng chekhai. Mami meng dow prui tün hown naklakah kown takla.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 5:1" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, ang laiklow sünta diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:1">sakdawng hownia ang awr lüah mih sünta ang diah.<verse eid="PSA 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 5:2" />Aw ang kowh Mangkri, ang kowh Thurai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:2">uang lü khowng se ang uang kar mih klow hawt sünta ang diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 5:2">Tawngplawng kowchow panow ang uang lü khowng mih dow en tut-e chowtaih.<verse eid="PSA 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 5:3" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, ang kowh laiklow dow rau towng en ta reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:3">ang kowh naura dow rau towng en tut-e ang uang lü reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:3">now sakowmma hai ang hawt tang mü en reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 5:4" />Aw Thurai, en dow angak kowi awmrawm dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:4">chang ngak mih maru dow en pur kowi nowng uowi dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 5:5" />Chang owrow miuüa dow en pur kowi nowng iowng dowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:5">chang lup ngak miuüa kowi dow en nuata reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 5:6" />Tek dai lai miuüa kowi dow en piakah reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:6">sai maru mih hai kuan maru mih kowi dow en suiah reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 5:7" />Nachenganchepaw en kowh saksing sanara ahuma rakowi ang dow en kim kowi uang ia kup khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:7">en kowh kim chimsaima mih prakowi dang se tabawk krawm hanow ang ia chup en khai.<verse eid="PSA 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 5:8" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, ang kowh dow ransu uowi ahuma;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:8">naiawng rakowi en kowh tiama nowm kowi kruila ang diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:8">en kowh tiama mih ang pur kowi atengma chang ang diah.<verse eid="PSA 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 5:9" />Ang ransu-uüa kowh laiklow dow kaah owm dowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:9">amatni kowh saktuak dow krawi piak maru kown mih kangowh chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 5:9">Amatni kowh nawr dow hota hüah mih tadupra iawng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:9">amatni kowh dai dow lai iung sowr akiakma chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 5:10" />Aw Thurai, amatni kowi dow amatni kowh angak sung peah diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:10">amatni dow amatni kowh sangkrangra ngak kowi pacham piak büah lah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 5:10">Amatni kowh achüt arawnma mih ngak rakowi amatni kowi prütta diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:10">Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni dow kingküa en reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 5:11" />Tawkchedow en tut-e pacham tatung tanim büah lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:11">apiawma hown chowngchowng saksakma pacham tek meng büah lah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 5:11">Amatni kowi dow kawngma iawng towkala reng diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:11">nahanow en ming kowi ngown miuüa dow apiawma naia uowi kown towbowt.<verse eid="PSA 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 5:12" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, en nau iawng chang miuüa kowi dow en peah prasi reng chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:12">kawngma iawng hai en kowh saksing sanara hown amatni kowi en takhula reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 5:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="PSA 6" />
  <para style="s">Aw CHAKRAMANG, uang lawng ang diah</para>
  <para style="d">Mami dow David kowh meng chekhai. Mami meng dow aiang uowi raiat iang mih tünteu chang müa hown natekah kown mih chekhai. Tünteu hai meng mih anemchow natekah kown mih chekhai.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 6:1" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, en kunmarau thüm khe hauang nang ang diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 6:1">en sak-hiah ang thüm khe hauang hawi ang diah.<verse eid="PSA 6:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 6:2" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, saksing sana ang diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 6:2">ang kowh kür uowi dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 6:2">Aw CHAKRAMANG, uang iungta ang diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 6:2">ang kowh hut khowm uak bowk khowk chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 6:3" />Ang kowh saktuak paw lainowmma pusa khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 6:3">Aw CHAKRAMANG, mün ni tak chow maiawng ang nauowi kown?<verse eid="PSA 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 6:4" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, ang prakowi uang plan diah, now uang lawng ang diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 6:4">en kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura rakowi uang towkala ang diah.<verse eid="PSA 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 6:5" />Kowng kung kowi dow miapaw ka tuak en dowi bowt chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 6:5">tadupra kuam hownia mia chow narowsi en kown chow?<verse eid="PSA 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 6:6" />Ang kar ang nguk lai bowt kowh ang kow uak mih nowm khowk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 6:6">mik tui hown phangbek hai mawk rah sik bowk khowk.<verse eid="PSA 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 6:7" />Ang tuak kawm lai bowt kowh ang kowh mik paw uang iiu rürü khowk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 6:7">ransu-uüa rakowi ang kowh mik mih uak mih nowm khowk chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 6:8" />Chang lup ngak mih maru-uüa low, ang hownia cham lang tahen büah bowk diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 6:8">Tawngplawng kowchow panow ang kowh kar klow mih CHAKRAMANG ta khowk chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 6:9" />Ang awr lü mih dow CHAKRAMANG hawt sünta ang khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 6:9">ang awr lü awr leng mih dow aia nauang klang ang kown.<verse eid="PSA 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 6:10" />Ang kowh ransu-uüa maten mih narukrai hai nakram bowt kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 6:10">amatni dow narukrai hanow naplan büah bowt kown.<verse eid="PSA 6:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="PSA 7" />
  <para style="s">CHAKRAMANG dow ang kowh tatung tanimra</para>
  <para style="d">Mami dow Benjamin krungchak kowi kowh Kusuüa lawnguan kowi CHAKRAMANG tut-e David tekah mih meng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 7:1" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, ang kowh Thurai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:1">ang dow en tut-e chowtaih uang tatung tanim reng.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 7:1">Uang kawikrawi ang miuüa rut hownia lawng ang diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:1">amatni hownia uang towkala ang diah.<verse eid="PSA 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 7:2" />Nadowi now krangsi iawng amatni naiaita ang nak kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:2">amatni dow nadita ang naknak kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 7:2">Nalawng ang kown mih miapaw uowi dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3-5" style="v" sid="PSA 7:3-5" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, ang kowh Thurai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:3-5">ang kowh atawi ama uowi khai hanow,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 7:3-5">ang changta ngak mih uowi khai hanow,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:3-5">ang auiua luk kowi ang changta ngak khai hanow,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 7:3-5">aiawnglowma ang kowh ransu kowi ang changah ngak khai hanow,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:3-5">ransu-uüa uang krawi ang hanow pauang saita ang lah;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 7:3-5">amatni dow krawng kowi pacham theu ang lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:3-5">now pacham thua ang lah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 7:3-5">Naiawng hai ang kowh ringkawra pacham piakta ang büah lah.<verse eid="PSA 7:3-5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 7:6" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, kunmarauma hown awr rü diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:6">ang kowh ransu-uüa kowi kingküaah diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 7:6">Ang vüi kowi awr iowng diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:6">now en tekta iawng chet tara nowm diah.<verse eid="PSA 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 7:7" />Chenchap maten kowi en pur kowi pe takua talawmah diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:7">now amatni kowi dow en uowi rah mukuang hownia kruitownah diah.<verse eid="PSA 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 7:8" />CHAKRAMANG dow chenchapuüa kowi chet pe tara reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 7:8">Aw CHAKRAMANG, ang achinawmma pami chet ang diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:8">ang dow chang lup ngak dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 7:9" />Aw anowmma mih Thurai, en dow maru kowh sak hai saktuak mih nowk khai reng;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:9">en dow maru ngakuüa kowh lup ngak chang en taingta pe reng.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 7:9">Tawkche achinawmma miuüa kowi dow aiungma en towah reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 7:10" />Ang kowh kawngma dow Thurai chowtaih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:10">aia dow saktuak chinawmma miuüa kowi lawngah reng.<verse eid="PSA 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 7:11" />Thurai dow tara nowm chet miia chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:11">maru ngakuüa kowi dow ni towng aia kunmarauah reng.<verse eid="PSA 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 7:12" />Maru che tarip dowi hanow Thurai dow aia kowh saidawng mih nasükah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:12">now aia kowh salangba mih navüiah kown.<verse eid="PSA 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 7:13" />Aia dow nasaila maru kown mih rutchün khawkleng kamrütta kaneu khowk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:13">maih lün pluplup mih aia kowh leba sek dow aia vüita kaneu khowk.<verse eid="PSA 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 7:14" />Maru ngak kowh saktuak dow angak kangowh chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:14">aia dow nakrawi piak kown mih sangkrang reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:14">now tek dai lai reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 7:15" />Aia dow maru dowla müa krawi thai kuam reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:15">Tawkche aia thaiah mih kuam kowi dow aia chowtaih dowh reng.<verse eid="PSA 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 7:16" />Aia kowh angak sung dow aia luk kowi chowtaih uang plan reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:16">aia krawi chang nowng mih klai dow aia chowtaih ka ripra reng.<verse eid="PSA 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 7:17" />CHAKRAMANG dow anowmma chet tara reng chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:17">naiawng rakowi aia kowi ang natek pe awmrawm lai kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:17">lang kri lang kraing mih CHAKRAMANG vüi ang natek kiow meng kown.<verse eid="PSA 7:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="PSA 8" />
  <para style="s">CHAKRAMANG kowh kraingra</para>
  <para style="d">Mami dow David kowh meng chekhai. Mami dow aiangchow mih tünteu chang müa hown natekah kown mih meng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 8:1" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, anging kowh CHAKRAMANG,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 8:1">palusama kowi en kowh ming dow kri kraingma chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 8:1">en kraingra dow mukuang pren kowi paw en tüngah khai.<verse eid="PSA 8:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 8:2" />Ngeuüa hown ingrikchowuüa nawr hownia en rowsi meng dow uang lawt khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 8:2">amatni nawr kowi naiawngün meng dow en peah khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 8:2">Naiawng en changah mih dow en ransu-uüa naka laira dowi kownkow chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 8:2">now kingküa en miuüa kowh nawr pacham takowp lah pakowh chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 8:3" />En rut hown kowh en thawpah mih mukuang prakowi ang tang mü khe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 8:3">krek hai lama amatni uowi rah kowi en towah mih ang khi khe,<verse eid="PSA 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 8:4" />ang ka tuak mih, “Tawngplawng kowchow lusa maru kowi khowt pat en mingkhetah khai?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 8:4">Tawngplawng kowchow khowt pat en towah sak khai?” pakhai.<verse eid="PSA 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 8:5" />Lusa maru kowi dow kramamu-uüa lak-e lang nem rowtchow en thawpah khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 8:5">Mang lukruk iawng en changla anging khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 8:5">ringkawra hai rowsira dow en pe anging khai.<verse eid="PSA 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 8:6" />En rut hown kowh en thawpah mih maten luk kowi en pe chang anging alow khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 8:6">uanh thawp maiow anging nimkrüa kowi en towah khai:<verse eid="PSA 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 8:7" />Chia hawmh hai ruapur hawmh ün,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 8:7">lusa kowi kowh kaurawng uaramchak maiow ün,<verse eid="PSA 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 8:8" />kuang dawng kowi kowh iow mih uakling uaber ün,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 8:8">sata kowi kowh sawng dam ün,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 8:8">asak uowi mih maten anging low kowi en pe uowiah khai.<verse eid="PSA 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 8:9" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, anging kowh CHAKRAMANG,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 8:9">palusama kowi en kowh ming dow kri kraingma chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 8:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="PSA 9" />
  <para style="s">CHAKRAMANG kowh lakkhiara lup</para>
  <para style="d">Mami dow David kowh meng chekhai. Mami meng dow “Chapa kowng mih” meng owi iawng natekah kown.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 9:1" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, ang kowh sak maiow hown ang nakiow en kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:1">en kowh lakkhiara lup lawnguan maten ang nakrawi phuang kown.<verse eid="PSA 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 9:2" />En rakowi chowtaih piaw pama hai awmrawmma ang nauowi kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:2">aw lang kri lang kraing mih Thurai, en ming vüi ang natek rowsi meng kown.<verse eid="PSA 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 9:3" />Ang kowh ransu-uüa dow khi en hanow plan bowk khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:3">amatni dow en pur kowi tim hanow kowng bowk khai.<verse eid="PSA 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 9:4" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow en tawi tangila ang khükhü en chet ang tara khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:4">en kowh mang chowm rah hownia en chet tara nowm khai.<verse eid="PSA 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 9:5" />Akeng chenchap kowi en nangah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:5">now maru ngakuüa kowi dow en piakah khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 9:5">Amatni kowh ming dow chowngchowng saksakma vüi en phiawkta pe khai.<verse eid="PSA 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 9:6" />Ransu-uüa kowi dow chowngchowng saksakma vüi en piakta bowk khowk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:6">amatni kowh marow maten dow asaima en piakta bowk khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 9:6">Amatni kowh ming khowm padow maru sak kowi uowi dowi bowt.<verse eid="PSA 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 9:7" />Nachenganchepaw CHAKRAMANG dow chowngchowng saksakma chowm mang reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:7">aia dow tara chet müa vüi thawp mang chowm rah khai.<verse eid="PSA 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 9:8" />Aia dow anowmma lusa kowi nauang chet tara kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:8">achinawmma hown chenchapuüa kowi nauang kruitownah kown.<verse eid="PSA 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 9:9" />Aia dow nowng chang powng changra kowi uowi miuüa vüi akhawtma mih kangchawngra kim chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:9">akrat pusara ni khe kowh vüi aia dow akhawtma mih kangchawngra kim chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 9:10" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, en ming tuk miuüa dow en luk kowi neplawng nesak reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:10">Naiawng rakowi krawi cham en miuüa kowi dow katpaw en nuata dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 9:11" />Zaiawn hungh kowi uowi mih CHAKRAMANG vüi tek rowsi meng büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:11">aia changah mih lup lawnguan palusama maru kowi phuangla pe diah.<verse eid="PSA 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 9:12" />Aia dow sai maru miuüa kowi naripah kown mih tamata dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:12">ngaraima miuüa kowh kar klow dow towsakma hown aia sünta pe reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 9:13" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, saksing sana ang diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:13">ang kowh ransu-uüa chang ang nowng mih iu mü diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:13">kowng kown mih hownia lawng ang diah.<verse eid="PSA 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 9:14" />Nahanow Zaiawn tapplawt kowi ang naia kiow en kown towbowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:14">now en uang lawng ang mih rakowi ang naia piaw kown towbowt.<verse eid="PSA 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 9:15" />Akeng chenchapuüa dow amatni thaiah mih kuam kowi dowh khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:15">amatni dow amatni krawi chakah mih leng kowi tasowk büah khai bowt.<verse eid="PSA 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 9:16" />CHAKRAMANG dow aiamat lawnguan pe tuk a-i reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:16">aia dow chet tara nowm reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 9:16">Maru ngakuüa dow maru kowi krawi chang ngak reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:16">amatni dow amatni kowh lup ngak rakowi piak reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 9:17" />Maru ngakuüa dow makowng tiama prakowi uowi mih chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:17">Thurai kowi nuata mih chenchapuüa paw napiak kown.<verse eid="PSA 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 9:18" />Akhawr hown uowi miuüa kowi dow chowngchowng saksakma Thurai natamata kown nadowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:18">aia dow ngarawng ngarai miuüa kowh sakowmra nauang pe tachiah ngengche kown.<verse eid="PSA 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 9:19" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, awr rü diah, maru kowi mih hangkow pe awngah diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:19">akeng chenchapuüa kowh tara mih en pur kowi chet pe diah.<verse eid="PSA 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 9:20" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, amatni kowh sak kowi mih peah kramra diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:20">amatni dow maru chowtaih pami akeng chenchapuüa pacham tuk lah.<verse eid="PSA 9:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="PSA 10" />
  <para style="s">Tawngplawng kowchow en lang tapet khai?</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 10:1" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, tawngplawng kowchow alakma kowi en lang iowng phulu khai?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:1">Tawngplawng kowchow ang kawm ang krat mih khin khe en lang tapet khai?<verse eid="PSA 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 10:2" />Maru ngakuüa dow abawrima rakowi ngarai miuüa kowi krawi chang nowng reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:2">amatni dow amatni krawi chakah mih leng kowi pacham tasowk lah.<verse eid="PSA 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 10:3" />Amatni dow amatni nau changah kown mih lup ngak lawnguan kowi chang bawri reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:3">lawphama miuüa dow CHAKRAMANG kowi pe piati reng, now aia kowi nuata reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 10:4" />Maru ngakuüa dow abawrima rakowi CHAKRAMANG kowi cham dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:4">amatni dow Thurai uowi dowi pahai ka tuak büah reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 10:5" />Amatni dow amatni changah mih lup kowi chawn reng,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 10:5">amatni dow en kowh ripra tuk mat büah dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 10:5">amatni dow amatni kowh ransu-uüa kowi nüah klowkah dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 10:6" />Amatni tatuak mih, “Miapaw uang nowng taing a-i kown nadowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:6">a-i luk kowi dow tawng iawng mih phih paw katpaw nauang kla kown nadowi,” pabüah khai.<verse eid="PSA 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 10:7" />Maru ngakuüa nawr hownia dow piati laiklow chowtaih lawt reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:7">now dai lai hai chang nowng kown mih laiklow chowtaih lawt reng.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 10:7">Amatni kowh dai dow maru sak kowi raula mih laiklow tek reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:7">now maru napiakla kown mih laiklow kangowh tek reng.<verse eid="PSA 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 10:8" />Amatni dow sai maru kownkow kharia kowi hawt pawm reng chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:8">amatni dow achinawmma miuüa kowi hawt sai reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:8">now kür uowi dowi miuüa kowi krawi matah reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 10:9" />Amatni dow krangsi iawng kukpa hawt pawm reng;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:9">kür uowi dowi miuüa kowi amatni dow hawt pawm hanow khümah reng.<verse eid="PSA 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 10:10" />Nahanow naiawngün maru-uüa dow maru ngakuüa rut kowi tapham reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:10">now amatni rut kowi dow kür uowi dowi miuüa piak reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 10:11" />Amatni tatuak mih, “Thurai khi a-i dowi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:11">aia bengta mik khai, katpaw aia nakhi kown nadowi,” pabüah khai.<verse eid="PSA 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 10:12" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, awr rü diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:12">aw Thurai, maru ngakuüa kowi iu ripah diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:12">ngarema miuüa kowi hangkow tamata diah.<verse eid="PSA 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 10:13" />Tawngplawng kowchow Thurai kowi maru ngakuüa nüah klowkah dowi?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:13">Amatni ka tuak mih, “Katpaw Thurai narip a-i kown nadowi,” pabüah khai.<verse eid="PSA 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 10:14" />Aw Thurai, amatni rakowi krat pusara uang ting mih maten en khi bowk chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:14">naiawngün en khi khowk chedow amatni kowi ripah diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 10:14">Ngarawng ngaraima miuüa dow en tut-e chowtaih uang taap reng;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:14">saratchowuüa kowi dow en khowngah reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 10:15" />Maru ngakuüa kowh kür piakta pe diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:15">now amatni ia chang lup ngak dowi bowt pat amatni kowi ripah diah.<verse eid="PSA 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 10:16" />CHAKRAMANG chowtaih chowngchowng saksakma mih mang,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:16">aia kowh pren kowi mih akeng chenchapuüa dow napiak bowk kown.<verse eid="PSA 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 10:17" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, ngarema miuüa kowh sakdawng laiklow dow en ta reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:17">amatni kowh kar klow dow en ta reng, now en peah sakkhawtra reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 10:18" />Saratchowuüa hai ngarawng ngarai miuüa kowi en tawi tangila hanow en chet pe tara nowm reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:18">Naiawng rakowi lusa maru-uüa dow amatni kowi nakrawkah kown nadowi bowt.<verse eid="PSA 10:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="PSA 11" />
  <para style="s">CHAKRAMANG luk kowi neplawng nesak kown mih</para>
  <para style="d">Mami dow David kowh meng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 11:1" />Ang dow CHAKRAMANG tut-e tatung tanim khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 11:1">Naiawng rakowi, “Uakling iawng hungh kowi cham tapet diah.<verse eid="PSA 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 11:2" />Maru ngakuüa mih kamrütta leba hüah khowk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 11:2">amatni dow nakrawi ap maru iunguüa kownkow krawi tapet thüm khowk.<verse eid="PSA 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 11:3" />Lusa kowi kowh rirow maten maru ngakuüa krawi piakta bowk khai hanow,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 11:3">achinawmma mih maru-uüa tawng chow naia chang bowt kown chow?” pahai hauang tek ang büa diah.<verse eid="PSA 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 11:4" />Nachenganchepaw CHAKRAMANG dow aia kowh chimsaima mih kim kowi uowi khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 11:4">aia kowh mang chowm rah dow mukuang pren kowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 11:4">Aia dow lusa maru kowi tang müah reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 11:4">aia dow lusa maru tawng chow chang mih tuk bowk chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 11:5" />CHAKRAMANG dow achinawmma mih maru kowi achangma nachangah kownkow chaingah reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 11:5">Tawkche chang ngak miuüa hai chang nowng miuüa kowi dow aia suiah reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 11:6" />Maru ngakuüa luk kowi dow maih iawng mih phih aia nauang pe klaah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 11:6">amatni kowi dow napawksi maih hai maih iawng mih li hown aia naripah kown.<verse eid="PSA 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 11:7" />CHAKRAMANG dow chinawmma rakowi achinawmma miuüa kowi sakrau reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 11:7">aia kowh lumowr dow achinawmma mih maru-uüa chowtaih nakhi kown.<verse eid="PSA 11:7" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="PSA 12" />
  <para style="s">Thurai tut-e lü khowng mih</para>
  <para style="d">Mami dow David kowh meng chekhai. Mami meng dow tünteu chang müa hown anemchow natekah kown mih chekhai.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 12:1" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, uang khowng ang diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 12:1">ringkaw en reng mih maru-uüa dow uowi dowi bowt chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 12:1">now kaah sakowm miuüa paw tama bowk khowk.<verse eid="PSA 12:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 12:2" />Maru maten dow miapaw tatek lainowm dowi bowt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 12:2">amatni kowh ve dow krawi sowr lai iung reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 12:2">amatni kowh sak dow limmara atekma chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 12:3" />Krawi dai maru reng mih ve dow CHAKRAMANG pacham hiata pe lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 12:3">krawi changla bawri mih dai ün paw CHAKRAMANG pacham hiata pe lah.<verse eid="PSA 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 12:4" />Naiawngünuüa tek mih, “Dai lai kür hown anging naawng kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 12:4">miapaw nowngia hang anging kown nadowi tham,” pakhai.<verse eid="PSA 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 12:5" />Nachenganchepaw CHAKRAMANG tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 12:5">“Ngarai miuüa kowi maru ngakuüa changah naklak mih ang khi khowk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 12:5">akawm akrat hown uowi miuüa kowh nguk klow kar klow ang ta khowk.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 12:5">Naiawng rakowi kawmat dow ang naawr rü bowt kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 12:5">now amatni kowi dow ang nalawngah bowt kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="PSA 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 12:6" />CHAKRAMANG kowh laiklow dow achangma mih tai iawng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 12:6">Nami dow maih kowi awpah ranit kat kowh achangma changah mih tai iawng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 12:7" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, ngarai miuüa kowi dow thaulangma en natowah reng kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 12:7">mami chowng kowi kowh maru ngakuüa hownia amatni kowi en nalawngah reng kown.<verse eid="PSA 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 12:8" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow angak kowi maru ringkawah khe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 12:8">maru ngakuüa dow thaulangma krawi len panglang reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 12:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="PSA 13" />
  <para style="s">Aw CHAKRAMANG, mün ni tak chow?</para>
  <para style="d">Mami dow David kowh meng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 13:1" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, mün ni tak chow en natamata ang kown?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 13:1">Chowngchowng saksakma bow en tamata ang kown?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 13:1">Ang hownia mün ni tak chow en nacham dangta ang lumowr kown?<verse eid="PSA 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 13:2" />Mün ni tak chow tuak krat hown ang nauowi kown?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 13:2">Tuak kawm tuak krat hown ni towng bow ang nauowi kown?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 13:2">Ang kowh ransu-uüa mün ni tak chow nanowng ang kown?<verse eid="PSA 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 13:3" />Aw CHAKRAMANG ang kowh Thurai, tang mü ang diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 13:3">now uang klang ang diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 13:3">Uang plan pe ang kür diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 13:3">nadowi now ang nakowng kown chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 13:4" />Nakhowk khe ang ransu-uüa natek kown mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 13:4">“Aia kowi a-i nowngta khai,” napa kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 13:4">Amatni nowngta ang khai hanow naawmrawm büah kown chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 13:5" />Nachenganchepaw ang dow en kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura luk kowi neplawng nesak reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 13:5">en nauang lawng ang kown mih rakowi ang kowh sak dow awmrawm reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 13:6" />CHAKRAMANG dow uang pe ang iungra khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 13:6">Naiawng rakowi aia kiow meng ang natek kown.<verse eid="PSA 13:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="PSA 14" />
  <para style="s">Abualama miuüa dow owm Thurai dowi</para>
  <para style="d">Mami dow David kowh meng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 14:1" />Abualama mih maru-uüa dow Thurai uowi dowi padow tuak reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 14:1">amatni dow lup ngak hai suiiai kaniaima mih lup chang reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 14:1">Lup iung chang mih maru amiapaw uowi dowi bowt chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 14:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 14:2" />CHAKRAMANG dow mukuang pren hownia lusa maru kowi iu tang müah reng;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 14:2">chanlaima hown mang mih uowi ne chünchü mih natukla kownkow chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 14:2">now aia kowi cham mih uowi ne chünchü mih natukla kownkow chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 14:3" />Tawkche maru kawmuüa dow tiama nowm hownia plan bowk khowk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 14:3">amatni dow lup ngak kangowh towbowt chang büah khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 14:3">Lup iung chang mih maru lowk iachow khowm uowi dowk chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 14:4" />Chang lup ngak mih maru-uüa tawng chow khowt pat tuk <char style="w">buala</char> khai?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 14:4">Amatni dow cha chakkham khe kowh iawng ang maru-uüa kowi piakah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 14:4">amatni dow CHAKRAMANG tut-e katpaw awr lü awr leng dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 14:5" />Tawkche akung kowi dow naiawngün maru ngakuüa mih lainowmma nakram kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 14:5">Tawngplawng kowchow panow CHAKRAMANG dow aia kowi ringkawah miuüa tut-e tawi uowi reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 14:6" />Maru ngakuüa dow ngarawng ngarai miuüa kowh sangkrangra piakta pe hanow peah rukrai reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 14:6">Tawkche CHAKRAMANG dow ngarawng ngarai miuüa kowi lawngah reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 14:7" />Israeluüa kowi lawngah kown mih dow Zaiawn hungh hownia pacham uang lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 14:7">CHAKRAMANG dow aia maru-uüa kowi naplan peah iungra iawk kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 14:7">Nami khin khe Jakawb krungchakuüa dow naawmrawm kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 14:7">now Israel krungchakuüa paw napiaw bowt kown.<verse eid="PSA 14:7" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="PSA 15" />
  <para style="s">CHAKRAMANG kowi mia chow kiow taing?</para>
  <para style="d">David kowh meng.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 15:1" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, en kowh taklowp taklangra te kowi mia chow kowkup kown tataing?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 15:1">En kowh chimsaima mih Zaiawn hungh kowi mia chow kowuowi kown tataing?<verse eid="PSA 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 15:2" />Tataing mih dow maiawng mih maru-uüa chowtaih:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 15:2">Thurai nau iawng uowi mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 15:2">chang lup iung mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 15:2">saktuak anowmma hown tek lai mih,<verse eid="PSA 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 15:3" />nawr hown prawngren maru dowi mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 15:3">auiuauüa kowi krawi chang ngak dowi mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 15:3">kimping namkhetuüa lawnguan kowi cham tek naklak dowi mih,<verse eid="PSA 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 15:4" />maru ngakuüa kowi mik ngak hown krawi mü reng mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 15:4">CHAKRAMANG nau iawng chang miuüa kowi ringkaw mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 15:4">krat pusara uang ting chepaw takhamta iawng chang reng mih,<verse eid="PSA 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 15:5" />paw achüt dowi kowi pe tangka khawi reng mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 15:5">ngak uowi dowi mih maru kowi nathuak pe dai lai saksi kownkow cha bümsua dowi mih chekhai.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 15:5" />
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 15:5">Naiawng mih maru dow chowngchowng saksakma anikma nauowi reng kown.<verse eid="PSA 15:5" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="PSA 16" />
  <para style="s">Thurai kowi ringkaw mih dow piak dowi</para>
  <para style="d">David kowh meng.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 16:1" />Aw Thurai, uang takhula ang diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 16:1">Tawngplawng kowchow panow ang dow en tut-e chowtaih tatung tanim reng.<verse eid="PSA 16:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 16:2" />CHAKRAMANG kowi ang tek pe mih, “Ang kowh CHAKRAMANG dow en chowtaih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 16:2">ang kowh iungra maten dow en hownia kowh uang ting mih kangowh chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="PSA 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 16:3" />Lusa kowi kowh Thurai maru maten dow iung lai kowbow!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 16:3">Ang kowh awmrawmra maten dow amatni hown chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 16:4" />Tawkche akeng thuraiuüa kowi chupiia miuüa dow akrat pusa nalang hu ngamlam kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 16:4">vi hown kowh amatni changah mih phuchua kowi dow ang natawi tahum kown nadowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 16:4">akeng thuraiuüa ming khowm padow ang natawi rük kown nadowi.<verse eid="PSA 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 16:5" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, en dow ang kowh dawngthawnguan chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 16:5">en dow ang lakkeah mih chap maten pe ang reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 16:5">Ang kowh chownglawng dow en rut kowi chowtaih.<verse eid="PSA 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 16:6" />En pe ang mih süng dow lainowmma klangiung khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 16:6">ang kowh dawngthawnguan dow mü reng chepaw ang tadu dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 16:7" />Pe ang prengia iung reng mih Thurai kowi dow ang kiowah reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 16:7">aia kowh tüngsang dow uar-e khe paw ang sak kowi uowi reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 16:8" />Ang kowh mik dow atungma CHAKRAMANG prakowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 16:8">aia tawi uowila ang reng rakowi anikma ang nauowi reng kown.<verse eid="PSA 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 16:9" />Naiawng rakowi ang kowh sak hai saktuak dow lainowmma piaw khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 16:9">now ang kowh kowpaw athaulangma chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 16:10" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow makownguüa uowi rah kowi en kuakta ang hüah kown nadowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 16:10">en kowh chimsaima mih maru kowh buk dow en pe piakah kown nadowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 16:11" />Singra tiama dow en natüng ang kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 16:11">en tut-e ang uowi hanow ang naawmrawm reng kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 16:11">en ria kowi ang uowi hanow chowngchowng saksakma ang napiaw reng kown.<verse eid="PSA 16:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="PSA 17" />
  <para style="s">CHAKRAMANG dow takhula ang reng</para>
  <para style="d">David chup Thurai mih.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 17:1" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, ang kowh achinawmma mih laiklow hawt sünta ang diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:1">ang kowh kar klow kowi hawt pe param diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:1">achinawmma ang awr lü awr leng mih kowi pe ching diah.<verse eid="PSA 17:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 17:2" />Chet ang tara nowm diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:2">chang lup nowm mih kowi dow en khi reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 17:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 17:3" />En dow chaing ang sak reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:3">uar-e khe paw en uang chaing ang reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 17:3">En chaing ang tawkche tawng angak paw en khi ang dowi chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:3">tawng iawng mih lai ngak paw natek dowi kown mih ang takham khowk.<verse eid="PSA 17:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 17:4" />Ang dow akeng mih maru chang iawng ang tawi chang dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:4">en laiklow iawng tiama ngak hownia dow ang lang tahen reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 17:5" />Ang dow en tiama kowi chowtaih mang reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:5">nami tiama hownia dow ditchow paw ang süt dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 17:6" />Aw Thurai, ang haw en khowk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:6">en naklang ang kown mih ang tuk chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 17:6">Ang kowh laiklow sünta ang diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:6">ang awr lü mih kowi pe param diah.<verse eid="PSA 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 17:7" />En kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura dow amülüngma hown uang tüng ang diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:7">en tut-e tatung tanim miuüa kowi dow ransu-uüa rut hownia lawngah reng diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:7">now amatni kowi dow en kowh kür akraingma mih hown lawngah reng diah.<verse eid="PSA 17:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 17:8" />En khet mik iawng khet ang diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:8">alap hown uaklinguüa takhula chauüa iawng en paw takhula ang diah.<verse eid="PSA 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 17:9" />Umta ang lut mih maru ngakuüa hownia lawng ang diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:9">kowngta ang kown mih ransu-uüa hownia lawng ang diah.<verse eid="PSA 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 17:10" />Amatni dow amia kowi paw saksing sana dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:10">amatni dow kowmatia kowi tanü reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 17:11" />Amatni dow kawmat rumta ang lut khowk;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:11">ang napowtla kown mih tiama uowi dowi bowt chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 17:11">Amatni dow napiakta ang kownkow</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:11">atungma hing mitta ang hüah chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 17:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 17:12" />Amatni dow krangsi iawng iaita ang naknak kown mih lainowmma sakkrai khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:12">amatni dow krangsila powrchow pawm chak mih iawng hawt pawm ang büah khai.<verse eid="PSA 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 17:13" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, awr rü bowt! Ransu-uüa kowi senah bowt!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:13">Amatni kowi dow pe sumah bowt!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 17:13">En kowh saidawng hown ransu-uüa hownia lawng ang bowt!<verse eid="PSA 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 17:14" />
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">17:14 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Mami uan kowi kowh laiklow Hebrai Baibul kowi chim dowi rakowi akeng Baibul kowi alangma kangowh chekhai. </char>
    </note> Aw CHAKRAMANG, lusa kurengra pra towsak miuüa hownia lawng ang diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:14">amatni kowi dow en nungta pe hüah mih ripra hown ripah diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 17:14">Nami ripra dow amatni kowh chauüa pacham ta ka lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:14">nami klen kowi amatni kowh chu cheuüa paw pacham ta ka lah.<verse eid="PSA 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 17:15" />Nachenganchepaw ang tarapdow achinawmma chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:15">Naiawng rakowi ang dow en kowh lumowr mih ang nakhi kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 17:15">Kowngra hownia ang awr plan rü khe ang naawmrawm kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:15">Tawngplawng kowchow panow ang dow nakhi en kown chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 17:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="PSA 18" />
  <para style="s">CHAKRAMANG dow ang kowh Singku Huamang</para>
  <para style="d">Mami dow David kowh meng chekhai. Mami meng dow mang Sawl hai akeng mih ransu-uüa hownia David kowi CHAKRAMANG lawngah mih khin khe kowh CHAKRAMANG vüi David tekah mih chekhai.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 18:1" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, ang kowh kürra dow en chowtaih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:1">en kowi dow ang sakrau en reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 18:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 18:2" />CHAKRAMANG dow ang kowh Singku Huamang chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:2">aia dow ang kowh akhawtma mih kangchawngra kim hai lawng miia chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 18:2">Aia dow ang kowh Thurai hai ang kowh Singku Huamang chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:2">ang tatung tanim mih dow aia tut-e chowtaih.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 18:2">Thurai dow ang kowh taka müa kawngma chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:2">aia dow nang iawng mih kür hown lawng ang reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:2">aia dow ang kowh alowngma mih tatung tanimra chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 18:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 18:3" />CHAKRAMANG kowi dow ang hawah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:3">now aia dow ang kowh ransu-uüa hownia lawng ang khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 18:3">CHAKRAMANG dow akiow taing chekhai!<verse eid="PSA 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 18:4" />Kramra uowima mih kowngra dow umta ang lut khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:4">ang luk kowi dow tui lawt iawng piakra uang kla khai bowt.<verse eid="PSA 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 18:5" />Kramra uowima mih kowngra dow umta ang lut khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:5">kowngra dow chak ang leng khai.<verse eid="PSA 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 18:6" />Ang kla phih khe CHAKRAMANG ang kowh Thurai kowi ang hawah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:6">nauang khowng ang kownkow aia tut-e ang awr kar awr nguk khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 18:6">Aia dow aia uowi rah hownia ang awr lüah mih hawt sünta ang khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:6">ang kar ang nguk mih aia param kowi kowting khai.<verse eid="PSA 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 18:7" />Nakhowk khe lusa dow chür nukluk hai tahowng nurlur khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:7">hungh kowi kowh achüng maten dow chür nukluk khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 18:7">Naiawng phaw mih dow Thurai kunmarau rakowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 18:8" />Aia nakawng hownia dow maikhük awr towk iualua khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:8">aia kowh nawr hownia dow piakla mih maih uang lawt khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:8">aia nawr kowi kowh maivia dow awr lün khai.<verse eid="PSA 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 18:9" />Aia dow mukuang nitah lang hanow lusa kowi uang iu dowm khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:9">aia khawk daw kowi dow uangnim iiuma chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 18:10" />Aia dow Cherup pami kramamu luk kowi chowm hanow uang iow khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:10">aia dow li hown alenma uang iow khai.<verse eid="PSA 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 18:11" />Aia dow aiiu hown aia matia kowi petah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:11">aia riaret kowi aiiuma mih uangnim dow tui kangowh chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 18:12" />Aia pur kowi anowi uang ting hanow aiiu dow lang tahen khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:12">nahanow nami uangnim hownia dow kaikreng hai ria mih uang kla khai.<verse eid="PSA 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 18:13" />CHAKRAMANG dow mukuang hownia tüng klow khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:13">muk tün hai kaikreng tün kowi lang kri lang kraing mih Thurai kowh klow ta chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 18:14" />CHAKRAMANG dow ransu-uüa kowi salangba hown ap-ah hanow cham uetta plawt khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:14">amatni kowi dow pla nowi hown aia pe takrow takraiah khai.<verse eid="PSA 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 18:15" />CHAKRAMANG dow ransu-uüa kowi nangah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:15">aia dow nakawng hownia plawt kawli khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 18:15">Nahanow krawng dawng tui dow uang tatüng khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:15">now lusa chüng maten dow uang tatüng khai.<verse eid="PSA 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 18:16" />Aia dow mukuang hownia iu iaw rut hanow iu dowk ang khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:16">tui büpma mih hownia dow aia uang khowngla ang khai.<verse eid="PSA 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 18:17" />Aia dow ang kowh akürma mih ransu-uüa hownia lawng ang khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:17">aia dow sui ang miuüa hownia lawng ang khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 18:17">Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni dow ang lak-e lang kür chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 18:18" />Ang kla phih khe amatni dow uang sen ang khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:18">Nachenganchepaw CHAKRAMANG dow uang dowk ang khai.<verse eid="PSA 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 18:19" />Aia dow aiungma mih arah kowi uang pawla ang khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:19">ang luk kowi aia sak-ih ang khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 18:19">Naiawng rakowi aia lawng ang khai.<verse eid="PSA 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 18:20" />Ang kowh anowmma mih lup rakowi CHAKRAMANG chang ang aiung khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:20">ang kowh tachi tanawm rakowi aia dow pe ang awmrawm sung khai.<verse eid="PSA 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 18:21" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow ang dow CHAKRAMANG tiama kowi mang reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:21">Thurai kowi kingküala mih angak dow ang chang dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 18:22" />Aia kowh ari aiang maten dow ang chün reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:22">aia kowh rirow hownia dow ang cham süt dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 18:23" />Aia pur kowi dow ang kowh angak uowi dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:23">angak hownia ang lang tahen reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 18:24" />Ang kowh lup nowm rakowi CHAKRAMANG dow chang ang aiung khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:24">ang kowh tachi tanawm rakowi en dow pe ang awmrawm sung khai.<verse eid="PSA 18:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 18:25" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, en kaah sakowm miuüa kowi dow kaah sakowm iawng en chang pe reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:25">aiungma miuüa kowi dow aiungma en chang pe reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 18:26" />Achinawmma miuüa kowi dow achinawmma en chang pe reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:26">kuanla miuüa kowi dow angakma en chang pe reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 18:27" />Khamsum khamdawma miuüa kowi dow en takhula reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:27">Tawkche bawrima miuüa kowi dow en piakah reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 18:28" />Aw CHAKRAMANG ang kowh Thurai, en dow ang kowh maibu chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:28">aiiu kowi ang uowi khe en tüng ang anowi reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 18:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 18:29" />En kowh kür hown ransu siphaiuüa kowi ang nowng sen khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:29">ang kowh Thurai khowngra hownia amatni kowh tap kowklaw hanow</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:29">alak kowi ang kownowng kup khai.<verse eid="PSA 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 18:30" />Thurai kowh tiama dow aser auowk uowi dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:30">CHAKRAMANG kowh laikham aching pami dow uang tatüng khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 18:30">Aia dow aia tut-e kowh uang tatung tanim miuüa kowh kawngma iawng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 18:31" />CHAKRAMANG klen kowi dow akeng mih Thurai lang uowi dowi bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:31">a-i kowh Thurai klen kowi dow akeng mih singku huamang lang uowi dowi bowt chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 18:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 18:32" />Thurai dow pe ang kür reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:32">now aia dow ang kowh tiama mih aiungma chang ang khai.<verse eid="PSA 18:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 18:33" />Aia dow ngahiu iia iawng alenma naiowmla kown mih kür pe ang khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:33">now alowngma mih hungma mawngma kowi thaulangma aia pe uowi ang khai.<verse eid="PSA 18:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 18:34" />Aia dow tawng iawng chow natasenah kown mih tüngsang ang khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:34">Naiawng rakowi kri hown kowh salangba dow ang nowng uüi khai.<verse eid="PSA 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 18:35" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, en dow en lawngla ang mih en kowh kawngma en pe ang khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:35">en kowh hawmlawm rut hown en dowkta ang hüah khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 18:35">Now en khowng ang mih hownia kri kraingma ang phaw khai.<verse eid="PSA 18:35" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 18:36" />Ransu-uüa sen ang khe en khowng ang khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:36">Naiawng rakowi ang tatheu dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 18:36" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 18:37" />Ang kowh ransu-uüa kowi kawikrawiah hanow ang saiah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:37">amatni kowi ang saita dowi mowr ang plan kung dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 18:37" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 18:38" />Amatni kowi dow ang sawtah khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:38">nahanow amatni dow ang khawk daw kowi tim büah khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 18:38">Amatni dow hing nowng rü dowi bowt chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 18:38" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 18:39" />Natasenla kown mih kür pe ang mih dow en chowtaih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:39">ang ransu-uüa kowi dow ang khawk daw kowi en towah khai.<verse eid="PSA 18:39" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 18:40" />Ang kowh ransu-uüa kowi dow ang hownia en prütah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:40">sui ang miuüa kowi dow ang piakta khai.<verse eid="PSA 18:40" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 18:41" />Amatni dow krawi lü khowng khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:41">Tawkche amatni kowi dow miapaw takhula dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 18:41">Amatni dow en tut-e awr lü khowng khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:41">Tawkche en dow amatni kowi klangah dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 18:41" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 18:42" />Amatni kowi dow dinchow iawng adima ang changah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:42">amatni kowi dow tiama kowi kowh suplawk iawng ang thuata nak khai.<verse eid="PSA 18:42" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 18:43" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, ang kowh maru-uüa kingküara hownia en lawng ang khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:43">akeng chenchapuüa luk kowi aluchow en tow ang khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 18:43">Akeng chenchapuüa khowm kawmat ang krüa kowi chang lup khai.<verse eid="PSA 18:43" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="PSA 18:44" />Prenlang maru-uüa dow ang kowh laiklow ta hown krowksang ang tek iawng chang reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:44">amatni dow ang pur kowi tabawk krawm se uang khamsum reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 18:44" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="PSA 18:45" />Amatni kowh dow sakowmra uowi dowi bowt chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:45">amatni dow chürla kluk se akhawtma mih kangchawngra kim hownia uang lawt khai.<verse eid="PSA 18:45" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="PSA 18:46" />En dow masing CHAKRAMANG chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:46">ang kowh Singku Huamang dow akiow pacham uowi lah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 18:46">Thurai dow ang kowh lawng miia chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:46">en kowh ringkawra dow pacham hu lah.<verse eid="PSA 18:46" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="PSA 18:47" />En dow ang vüi kowi paw lu klai reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:47">akeng chenchapuüa kowi dow ang nimkrüa kowi en towah khai.<verse eid="PSA 18:47" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="PSA 18:48" />En dow ransu-uüa rut hownia lawng ang khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:48">chang ang nowng miuüa rut hownia paw en lawng ang khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 18:48">Ransu-uüa luk kowi dow en pe awng ang khai.<verse eid="PSA 18:48" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="PSA 18:49" />Naiawng rakowi aw CHAKRAMANG, akeng chenchapuüa pungmadawng kowi ang nakiow en kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:49">en ming hown ang natek rowsi meng kown.<verse eid="PSA 18:49" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="PSA 18:50" />En kowh mang kowi dow kri kraingma mih awngra en peah reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:50">en nümnapah mih maru kowi dow achur uowi dowi mih sakraura en tüng pe reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 18:50">David kowi dow chowngchowng saksakma en sakrauah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:50">aia krungchakuüa kowi paw chowngchowng saksakma en sakrauah khai.<verse eid="PSA 18:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="PSA 19" />
  <para style="s">CHAKRAMANG kowh ana pek dow anowmma</para>
  <para style="d">Mami dow David kowh meng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 19:1" />Mukuang dow Thurai kowh kraingra uang tüng reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:1">awr mü mukuang hanow Thurai uanh thawp kri kraing mih krang khi reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 19:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 19:2" />Thurai kowh kri kraingra dow sat uang lawt towng khi-ah reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:2">Thurai kowh chanlaira dow krek hai lama uang lawt towng tukah reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 19:3" />Naiawngün uanthawp kowi dow tawng iawng mih atün uowi dowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:3">tawng iawng mih lai paw uowi dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 19:4" />Nachenganchepaw amatni kowh laiklow dow palusama kowi krawi tauet khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:4">amatni kowh laiklow dow lusa rihi chur kowi pat krawi tauet khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 19:4">Thurai dow mukuang kowi kowh sat vüi thawp pe uowi rah lowk khai;<verse eid="PSA 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 19:5" />nami sat dow paw masi thowi mih klanguüa iawng aia uowi rah hownia uang lawt reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:5">aia dow cham taowt iowm kownkow süngürma hown uang lawt mih maru iawng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 19:6" />Aia dow mukuang papra hownia uang lawt hanow akeng prakowi kup khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:6">aia kowh aden tawi ka dowi mih dow tawng chap paw uowi dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 19:7" />CHAKRAMANG kowh ari aiang dow aiung akümma chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:7">nami ari aiang hown dow maru takrüng tathowr reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 19:7">CHAKRAMANG kowh laiklow dow sakowmra uowima chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:7">nami laiklow dow saktuak tengma miuüa kowi pe chanlaira reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 19:8" />CHAKRAMANG kowh ana pek maten dow anowmma chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:8">naiawngün ana pek dow sak kowi pe awmrawmra reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 19:8">CHAKRAMANG kowh ari arow dow achinawmma chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:8">Nami dow pe mik thowira reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 19:9" />CHAKRAMANG kowi ringkawma hown kram mih dow chimsaira chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:9">Nami dow chowngchowng saksakma anikma chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 19:9">CHAKRAMANG kowh ari aiang dow anowmma chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:9">nami ari aiang kowi dow angak uowi dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 19:10" />Nami ari aiang dow kuh lak-e paw asung lang uowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:10">achangma mih kuh lak-e paw irra lang uowi khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 19:10">Nami dow kuai tui lak-e paw ding chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:10">kuaiba hownia kowh kuai tui lak-e paw lang ding chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 19:11" />Nami ari aiang dow nachang ngak dowi kownkow en nar kowi sangah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:11">nami ari aiang chün miuüa dow kri kraingma mih awmrawm sung ka reng.<verse eid="PSA 19:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 19:12" />Kowmatia tawi mih amia chow tuk?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:12">Ang tukah dowi mih angak dow lawtta ang diah.<verse eid="PSA 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 19:13" />Atawm tukma mih ngak changra hownia dow lang hen ang diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:13">naiawngün angak dow ang luk kowi hauang pe changah alow diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 19:13">Nahanow achinawmma ang nowng uowi kown towbowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:13">Angak iukma mih ang chownglawng kowi nauowi kown nadowi bowt.<verse eid="PSA 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 19:14" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, en dow ang kowh tatung tanimra hai lawng miia chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:14">ang nawr hownia kowh laiklow hai sak hownia kowh tuak mih pacham sak-ih en reng lah.<verse eid="PSA 19:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="PSA 20" />
  <para style="s">Thurai ming hown naruang tamkhuown kown mih</para>
  <para style="d">Mami dow David kowh meng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 20:1" />CHAKRAMANG dow en krat mih khin khe pacham khowng en reng lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 20:1">Jakawb kowh Thurai dow pacham lawng en lah.<verse eid="PSA 20:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 20:2" />Aia dow aia kowh chimsaima mih arah hownia pacham khowng en lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 20:2">Zaiawn hungh hownia pacham pe en kür reng lah.<verse eid="PSA 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 20:3" />En chang pe phuchua mih maten aia pacham ka tuak lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 20:3">en tikah mih uanap ün dow aia pacham paw en lah.<verse eid="PSA 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 20:4" />En nauah mih sia maten aia pacham pe en lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 20:4">en sangkrangah mih maten aia pacham pe phaw en lah.<verse eid="PSA 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 20:5" />En awng tasen mih khin khe anging naawmrawm kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 20:5">now Thurai ming hown anging naruang <char style="w">tamkhuown</char> kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 20:5">CHAKRAMANG dow en awr lü awr lengah mih maten pacham pe en lah.<verse eid="PSA 20:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 20:6" />Kawmat dow ang tuk khowk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 20:6">CHAKRAMANG dow aia nümnapah mih maru kowi natakhula reng kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 20:6">Aia nümnapah mih maru kowh hawk klow dow mukuang pren hownia aia naiu sünta pe reng kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 20:6">now aia kowh kür akraingma mih hown aia dow amatni kowi towkala reng kown.<verse eid="PSA 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 20:7" />Tawngbak mih maru dow amatni kowh kawrnga kari luk kowi neplawng nesak khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 20:7">tawngbak mih maru dow amatni kowh siphaiuüa luk kowi neplawng nesak khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 20:7">Tawkche anging dow CHAKRAMANG anging kowh Thurai ming kowi chowtaih neplawng nesak reng.<verse eid="PSA 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 20:8" />Thurai kowi neplawng nesak dowi miuüa dow nasum bowk kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 20:8">amatni dow tasenra kowi natim bowk kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 20:8">Tawkche anging dow anikma naiowng kown.<verse eid="PSA 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 20:9" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, en nümnapah mih mang kowi takhula diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 20:9">now anging haw en mih khin khe uang klang anging diah.<verse eid="PSA 20:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="PSA 21" />
  <para style="s">CHAKRAMANG kür rakowi mang awmrawm mih</para>
  <para style="d">Mami dow David kowh meng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 21:1" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, en peah kür rakowi mang dow awmrawm reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 21:1">en pe awngah khai rakowi aia dow lainowmma piaw reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 21:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 21:2" />Aia kowi dow aia nau mih en peah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 21:2">aia awr lü mih sia en peah reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 21:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 21:3" />Aia kowi dow en peah iungra khai, now aia kowh lup en pe chawnah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 21:3">aia lu kowi dow kuh hown kowh mang lukruk en kruk pe khai.<verse eid="PSA 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 21:4" />Aia dow en tut-e uang lü singra khai, now aia kowi dow en peah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 21:4">aia kowi dow chowngdawng sakklangma en pe singah khai.<verse eid="PSA 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 21:5" />En pe awngah rakowi aia dow ringkawra ahuma ka khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 21:5">aia kowi dow kiowrira hai kraingra en peah khai.<verse eid="PSA 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 21:6" />Aia kowi dow chowngchowng saksakma vüi en peah prasi khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 21:6">en tawi uowila reng rakowi aia dow lainowmma piaw khai.<verse eid="PSA 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 21:7" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow mang dow CHAKRAMANG luk kowi chowtaih neplawng nesak reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 21:7">lang kri lang kraing mih Thurai kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura hown mang dow anikma nauowi kown.<verse eid="PSA 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 21:8" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, en kowh ransu-uüa maten kowi dow en nakhümta bowk kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 21:8">sui en miuüa maten dow en hawmlawm rut kowi nauang tapham kown.<verse eid="PSA 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 21:9" />En uang mih khin khe amatni kowi dow maih hown en napiakah kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 21:9">Amatni kowi dow en kunmarauah rakowi en napiakah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 21:9">amatni kowi dow maih hown en nakamta kown.<verse eid="PSA 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 21:10" />Lusa hownia dow amatni kowh chauüa kowi en namata pe kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 21:10">lusa maru pungmadawng hownia dow amatni kowh krungchakuüa kowi en namitta pe kown.<verse eid="PSA 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 21:11" />Amatni dow nakingküa en kownkow thawp prengia ngak khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 21:11">Tawkche amatni kowh sangkrangra ngak dow nachawn kown nadowi.<verse eid="PSA 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 21:12" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni kowi tawngah now en nauüi leba kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 21:12">Nakhowk khe amatni dow khawlawt dowi kowi apowt natakla kown chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 21:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 21:13" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, en kowh kür uang tüng diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 21:13">nahanow en kowh kürra kowi anging narowsi hai natek meng kown.<verse eid="PSA 21:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="PSA 22" />
  <para style="s">Tawngplawng kowchow en powtta ang khai?</para>
  <para style="d">Mami dow David kowh meng chekhai. Mami meng dow “Rau-e kowh naki iia” pami meng owi iawng natekah kown takla.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 22:1" />Ang kowh Thurai, ang kowh Thurai, tawngplawng kowchow en powtta ang khai?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 22:1">Tawngplawng kowchow kar se ang awr lü mih en sünta ang dowi?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 22:1">Tawngplawng kowchow takhula ang dowi kowi alakma en lang uowi khai?<verse eid="PSA 22:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 22:2" />Aw ang kowh Thurai, ni towng ang awr haw en reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:2">Tawkche en iu klang ang dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 22:2">Iak towng ang awr haw en reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:2">Nachenganchepaw ang ka iungra dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 22:3" />Tawkche en dow chimsaima chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:3">en dow mang chowm rah kowi chowm hanow Israeluüa kowh rowsi kiowrira ka khai.<verse eid="PSA 22:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 22:4" />Anging kowh pipu-uüa dow en luk kowi chowtaih neplawng nesak reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:4">now amatni kowi dow en takhula reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 22:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 22:5" />En tut-e amatni uang kar hanow amatni kowi dow en takhula reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:5">en luk kowi neplawng nesak hanow amatni dow cham kla rukrai dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 22:6" />Nachenganchepaw ang dow maru nadowi, lowngsur kambawr chowtaih;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:6">ang kowi dow maru nü ang klowk ang dowi kowi sui ang khai.<verse eid="PSA 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 22:7" />Khi ang miuüa maten dow changla ang rensi kau khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:7">amatni dow kharema hown mü ang reng, now ngüp lu se tek büah mih,<verse eid="PSA 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 22:8" />“Aia dow CHAKRAMANG luk kowi neplawng nesak reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:8">Naiawng rakowi aia kowi mih CHAKRAMANG pacham takhula lah!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 22:8">Aia luk kowi dow CHAKRAMANG sak-ihah reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:8">Naiawng rakowi aia kowi mih CHAKRAMANG pacham takhula lah,” pakhai.<verse eid="PSA 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 22:9" />Au mu lak hownia uang lawtla ang mih dow en chowtaih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:9">ang kham iawn reng tak hownia en luk kowi neplawng nesak kown mih en sang ang khai.<verse eid="PSA 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 22:10" />Uang dia kung kowi ang kowi mih en rut kowi ap en khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:10">au mu lak kowi ang uowi hownia en chowtaih ang kowh Thurai.<verse eid="PSA 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 22:11" />Ang hownia alakma kowi hang cham uowi diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:11">tawngplawng kowchow panow ang kowh phih uang tawn khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:11">phih hownia nalawng ang kown mih miapaw uowi dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 22:12" />Ang kowh ransu-uüa dow chiala hawmh iawng rumta ang chuk khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:12">amatni dow Basan pren kowi kowh akürma kangowh mih chiala iawng umta ang lut khai.<verse eid="PSA 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 22:13" />Krawi cham chak khe kowh krangsi hek klow iawng</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:13">amatni dow kingküa ang kownkow hata nawr hüah khai.<verse eid="PSA 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 22:14" />Tui takhük iawng ang kowh dow kür khowk bowk khowk,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 22:14">ang kowh kung ming pang ming dow tasüt tasowi bowk khowk;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 22:14">iawn maih iawng ang kowh sak dow ter bowk khowk chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 22:15" />Akangma mih bawn kawng sek iawng ang kowh kür dow kang bowk khowk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:15">ang kowh dai dow krang kowi tadan tüng khowk.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 22:15">En nape kowng ang kownkow bawn dawng kowi en iüata ang hüah khai.<verse eid="PSA 22:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 22:16" />Ang kowh ransu-uüa dow kui hawmh iawng rumta chuk khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:16">amatni dow ang kowh rut hai khawk ün iaita ang nak khai.<verse eid="PSA 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 22:17" />Naiawng rakowi ang kowh hut khowm kaah rüa khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:17">ang kowh ransu-uüa dow awmrawm kowh tang müla ang mak khai.<verse eid="PSA 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 22:18" />Amatni dow ang kowh tawnguat taretah büah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:18">now ang kowh khupdip tawngklai vüi kuak plang büah khai.<verse eid="PSA 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 22:19" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, alakma kowi hangkow cham uowita ang diah!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:19">Aw ang kowh kür, uang khowng ang kownkow alenma uang diah!<verse eid="PSA 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 22:20" />Saidawng rut hownia uang takhula ang reng diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:20">pai iawngün kui hawmh hownia ang kowh asung khakma mih chownglawng towkala ang diah.<verse eid="PSA 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 22:21" />Naiawngün krangsi nawr hownia uang lawng ang diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:21">naiawngün chiarowngla nang hownia uang towkala ang diah.<verse eid="PSA 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 22:22" />Ang tainau-uüa tut-e en lawnguan ang nakrawi phuang kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:22">en kowh maru-uüa takua talawm mih rah kowi ang nakiow en kown.<verse eid="PSA 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 22:23" />CHAKRAMANG kowi ringkaw miuüa low, aia kowi rowsiah diah!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:23">Jakawb kowh krungchakuüa low, enni mih aia kowi ringkawah büa diah!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:23">Israel krungchakuüa low, enni mih aia kowi towah kiowri diah!<verse eid="PSA 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 22:24" />Aia dow ngare miuüa kowi suiah dowi hai nuata hüah dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:24">aia dow amatni hownia cham dangta pe lumowr dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 22:24">Naiawng changah lak dow amatni awr lü khowng mih aia hawt sünta pe reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 22:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 22:25" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, en kowh maru-uüa takua talawmra kri kowi ang nakiowri en kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:25">ringkawma hown kram en miuüa pur kowi ang takhamta mih uanap maten ang nachang en kown.<verse eid="PSA 22:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 22:26" />Ngarawng ngarai miuüa dow aduma naka cha reng kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:26">CHAKRAMANG kowi cham miuüa dow CHAKRAMANG kowi nakiowah kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 22:26">Amatni kowh sak dow chowngchowng saksakma pacham piaw reng lah.<verse eid="PSA 22:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 22:27" />Prenchur nammowt kowi kowh maru-uüa paw dia sar hanow CHAKRAMANG tut-e nauang kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:27">palusama kowi kowh chenchap maru maten paw aia pur kowi natabawk hanow aia kowi nachup naiiaah kown.<verse eid="PSA 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 22:28" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow CHAKRAMANG chowtaih mang,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:28">chen towng chap towng kowi kowh kruitown mih dow aia chowtaih.<verse eid="PSA 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 22:29" />Lusa kowi kowh kurengma miuüa paw aia pur kowi nacha nakham kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:29">now aia kowi nachup naiiaah kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 22:29">Kowng ngialia miuüa paw aia pur kowi nauang tabawk kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:29">now aia kowi nachup naiiaah kown.<verse eid="PSA 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 22:30" />Pur prakowi kowh krungchakuüa dow aia kowh lup nachang bowt kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:30">now maru-uüa tut-e mih CHAKRAMANG lawnguan natek büah kown.<verse eid="PSA 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 22:31" />Amatni dow aia tachi tanawm mih lawnguan nakrawi tek kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:31">amatni dow kawmat kowh uang dia dowi tak miuüa tut-e CHAKRAMANG changah mih lup lawnguan nakrawi phowng kown.<verse eid="PSA 22:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="PSA 23" />
  <para style="s">CHAKRAMANG dow thing ang miia</para>
  <para style="d">David kowh meng.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 23:1" />CHAKRAMANG dow thing ang miia chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 23:1">Naiawng rakowi tawngpaw ang nakhawr kown nadowi.<verse eid="PSA 23:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 23:2" />Aia dow dowm kowi kowh pram asingma mih dawng kowi pe tanai ang khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 23:2">now tui achimma mih awchawng ria kowi paw pawla ang reng.<verse eid="PSA 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 23:3" />Aia dow pe ang kür sar reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 23:3">Aia dow aia kowh tiama anowmma mih kowi kruila ang reng;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 23:3">nami dow aia kowh ming iungra natownla kownkow chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 23:4" />Makowng nim iawng aiiuma mih lawngrawi kowi mang takla chepaw</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 23:4">angak chap kowi dow ang nakram kown nadowi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 23:4">Tawngplawng kowchow panow en tawi uowila ang reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 23:4">en kowh raitua hai müa dow henta ang kramra reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 23:5" />Ransu-uüa pur kowi pawitang kowi en then ang chakkham khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 23:5">pinsüa kowi iawng lu kowi en klai ang sau hanow en rowsi ang khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 23:5">now ang kowh bia ue pat en pe ang prasi khai.<verse eid="PSA 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 23:6" />En kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura hai iungra ang kung nauang krawi reng kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 23:6">Nami dow chownglawng prat ang kung nauang krawi reng kown mih ang tuk.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 23:6">Nahanow CHAKRAMANG kim kowi dow chowngchowng saksakma ang nauowi reng kown.<verse eid="PSA 23:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="PSA 24" />
  <para style="s">Rowsira mang</para>
  <para style="d">David kowh meng.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 24:1" />Lusa hai alak kowi kowh maten CHAKRAMANG kowh chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 24:1">lusa hai alak kowi kowh uowi miuüa paw aia kowh chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 24:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 24:2" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia dow sata luk kowi kowh lusa tow miia chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 24:2">aia dow tui abüpma mih luk kowi nami lusa towah khai.<verse eid="PSA 24:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 24:3" />CHAKRAMANG hungh kowi pün kown tataing mih mia chow uowi?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 24:3">Aia kowh kim chimsaima mih kowi iowng kown tataing mih mia chow uowi?<verse eid="PSA 24:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 24:4" />Chang lup ngak dowi mih hai saktuak chimsaima mih maru chowtaih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 24:4">chup arup dowi mih hai tek dai lai dowi mih chowtaih tataing.<verse eid="PSA 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 24:5" />Aia kowi dow CHAKRAMANG napeah prasi kown, now nalawngah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 24:5">aia dow achinawmma pami aia kowh lawng miia naphuangah kown.<verse eid="PSA 24:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 24:6" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni dow CHAKRAMANG kowi cham reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 24:6">Amatni dow Jakawb kowh Thurai kowi chupiia reng chekhai. [Sela]<verse eid="PSA 24:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 24:7" />Aw marow tapplawtuüa low, auarma tauow büa diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 24:7">aningma mih kimplawtuüa low, auarma tauow büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 24:7">kri kraingma mih mang nauang kup kown chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 24:8" />Kri kraingma mih mang dow mia chow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 24:8">Aia dow CHAKRAMANG chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 24:8">Aia dow lang kri lang kraing mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 24:8">tasen kiakma mih CHAKRAMANG chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 24:9" />Aw marow tapplawtuüa low, auarma tauow büa diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 24:9">aningma mih kimplawtuüa low, auarma tauow büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 24:9">kri kraingma mih mang nauang kup kown chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 24:10" />Kri kraingma mih mang dow mia chow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 24:10">Aia dow mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 24:10">aia dow kri kraingma mih mang chekhai. [Sela]<verse eid="PSA 24:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="PSA 25" />
  <para style="s">En kowh tiama nowm kowi kruila ang diah</para>
  <para style="d">David kowh meng.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 25:1" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, ang kowh sak mih en tut-e ang uang ap en khai.<verse eid="PSA 25:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 25:2" />Aw ang kowh Thurai, en luk kowi chowtaih ang neplawng nesak reng;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:2">naiawng rakowi hauang pe ka ang rukrai diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:2">ang lawnguan kowi ang kowh ransu-uüa mih hang pacham ka piaw lah.<verse eid="PSA 25:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 25:3" />En luk kowi kowh owmsak mih maru dow naka rukrai kown nadowi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:3">Tawkche kingküa en miuüa dow naka rukrai kown.<verse eid="PSA 25:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 25:4" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, en kowh tiama tüng ang diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:4">en tiama kowi namang kown mih sang ang diah.<verse eid="PSA 25:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 25:5" />En kowh anowmma mih lawnguan kowi sang ang hanow krui ang diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:5">Tawngplawng kowchow panow en chowtaih ang kowh lawng miia Thurai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:5">ang dow atungma en luk kowi chowtaih ang owmsak reng.<verse eid="PSA 25:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 25:6" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, en kowh saksing sanara hai achur uowi dowi mih sakraura sak kowi towah reng diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:6">naiawngün dow achük alai hownia en tut-e uowi reng mih chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 25:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 25:7" />Ang klanguüa khe kowh angak hai kingküa en mih maten sak kowi hangkow towah diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:7">en kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura hown ang kowi mih sak kowi towah reng diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 25:7">Tawngplawng kowchow panow aw CHAKRAMANG, en dow aiungma chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 25:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 25:8" />CHAKRAMANG dow aiungma hai anowmma chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:8">Naiawng rakowi aia dow maru ngakuüa kowi tüng pe tiama nowm reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 25:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 25:9" />Aia dow khamsum khamdaw miuüa kowi tiama anowmma mih kowi kruila reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:9">now aia kowh tiama anowmma mih lawnguan kowi tüngsangah reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 25:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 25:10" />CHAKRAMANG kowh sangbowk laitawm hai ari aiang iawng mang miuüa kowi dow aia kruiah reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:10">amatni kowi dow aia kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura hai kaah sakowmma mih rah hown aia kruiah reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 25:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 25:11" />En kowh ming iung nang iung naia townla reng kownkow</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:11">Aw CHAKRAMANG, ang kowh ngak maten lawtta ang diah.<verse eid="PSA 25:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 25:12" />CHAKRAMANG kowi ringkawma hown kram miuüa kowi dow aia natüng pe tiama kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:12">amatni kowi dow tawng mih tiama kowi chow amang takla mih aia natüng pe kown.<verse eid="PSA 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 25:13" />Naiawng mih maru-uüa dow aiungma hown naia sun chownglawng kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:13">amatni kowh krungchakuüa dow naka powng pren reng kown.<verse eid="PSA 25:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 25:14" />CHAKRAMANG dow aia kowi ringkaw miuüa kowi changla auiua reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:14">aia dow aia kowh sangbowk laitawm amatni kowi tüngsangah reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 25:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 25:15" />Ang dow nakala khowng kownkow atungma CHAKRAMANG prakowi tang mü reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:15">Tawngplawng kowchow panow phih hownia uang lawng ang mih dow aia chowtaih.<verse eid="PSA 25:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 25:16" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, ang prakowi uang dang diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:16">now saksing sana ang diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 25:16">Tawngplawng kowchow panow ang dow lowk iachow hai akawm akratma chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 25:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 25:17" />Ang kowh tuak kawm tuak kratra uang hu ngamlam chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:17">akrat pusara maten hownia uang towkala ang diah.<verse eid="PSA 25:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 25:18" />Ang kowh tuak krat pusara sam mü ang madiah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:18">ang kowh angak maten uang lawtta ang diah.<verse eid="PSA 25:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 25:19" />Ang kowh ransu-uüa kawm krang sam mü madiah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:19">amatni dow lainowmma sui ang khai.<verse eid="PSA 25:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 25:20" />Uang takhula ang diah, now uang lawng ang diah, hauang pe ka ang rukrai diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:20">Tawngplawng kowchow panow en tut-e chowtaih ang uang tatung tanim khai.<verse eid="PSA 25:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 25:21" />Ang kowh anowmma mih lup hai aiungma mih lup rakowi uang takhula ang diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:21">Tawngplawng kowchow panow en tut-e chowtaih ang neplawng nesak khai.<verse eid="PSA 25:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 25:22" />Aw Thurai, akrat pusara maten hownia en maru Israeluüa kowi uang lawngah diah.<verse eid="PSA 25:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="PSA 26" />
  <para style="s">CHAKRAMANG kowi ang nakiow kown</para>
  <para style="d">David kowh meng.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 26:1" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, ang kowh angak uowi dowi pami phuangah diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 26:1">tawngplawng kowchow panow ang dow anowmma mang reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 26:1">now ang dow anikma en luk kowi neplawng nesak reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 26:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 26:2" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, uang chaing ang diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 26:2">ang sak lak kowi tawng chow uowi mih sam mü ang madiah.<verse eid="PSA 26:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 26:3" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow en kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura dow ang tamata dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 26:3">en kowh kaah sakowm mih rah sak kowi ang towah reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 26:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 26:4" />Ang dow dailama miuüa hown taiua dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 26:4">now kuanlama miuüa hownia ang lang tahen reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 26:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 26:5" />Chang lup ngak mih thumchakuüa kowi ang suiah reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 26:5">maru ngakuüa hown tawi taiua kown mih ang nau dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 26:6" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, ang kowh angak uowi dowi mih natüngla kownkow ang nasia rut kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 26:6">now nauang chupiia en kownkow en kowh phuchuara kowi ang nauang kown.<verse eid="PSA 26:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 26:7" />Natek en awmrawm lai kownkow atünma ang natek meng kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 26:7">now en changah mih awdara lup lawnguan maten maru-uüa kowi ang natek pe kown.<verse eid="PSA 26:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 26:8" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, en kowh kraingra dow en uowi rah kowi uowi reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 26:8">nami arah kowi dow ang sakrau khai.<verse eid="PSA 26:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 26:9" />Maru ngakuüa thum kowi hauang klowkla ang diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 26:9">sai maru miuüa hown hauang saila ang diah.<verse eid="PSA 26:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 26:10" />Maru ngakuüa kowh sangkrangra dow nachang ngak kown mih kangowh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 26:10">now amatni dow cha büm cha sua reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 26:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 26:11" />Nachenganchepaw ang dow anowmma mang reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 26:11">Naiawng rakowi sana ang diah, now lawng ang diah.<verse eid="PSA 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 26:12" />Ang dow thaulangma mih arah kowi ang iowng khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 26:12">aia maru-uüa pur kowi CHAKRAMANG kowi ang nakiowah kown.<verse eid="PSA 26:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="PSA 27" />
  <para style="s">CHAKRAMANG dow ang kowh anowi</para>
  <para style="d">David kowh meng.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 27:1" />CHAKRAMANG dow ang kowh anowi hai ang kowh lawng miia chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:1">naiawng rakowi mia kowi chow ang nakram kown?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 27:1">CHAKRAMANG dow ang kowh akhawtma mih kangchawngra kim chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:1">tawngplawng kowchow ang nakram kown?<verse eid="PSA 27:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 27:2" />Maru ngakuüa dow nauang piak ang kownkow uang tarü reng;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:2">nami khin khe amatni dow tatui hanow tim büah reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 27:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 27:3" />Siphaiuüa rumta ang lut chepaw ang nakramah kown nadowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:3">amatni uang sen ang chepaw Thurai luk kowi ang naowmsak reng kown.<verse eid="PSA 27:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 27:4" />CHAKRAMANG tut-e ang lüah mih sia uowi pachap mih dow:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:4">chownglawng prat CHAKRAMANG kim kowi ang naka uowi kown mih chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 27:4">Nahanow aia klangiung mih krang ang naka mü kown towbowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:4">now aia lawnguan kowi ang natuak reng kown towbowt.<verse eid="PSA 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 27:5" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow ang kla phih mih khin khe aia dow nape tatung tanim ang kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:5">aia dow aia kowh kim chimsaima mih kowi napet ang reng kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:5">now singku huamang akroma mih luk kowi aia natow ang kown.<verse eid="PSA 27:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 27:6" />Nakhowk khe dow rum ang reng mih ransu-uüa lak-e ang kowh ringkawra nalang hu kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:6">awmrawmma hown aia kim kowi maiow maiow phuchua pawi ang nachang bowt kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 27:6">CHAKRAMANG vüi kowi ang natek meng kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:6">aia kiow müa meng ang natek reng kown.<verse eid="PSA 27:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 27:7" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, ang haw en hanow sünta ang diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:7">saksing sana ang diah, now uang klang ang reng diah.<verse eid="PSA 27:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 27:8" />“Ang tut-e uang lü uang leng büa diah,” pahai en tekah mih laiklow ang sak kowi uowi reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:8">Naiawng rakowi aw CHAKRAMANG, ang nahaw en reng kown.<verse eid="PSA 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 27:9" />En kowh lumowr mih ang hownia hangkow cham dangta ang diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:9">en kunmarau rakowi en kowh nar kowi hangkow nuata diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 27:9">Khowng ang reng mih dow en chowtaih chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 27:9">Aw CHAKRAMANG, ang kowh lawng miia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:9">hangkow powtta ang diah, now hauang nuata ang diah.<verse eid="PSA 27:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 27:10" />Ang kowh u-pa nuata ang chepaw</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:10">en dow namingkhet ang reng kown.<verse eid="PSA 27:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 27:11" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, ang kowh ransu-uüa dow akawmma chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:11">Naiawng rakowi en kowh tiama tüng ang diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:11">now tiama anowmma mih kowi kruila ang reng diah.<verse eid="PSA 27:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 27:12" />Ang kowh ransu-uüa rut kowi hauang apta ang hüah diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:12">amatni dow amatni nau iawng nachang ang kown chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 27:12">Tawngplawng kowchow panow daila saksiuüa kingküa ang mih nowm khowk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:12">amatni dow nachang ang anowng apowng kown mih nau mih nowm chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 27:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 27:13" />Ang chownglawng kowi en iung mih krang ang nakhila ngengche kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:13">nami lawnguan kowi ang owm chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 27:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 27:14" />CHAKRAMANG luk kowi sakowm büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:14">sakkhawtma hai sakkraingma uowiah büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 27:14">CHAKRAMANG luk kowi owmsak büa reng diah.<verse eid="PSA 27:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="PSA 28" />
  <para style="s">CHAKRAMANG dow ang kowh kür hai kawngma</para>
  <para style="d">David kowh meng.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 28:1" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, en dow ang kowh tatung tanimra Singku Huamang,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 28:1">ang haw en hanow hawt sünta ang diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 28:1">En che klang ang dowi hanow</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 28:1">kowng miuüa iawng chowtaih ang naown kown.<verse eid="PSA 28:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 28:2" />Nakhowng ang kownkow ang haw en mih khin khe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 28:2">en chupra kim lang chimsai mih prakowi dang hanow iaw rut se ang haw en khe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 28:2">ang kowh hawk klow dow sünta ang diah.<verse eid="PSA 28:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 28:3" />Maru ngakuüa dow lowra maru hown aiungma taklowp taklang reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 28:3">Tawkche amatni kowh sak kowi angak tuak kangowh chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 28:3">Narip ang kownkow naiawngün thumchakuüa hown hauang küngla ang diah.<verse eid="PSA 28:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 28:4" />Amatni changah mih lup sung amatni kowi peah diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 28:4">amatni kowh lup ngak sung amatni kowi peah diah.<verse eid="PSA 28:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 28:5" />Amatni dow CHAKRAMANG changah mih lup kowi pe ching dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 28:5">Naiawng rakowi CHAKRAMANG dow achowngma vüi amatni kowi napiakah kown.<verse eid="PSA 28:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 28:6" />CHAKRAMANG dow ang lü mih sünta ang khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 28:6">Naiawng rakowi aia dow akiow pauowi lah.<verse eid="PSA 28:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 28:7" />CHAKRAMANG dow ang kowh kür hai ang kowh kawngma chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 28:7">ang kowh sak dow aia luk kowi neplawng nesak reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 28:7">aia dow uang khowng ang khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 28:7">Naiawng rakowi lainowmma ang kowh sak piaw khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 28:7">now aia kowi dow meng hown ang kiowah khai.<verse eid="PSA 28:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 28:8" />CHAKRAMANG dow aia maru-uüa kowi peah kür reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 28:8">aia dow aia phawk pe sau mih manguüa kowi lawngah reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 28:9" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, en maru-uüa kowi takhula reng diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 28:9">en matia kowh maru-uüa kowi peah prasi reng diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 28:9">Ruapur thing mih iawng dow en maru-uüa kowi tawi uowila reng diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 28:9">chowngchowng saksakma amatni kowi mingkhetah reng diah.<verse eid="PSA 28:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="PSA 29" />
  <para style="s">CHAKRAMANG kowh kürra hai kri kraingra</para>
  <para style="d">David kowh meng.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 29:1" />Mukuang kramamu-uüa low, CHAKRAMANG kowi kiow büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 29:1">aia kowh kürra hai kri kraingra lawnguan krawi phuang büa diah.<verse eid="PSA 29:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 29:2" />CHAKRAMANG kowh kraingra uowima mih ming kowi kiow büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 29:2">kri kraingma hai chimsaima mih CHAKRAMANG kowi chupiia büa diah.<verse eid="PSA 29:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 29:3" />CHAKRAMANG kowh klow dow sata tui luk kowi ta reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 29:3">kri kraingma mih Thurai dow kaikreng tün kowi tüng klow reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 29:3">now tui talowng phunglung mih klow kowi aia kowh hek klow dow ta reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 29:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 29:4" />CHAKRAMANG kowh klow dow lainowmma kür chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 29:4">aia kowh klow kowi dow kri kraingra atekma chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 29:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 29:5" />Nami klow hown dow sidar singh paw talak phar reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 29:5">Lebanawn kowi kowh sidar singh paw tadi naknak reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 29:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 29:6" />Aia dow Lebanawn kowi kowh hungma mawngma kowi chia chah lo dowklowk mih iawng changah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 29:6">now Harmawn hungh kowi paw chiarowngla chah chet dawklawk mih iawng aia changah khai.<verse eid="PSA 29:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 29:7" />CHAKRAMANG kowh klow hown dow kuang kowi pla nowi reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 29:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 29:8" />Nami klow hown dow süngrüp süngkangma paw chür nukluk reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 29:8">Kades kowi kowh süngrüp süngkangma kowi paw aia pe chürah reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 29:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 29:9" />Aia kowh klow hown dow akhin nadowi tak khe ngahiu pawm khowm pen reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 29:9">now kaurawng kowi kowh singh ram kauram paw prua reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 29:9">Aia chup kim kowi kowh uowi mih maru maten,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 29:9">“Kraingra uowi lai kowbow!” pahai atünma tek reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 29:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 29:10" />Tuikling mangma paw CHAKRAMANG low kowi kowh uowi mih chowtaih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 29:10">CHAKRAMANG dow chowngchowng saksakma chowm mang reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 29:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 29:11" />CHAKRAMANG dow aia maru-uüa kowi peah kür reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 29:11">now amatni kowi peah thaulangra hanow peah prasi reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 29:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="PSA 30" />
  <para style="s">Rau-e khe dow awmrawmra uang ting reng</para>
  <para style="d">David kowh meng. Mami dow ap Thurai chup kim khe kowh meng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 30:1" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, ang nakiow en reng kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 30:1">tawngplawng kowchow panow kowngra hownia en uang lawng ang khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 30:1">ang kowh ransu-uüa kowi ang lawnguan kowi en pe ka piawah dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 30:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 30:2" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, ang kowh Thurai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 30:2">naiung ang arau kownkow ang haw en khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 30:2">nahanow ang kowh arau mih en uang iungta ang khai.<verse eid="PSA 30:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 30:3" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, kowngra hownia en uang lawng ang khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 30:3">tadupra kowi natingla dowi kownkow en uang pe sing ang khai.<verse eid="PSA 30:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 30:4" />CHAKRAMANG kowi owm miuüa low,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 30:4">CHAKRAMANG rowsi meng tek büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 30:4">Chimsaima mih Thurai changah mih lawnguan tuak büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 30:4">now aia kowi tek pe awmrawm lai büa diah.<verse eid="PSA 30:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 30:5" />CHAKRAMANG kowh kunmarau dow nawngchow taih.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 30:5">Tawkche aia kowh saksing sanara dow achowngma chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 30:5">Uar prowt kar hai mik tui hown uowi chepaw</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 30:5">rau-e khe dow awmrawmra uang ting reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 30:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 30:6" />Akrat pusara uowi dowi khe ang tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 30:6">“Miapaw uang nowng ang dowi bowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="PSA 30:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 30:7" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, en saksing sana ang rakowi thaulangma ang uowi reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 30:7">Tawkche en cham dangta ang khe dow lainowmma ang kram reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 30:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 30:8" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, en kowi chowtaih ang haw en reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 30:8">saksing sana ang kownkow CHAKRAMANG kowi ang tek pe mih,<verse eid="PSA 30:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 30:9" />“Ang kowng mih tawng chow en kowh maratra uowi?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 30:9">Ang chowng bawn khe ang ia kiow en kown pe bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 30:9">Nakhowk khe en dow kaah sakowmma pami ang krawi ia phuang kown pe bow?<verse eid="PSA 30:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 30:10" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, sünta diah, saksing sana ang diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 30:10">aw CHAKRAMANG, uang khowng ang diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="PSA 30:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 30:11" />Uowila uiting uangtak mih arah hownia plaira kowi en uang pawla ang khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 30:11">now uowila uiting uangtak mih tawnguat en klüpta ang hanow piawla kown mih tawnguat en khup ang khai.<verse eid="PSA 30:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 30:12" />Naiawng rakowi ririmma ang uowi phulu kown nadowk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 30:12">en vüi kowi ang natek rowsi meng bowt kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 30:12">Aw CHAKRAMANG, en dow ang kowh Thurai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 30:12">chowngchowng saksakma ang natek en awmrawm lai kown.<verse eid="PSA 30:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="PSA 31" />
  <para style="s">Ang kowh lümla dow en rut kowi ang apta khowk</para>
  <para style="d">Mami dow David kowh meng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 31:1" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, en tut-e chowtaih ang tatung tanim reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:1">Naiawng rakowi tawng khe paw hauang pe ka ang rukrai diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 31:1">En dow achinawmma mih Thurai chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:1">Naiawng rakowi uang towkala ang reng diah.<verse eid="PSA 31:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 31:2" />Ang awr lü mih hawt sünta ang diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:2">now alenma uang lawng ang diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 31:2">Takhula ang kownkow uang chowng singku huamang diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:2">now akhawtma mih kangchawngra kim uang chowng diah.<verse eid="PSA 31:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 31:3" />Ang kowh Singku Huamang dow en chowtaih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:3">ang kowh akhawtma mih kangchawngra kim paw en chowtaih.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 31:3">En kowh ming iung natownla kownkow uang tüng ang tiama diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:3">nami tiama prakowi dow en kruila ang reng diah.<verse eid="PSA 31:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 31:4" />Ransu-uüa chakta ang hüah mih leng hownia uang lawng ang diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:4">Tawngplawng kowchow panow en dow ang kowh tatung tanimra chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 31:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 31:5" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, ang kowh lümla mih en rut kowi ang uang apta khowk;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:5">tawngplawng kowchow panow en dow kaah sakowm mih Thurai chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:5">phih hownia uang lawng ang reng mih dow en chowtaih chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 31:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 31:6" />Asung uowi dowi mih arup aren kowi chup miuüa kowi ang sui reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:6">Nachenganchepaw ang dow CHAKRAMANG luk kowi chowtaih neplawng nesak reng.<verse eid="PSA 31:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 31:7" />En kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura ang ka rakowi napiaw hai ang naawmrawm reng kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:7">tawngplawng kowchow panow ang tuak krat mih en khi ang reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:7">now akawm akrat hown ang uowi mih paw en tuk reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 31:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 31:8" />Ang kowh ransu-uüa rut kowi en apta ang hüah dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:8">ang nau rah kowi cham ia kowila kownkow thaulangma en tow ang khai.<verse eid="PSA 31:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 31:9" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, saksing sana ang diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 31:9">Tawngplawng kowchow panow akrat pusa hown ang uowi thüm chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:9">tuak krat lai rakowi ang kowh mik hai kow uak mih nowm khowk.<verse eid="PSA 31:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 31:10" />Akrat pusara kangowh hown ang nakowng kown chowbowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:10">tuak kawm tuak krat hown ang kowh chowng chur kown chowbowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 31:10">Ang kowh angak hu lai rakowi ang kowh kür uowi dowi bowt chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:10">ang kowh hut khowm padow raw bowk khowk chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 31:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 31:11" />Ang kowh ransu-uüa mih changla ang rensi kau khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:11">ang kowh kimping namkhetuüa khowm padow tawi changla ang rensi kau khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 31:11">Tuk ang miuüa maten dow ang tut-e uang kown mih khowm kram khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:11">amatni dow tiama rawng kowi krum ang hanow powt khai.<verse eid="PSA 31:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 31:12" />Kowng miuüa kowi maru tamata iawng ang kowi paw maru tamata ang khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:12">ang dow kaah atawng dowk mih tuikawng teuia iawng towbowt.<verse eid="PSA 31:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 31:13" />Maru prawngren ang mih laiklow ang ta khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:13">ang riaret kowi taum lut kramra kangowh chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 31:13">Amatni dow nakingküa ang kownkow thawp prengia khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:13">amatni dow nasaita ang kownkow sangkrang büa khai.<verse eid="PSA 31:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 31:14" />Nachenganchepaw aw CHAKRAMANG, en luk kowi ang neplawng nesak khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:14">“En chowtaih ang kowh Thurai,” pahai ang tek reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 31:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 31:15" />Ang kowh chownglawng dow en rut kowi chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:15">uang krawi ang mih ransu-uüa rut hownia lawng ang diah.<verse eid="PSA 31:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 31:16" />En nar luk kowi en kowh saksing sanara mih anowi iawng pauang tatüng lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:16">en kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura hown uang lawng ang diah.<verse eid="PSA 31:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 31:17" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, en tut-e ang uang lü khowng khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:17">Naiawng rakowi hauang pe ka ang rukrai diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 31:17">Maru ngakuüa kowi phai pe kaah rukrai diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:17">now makownguüa uowi rah ririmma pacham uowi lah.<verse eid="PSA 31:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 31:18" />Bawrima hai sui saktuak hown tek dai lai miuüa kowh nawr mih kowpta pe diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:18">amatni dow achinawmma mih maru-uüa kowi kingküala kownkow tek dai lai mih chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 31:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 31:19" />Ringkaw en miuüa kowi en peah iungra mih dow lainowmma kri kraing khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:19">en tut-e kowh tatung tanim miuüa kowi dow maru maten pur kowi en peah iungra reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 31:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 31:20" />Amatni kowi nakingküaah kownkow maru sangkrang khe en tut-e en petah reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:20">amatni kowi dow ransu-uüa prawng renra hownia en tut-e en pe tatung tanimah reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 31:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 31:21" />CHAKRAMANG dow akiow pauowi lah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:21">ang uowiah mih marow kowi ransu-uüa uang rumta ang lut khe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:21">awdara uowima hown aia dow aia kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura tüng ang khai.<verse eid="PSA 31:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 31:22" />“CHAKRAMANG powtta ang khai bowt,” padow ang takrow lai kowh ang tek khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:22">Nachenganchepaw nauang khowng ang kownkow ang haw en khe en sünta ang khai.<verse eid="PSA 31:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 31:23" />Thurai maru-uüa low, CHAKRAMANG kowi sakrauah büa diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:23">CHAKRAMANG dow kaah sakowm miuüa kowi takhula reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 31:23">Tawkche bawrima miuüa kowi dow achima aia peah ripra reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 31:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 31:24" />CHAKRAMANG luk kowi owmsak miuüa low,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:24">sakkhawtma hai sakkraingma uowiah büa diah.<verse eid="PSA 31:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="PSA 32" />
  <para style="s">Aprek lawtra ka mih maru dow prasira uowima</para>
  <para style="d">David kowh meng.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 32:1" />Thurai kowi kingküa mih aprek lawtra ka mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 32:1">Thurai lawtta pe angak mih maru dow prasira uowima.<verse eid="PSA 32:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 32:2" />Thurai klowk pe angak dowi mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 32:2">kuan kown mih saktuak uowi dowi mih maru dow prasira uowima chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 32:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 32:3" />CHAKRAMANG, en tut-e dow atungma ang uang lü uang leng reng chowdiah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 32:3">Tawkche ang kowh angak dow ang taphuang dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 32:3">Naiawng rakowi ang lu prasi towng ang kow uak khai.<verse eid="PSA 32:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 32:4" />Nakhowk khe dow ni chut uar prowt chi en ripta ang hüah chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 32:4">ang kowh kür dow satma khin khe kowh tui kang mih iawng e rürü chekhai. [Sela]<verse eid="PSA 32:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 32:5" />Nakhowk khe ang kowh angak mih en tut-e ang uang taphuang khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 32:5">ang kowh aprek mih ang khuah dowi bowt chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 32:5">Ang tek mih, “Ang kingküaah mih laiklow CHAKRAMANG tut-e ang taphuang bowt kown,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 32:5">Now ang changta angak mih aprek dow en lawtta ang khai. [Sela]<verse eid="PSA 32:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 32:6" />Naiawng rakowi aw CHAKRAMANG, khin uowi reng tak khe en maru-uüa mih en tut-e pauang lü khowng lah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 32:6">Nahanow tuikling mangma iawng mih phih uang ting khe paw amatni mih natawi piak kown nadowi bowt.<verse eid="PSA 32:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 32:7" />En dow ang kowh tapetra chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 32:7">en dow akrat pusara hownia uang towkala ang khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 32:7">En lawng ang rakowi how se ang rowsi en khai. [Sela]<verse eid="PSA 32:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 32:8" />En tek ang mih, “Ang dow CHAKRAMANG, ang nape en chanlaira kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 32:8">tawng mih tiama kowi chow amang kla mih ang natüng en kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 32:8">ang natüng nasang en hanow ang namingkhet en reng kown.<verse eid="PSA 32:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 32:9" />Tawngpaw tuk dowi mih kawrnga hai kawrngaramchük iawng hang uowi büa diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 32:9">amatni kowi dow mum pe nawrbawng hanow leng hown akhuowk takla,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 32:9">nadowi now en naura prakowi en cham ia pawla kown nadowi,” pakhai.<verse eid="PSA 32:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 32:10" />Maru ngakuüa dow lainowmma nakawm nakrat kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 32:10">CHAKRAMANG luk kowi kowh neplawng nesak miuüa dow aia sakraura naka kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 32:10">now amatni dow aia kowh achur uowi dowi mih saksing sanara naka reng kown.<verse eid="PSA 32:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 32:11" />Naiawng rakowi CHAKRAMANG maru-uüa low,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 32:11">aia luk kowi piaw hai awmrawm büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 32:11">Saktuak achinawmma miuüa low,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 32:11">enni bowkbowk tek awmrawm meng büa diah.<verse eid="PSA 32:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="PSA 33" />
  <para style="s">CHAKRAMANG kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 33:1" />Thurai maru-uüa low, CHAKRAMANG kowi awmrawmma kowh how büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:1">achinawmma mih maru-uüa kowh lup dow aia lawnguan kowi natek meng kown mih chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 33:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 33:2" />Tepla taraw se CHAKRAMANG kowi tek pe awmrawm lai büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:2">aia vüi hamüt iang mih taraw tep büa diah.<verse eid="PSA 33:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 33:3" />Meng sar hown aia kowi kiowah büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:3">tünteu iungma hown awmrawmma tek meng büa diah.<verse eid="PSA 33:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 33:4" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow CHAKRAMANG kowh laiklow dow anowmma chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:4">aia kowh lup maten dow kaah sakowm reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 33:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 33:5" />CHAKRAMANG dow lup iung hai tara nowm kowi nau reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:5">aia kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura dow palusama kowi atekma chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 33:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 33:6" />CHAKRAMANG dow aia kowh ana hown mukuang mih thawpah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:6">now nakowi kowh uowi mih maten paw aia kowh laiklow hown thawpah khai,<verse eid="PSA 33:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 33:7" />Aia dow sata kowi kowh tui arasang kuaah hanow chunah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:7">naiawngün tui dow abüpma mih atowk rah kowi aia towah khai.<verse eid="PSA 33:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 33:8" />Lusa kowi kowh maru maten CHAKRAMANG kowi pacham kram lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:8">lusa kowi kowh maru maten mih aia kowi pacham ringkawah lah.<verse eid="PSA 33:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 33:9" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia laiklow hown lusa dow uang phaw khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:9">aia peta ana hanow lowra chap uang phaw khai.<verse eid="PSA 33:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 33:10" />Paprenma aluchowuüa kowh sangkrangra dow CHAKRAMANG piakta pe reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:10">amatni tuakta iawng CHAKRAMANG pe phawah dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 33:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 33:11" />Nachenganchepaw CHAKRAMANG kowh sangkrangra dow anikma chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:11">aia kowh sangkrangra dow chowngchowng saksakma anikma uowi reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 33:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 33:12" />CHAKRAMANG kowi kham Thurai mih prenchakuüa dow prasira uowima chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:12">aia changla dawngthawnguan kownkow aia kloah mih chenchapuüa dow prasira uowima chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 33:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 33:13" />CHAKRAMANG dow mukuang pren hownia lusa kowi iu mü reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:13">aia dow maru maten luk kowi krawi tang mü reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 33:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 33:14" />Lusa kowi kowh uowi mih maru-uüa kowi dow aia iu müah reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:14">amatni kowi dow aia kowh uowi rah hownia aia iu müah reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 33:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 33:15" />Lusa maru maten kowh sak dow CHAKRAMANG thawpah mih chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:15">Naiawng rakowi lusa maru changah mih srui aia tuk bowk chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 33:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 33:16" />Siphai hawmh akawmma chepaw amia mang paw kowmatia kowi ia towkala dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:16">now tasen kiakma mih siphai paw aia kowh kür hown kowmatia kowi nowng towkala dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 33:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 33:17" />Kawrnga kowi neplawng nesak kowh naawng tasen kown tuak mih maru dow bualama chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:17">Tawngplawng kowchow panow kawrnga dow akürma chepaw ia towkala maru dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 33:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 33:18" />Nachenganchepaw CHAKRAMANG kowi ringkawma hown kram miuüa kowi dow aia mingkhetah reng chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:18">aia kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura kowi owmsak miuüa kowi dow aia mingkhetah reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 33:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 33:19" />Amatni kowi dow kowngra hownia CHAKRAMANG lawngah reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:19">amatni kowi dow khown hownia aia pe plaiah reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 33:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 33:20" />Anging dow CHAKRAMANG luk kowi owmsak reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:20">aia dow anging kowh khowng mih hai anging kowh kawngma chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 33:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 33:21" />Aia rakowi anging kowh sak napiaw reng kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:21">anging dow aia kowh ming chimsaima mih kowi neplawng nesak reng kown.<verse eid="PSA 33:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 33:22" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, en kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura anging luk kowi pacham uowi reng lah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:22">Tawngplawng kowchow panow anging dow en luk kowi chowtaih neplawng nesak reng.<verse eid="PSA 33:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="PSA 34" />
  <para style="s">CHAKRAMANG iung krang tuk kown nau now chaingah diah</para>
  <para style="d">David kowh meng. Abimelek pur kowi David chang thuk iow kowh David kowi Abimelek prütah khai. Mami dow Abimelek hownia David powt khe kowh meng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 34:1" />CHAKRAMANG kowi atungma ang nakiowah reng kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:1">aia kiow müa meng dow ang nawr kowi atungma nauowi reng kown.<verse eid="PSA 34:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 34:2" />CHAKRAMANG lawnguan kowi ang nachang bawri reng kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:2">nami tata hanow khamsum khamdaw miuüa dow pacham awmrawm lah.<verse eid="PSA 34:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 34:3" />Chu, CHAKRAMANG kowh kri kraingra lawnguan a-i taiua phuang diah sik,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:3">chu, aia kowh kri kraingma mih ming kowi a-i taiua rowsi diah sik.<verse eid="PSA 34:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 34:4" />Ang hawah hanow CHAKRAMANG dow uang klang ang khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:4">kramra chap maiow hownia aia dow uang lawng ang khai.<verse eid="PSA 34:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 34:5" />Ka khowng kownkow aia prakowi tang mü miuüa dow awmrawm reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:5">amatni kowh lumowr kowi dow rukrai mih powm nauowi kown nadowi bowt.<verse eid="PSA 34:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 34:6" />Khowng ang kown mih miapaw uowi dowi kowh CHAKRAMANG kowi ang hawah khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:6">Nakhowk khe aia dow uang klang ang hanow akrat pusara maten hownia uang lawng ang khai.<verse eid="PSA 34:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 34:7" />CHAKRAMANG kowi ringkaw miuüa kowi dow CHAKRAMANG kowh kramamu towkala reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:7">amatni kowi dow tavir lut CHAKRAMANG kowh kramamu tawi chawngah reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 34:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 34:8" />CHAKRAMANG iung krang tuk kown nau now chaingah diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:8">aia tut-e kowh tatung tanim miuüa dow prasira uowima chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 34:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 34:9" />Thurai maru-uüa low, CHAKRAMANG kowi ringkawma hown kramah büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:9">Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia kowi ringkaw miuüa dow tawngpaw khawr dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 34:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 34:10" />Krangsila powrchow khowm padow khawr chakkham rakowi sakkrai hown kawm reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:10">Nachenganchepaw CHAKRAMANG kowi cham miuüa dow aiung sia khawr dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 34:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 34:11" />Chauüa low, uang büa diah, now ang kowh laiklow uang sünta büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:11">CHAKRAMANG kowi naringkawah kown mih krang ang sang enni sow.<verse eid="PSA 34:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 34:12" />Apiawma nasun chownglawng kown nau mih mia chow uowi?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:12">Apiaw apama hai chowngdawng sakklangma sing kown mia chow nau?<verse eid="PSA 34:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 34:13" />Naiawng che enni nau hanow enni kowh dai hownia lai ngak hang pacham lawt lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:13">now en kowh nawr hownia nakuanla maru kown mih lai hang pacham lawt lah.<verse eid="PSA 34:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 34:14" />Lup ngak hownia alakma lang uowi diah, now chang lup iung diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:14">Maru maten hown taking tasangra nauowila reng kownkow towsak diah.<verse eid="PSA 34:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 34:15" />Tiama nowm kowi mang miuüa luk kowi dow CHAKRAMANG kowh mik uowi reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:15">amatni kowh hawk klow nasünta pe kownkow aia kowh param dow auowma uowi reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 34:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 34:16" />Tawkche chang lup ngak miuüa kowi dow CHAKRAMANG kingküaah reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:16">Nami dow amatni kowh ming mih lusa hownia naphiawkta pe kownkow chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 34:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 34:17" />Chang lup iung miuüa kowh kar klow dow CHAKRAMANG sünta pe reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:17">amatni kowi dow akrat pusara maten hownia aia lawngah reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 34:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 34:18" />Sak piak miuüa tut-e dow CHAKRAMANG tawi uowi reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:18">sak ter iawmlawm khowk miuüa kowi dow aia lawngah reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 34:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 34:19" />Achinawmma mih maru dow ahuma kla phih reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:19">Nachenganchepaw aia kowi dow atungma CHAKRAMANG lawngah reng.<verse eid="PSA 34:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 34:20" />Aia kowh hut maten CHAKRAMANG takhula pe reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:20">aiamat kowh hut dow lowkchow khowm nataklowk kown nadowi.<verse eid="PSA 34:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 34:21" />Maru ngakuüa dow amatni kowh lup ngak rakowi nakowng kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:21">lup iung chang miuüa kowi sui miuüa dow naka ripra kown.<verse eid="PSA 34:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 34:22" />Tawkche aia naruüa kowi dow CHAKRAMANG lawngah reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:22">aia tut-e tatung tanim miuüa dow miapaw sumra kowi nauowi kown nadowi.<verse eid="PSA 34:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 34" />
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="PSA 35" />
  <para style="s">CHAKRAMANG dow aia naruüa iung mih kowi awmrawm reng</para>
  <para style="d">David kowh meng.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 35:1" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, kingküa ang miuüa kowi en paw kingküaah diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:1">ang kowi kowh sen ang miuüa kowi en paw senah diah.<verse eid="PSA 35:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 35:2" />Kawngma iuk hai kawngma sowm dowk diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:2">now nakhowng ang kownkow uang iowngla ang diah.<verse eid="PSA 35:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 35:3" />Uang kawikrawi ang miuüa kowi reh hown hawt sawtah diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:3">now, “Ang lawng en sow,” pahai ang tut-e uang takham diah.<verse eid="PSA 35:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 35:4" />Saita ang kown nau miuüa dow pacham ka rukrai lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:4">napiak ang kownkow sangkrang miuüa dow ka rukrai hanow pacham plan lah.<verse eid="PSA 35:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 35:5" />Amatni dow li hown kowh chapli rown iawng pacham rown bowk lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:5">amatni kowi dow CHAKRAMANG kowh kramamu pacham prütah lah.<verse eid="PSA 35:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 35:6" />Amatni kowh tiama mih aiiuma hai aklaima pacham phaw lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:6">CHAKRAMANG kowh kramamu amatni kowi pacham krawiah lah.<verse eid="PSA 35:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 35:7" />Amatni dow aiawnglowma kuam luk kowi chak ang leng khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:7">alow akan uowi dowi matchang amatni dow thai ang kuam büah khai.<verse eid="PSA 35:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 35:8" />Naiawng rakowi amatni luk kowi mih linlanma piakra pacham ting lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:8">amatni chak ang mih leng kowi amatni tasowk hanow pacham piak lah.<verse eid="PSA 35:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 35:9" />Nakhowk khe dow CHAKRAMANG lawnguan kowi ang napiaw kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:9">aia pe ang mih lawngra rakowi ang naawmrawm kown.<verse eid="PSA 35:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 35:10" />Nakhowk khe dow ang kowh sak maiow natek kown mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:10">“Aw CHAKRAMANG, en iawng mih mia chow uowi?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 35:10">Kür uowi dowi miuüa kowi akürma miuüa rut hownia mia chow nowng lawng mih uowi?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:10">Ngarai miuüa kowi krawi thowk damra miuüa rut hownia mia chow nowng lawng mih uowi?” napa kown.<verse eid="PSA 35:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 35:11" />Dai lai saksiuüa dow nathuak saksi kownkow tara chetra kowi iowng khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:11">amatni dow ang tukah dowi mih lawnguan kowi bek ang angak khai.<verse eid="PSA 35:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 35:12" />Amatni dow ang changah aiung mih takcha chang ang angak khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:12">ang kowh sakowmra tama bowk khowk.<verse eid="PSA 35:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 35:13" />Nachenganchepaw amatni arau uowi khe ang khup sala uan khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:13">naiawng hai amatni vüi ang tawi uowila pe uiting uangtak khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 35:13">Ang khang pe hawm khükhü amatni vüi ang kham ngare khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:13">now amatni kowh arau naiungla kownkow ang chup pe Thurai khai.<verse eid="PSA 35:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 35:14" />Tainau hai auiua kowng khe kowh iawng amatni vüi ang uowi pe uiting uangtak khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:14">ang kowh u kowng khe kowh uowila uiting uangtak mih iawng ang uowi pe khai.<verse eid="PSA 35:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 35:15" />Nachenganchepaw ang krat mih khin khe dow amatni bowkbowk awmrawm khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:15">amatni dow ang ria kowi uang takuaah büah hanow changla ang rensi kau khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 35:15">Ang tukah dowi mih maru-uüa paw kingküa ang kownkow tawi tabawng khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:15">amatni dow amowt uowi dowi kowi chang ang naklak büah khai.<verse eid="PSA 35:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 35:16" />Amatni dow prawngren dawma miuüa iawng prawngren ang khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:16">amatni dow sui ang kowh mik ngak hown mü ang khai.<verse eid="PSA 35:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 35:17" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, mün ni tak chow naiawng en mü ang phülü kown?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:17">Chang nowng chang powng miuüa rut hownia uang towkala ang diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:17">maiawngün krangsi hawmh rut hownia ang kowh chownglawng pe plai ang diah.<verse eid="PSA 35:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 35:18" />Nahanow en maru-uüa takua talawmra kowi ang natek en awmrawm lai kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:18">maru akawmma dawng kowi ang natek en rowsi meng kown.<verse eid="PSA 35:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 35:19" />Aiawnglowma nüla ang ransu miuüa rut kowi hauang pe chowng ang rensi kau diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:19">alow akan uowi dowi matchang sui ang miuüa kowi ang krat mih khi hanow hangkow pe renah diah.<verse eid="PSA 35:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 35:20" />Amatni dow taking tasangra laiklow tek dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:20">amatni dow pren kowi kowh athaulangma miuüa kowi krawi dai krawi kuan khai.<verse eid="PSA 35:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 35:21" />Amatni dow ang lawnguan kowi atün atünma tek dai lai mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:21">“Khi, khi! En chang lup ngak mih anging matia mik hown anging khi lowmow,” pakhai.<verse eid="PSA 35:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 35:22" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, naiawngün en khi bowk chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:22">naiawng rakowi ririmma hang uowi diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:22">ang hownia alakma hang cham uowi diah.<verse eid="PSA 35:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 35:23" />Aw ang kowh Thurai, awr rü hanow uang tangila ang diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:23">aw CHAKRAMANG, ang prakowi tangila mih lai uang tek diah.<verse eid="PSA 35:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 35:24" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, en dow achinawmma chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:24">naiawng rakowi anowmma mih tara uang chet ang diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:24">ang kowh ransu-uüa kowi hangkow pe awmrawmah diah.<verse eid="PSA 35:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 35:25" />“Cham na bowt lah, cham na bowt lah!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:25">Naiawng phaw mih chowbowt anging nau.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 35:25">Aia kowi a-i nowng iawnta khowk,” pahai sakdawng kowi amatni hang pacham ka tek büah lah.<verse eid="PSA 35:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 35:26" />Ang kla phih mih khi hanow awmrawm miuüa maten pacham ka rukrai lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:26">ang lak-e amatni lang iung pahai tatuak miuüa dow pacham rukrai bowk lah.<verse eid="PSA 35:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 35:27" />Nachenganchepaw tiama nowm kowi ang mang mih laiklow ta kown nau miuüa pacham piaw lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:27">amatni dow awmrawm rakowi atünma how se pacham piaw lah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 35:27">Amatni dow atünma, “CHAKRAMANG dow kri kraingma chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:27">aia dow aia naruüa iung mih kowi awmrawm reng,” pahai pacham tek lah.<verse eid="PSA 35:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 35:28" />Nahanow ang kowh dai hown en tachi tanawm mih laiklow ang natek reng kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:28">now ni chut chi en rowsi meng ang natek reng kown.<verse eid="PSA 35:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 35" />
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="PSA 36" />
  <para style="s">En tut-e dow lowra chap kowh singra uowi</para>
  <para style="d">Mami dow David kowh meng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 36:1" />Maru ngakuüa kowh dow sak lak kowi angak uang kup reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 36:1">amatni dow Thurai kowi ringkaw hai kram dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 36:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 36:2" />Amatni dow bawrima rakowi tatuak mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 36:2">“Thurai naka dowk ang angak kown nadowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 36:2">Thurai nasui ang kown nadowi,” pakhai.<verse eid="PSA 36:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 36:3" />Amatni kowh nawr kowi dow lai ngak hai limmara atekma chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 36:3">amatni dow chanlaira hai lup iung kowi nau büah dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 36:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 36:4" />Phangbek kowi mawk khe paw amatni dow thawp prengia ngak reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 36:4">angak prakowi hing tape büah khai, now angak kowi sui büah dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 36:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 36:5" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, en kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura dow kuang kowi tawk khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 36:5">en kowh kaah sakowmma mih rah dow uangnim luk kowi chüt prang chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 36:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 36:6" />En kowh tachi tanawmra dow hungh aiukma mih iawng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 36:6">en kowh tara nowm dow sata abüpma mih iawng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 36:6">Aw CHAKRAMANG, en dow lusa maru hai asadua maten kowi khetah reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 36:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 36:7" />Aw Thurai, en kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura dow ia ranah dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 36:7">en lap krüa kowi dow lusa maru-uüa mih ka tatung tanimra reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 36:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 36:8" />Anging lakke mowr en tut-e dow chakkham uowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 36:8">anging lakke mowr iungra aw tui en pe kham anging khai.<verse eid="PSA 36:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 36:9" />Lowra chap kowi pe singra reng mih dow en chowtaih.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 36:9">En kowh anowi rakowi anging tawi khi anowi mih chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 36:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 36:10" />Tuk en miuüa kowi dow en kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura tüng pe reng diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 36:10">saktuak achinawmma miuüa kowi dow anowmma mih tara chet pe reng diah.<verse eid="PSA 36:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 36:11" />Bawrima miuüa nauang sen ang kownkow hang pacham nowng uang lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 36:11">maru ngakuüa mih hang pacham nowng prüt ang lah.<verse eid="PSA 36:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 36:12" />Sam mü madiah, maru ngakuüa dow tim khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 36:12">amatni kowi dow kuakta khai bowt, now nowng rü dowi bowt chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 36:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 36" />
  <chapter number="37" style="c" sid="PSA 37" />
  <para style="s">Aia maru-uüa kowi dow CHAKRAMANG nuaah dowi</para>
  <para style="d">David kowh meng.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 37:1" />Maru ngakuüa lawnguan kowi hangkow tuak krat diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:1">maru chang lup ngak mih khi hanow hangkow ir diah.<verse eid="PSA 37:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 37:2" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow maru ngakuüa dow bawrchak iawng nalüa keu kown taih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:2">amatni dow asingma mih pram iawng mün ni paw nakham kown nadowi.<verse eid="PSA 37:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 37:3" />CHAKRAMANG luk kowi owmsak reng diah, now chang lup iung reng diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:3">nahanow enni kowh pren kowi athaulangma hai aiungma enni naka uowi kown.<verse eid="PSA 37:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 37:4" />CHAKRAMANG tut-e cham awmrawmra diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:4">nahanow en sak nau iawng aia nachang en kown taih.<verse eid="PSA 37:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 37:5" />En kowh sangkrangra maten CHAKRAMANG luk kowi tang pe diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:5">aia luk kowi neplawng nesak diah; nahanow aia mih nakhowng en kown taih.<verse eid="PSA 37:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 37:6" />Aia dow en kowh tachi tanawmra mih anowi iawng tawk pluplup nachang en kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:6">en kowh anowmma mih lup dow ni-e kowh sat nowi iawng achimma natüng en kown.<verse eid="PSA 37:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 37:7" />CHAKRAMANG pur kowi sak klamma hown uowi diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:7">kunma thawngma hown aia kowi hawt chawngah diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 37:7">Maru ngakuüa chang lup ngak mih phaw khai chepaw hangkow tuak krat diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:7">amatni kowh sangkrangra ngak iawng lup phaw khai chepaw hangkow sak-hiah diah.<verse eid="PSA 37:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 37:8" />Kunmaraura rimta diah, kunma ngak tüng nuata diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:8">Tawngplawng kowchow panow nami dow angak prakowi napawla en kown mih taih.<verse eid="PSA 37:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 37:9" />Maru ngakuüa kowi dow CHAKRAMANG napiakta kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:9">Tawkche CHAKRAMANG luk kowi owmsak miuüa dow naka powng pren kown.<verse eid="PSA 37:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 37:10" />Khin kra dowi kowi maru ngakuüa dow nachur kown chowbowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:10">amatni kowi dow krawi chamah chepaw naka kown nadowi bowt.<verse eid="PSA 37:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 37:11" />Nachenganchepaw khamsum khamdaw miuüa dow naka powng pren kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:11">thaulangma ka uowi rakowi amatni dow napiaw napa kown.<verse eid="PSA 37:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 37:12" />Maru ngakuüa dow maru iunguüa kowi kingküala kown mih sangkrang reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:12">amatni dow maru iunguüa kowi sui lai bowt kowh mik ngak hown müah khai.<verse eid="PSA 37:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 37:13" />Nachenganchepaw CHAKRAMANG dow maru ngakuüa kowh piakra ni uang tawn khowk mih tuk chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:13">Naiawng rakowi aia dow maru ngakuüa kowi müah hanow renah reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 37:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 37:14" />Ngarai miuüa hai akhawr hown uowi miuüa kowi napiakah kownkow,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:14">tiama nowm kowi mang miuüa kowi nasaita kownkow</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 37:14">maru ngakuüa dow par saidawng hai uüi leba reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 37:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 37:15" />Tawkchedow amatni kowh saidawng mih amatni buk kowi chowtaih nakup kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:15">now amatni kowh leba paw nataklowk kown.<verse eid="PSA 37:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 37:16" />Maru ngakuüa kowh dow dawngthawnguan ahuma uowi chepaw naia.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:16">Tawkche dawngthawnguan a-echow chepaw Thurai nau iawng uowi mih lang iung.<verse eid="PSA 37:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 37:17" />Maru ngakuüa kowh rut dow nataklowk kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:17">Tawkche Thurai maru-uüa kowi dow CHAKRAMANG nadowkah reng kown.<verse eid="PSA 37:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 37:18" />CHAKRAMANG dow ni towng maru iunguüa kowi mingkhetah reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:18">amatni kowh dawngthawnguan kakbak dow chowngchowng saksakma nauowi reng kown.<verse eid="PSA 37:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 37:19" />Akrat pusa mih khin khe amatni dow narukrai kown nadowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:19">khown kuak mih khin khe amatni dow alawkma naka chakkham kown.<verse eid="PSA 37:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 37:20" />Nachenganchepaw maru ngakuüa dow napiak kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:20">CHAKRAMANG kowh ransu-uüa dow klangiungma mih pau iawng natama kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:20">amatni dow maikhük tama mih iawng alenma natama kown.<verse eid="PSA 37:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 37:21" />Maru ngakuüa dow cham paw tangka khawi chepaw planah dowi bowt chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:21">Tawkche Thurai maru-uüa dow kawklawma hai saksing sanama chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 37:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 37:22" />CHAKRAMANG peah prasi miuüa dow naka powng pren kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:22">Tawkche CHAKRAMANG peah piati miuüa dow napiak bowk kown.<verse eid="PSA 37:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 37:23" />CHAKRAMANG dow aia maru-uüa kowi khowm bowk pe tiama reng chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:23">aia kowi peah awmrawmra reng miuüa kowi dow aia khetah reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 37:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 37:24" />Tim khowk chepaw amatni dow naplan rü iawk kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:24">Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni kowi dow CHAKRAMANG dowkah reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 37:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 37:25" />Ang klanguüa kowh ang lawngtang prang towbowt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:25">tawkche Thurai nau iawng uowi miuüa kowi Thurai nuata mih hai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:25">amatni kowh krungchakuüa lu lük takla mih ang khi dowi tak chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 37:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 37:26" />Amatni dow kawklawma hai pe tangka khawi reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:26">amatni nakaah kown mih chu chauüa dow amatni kowh prasira chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 37:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 37:27" />Lup ngak chang towta diah, now chang lup iung diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:27">nahanow nami pren kowi dow chownglawng prat naka uowi kown.<verse eid="PSA 37:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 37:28" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow CHAKRAMANG dow tara nowm kowi lang nau reng;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:28">aia dow aia maru-uüa kowi nuata dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 37:28">Aia maru-uüa kowi dow chowngchowng saksakma aia natakhula reng kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:28">Tawkche maru ngakuüa kowh krungchakuüa kowi dow aia napiakah reng kown.<verse eid="PSA 37:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 37:29" />Achinawmma miuüa dow naka powng pren reng kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:29">now amatni dow nakowi naka uowi reng kown.<verse eid="PSA 37:29" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 37:30" />Thurai maru-uüa kowh nawr dow tek chanlai laiklow reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:30">amatni kowh dai dow tara nowm laiklow tek reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 37:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 37:31" />Amatni dow Thurai kowh ari aiang sak kowi towah reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:31">aia tiama hownia dow nacham tapleng büah kown nadowi.<verse eid="PSA 37:31" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 37:32" />Maru ngakuüa dow Thurai maru-uüa kowi krawi mitah reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:32">amatni dow Thurai maru-uüa kowi nasaiah kownkow kamrüt reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 37:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 37:33" />Nachenganchepaw CHAKRAMANG dow amatni kowi mih maru ngakuüa rut kowi naap-ah kown nadowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:33">aia maru-uüa kowi dow tara chetra kowi mih CHAKRAMANG natang pe aprek kown nadowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 37:33" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 37:34" />CHAKRAMANG luk kowi owmsak diah, now aia tiama kowi mang diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:34">nahanow en naka powng pren kownkow kri kraingma aia nachang en kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:34">now ransu-uüa piak mih khin khe en namüah phülü kown.<verse eid="PSA 37:34" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 37:35" />Angakma mih maru iuksown mih ang khi khowk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:35">aia dow krawng iungma mih kowi kowh singh sa urlur mih iawng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 37:35" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 37:36" />Tawkche akung kowi dow aia mih tapiak hanow hing tama khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:36">aia kowi ang krawi chamah chepaw ang krumah dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 37:36" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 37:37" />Anowmma mih hai aiungma mih maru prakowi tang mü diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:37">nau taking tasangra reng miuüa kowh dow krungchak nauowi kown.<verse eid="PSA 37:37" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 37:38" />Tawkche maru ngakuüa dow natapiak kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:38">maru ngakuüa kowh krungchakuüa dow napiak bowk kown.<verse eid="PSA 37:38" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 37:39" />Thurai maru-uüa kowi lawngah reng mih dow CHAKRAMANG chowtaih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:39">aia dow kla phih mih khin khe kowh akhawtma mih kangchawngra kim chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 37:39" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 37:40" />Amatni kowi dow CHAKRAMANG khowngah hai takhula reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:40">amatni kowi dow ransu-uüa rut hownia CHAKRAMANG lawngah reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 37:40">Amatni dow CHAKRAMANG tut-e tatung tanim reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:40">Naiawng rakowi amatni kowi dow CHAKRAMANG lawngah reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 37:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 37" />
  <chapter number="38" style="c" sid="PSA 38" />
  <para style="s">Aw CHAKRAMANG, hauang nuata ang diah</para>
  <para style="d">Mami dow David kowh meng chekhai. Mami dow sak kowi towah reng kown mih meng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 38:1" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, en kunmarau rakowi hauang nang ang diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:1">en kunmarau ang lai rakowi hauang hawi ang diah.<verse eid="PSA 38:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 38:2" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow leba sek hown en ap ang khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:2">en kowh rut hown en uang napta ang hüah khai.<verse eid="PSA 38:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 38:3" />En kunmarau ang rakowi ang kowh kow nga mih nowm khowk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:3">ang kowh angak rakowi ang kowh hut paw iung dowi bowt chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 38:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 38:4" />Ang kowh lup ngak dow hu krang ang luk kowi chut khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:4">ang kowh angak di lai bowt kowh ang nowng kurah dowi bowt chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 38:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 38:5" />Ang buala lai rakowi ang kowh ma hownia nam ngak tauet khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:5">nami ma dow uown su iawlaw khowk chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 38:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 38:6" />Ang kowh arau rakowi ang tabawk hüah towbowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:6">uowila uiting uangtak mih iawng ni chut chi ang uowi khai.<verse eid="PSA 38:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 38:7" />Ang kowh kawmh paw lainowmma rau khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:7">ang kowh kow mih lainowmma nga khai bowt.<verse eid="PSA 38:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 38:8" />Ang kowh kür uowi dowi bowt kowh ang tim khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:8">ang kowh sak-uih rau lai bowt kowh ang nguk runrun towbowt.<verse eid="PSA 38:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 38:9" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, ang kowh naura sia en tuk bowk chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:9">ang kowh sak hü kawm mih khowm padow en tut-e ia tapet dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 38:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 38:10" />Ang kowh sakmowr mih thü dukluk towbowt, ang kowh kür uowi dowi bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:10">now ang kowh mik khowm padow uang iiu tüng khowk chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 38:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 38:11" />Maiawng ang uowi mih khi hanow ang auiuauüa khowm padow alakma lang uowi khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:11">ang kowh kimchakuüa khowm padow ang hownia alakma lang süt khai.<verse eid="PSA 38:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 38:12" />Lim ang sak miuüa dow chak ang leng khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:12">napiak ang kown nau miuüa dow tüng ang kram khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 38:12">Ni chut chi amatni dow nakuan ang kownkow thawp prengia khai.<verse eid="PSA 38:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 38:13" />Param pangma mih iawng ang chowng khai bowt, tawngpaw ang ta dowi bowt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:13">lai a-ma mih iawng ang chowng khai bowt, tawngpaw ang nowng tek dowi bowt.<verse eid="PSA 38:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 38:14" />Ang dow maru klang ang khe tawngpaw ta dowi mih maru iawng towbowt chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:14">now tawngpaw tuk tek dowi mih maru iawng towbowt chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 38:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 38:15" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, en prakowi ang tang mü khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:15">aw CHAKRAMANG ang kowh Thurai, en chowtaih nauang klang ang kown.<verse eid="PSA 38:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 38:16" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow, “Ang tatheu khe ransu-uüa kowi hangkow pe awmrawmah diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:16">amatni kowi mih ang rakowi hangkow pe ka changah bawri diah,” pahai ang tek en khowk chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 38:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 38:17" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow ang natim kown chowbowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:17">ang kowh arau mih mapaw rim dowi bowt chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 38:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 38:18" />Ang kowh atawi mih ang uang taphuang khowk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:18">ang kowh angak rakowi ang kowh sak piak khai bowt.<verse eid="PSA 38:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 38:19" />Ang kowh ransu-uüa dow kow iungma hai akürma chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:19">aiawnglowma sui ang mih maru akawmma chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 38:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 38:20" />Amatni dow ang changah aiung mih takcha chang ang angak khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:20">ang krawi cham aiung rakowi amatni dow kingküa ang khai.<verse eid="PSA 38:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 38:21" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, hauang nuata ang diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:21">Aw ang kowh Thurai, ang hownia alakma kowi hang cham uowi diah.<verse eid="PSA 38:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 38:22" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, ang kowh lawng miia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:22">nauang khowng ang kownkow alenma uang tarü diah.<verse eid="PSA 38:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 38" />
  <chapter number="39" style="c" sid="PSA 39" />
  <para style="s">Lusa kowi maru uang uowi mih dow anim krowngchow taih</para>
  <para style="d">Meng sara Jeduthun vüi kowi kowh David tekah mih meng.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 39:1" />Ang tek mih, “Kaneuma ang natek laiklow kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:1">ang kowh dai hown mapaw ang chang angak dowi pat.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 39:1">Ang pur kowi maru ngakuüa uowi mowr mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:1">ang kowh nawr ang namumta hüah kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="PSA 39:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 39:2" />Naiawng rakowi mumta nawr hanow ririmma ang uowi khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:2">lai iung khowm padow ang tek dowi bowt chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 39:2">tawkche ang kowh tuak kratra mih uang hu ngamlam khai.<verse eid="PSA 39:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 39:3" />Ang kowh sak mih den hunglung khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:3">ang sak kowi mih maih lün pluplup iawng ang tatuk khai.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 39:3" />
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 39:3">Achur kowi ang tek mih,<verse eid="PSA 39:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 39:4" />“Aw CHAKRAMANG, tawng khe chow ang kowh chowng chur kown?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:4">Mün ni tak chow ang nasing kown mih tek ang diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:4">ang kowh chownglawng mün khowt chow town khai mih pe tuk ang diah.<verse eid="PSA 39:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 39:5" />Ang kowh chownglawng dow apawkchow taih en chang ang khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:5">en mik kowi dow ang kowh chownglawng mih tawngpaw nadowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 39:5">lusa maru kowh chownglawng dow kawli krowngchow klen kowi tawngpaw nadowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 39:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 39:6" />Lusa maru kowh chownglawng dow atowngchow taih.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:6">Nami dow anim iawng alenma tama reng chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 39:6">Lusa maru dow aiawnglowma pusa khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:6">amatni dow krüm dawngthawnguan khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:6">Tawkche nami dawngthawnguan mia chow ta powng kown mih tuk büah dowi.<verse eid="PSA 39:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 39:7" />“Aw CHAKRAMANG, tawng kowi chow ang owmsak bowt kown?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:7">Ang kowh owmsakra maten dow en luk kowi chowtaih chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 39:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 39:8" />Ang kowh angak maten hownia uang lawng ang diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:8">sangching uowi dowi miuüa tut-e hauang changla ang rensi kau diah.<verse eid="PSA 39:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 39:9" />Ririmma ang uowi khai, ang nalai kown nadowi bowt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:9">tawngplawng kowchow panow mami akratra maten dow en uang pe tingah mih chowtaih.<verse eid="PSA 39:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 39:10" />Ang luk kowi kowh en kowh ripra mih henta ang diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:10">en rut hown kowh müa dang hown ang nakowng kown chowbowt.<verse eid="PSA 39:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 39:11" />Angak rakowi maru kowi lai rangma hown en hawiah reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:11">Nakhowk khe lowngsirin natchowua kowi iawng</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:11">amatni kowh chownglawng khowm en piakta pe reng.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 39:11">Lusa maru dow kawli krowngchow taih chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 39:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 39:12" />“Aw CHAKRAMANG, ang awr lü mih sünta ang diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:12">ang awr kar mih kowi pe param diah;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 39:12">ang kowh mik tui khi hanow ririmma hang uowi diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:12">tawngplawng kowchow panow ang kowh pipu-uüa maten iawng ang uowi khai,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 39:12">mami lusa kowi dow en pur kowi khari kowi mih iawng ang uowi khai.<verse eid="PSA 39:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 39:13" />Kowng dowi rawn ang naia awmrawmla iawk kownkow</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:13">ang luk hownia en kowh mik mük ngak mih cham plengta ang diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="PSA 39:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 39" />
  <chapter number="40" style="c" sid="PSA 40" />
  <para style="s">CHAKRAMANG iawng mih miapaw uowi dowi</para>
  <para style="d">Mami dow David kowh meng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 40:1" />Kunma thawngma hown CHAKRAMANG kowi ang chawngah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:1">aia dow ang kowh laiklow hai ang kowh kar klow sünta ang khai.<verse eid="PSA 40:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 40:2" />Sakowmra uowi dowk mih kuam hownia aia dow uang lawng ang khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:2">kramra uowima mih krawng uapma hownia aia dow uang lawng ang khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 40:2">Now huaklu aiukma mih luk kowi aia pe iowng ang khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:2">akhawtma mih bawn luk kowi aia pe mang ang khai.<verse eid="PSA 40:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 40:3" />Aia dow ang kowh nawr kowi pe ang meng sar khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:3">aia dow aia kiow müa pe ang meng sar khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 40:3">Aia kowh lawngra lup dow maru akawmma nakhi kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:3">amatni sak kowi mih ringkawma hown kramra nauowi kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:3">now amatni dow CHAKRAMANG luk kowi naneplawng nesak kown.<verse eid="PSA 40:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 40:4" />CHAKRAMANG luk kowi neplawng nesak mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:4">bawrima hai arup chup mih prakowi dang dowi mih dow prasira uowima.<verse eid="PSA 40:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 40:5" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, ang kowh Thurai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:5">en changah mih awdara lup dow ahuma chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 40:5">anging vüi en tuakah mih dow nowng phuangah dowi mowr chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:5">Nami dow tek reng chepaw achur nauowi kown nadowi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 40:5">En iawng mih miapaw uowi dowi bowt chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 40:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 40:6" />Tawncher phuchua hai akeng mih uanap kowi en awmrawm dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:6">tikah mih uanap hai angak lawt lük müa uanap paw en lakke dowi chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 40:6">nami lak-e en laiklow ta hanow natuktala kownkow en thawp ang param khai.<verse eid="PSA 40:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 40:7" />Naiawng rakowi ang tek mih, “Mow, ang uang khowk chaw;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:7">ang lawnguan dow rirow bowih kowi arui uowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 40:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 40:8" />Aw ang kowh Thurai, en nau iawng chang mih kowi ang awmrawm reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:8">en kowh ana pek ang sak lak kowi uowi reng chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="PSA 40:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 40:9" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, en lawng anging mih laiklow takua talawmra kri kowi ang phuang reng;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:9">ang kowh nawr dow ang kowpta phülü dowi mih en aiawng tuk chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 40:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 40:10" />En changah mih lup iung lawnguan sakdawng kowi ang towah phülü dowi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:10">en kowh kaah sakowmma mih hai lawngra lup lawnguan ang tek reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 40:10">En kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura hai kaah sakowm mih rah dow ang itah dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 40:10">Nami dow takua talawmra kri kowi ün ang phuangah reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 40:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 40:11" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, en natüng ang saksing sanara kown mih hangkow taingta diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:11">en kowh kaah sakowm mih rah hai achur uowi dowi mih sakraura dow atungma pacham towkala ang lah.<verse eid="PSA 40:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 40:12" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow phih ahuma uang umta ang lut khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:12">naiawngün dow nowng rüaah dowi mowr chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 40:12">Angak dow uang kawikrawi ang hanow uang krawi ka dowkta ang khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:12">Naiawng rakowi ang khi tiama dowi bowt chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 40:12">Naiawngün angak dow aiun kawm krang ang lu kowi kowh sam lak-e hu chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:12">Naiawng rakowi ang kowh dow sakkraingra pami hing uowi dowi bowt chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 40:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 40:13" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, sakrauma hown uang lawng ang diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:13">aw CHAKRAMANG, nauang lawng ang kownkow alenma uang diah.<verse eid="PSA 40:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 40:14" />Kowngta ang kownkow sangkrang miuüa dow pacham ka rukrai lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:14">ang piak mih khi kown nau miuüa dow mumla tulu se pacham plan büah lah.<verse eid="PSA 40:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 40:15" />Khi ang kowh chit ang miuüa dow pacham plan büah lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:15">amatni dow ka rukrai hanow pacham plan bowk büah lah.<verse eid="PSA 40:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 40:16" />Nachenganchepaw en nau iawng mang miuüa pacham piaw lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:16">amatni dow en rakowi pacham awmrawm büah lah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 40:16">En changah mih lawngra lup kowi nau miuüa dow,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:16">“CHAKRAMANG dow kri kraingma,” pahai pacham tek reng lah.<verse eid="PSA 40:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 40:17" />Ang dow ngaraima hai kür uowi dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:17">Nachenganchepaw ang lawnguan kowi en tuak reng.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 40:17">Aw ang kowh Thurai, hangkow kra tham bowt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:17">en chowtaih ang kowh khowng mih hai lawng miia.<verse eid="PSA 40:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 40" />
  <chapter number="41" style="c" sid="PSA 41" />
  <para style="s">Arau uowi khe CHAKRAMANG tut-e lü khowng mih</para>
  <para style="d">Mami dow David kowh meng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 41:1" />Ngarawng ngarai miuüa kowi khowng mih dow prasira uowima chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 41:1">aia kla phih mih khin khe aia kowi CHAKRAMANG nakhowngah reng kown.<verse eid="PSA 41:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 41:2" />CHAKRAMANG mih aia kowi natakhula reng kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 41:2">aia kowi dow CHAKRAMANG natowah sing reng kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 41:2">Aia dow pren kowi aiungma naka uowi kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 41:2">aia kowi dow aia kowh ransu-uüa hownia CHAKRAMANG nalawngah kown.<verse eid="PSA 41:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 41:3" />Arau uowi kowh phangbek kowi mawk mih khin khe aia kowi CHAKRAMANG napeah kür kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 41:3">aia kowi dow phangbek hownia CHAKRAMANG nakrüngah kown.<verse eid="PSA 41:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 41:4" />Ang tek mih, “Aw CHAKRAMANG, kingküala en mih angak ang changta khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 41:4">Nachenganchepaw saksing sana ang diah, ang kowh arau iungta ang diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="PSA 41:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 41:5" />Ang ransu-uüa dow nau ang angak kowh tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 41:5">“Tawng khe chow nami maru nakowng kown?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 41:5">tawng khe chow aia kowh ming natama kown?” pakhai.<verse eid="PSA 41:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 41:6" />Amatni dow uang mü ang hanow asung uowi dowi mih laiklow uang talawp khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 41:6">Nakingküala ang kownkow amatni dow ang lawnguan kowi angakma mih laiklow kumla büah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 41:6">now ang kowh angak lawnguan dow maru kawmuüa tut-e krawi uetah khai.<verse eid="PSA 41:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 41:7" />Sui ang miuüa dow kingküa ang kownkow cham ku tatek laisin reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 41:7">amatni dow napiak ang kown mih kangowh tatuak büah khai.<verse eid="PSA 41:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 41:8" />Amatni tek mih, “Aia luk kowi kramra uowima mih rawka ngak phaw khowk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 41:8">aia mawk rah hownia dow aia naia rü kown nadowi bowt,” pabüah khai.<verse eid="PSA 41:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 41:9" />Kawmat dow ang auiua sin khowm kingküa ang khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 41:9">aia dow ang hown taiua cha chakkham reng mih chowdiah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 41:9">aia dow ang lang owmah mih chowdiah.<verse eid="PSA 41:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 41:10" />Nachenganchepaw aw CHAKRAMANG, en dow saksing sana ang diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 41:10">ang ransu-uüa kowi ang naia satla klai kownkow ang kowh arau iungta ang diah.<verse eid="PSA 41:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 41:11" />Ang luk kowi en sak-ih reng mih ang tuk chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 41:11">Tawngplawng kowchow panow ransu-uüa nowng ang dowi bowt.<verse eid="PSA 41:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 41:12" />Ang achinawmma rakowi en khowng ang reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 41:12">chowngchowng saksakma en pur kowi en tow ang reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 41:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 41:13" />CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh Thurai dow akiow pauowi reng lah!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 41:13">kawmat hownia chowngchowng saksakma aia dow akiow pauowi lah!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 41:13">Amen! Amen!<verse eid="PSA 41:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 41" />
  <chapter number="42" style="c" sid="PSA 42" />
  <para style="ms">BOWIH 2</para>
  <para style="mr">(<ref loc="PSA 42-72">Meng Lai 42-72</ref>)</para>
  <para style="s">Akawm akrat khe kowh Thurai chup</para>
  <para style="d">Mami dow Kora krungchakuüa kowh meng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 42:1" />Naki dow nakham hawriang tui kown mih lainowmma sakkrai reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:1">aw CHAKRAMANG, nami iawng ang kowh sak paw lainowmma sakkrai en khai.<verse eid="PSA 42:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 42:2" />Thurai kowi, masing Thurai kowi lainowmma ang sakkrai khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:2">tawng khe chow aia pur kowi aia kowi ang kownowng chupiia kown?<verse eid="PSA 42:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 42:3" />Ang dow ni chut uar prowt hing karta hüah towbowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:3">ni towng maru lünta ang mih, “Tawng kowi chow en kowh Thurai?” pakhai.<verse eid="PSA 42:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 42:4" />Ang klenta mih chownglawng krawi tuakah hanow lainowmma ang tuak kawm khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 42:4">Akat khe dow kiow Thurai miuüa kowi kruila se Thurai chup kim kowi ang cham kowi reng chowdiah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:4">now maru kawmuüa hown piaw se pa se Thurai kowi ang tek awmrawm lai reng chowdiah.<verse eid="PSA 42:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 42:5" />Tawngplawng kowchow khowt pat ang kowh sak tuk nen khai?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:5">Tawngplawng kowchow khowt pat ang tuk tuak krat khai?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 42:5">Thurai luk kowi ang naowmsak kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:5">lawng ang mih kowi ang naplan kiow iawk kown.<verse eid="PSA 42:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 42:6" />Aw ang kowh Thurai, lainowmma ang sak nen khai bowt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:6">naiawng rakowi Jawrdan aw mawr kowi ang cham iowng khe ang ka tuak khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:6">now Hermawn hungh hai Mizar hungh chut kowi ang cham iowng khe paw ang ka tuak en khai.<verse eid="PSA 42:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 42:7" />Tui lawt khe kowh tui uang hawr dutlut mih iawng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:7">ang luk kowi mih akrat pusara en uang pe tingah khai.<verse eid="PSA 42:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 42:8" />CHAKRAMANG dow aia kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura ni towng uang tüng ang reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:8">Naiawng rakowi iak towng aia vüi kowi ang tek pe kiowri meng reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:8">pe ang singra mih Thurai tut-e ang awr lü awr leng reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 42:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 42:9" />Ang kowh Thurai, ang kowh tatung tanimra Singku Huamang kowi maiawng ang tek pe khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:9">“Tawngplawng kowchow en tuk tamata ang khai?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:9">Tawngplawng kowchow ransu-uüa chang ang nowng hanow tuk towk ang krat khai?” pakhai.<verse eid="PSA 42:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 42:10" />Ang kowh ransu-uüa dow hing prawngrenta ang hüah chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:10">amatni dow, “Tawng kowi chow en kowh Thurai?” pahai tek ang reng.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 42:10">Nakhowk khe ang dow rukrai krang hut ter khai iawng towbowt.<verse eid="PSA 42:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 42:11" />Tawngplawng kowchow khowt pat ang kowh sak tuk nen khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:11">Tawngplawng kowchow khowt pat ang tuk tuak krat khai?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 42:11">Thurai luk kowi ang naowmsak kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:11">lawng ang mih kowi ang naplan kiow iawk kown.<verse eid="PSA 42:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 42" />
  <chapter number="43" style="c" sid="PSA 43" />
  <para style="s">En kowh anowi hai tiama nowm uang tüng ang diah</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 43:1" />Aw Thurai, chet ang tara nowm diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 43:1">angakma mih chenchap kowi nakingküala kownkow tawi tangila ang diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 43:1">now kuanlama mih hai chang ngak mih maru-uüa hownia lawng ang diah.<verse eid="PSA 43:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 43:2" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow ang kowh akhawtma mih tatung tanimra kim dow en chowtaih.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 43:2">Tawng rakowi chow en tuk nuata ang khai?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 43:2">Tawngplawng kowchow ransu-uüa chang ang nowng hanow tuk towk ang krat khai?<verse eid="PSA 43:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 43:3" />En kowh anowi hai en kowh anowm tüng ang diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 43:3">en kowh anowi hai anowm mih pacham tüng ang tiama lah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 43:3">Nami anowi hai anowm dow en uowi rah kowi pacham pawla ang lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 43:3">now en kowh chimsaima mih hungh kowi pacham pawla ang lah.<verse eid="PSA 43:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 43:4" />Nahanow Thurai phuchuara re-e ang naia kowi kown towbowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 43:4">en chowtaih ang kowh piawra hai awmrawmra.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 43:4">Aw Thurai, ang kowh Thurai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 43:4">nakowi mih tepla taraw se ang nakiow en kown.<verse eid="PSA 43:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 43:5" />Tawngplawng kowchow khowt pat ang kowh sak tuk nen khai?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 43:5">Tawngplawng kowchow khowt pat ang tuk tuak krat khai?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 43:5">Thurai luk kowi ang naowmsak kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 43:5">aia kowi ang naplan kiow iawk kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 43:5">Aia chowtaih ang kowh lawng miia hai ang kowh Thurai.<verse eid="PSA 43:5" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 43" />
  <chapter number="44" style="c" sid="PSA 44" />
  <para style="s">Kala khowng kownkow chup Thurai mih</para>
  <para style="d">Mami dow Kora krungchakuüa kowh meng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 44:1" />Aw Thurai, anging pipu-uüa chowng khe awdara lup en chang pe khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:1">naiawngün lawnguan dow anging kowh pipu-uüa hownia anging ta bowk chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 44:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 44:2" />En kür hown akeng chenchapuüa kowi dow en prütta pe khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:2">amatni uowi rah kowi dow anging kowh pipu-uüa kowi en towah khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 44:2">Naiawngün chenchapuüa luk kowi piakra en uang pawla pe khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:2">now anging kowh pipu-uüa kowi dow en pe iuksownah khai.<verse eid="PSA 44:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 44:3" />Nami pren dow amatni saidawng hown kowh amatni powngah mih nadowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:3">amatni matia kür hown kowh amatni powngah mih paw nadowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 44:3">Nami dow en kowh kür, en tawi uowi mih kri kraingra hown kowh ia powng mih chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:3">Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni luk kowi dow en kowh saksing sanara uowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 44:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 44:4" />Aw Thurai, en chowtaih ang kowh mang,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:4">en kowh maru Jakawb kowi pe awngah diah.<verse eid="PSA 44:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 44:5" />Anging kowh ransu-uüa kowi dow en kowh kür hown chowtaih anging nanowngta kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:5">kingküa anging miuüa kowi dow en kowh ia changra hown anging nathuaah kown.<verse eid="PSA 44:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 44:6" />Ang kowh salangba luk kowi dow ang neplawng nesak dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:6">ang kowh saidawng dow nowngia lawng ang dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 44:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 44:7" />Tawkche ransu-uüa hownia dow en chowtaih lawng anging khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:7">prawngren anging miuüa kowi dow en peah rukrai khai.<verse eid="PSA 44:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 44:8" />Thurai ming hown chowtaih anging awr changla bawri reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:8">chowngchowng saksakma anging nakiow en reng kown. [Sela]<verse eid="PSA 44:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 44:9" />Nachenganchepaw kawmat dow en nuata anging khai, now en pe anging rukrai khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:9">tasen khin khe anging kowh siphaiuüa hown en tawi taiua uowi dowi bowt chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 44:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 44:10" />Anging kowh ransu-uüa hownia en pe powt anging khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:10">sui anging miuüa dow rupta anging uanh bowk khowk.<verse eid="PSA 44:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 44:11" />Ngenah kown mih ruapur iawng amatni rut kowi dow en ap anging khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:11">now chen towng chap towng kowi en krawi uetta anging plawt khai.<verse eid="PSA 44:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 44:12" />En maru-uüa kowi dow asung tanchow hown en sumah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:12">naiawng en chang mih tawngpaw en kowh maratra uowi dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 44:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 44:13" />Kimping namkhetuüa tut-e en changla anging prawng renra khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:13">aria aret kowi kowh maru-uüa tut-e en changla anging rensi kau khai.<verse eid="PSA 44:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 44:14" />Akeng chenchap tut-e en cham khare anging khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:14">maru kawmuüa paw khi anging hanow prawngren anging khai.<verse eid="PSA 44:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15-16" style="v" sid="PSA 44:15-16" />Rukraira dawng kowi ang uowi khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:15-16">ni towng ang ka rukrai mih ang takhi khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 44:15-16">Anging kowh ransu-uüa prawngren anging mih anging ta khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:15-16">anging kowh ransu-uüa sui anging mih ang khi khai bowt.<verse eid="PSA 44:15-16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 44:17" />Naiawngün dow anging luk kowi uang phaw khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:17">naiawng chepaw anging tamata en dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:17">en kowh sangbowk laitawm anging piakta dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 44:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 44:18" />Anging kowh sak dow powtta en dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:18">en tiama hownia anging süt dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 44:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 44:19" />Nachenganchepaw brenkhui dawng kowi ngarema en tow anging khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:19">
    <char style="w">makowng nimkrüa</char> kowi en mumta anging hüah khai.<verse eid="PSA 44:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 44:20" />Anging kowh Thurai kowi anging tamata khai e dow,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:20">akeng thuraiuüa kowi anging cham chupiia khai e dow,<verse eid="PSA 44:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 44:21" />Thurai tuk dowi tham pabow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:21">Aia dow a-i sak kowi kowh uowi mih maten tuk bowk chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 44:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 44:22" />Tawkche en rakowi ni towng maru sai anging reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:22">anging kowi dow ngenah kown mih ruapur iawng maru changla anging khai.<verse eid="PSA 44:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 44:23" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, rü diah! Tawngplawng kowchow en müi rengreng tak?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:23">Awr rü diah! Chowngchowng saksakma vüi kowi hauang nuata ang hüa diah.<verse eid="PSA 44:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 44:24" />Tawngplawng kowchow en cham dangta anging lumowr khai?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:24">Tawngplawng kowchow anging kowh kawmkrat en tamata khai?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:24">Tawngplawng kowchow anging kowh nowng chang powng changra en tamata khai?<verse eid="PSA 44:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 44:25" />Anging dow dinchow dawng kowi takhum hüah towbowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:25">anging kowh kow dow bawn hown taiüa nak khowk.<verse eid="PSA 44:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 44:26" />Awr rü bowt! Uang khowng anging bowt!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:26">En kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura rakowi uang lawng anging bowt!<verse eid="PSA 44:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 44" />
  <chapter number="45" style="c" sid="PSA 45" />
  <para style="s">Mang Sutawng Meng</para>
  <para style="d">Mami dow Kora krungchakuüa tekah mih “Changlawng plawngnau” meng chekhai. Mami meng dow “Kra pau” meng owi iawng natekah kown.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 45:1" />Ang kowh sak kowi dow lai ding lai sau kangowh chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:1">mangkri vüi kowi ang thawn pe changlawng plawngnau meng lowk khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 45:1">Ang dow meng thawn kiakma mih iawng ang tuk thawn meng khai.<verse eid="PSA 45:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 45:2" />Lusa maru pungmadawng kowi dow en lang klangiung khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:2">en nawr hownia kowh uang lawt mih dow lai ding lai sau kangowh chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 45:2">Naiawng rakowi Thurai mih chowngchowng saksakma pe en prasi reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 45:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 45:3" />Aw tasen kiakma mih maru, en kowh saidawng mih kelang kowi tapla diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:3">en tut-e dow kiowrira hai kraingra uowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 45:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 45:4" />Anowm, khamsum khamdawra hai tachi tanawmra vüi kowi tasen reng diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:4">nami tasen naia awngla kownkow en kowh kraingra hown tarü reng diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 45:4">Nahanow en kowh akürma mih rut hown kri kraingma mih lup en naia chang kown.<verse eid="PSA 45:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 45:5" />En ransu-uüa kowi dow achukma mih leba sek hown en ap-ah reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:5">en kowh ransu chenchapuüa dow en khawk daw kowi uang khamsum reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 45:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 45:6" />Aw Thurai, en kowh mang chowm rah dow chowngchowng saksakma anikma nauowi kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:6">en dow en kowh maru-uüa kowi anowmma hown en kruitown reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 45:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 45:7" />Anowm kowi dow en sakrau reng, now angak kowi en sui reng;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:7">naiawng rakowi Thurai, en kowh Thurai dow lang klo en khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:7">now akeng miuüa kowi lak-e awmrawmra kraingma aia lang pe en khai.<verse eid="PSA 45:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 45:8" />En kowh mang tawnguat kowi dow nam iungma mih sau, asung khakma mih singh pun hai paingbawng nam uowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:8">ngasai sa hown tawngah mih mang kim kowi aiang uowi mih tünteu chang müa tün hown en piaw khai.<verse eid="PSA 45:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 45:9" />En kowh ringkaw uowima mih masiuüa pungmadawng kowi dow mang chama uowi ne chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:9">en hawmlawm prakowi dow Ofir pren hownia kowh kuh uanh hown tatawng mih en nachangla masi kown mih masiuüa uowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 45:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 45:10" />Aw mang masi, ang laiklow sünta diah, pe ching diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:10">en kowh chen nawiuüa kowi hangkow tuak tham bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:10">now en kimchakuüa kowi paw hangkow prüa tham bowt.<verse eid="PSA 45:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 45:11" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow en klangiung rakowi en hua dow nanau en bowt kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:11">aia dow en kowh kimrengia chekhai rakowi aia kowi en naring nakawah kown takla.<verse eid="PSA 45:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 45:12" />Tura marow kowi kowh kurengma miuüa dow nauang pawla en awmrawm sung kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:12">amatni dow en tut-e uang hanow nauang lü khowng kown.<verse eid="PSA 45:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 45:13" />Mang kim kowi dow mang masi mih lainowmma klangiung khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:13">aia khupah mih tawnguat dow kuh hown kowh tawngah mih chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 45:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 45:14" />Sawt pe bawng mih tawnguat khupma hown aia kowi dow mang tut-e nakowpawla kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:14">aia tut-e kowh tawi mih narma malauüa hawmh paw mang re-e nakowtawi kown.<verse eid="PSA 45:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 45:15" />Amatni dow apiaw apama hown mang kim kowi nauang kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:15">amatni dow mang kim kowi nauang kup büah kown.<verse eid="PSA 45:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 45:16" />Aw mangkri, en chapauüa dow en pipu-uüa iawng nata chowm mang kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:16">amatni kowi dow palusama kowi kowh pren kruitown mih en nachangah kown.<verse eid="PSA 45:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 45:17" />Ang kowh meng dow achowngma en kowh ming iung natown en reng kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:17">Naiawng rakowi chenchapuüa dow chowngchowng saksakma nakiow en kown.<verse eid="PSA 45:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 45" />
  <chapter number="46" style="c" sid="PSA 46" />
  <para style="s">Thurai dow a-i kowh tatung tanimra</para>
  <para style="d">Mami dow Kora krungchakuüa kowh meng chekhai. Mami meng dow alowngma natekah kown takla.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 46:1" />A-i kowh tatung tanimra hai kürra dow Thurai chowtaih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 46:1">aia dow a-i kla phih khe nauang khowng a-i kownkow kamrüt reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 46:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 46:2" />Naiawng rakowi lihowngma uang chepaw a-i nakram kown nadowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 46:2">hungma mawngma ün sata kowi takla bun chepaw a-i nakram kown nadowi.<verse eid="PSA 46:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 46:3" />Sata tui awr talowng phunglung se apawp talowi chualua chepaw a-i nakram kown nadowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 46:3">tuilowng rakowi hungma mawngma chür nurlur chepaw a-i nakram kown nadowi. [Sela]<verse eid="PSA 46:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 46:4" />Thurai kowh marow kowi tui uang hawr reng mih aw uowi lowk;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 46:4">nami aw rakowi marowchakuüa dow awmrawm reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 46:4">lang kri lang kraing mih Thurai uowi rah chimsaima mih dow awmrawm reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 46:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 46:5" />Nami marow kowi dow Thurai tawi uowi reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 46:5">Naiawng rakowi nami marow dow anikma nauowi kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 46:5">Aia kowi dow sat lawt dowi rawn Thurai nakhowngah reng kown.<verse eid="PSA 46:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 46:6" />Thurai hek hanow lusa mih napiak kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 46:6">chenchapuüa dow kram hown nachurla kluk kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 46:6">now pren ün paw napiak bowk kown.<verse eid="PSA 46:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 46:7" />Mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG dow a-i tut-e tawi uowi reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 46:7">a-i kowh akhawtma mih kangchawngra kimkrowng dow Jakawb kowh Thurai chowtaih.<verse eid="PSA 46:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 46:8" />CHAKRAMANG kowh lup uang mü diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 46:8">aia dow lusa kowi uang pawla piakra khai.<verse eid="PSA 46:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 46:9" />Aia dow lusa kowi kowh tasen maten taingta bowk khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 46:9">aia dow salangba ün klowkta pe khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 46:9">reh ün aia dungta pe naknak khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 46:9">kawrnga kari ün paw maih kowi aia nawmta pe bowk khai.<verse eid="PSA 46:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 46:10" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “Taingta tasen büah bowt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 46:10">ang chowtaih Thurai pami tukah büah reng diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 46:10">Chen towng chap towng maru-uüa dow nakiow ang kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 46:10">palusama maru-uüa dow nakiow ang reng kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="PSA 46:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 46:11" />Mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG dow a-i tut-e tawi uowi reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 46:11">a-i kowh akhawtma mih kangchawngra kimkrowng dow Jakawb kowh Thurai chowtaih.<verse eid="PSA 46:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 46" />
  <chapter number="47" style="c" sid="PSA 47" />
  <para style="s">Thurai dow palusama kowh mang</para>
  <para style="d">Mami dow Kora krungchakuüa kowh meng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 47:1" />Aw chenchap maten, apiawma hown phek rut büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 47:1">Thurai vüi kowi atünma tek rowsi meng büa diah.<verse eid="PSA 47:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 47:2" />Lang kri lang kraing mih CHAKRAMANG dow ringkawra hai kramra uowima chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 47:2">aia dow palusama kowi kowh lang kri mih mang chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 47:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 47:3" />Akeng chenchapuüa kowi aia dow a-i nimkrüa kowi towah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 47:3">amatni kowi dow a-i khawk daw kowi aia towah khai.<verse eid="PSA 47:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 47:4" />A-i uowiah mih pren dow aia lang klo a-i mih chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 47:4">nami pren dow aia lang sakrauah mih Jakawb lang nauah mih chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 47:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 47:5" />Thurai dow piaw klow hown aia kowh mang chowm rah kowi awr pün khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 47:5">CHAKRAMANG dow baw tün hown aluk kowi awr pün khai.<verse eid="PSA 47:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 47:6" />Thurai vüi tek rowsi meng diah, tek rowsi meng diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 47:6">a-i kowh Mang vüi tek rowsi meng diah, tek rowsi meng diah.<verse eid="PSA 47:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 47:7" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow palusama kowi kowh mang dow aia chowtaih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 47:7">aia vüi kowi tek rowsi meng diah.<verse eid="PSA 47:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 47:8" />Chenchap maten luk kowi chowm mang mih dow Thurai chowtaih;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 47:8">aia dow aia kowh mang chowm rah chimsaima mih kowi chowm mang khai.<verse eid="PSA 47:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 47:9" />Lusa kowi kowh pren kruitown miuüa maten dow takua talawm khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 47:9">amatni dow Abraham kowh Thurai maru-uüa hown takua talawm khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 47:9">Tawngplawng kowchow panow lusa kowi kowh manguüa maten dow Thurai kowh chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 47:9">aia dow bowkbowk lak-e kowh rowsira lang uowi mih chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 47:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 47" />
  <chapter number="48" style="c" sid="PSA 48" />
  <para style="s">Zaiawn, Thurai kowh marow</para>
  <para style="d">Mami meng dow Kora krungchakuüa tekah mih chekhai.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 48:1" />A-i kowh Thurai marow kowi, aia kowh chimsaima mih hungh kowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:1">CHAKRAMANG dow kri kraingma hai kiowrira uowima chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 48:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 48:2" />Thurai kowh uowi rah dow paimi Zaiawn<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">48:2 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Zaiawn </char><char style="ft" closed="false">dow Jerusalem marow kowi kowh hungh ming chekhai. Tawkche tawngbak khe dow marow pahai paw tekah khai.</char></note> hungh kowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:2">hungh lowngma kowi kowh nami marow dow klangiungma chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 48:2">Nami lang kri lang kraing mih mang kowh marow khita hanow</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:2">palusama maru-uüa mih awmrawm reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 48:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 48:3" />Thurai matia ngengche dow nami marow kowi tawi uowi reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:3">aia dow nami marow kowi kowh taka müa iawng hai uang tatüng khai.<verse eid="PSA 48:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 48:4" />Manguüa dow amatni kowh siphaiuüa kowi kuaah lawmah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:4">now nauang sen marow kownkow uang ting büah khai bowt.<verse eid="PSA 48:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 48:5" />Tawkche nami marow khita hanow amatni dow takrow khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:5">now lainowmma kram büah hanow powt bowk khai.<verse eid="PSA 48:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 48:6" />Kram lai rakowi amatni dow chürla kluk khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:6">penchow kimuowi mu rau iawng bowm büah khai.<verse eid="PSA 48:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 48:7" />Thurai dow satlawt li akürma mih uang chin pe khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:7">now Tarsis marow kowi kowh chawnlawng uang piakta pe khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 48:7">Naiawng hai amatni kowi dow aia piakta khai.<verse eid="PSA 48:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 48:8" />Mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG marow lawnguan anging ta chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:8">now kawmat dow nami marow mih mik hown anging khi khowk chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 48:8">Nami marow dow chowngchowng saksakma vüi aia natowah kown.<verse eid="PSA 48:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 48:9" />Aw Thurai, en kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura laiklow anging tuak khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:9">nami lawnguan dow en kim kowi anging tuak reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 48:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 48:10" />Aw Thurai, en lawnguan kowi maru tuk bowk chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:10">en kowi dow prenchur nammowt kowi pat maru kiow en reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 48:10">En tut-e dow nachang lup iung kown mih kür uowi huma chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 48:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 48:11" />En kowh anowmma mih lup khita hanow Zaiawn hungh kowi kowh maru-uüa pacham piaw lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:11">Juda pren kowi kowh marowchakuüa dow pacham awmrawm lah.<verse eid="PSA 48:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 48:12" />Thurai maru-uüa low, Zaiawn hungh tapat lut krawi len büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:12">nakowi mün khowt chow kimkrowng uowi mih krawi rüa diah.<verse eid="PSA 48:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 48:13" />Nakowi kowh tap ün mün khowt chow khikhawt mih krawi mü büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:13">now nakowi kowh kimkrowng ün mün khowt chow khawt mih krawi mü diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 48:13">Nahanow naiawngün lawnguan mih enni kowh chauüa tut-e enni naia lawpla kown towbowt.<verse eid="PSA 48:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 48:14" />Enni natekla pe kown mih, “A-i kowh chowngchowng saksakma mih Thurai dow nami Thurai chowtaih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:14">aia dow a-i kowng dowi mowr natüng a-i tiama reng kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="PSA 48:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 48" />
  <chapter number="49" style="c" sid="PSA 49" />
  <para style="s">Akrat pusa uang ting khe tawngplawng kowchow ang nakram kown?</para>
  <para style="d">Mami dow Kora krungchakuüa kowh meng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 49:1" />Aw chenchap maten, ang laiklow sünta büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:1">mami lusa kowi kowh uowi miuüa maten, ang laiklow kowi pe ching büa diah.<verse eid="PSA 49:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 49:2" />Maru iuk hai maru sowmuüa, ang laiklow sünta büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:2">kureng hai ngarai miuüa, ang laiklow kowi pe ching büa diah.<verse eid="PSA 49:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 49:3" />Ang kowh laiklow kowi dow chanlaira uowi reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:3">now ang sak kowi dow prengia uowi reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 49:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 49:4" />Ang dow chanlai lawng prakowi pe ching reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:4">taraw tün hown tek meng se <char style="w">laipet</char> ün ang phuang reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 49:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 49:5" />Akrat pusa uang ting khe, ransu-uüa uang umta ang lut khe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:5">tawngplawng kowchow ang nakram kown?<verse eid="PSA 49:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 49:6" />Amatni dow dawngthawnguan luk kowi neplawng nesak miuüa chowtaih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:6">now amatni kowh kurengra hown chang bawri miuüa chowtaih.<verse eid="PSA 49:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 49:7" />Nachenganchepaw chowngchowng saksakma nasingla kown mih vüi miapaw nowng pe tangka pawisa dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:7">achowngma nasingla kown mih vüi dow Thurai nau mowr miapaw nowng pe dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 49:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8-9" style="v" sid="PSA 49:8-9" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow lusa maru kowh chownglawng dow asung uowima chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:8-9">chowngchowng saksakma nasingla kown mih sung dow a-i nowng thaw dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 49:8-9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 49:10" />Chanlaima mih maru paw kowng reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:10">nami iawng prengia uowi dowi mih maru paw kowng reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:10">now aiung angak tukra uowi dowi mih maru paw kowng reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 49:10">Amatni dow kowng hanow amatni kowh dawngthawnguan ta towla hüah reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:10">now naiawngün dawngthawnguan dow akeng miuüa vüi ta chowng reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 49:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 49:11" />Amatni sing uowi khe dow amatni kowh krawng bawn uowi chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:11">kowng kung kowi kowh amatni kowh uowi rah dow tadupra towbowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:11">achowngma pat amatni nauowi kown mih dow nakowi towbowt.<verse eid="PSA 49:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 49:12" />Amatni dow kurengma chepaw kowng hownia naia plai kown nadowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:12">amatni dow tawncher chap maten kowng iawng nakowng kown.<verse eid="PSA 49:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 49:13" />Kowmatia luk kowi neplawng nesak mih maru-uüa luk kowi dow naiawng nauang ting kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:13">now naiawngünuüa laiklow chün miuüa luk kowi paw naiawng nauang ting kown.<verse eid="PSA 49:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 49:14" />Ruapur thing mih ruapur hawmh kowi dow angenra prakowi cham pawla reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:14">nami iawng kowngra mih naiawngün maru-uüa kowi kowngra prakowi nacham pawla kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 49:14">Nakowi dow amatni kowh uak mih nasu bunlun kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:14">Nakhowk khe achinawmma miuüa dow amatni luk kowi naawng kown.<verse eid="PSA 49:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 49:15" />Tawkche Thurai dow ang kowh chownglawng mih kowngra hownia nalawng ang kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:15">aia dow tadupra hownia nauang lawng ang hanow aia tut-e napawla ang ngengche kown.<verse eid="PSA 49:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 49:16" />Naiawng rakowi amatni awr kureng chepaw hangkow kram diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:16">amatni kimchakuüa kowh dawngthawnguan uang hu ngamlam chepaw hangkow kram diah.<verse eid="PSA 49:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 49:17" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni kowng mih khin khe tawngpaw naia pawla kown nadowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:17">amatni kowh dawngthawnguan paw amatni tadupra kowi natawi kown nadowi.<verse eid="PSA 49:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 49:18" />Amatni dow sing uowi sak uowi reng tak khe kowmatia kowi prasira uowima pahai tatuak reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:18">ka iungra miuüa kowi dow maru mih prasira uowima pahai tek pe reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 49:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 49:19" />Nachenganchepaw amatni pipu-uüa iawng dow amatni paw nakowng kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:19">now amatni mih katpaw nakhi ni nowi kown nadowi.<verse eid="PSA 49:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 49:20" />Kurengma chepaw tukra uowi dowi hanow,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:20">tawncher kowng mih iawng chowtaih chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 49:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 49" />
  <chapter number="50" style="c" sid="PSA 50" />
  <para style="s">Thurai dow tara chet miia</para>
  <para style="d">Asaf kowh meng.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 50:1" />Mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG Thurai tek lai khowk;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:1">aia dow satlawt hownia satkup mowr lusa kowi uowi mih maten kowi hawah khai.<verse eid="PSA 50:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 50:2" />Lang klangiung mih Zaiawn hungh hownia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:2">Thurai kowh anowi dow uang krawi sawt khai.<verse eid="PSA 50:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 50:3" />A-i kowh Thurai dow uang tarü khowk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:3">aia dow rarimma nauowi kown nadowi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 50:3">Aia dowi rawn maih mih narik kamta bowk kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:3">aia riaret kowi dow liku uangchak nauang kown.<verse eid="PSA 50:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 50:4" />Aia maru-uüa kowi nauang chet pe tara kownkow</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:4">mukuang hai lusa kowi aia towngla saksi khai.<verse eid="PSA 50:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 50:5" />Aia tek mih, “Ringkaw ang miuüa maten kowi ang tut-e uang kuala diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:5">tawncher phuchua hown kowh ang hown tatow sangbowk laitawm miuüa kowi kuaah diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="PSA 50:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 50:6" />Aia kowh tara nowm dow mukuang mih phuangah khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:6">Tawngplawng kowchow panow Thurai dow tara chet miia chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 50:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 50:7" />Thurai tek mih, “Ang kowh maru-uüa low, sünta büa diah, ang tek tak;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:7">aw Israel, en kowi kingküala mih saksi ang thuak en kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 50:7">Ang dow Thurai chekhai, en kowh Thurai chowtaih.<verse eid="PSA 50:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 50:8" />En chang tawncher phuchua kowh ang bek en angak mih nadowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:8">en kowh tikah mih uanap dow atungma ang pur kowi uowi reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 50:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 50:9" />En kowh chia rum kowi kowh chiala ang lakke dowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:9">en kowh rua tung kowi kowh rua paw ang hau dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 50:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 50:10" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow kaurawng uaramchak maten mih ang kowh chowtaih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:10">hungma mawngma kowi kowh tawncher maten paw ang kowh chowtaih.<verse eid="PSA 50:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 50:11" />Hungh kowi kowh uakling uaber maten paw ang kowh chowtaih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:11">dowm kowi kowh asak uowi mih maten paw ang kowh chowtaih.<verse eid="PSA 50:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 50:12" />Ang hawm sakkrai khai chepaw ang tek en dowi tham.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 50:12">Tawngplawng kowchow panow palusama dow ang kowh chowtaih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:12">now alak kowi kowh uowi mih chap maten paw ang kowh chowtaih.<verse eid="PSA 50:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 50:13" />Chiala nga ang kowh chakkham pabow en ka tuak?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:13">Rua vi ang kham reng pabow en ka tuak?<verse eid="PSA 50:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 50:14" />Thurai tut-e en tek awmrawm lai mih phai en kowh phuchua pana lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:14">lang kri lang kraing mih Thurai tut-e en takhamta mih chang reng diah.<verse eid="PSA 50:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 50:15" />Nahanow en kla phih mih ni khe haw ang diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:15">ang nauang lawng en kown taih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:15">now en naringkaw ang kown towbowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="PSA 50:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 50:16" />Tawkche maru ngakuüa kowi dow Thurai tek pe mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:16">“Ang kowh ari aiang laiklow natek kown mih en kowh alow uowi khai bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:16">Ang kowh sangbowk laitawm laiklow natek kown mih en kowh alow uowi khai bow?<verse eid="PSA 50:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 50:17" />En dow ang kowh pringhawi laiklow kowi en sui khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:17">ang kowh laiklow sünta kown khowm en nau dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 50:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 50:18" />En dow khi kuk mih now tawi tahum reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:18">chang iang mih maru hown en dow tawi taiua reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 50:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 50:19" />En kowh nawr kowi dow laiklow ngak atekma chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:19">en kowh dai dow kuanla kown mih laiklow kangowh tek reng.<verse eid="PSA 50:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 50:20" />Chowm parasang en tainau kowi en kingküaah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:20">now aia kowi dow en prawng renah khai.<verse eid="PSA 50:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 50:21" />“Naiawng en chang mih maten ang tuk; tawkche ang lai dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:21">Naiawng rakowi ang kowi mih en matia iawng en nüla ang khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 50:21">Tawkche kawmat dow en kowh angak ang natüng en bowt kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:21">en kowh angak maten en pur kowi lowkchow lowkchow ang tüng en kown.<verse eid="PSA 50:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 50:22" />Thurai kowi tamata miuüa maten mami laiklow tuakah büah kaneu diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:22">nadowi now adi asekma ang nachangta enni naknak kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 50:22">Nakhowk khe miapaw nalawng enni kown mih nauowi kown nadowi.<verse eid="PSA 50:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 50:23" />Tek ang awmrawm lai kownkow chang phuchua miuüa dow ringkaw ang mih chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:23">ang tiama kowi mang miuüa kowi dow ang nalawngah ngengche kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="PSA 50:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 50" />
  <chapter number="51" style="c" sid="PSA 51" />
  <para style="s">Thurai tut-e lü lawt mih</para>
  <para style="d">Mami dow David kowh meng chekhai. Mami dow Betseba hown David taphua taiua kung kowi David tut-e risi Nathan uang khe kowh meng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 51:1" />Aw Thurai, en kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura rakowi saksing sana ang diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:1">en kowh saksing sanara hown ang kingküa en mih angak lawtta ang diah.<verse eid="PSA 51:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 51:2" />Ang kowh ngak maten uang sia sauta ang diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:2">ang kowh ngak hownia uang chimsaita ang diah.<verse eid="PSA 51:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 51:3" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow ang kingküa en mih maten ang tuk chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:3">now ang kowh ngak maten dow ang sak kowi uowi reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 51:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 51:4" />Ang dow en luk kowi chowtaih chang ngak khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:4">now en mik kowi angakma mih lup ang changta khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 51:4">Ang ngakma pahai en tek mih anowm chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:4">en kowh tara dow aser auowk uowi dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 51:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 51:5" />Ang kowh dow uang dia hownia angak uowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:5">au mu lak kowi uowi reng tak hownia ang kowh angak uowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 51:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 51:6" />Tawkche achinawmma ang nauowi kown mih en nau ang khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:6">Naiawng rakowi ang sak lak kowi pe ang chanlaira diah.<verse eid="PSA 51:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 51:7" />Lawngthow singh mia hown uang sia sau ang diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:7">nahanow angak hownia ang nachimsai bowt kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 51:7">Ang kowi uang sawk sau ang diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:7">nahanow nangkhe iawng akawma ang naphaw bowt kown.<verse eid="PSA 51:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 51:8" />Piaw hai awmrawm mih klow pe sünta ang diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:8">en piakta ang nak khowk chepaw kawmat dow pe awmrawm ang diah.<verse eid="PSA 51:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 51:9" />Ang kowh angak nakhi dowi kownkow petta lumowr diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:9">ang kowh angak maten phiawkta ang diah.<verse eid="PSA 51:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 51:10" />Aw Thurai, achinawmma mih sak pe ang diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:10">ang kowh lümla mih anowmma plan chang ang diah.<verse eid="PSA 51:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 51:11" />En pur hownia hauang prütta ang diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:11">ang hownia en kowh <char style="w">Lümlasai</char> hauang pawta ang diah.<verse eid="PSA 51:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 51:12" />En lawng ang khe kowh piawra plan pe ang iawk diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:12">en kowh alow nachün kown nau mih saktuak pe ang diah.<verse eid="PSA 51:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 51:13" />Nahanow kingküa en miuüa kowi en tiama lawnguan ang ia tüngsangah kown towbowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:13">now maru ngakuüa mih en prakowi nauang plan kown towbowt.<verse eid="PSA 51:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 51:14" />Aw Thurai, en dow ang kowh lawng miia Thurai chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:14">saita maru mih angak hownia uang lawng ang diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 51:14">Nahanow en lawng ang rakowi apiawma ang nakiow en kown.<verse eid="PSA 51:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 51:15" />Aw Thurai, natek lai kownkow uang khowng ang diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:15">nahanow ang mih nakiow en kown.<verse eid="PSA 51:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 51:16" />Tawncher phuchua kowi dow en awmrawm dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:16">tikah mih uanap kowi paw en awmrawm dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 51:16">En nau panü dow naiawngün ang nachang en kown taih diah.<verse eid="PSA 51:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 51:17" />En lang nauah mih phuchua dow sak kowi arauma hown uowi mih chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:17">aw Thurai, khamsum khamdawma hai dia sar mih saktuak dow en nuata dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 51:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 51:18" />Aw Thurai, Zaiawn kowi saksing sanaah hai khowngah diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:18">Jerusalem marow kowi kowh tap mih plan rawah iawk diah.<verse eid="PSA 51:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 51:19" />Nahanow achinawmma mih saktuak hown kowh uanap pawi kowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:19">tikah mih uanap pawi kowi mih en naawmrawm bowt kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 51:19">Now en kowh phuchuara luk kowi maru nauang phuchua chiala kown towbowt.<verse eid="PSA 51:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 51" />
  <chapter number="52" style="c" sid="PSA 52" />
  <para style="s">Thurai kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura</para>
  <para style="d">Mami dow David kowh meng chekhai. Mami meng aia tek mih dow Ahimelek kim kowi aia uowi pami satang Sawl kowi Edawm chenchap Doeg uang phowng pe khe kowh chekhai.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 52:1" />Aw akürma mih siphai, tawngplawng kowchow en kowh lup ngak hown en tuk chang bawri khai?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 52:1">Thurai dow achowngma chet tara nowm reng pami en tuk dowi ü?<verse eid="PSA 52:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 52:2" />En kowh sangkrangra dow nakrawi piak maru kown mih kangowh chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 52:2">en dow kuanlama, en kowh dai dow achukma mih sangthünchow iawng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 52:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 52:3" />En dow aiung lak-e angak kowi en lang nau khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 52:3">now lainowm lak-e dai lai kowi en lang nau khai.<verse eid="PSA 52:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 52:4" />Aw kuanlalu, en dow krawi kuan maru reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 52:4">en dow maru napiakla kown mih laiklow prakowi lang nau chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 52:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 52:5" />Nachenganchepaw Thurai dow chowngchowng saksakma vüi nahing piakta en kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 52:5">aia dow en kim hownia nauang küngla en kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 52:5">aia dow lusa maru uowi mih pren hownia mawh chawi iawng nachawi en kown.<verse eid="PSA 52:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 52:6" />Naiawngün khita hanow Thurai maru-uüa dow ringkawma hown nakram kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 52:6">amatni dow prawngren en se natek en kown mih,<verse eid="PSA 52:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 52:7" />“Pai iow, paimi maru dow Thurai luk kowi neplawng nesak dowi pai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 52:7">paimi maru dow aia kowh dawngthawnguan luk kowi chowtaih neplawng nesak reng.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 52:7">Aia dow aia kowh angakma mih kür luk kowi neplawng nesak khai,” napa kown.<verse eid="PSA 52:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 52:8" />Nachenganchepaw ang dow Thurai kim kowi kowh awr iuk mih kanrawn singh iawng chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 52:8">ang dow Thurai kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura luk kowi neplawng nesak reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 52:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 52:9" />Aw Thurai, en kowh lup rakowi atungma ang nakiow en kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 52:9">en iung mih lawnguan dow en maru-uüa pur kowi ang naphuang kown.<verse eid="PSA 52:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 52" />
  <chapter number="53" style="c" sid="PSA 53" />
  <para style="s">Aiungma mih maru miapaw uowi dowi</para>
  <para style="d">Mami dow David kowh meng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 53:1" />Abualama mih maru-uüa dow Thurai uowi dowi padow tuak reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 53:1">amatni dow lup ngak hai suiiai kaniaima mih lup chang reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 53:1">Lup iung chang mih maru amiapaw uowi dowi bowt chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 53:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 53:2" />Thurai dow mukuang pren hownia lusa maru kowi iu tang müah reng chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 53:2">aia iu tang mü mih dow chanlaima hown mang mih uowi ne chünchü mih natukla kownkow chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 53:2">now aia kowi cham mih uowi ne chünchü mih natukla kownkow chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 53:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 53:3" />Tawkche maru kawmuüa dow tiama nowm hownia plan bowk khowk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 53:3">amatni dow piak bowk khowk chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 53:3">Lup iung chang mih maru lowk iachow khowm uowi dowk chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 53:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 53:4" />Chang lup ngak mih maru-uüa tawng chow khowt pat tuk buala khai?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 53:4">Amatni dow tawngpaw tuak dowi kowi ang maru-uüa kowi piakah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 53:4">now Thurai kowi nachup kown mih paw tuak büah dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 53:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 53:5" />Tawkche akung kowi amatni dow lainowmma nakram kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 53:5">amatni dow nami dowi rawn naiawng khowt katpaw kram dowi tak chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 53:5">Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia maru-uüa kowh ransu-uüa hut mih Thurai nacham setta pe plawt kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 53:5">ransu-uüa kowi dow Thurai nuata rakowi aia maru-uüa mih nanowngta kown.<verse eid="PSA 53:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 53:6" />Israeluüa kowh lawngra dow Zaiawn hungh hownia pacham uang lah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 53:6">Thurai dow aia maru-uüa kowi naplan peah iungra iawk kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 53:6">Jakawb krungchakuüa dow naawmrawm kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 53:6">Israel krungchakuüa dow napiaw bowt kown.<verse eid="PSA 53:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 53" />
  <chapter number="54" style="c" sid="PSA 54" />
  <para style="s">CHAKRAMANG dow tow ang sing reng</para>
  <para style="d">Mami dow David kowh meng chekhai. Mami meng aia tek mih dow Zifituüa tut-e aia tapet mih satang Sawl kowi Zifituüa kowtek pe khe kowh chekhai. Mami meng dow aiang uowi mih tünteu chang müa hown natekah kown mih chekhai.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 54:1" />Aw Thurai, en kowh ming hown uang lawng ang diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 54:1">en kowh kür hown ang achinawmma pami uang tüng diah.<verse eid="PSA 54:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 54:2" />Aw Thurai, ang awr lü awr leng mih hawt sünta ang diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 54:2">ang kowh laiklow kowi hawt pe ching reng diah.<verse eid="PSA 54:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 54:3" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow akeng mih chenchapuüa dow kingküa ang khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 54:3">chang nowng chang powng miuüa dow kowngta ang kownkow sangkrang khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 54:3">Naiawngün maru-uüa dow Thurai kowi ringkaw dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 54:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 54:4" />Nachenganchepaw Thurai dow ang kowh khowng miia chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 54:4">CHAKRAMANG dow tow ang sing reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 54:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 54:5" />Ransu-uüa chang ang angak mih dow amatni luk kowi aia pe tingah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 54:5">aia takhamta khowk mih iawng amatni kowi aia nasaita kown.<verse eid="PSA 54:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 54:6" />Ang matia sak nau hown en tut-e ang nauang chang tawncher phuchua kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 54:6">Aw CHAKRAMANG, en dow aiungma chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 54:6">Naiawng rakowi ang nakiow en kown.<verse eid="PSA 54:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 54:7" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow en dow ang kowh phih maten hownia lawng ang khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 54:7">now ang ransu-uüa kowi en piakah mih dow ang matia mik hown ang khi khai.<verse eid="PSA 54:7" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 54" />
  <chapter number="55" style="c" sid="PSA 55" />
  <para style="s">CHAKRAMANG luk kowi en kowh kurdik apta diah</para>
  <para style="d">Mami dow David kowh meng chekhai. Mami meng dow aiang uowi mih tünteu chang müa hown natekah kown mih chekhai.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 55:1" />Aw Thurai, ang awr lü awr leng mih hawt sünta ang diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:1">kar se ang uang lü khowng mih kowi hangkow nuata ang diah.<verse eid="PSA 55:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 55:2" />Ang kowh laiklow sünta ang hanow klang ang diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:2">Tawngplawng kowchow panow ang dow krat pusa dawng kowi ang uowi khai.<verse eid="PSA 55:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 55:3" />Ang kowh ransu-uüa dow uang krawk ang khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:3">maru ngakuüa dow chang ang nowng khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 55:3">Amatni dow pe ang krat pusara khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:3">amatni dow kunmarau kowh chang ang nowng khai.<verse eid="PSA 55:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 55:4" />Ang dow lainowmma takrow khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:4">now nakowng kown mih kowi lainowmma ang takram khai.<verse eid="PSA 55:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 55:5" />Kram lai bowt kowh ang chür klukluk towbowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:5">ang takrow krang chur khai bowt.<verse eid="PSA 55:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 55:6" />Naiawng rakowi ang tek mih, “Owh, uatur iawng ang kowh lap uowi panü!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:6">Ang cham iowta pe hanow ang khalat diah!<verse eid="PSA 55:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 55:7" />Alakma kowi ang cham iowta pe hanow,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:7">ririm raramma mih süngrüp süngkangma kowi ang ka uowi diah. [Sela]<verse eid="PSA 55:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 55:8" />Alenma ang cham powtta pe hanow ang cham ka tatung tanimra diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:8">liku uangchak iawng akürma mih ransu-uüa hownia ang khalat diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="PSA 55:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 55:9" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, ransu-uüa luk kowi uang pawla pe piakra diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:9">amatni sangkrangta mih iawng tawngpaw hangkow pe phawah diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 55:9">Tawngplawng kowchow panow marow kowi kowh phaw mih maten ang khi khai bowt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:9">nakowi kowh maru-uüa dow tabawp tatep prungrung hai taran urlur chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 55:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 55:10" />Tabawp tatep mih hai taran urlur mih dow marow kowi taum lut khowk chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:10">nami marow kowi dow lup ngak hai nowng chang powng changra atekma chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 55:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 55:11" />Marow kowi dow piakra lup kangowh taih bowt chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:11">marow plawt kowi amatni mih krawi chang nowng hai krawi kuan maru reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 55:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 55:12" />Pe ang rukrai miuüa che ang kowh ransu chekhai panü,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:12">ang ia kham kown taih diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 55:12">Kingküa ang miuüa che akeng mih chekhai panü,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:12">amatni hownia ang ia tapet kown taih diah.<verse eid="PSA 55:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 55:13" />Tawkche naiawng chang ang mih dow ang hown tale mih maru chowtaih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:13">aia dow ang kowh maru hai ang kowh auiua sin chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 55:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 55:14" />Angching kowh dow tatukra iungma chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:14">now Thurai chup kim kowi taiua takua reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 55:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 55:15" />Ang ransu-uüa dow linlanma pacham kowng lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:15">kowng khin nadowi tak khe amatni dow pacham kowng lah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 55:15">Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni kowh kim üa hai saktuak kowi dow angak kangowh chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 55:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 55:16" />Nachenganchepaw ang dow Thurai tut-e nalü khowng kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:16">nahanow CHAKRAMANG mih nauang lawng ang kown.<verse eid="PSA 55:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 55:17" />Ang dow rau-e khe, sat downg khe hai iak-e khe kar se aia tut-e naawr chawk lai reng kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:17">now aia dow ang kowh klow nahawt sünta ang kown.<verse eid="PSA 55:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 55:18" />Sen ang mih ransu-uüa dow akawmma chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:18">Tawkche aia dow tasen hownia aiungma uang lawngla ang khai.<verse eid="PSA 55:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 55:19" />Thurai dow chowngchowng saksakma chowm mang reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:19">aia dow ang awr lüah mih nasünta ang hanow amatni kowi naripah kown. [Sela]</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 55:19">Tawngplawng kowchow panow ransu-uüa dow dia sar büah dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:19">amatni dow Thurai kowi kram paw kram büah dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 55:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 55:20" />Ang auiua dow aia auiuauüa kowi kingküaah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:20">now aia dow aia kowh laikham mih piakta khai.<verse eid="PSA 55:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 55:21" />Aia kowh laiklow dow adechow chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:21">Tawkche aia sak kowi dow kingküa kown mih saktuak kangowh chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 55:21">Aia kowh laiklow dow sakka lak-e lang ding chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:21">Tawkche aia dow achukma mih saidawng iawng krawi pe ngarau reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 55:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 55:22" />En kowh kurdik maten CHAKRAMANG luk kowi apta diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:22">nahanow aia mih naming nakhet en reng kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 55:22">Achinawmma miuüa kowi dow aia nape tatheuah kown nadowi.<verse eid="PSA 55:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 55:23" />Tawkche aw Thurai, sai maru miuüa hai limma maru miuüa kowi dow kowngra kowi en nakuakah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:23">amatni kowi dow kowng khin nadowi tak khe en nape kowngah kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 55:23">Ang dow en luk kowi neplawng nesak reng kown.<verse eid="PSA 55:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 55" />
  <chapter number="56" style="c" sid="PSA 56" />
  <para style="s">Thurai luk kowi ang neplawng nesak reng</para>
  <para style="d">Mami dow David kowh meng chekhai. Mami dow Gat marow kowi Filistinuüa khümah khe kowh aia tekah mih meng chekhai. Mami meng dow “Ririm raramma mih prenlang uatur” meng owi iawng natekah kown.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 56:1" />Aw Thurai, uang saksing sana ang diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 56:1">Tawngplawng kowchow panow maru kawmuüa dow kawikrawi ang khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 56:1">amatni dow ni chut chi uang krawi sen ang hanow towk ang kawm khai.<verse eid="PSA 56:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 56:2" />Ang kowh ransu-uüa dow atungma kawikrawi ang reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 56:2">tawngbak mih dow bawrima hown uang sen ang khai.<verse eid="PSA 56:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 56:3" />Nachenganchepaw ang kram mih khin khe en luk kowi ang neplawng nesak reng kown.<verse eid="PSA 56:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 56:4" />Ang neplawng nesak mih dow Thurai luk kowi chowtaih.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 56:4">Naiawng rakowi tawngpaw ang nakram kown nadowi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 56:4">Aia kowh laikham rakowi Thurai kowi ang kiowah reng.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 56:4">Tawng chow lusa maru nowng chang ang kown chow?<verse eid="PSA 56:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 56:5" />Ang kowh ransu-uüa dow atungma khüm ang atawi reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 56:5">now nachang ang angak kown mih lawnguan kowi atungma talawp talai büah reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 56:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 56:6" />Amatni dow takua talawm hanow hawt pawm ang büah reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 56:6">amatni dow tawng chow ang chang mih krawi kumit ang reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 56:6">Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni dow sai ang kown nau chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 56:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 56:7" />Aw Thurai, amatni changta lup ngak mih rakowi amatni kowi peah ripra diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 56:7">en kunmarauah rakowi chenchapuüa kowi piakah diah.<verse eid="PSA 56:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 56:8" />Akawm akrat hown mün khowt chow ang uowi mih en tuk chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 56:8">mün khowt chow ang kowh mik tui hawk mih en klowkah reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 56:8">Naiawngün dow en kowh chabowih kowi en ruiah khowk chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 56:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 56:9" />Nauang khowng ang kownkow ang haw en mih khin khe ang kowh ransu-uüa dow napowt büah kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 56:9">Tawngplawng kowchow panow Thurai tawi tangila ang reng mih ang tuk chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 56:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 56:10" />Aia kowh laikham rakowi Thurai kowi ang kiowah reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 56:10">aia kowh laikham rakowi CHAKRAMANG kowi ang kiowah reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 56:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 56:11" />Ang neplawng nesak mih dow Thurai luk kowi chowtaih;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 56:11">tawngpaw ang nakram kown nadowi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 56:11">Tawng chow lusa maru nowng chang ang kown chow?<verse eid="PSA 56:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 56:12" />Aw Thurai, en tut-e kowh ang takham mih uanap ang nauang chang kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 56:12">en tut-e awmrawm lai tek uanap ang nauang chang kown.<verse eid="PSA 56:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 56:13" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow en dow kowngra hownia uang towkala ang khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 56:13">now ang natatheu kown mih hownia paw en town ang khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 56:13">Nami dow en pur kowi kala singra mih nowi kowi ang pacham ia mangla pakowh chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 56:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 56" />
  <chapter number="57" style="c" sid="PSA 57" />
  <para style="s">Palusama kowi Thurai kowh kraingra</para>
  <para style="d">Mami dow David kowh meng chekhai. Mami meng dow Sawl hownia powt hanow puk kowi cham tapet khe kowh aia tekah mih chekhai. Mami meng dow “Hangkow piak diah” pami meng owi iawng natekah kown.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 57:1" />Saksing sana ang diah, aw Thurai, saksing sana ang diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 57:1">Tawngplawng kowchow panow ang dow en tut-e chowtaih tatung tanim reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 57:1">ang luk hownia mami phih tahen dowi mowr dow en tut-e ang nauang tatung tanim kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 57:1">a-u lap krüa kowi uaklinguüa tatung tanim iawng en tut-e ang nauang tatung tanim kown.<verse eid="PSA 57:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 57:2" />Lang kri lang kraing mih Thurai kowi ang nahaw kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 57:2">aia kowh laikham maten town ang reng mih Thurai kowi ang nahaw kown.<verse eid="PSA 57:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 57:3" />Aia dow mukuang pren hownia naiu klang ang kown, now nauang takhula ang kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 57:3">krawi piak ang miuüa kowi dow aia nape kaah rukrai kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 57:3">Thurai dow aia kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura nauang tüng ang kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 57:3">aia kowh kaah sakowm mih lup aia nauang tüng ang kown. [Sela]<verse eid="PSA 57:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 57:4" />Ang kowh ransu-uüa dow umta ang lut khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 57:4">amatni dow chak sakkrai mih krangsi iawng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 57:4">Amatni tut-e dow reh hai leba sek uowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 57:4">amatni kowh dai dow achukma mih saidawng iawng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 57:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 57:5" />Aw Thurai, en kowh kri kraingra dow kuang luk kowi pat pacham tatüng lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 57:5">palusama kowi dow en kowh kraingra pacham tatüng lah.<verse eid="PSA 57:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 57:6" />Ang kowh ransu-uüa dow ang mangah mih tiama kowi chak ang leng khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 57:6">amatni chang ang nowng rakowi lainowmma ang kawm khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 57:6">Amatni dow ang dowla müa thai ang kuam khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 57:6">Tawkche naiawngün kuam kowi dow amatni chowtaih dowh büah khai. [Sela]<verse eid="PSA 57:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 57:7" />Aw Thurai, en luk kowi ang kowh owmra khawtma chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 57:7">tek meng se ang nakiow en kown.<verse eid="PSA 57:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 57:8" />Ang kowh sak ow, awr thowr bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 57:8">ang kowh tingteng hai taraw ow, awr tün bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 57:8">Sat lawt dowi rawn ang narü bowt kown,<verse eid="PSA 57:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 57:9" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, chenchapuüa pungmadawng kowi ang natek en awmrawm lai kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 57:9">maru kawmuüa pungmadawng kowi meng hown ang nakiow en kown.<verse eid="PSA 57:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 57:10" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow en kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura dow hu krang kuang kowi tawk prang chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 57:10">now en kowh kaah sakowm mih paw hu krang uangnim kowi tawk prang chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 57:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 57:11" />Aw Thurai, en kowh kri kraingra dow mukuang kowi pacham tatüng lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 57:11">en kowh kraingra dow palusama kowi pacham tatüng lah.<verse eid="PSA 57:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 57" />
  <chapter number="58" style="c" sid="PSA 58" />
  <para style="s">Thurai dow lusa kowi kowh tara chet miia</para>
  <para style="d">Mami dow David kowh meng chekhai. Mami dow “Hangkow piak diah” pami meng owi iawng natekah kown.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 58:1" />Aw tara chet miuüa, enni chet tara nowm tak bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 58:1">Maru kawmuüa kowi enni chet pe tara nowm khowk bow?<verse eid="PSA 58:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 58:2" />Enni chet pe tara nowm dowi chekhai!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 58:2">Enni kowh saktuak dow nachang angak kown mih kangowh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 58:2">lusa kowi dow enni kowh lup ngak mih krawi tasak khai bowt.<verse eid="PSA 58:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 58:3" />Maru ngakuüa dow uang dia hownia chang lup ngak reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 58:3">now uang dia hownia tek dai lai büah reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 58:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 58:4" />Amatni kowh laiklow dow rua kru iawng kramra uowima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 58:4">amatni dow pitta param mih tawkpaw iawng prengia iung sünta kown nau dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 58:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 58:5" />Amatni dow rua khüm sara kowh prui tün nau sünta dowi mih rua iawng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 58:5">amatni dow prui tum akiakma chepaw nau sünta dowi mih rua iawng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 58:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 58:6" />Aw CHAKRAMANG Thurai, ang kowh ransu-uüa dow kramra uowima chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 58:6">amatni dow krangsila powrchow iawng kramra uowima chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 58:6">Amatni kowh iüng mih en letta pe bowk diah.<verse eid="PSA 58:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 58:7" />Krawng kangma mih kowi khük pe tui khe kowh kang iawng amatni pacham tama bowk lah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 58:7">amatni rüata hüah mih salangba sek dow pacham taklowk bowk lah.<verse eid="PSA 58:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 58:8" />Neng kowi kam kam now tem dow hing tama reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 58:8">nami iawng amatni dow pacham tama lah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 58:8">U mu lak hownia auakma uang dia mih chah dow khila nowi dowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 58:8">nami iawng amatni dow pacham own lah.<verse eid="PSA 58:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 58:9" />
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">58:9 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Mami uan kowi kowh laiklow dow Hebrai lai hown chim dowi chekhai.</char>
    </note>Maru ngakuüa kowi dow alenma kowngta diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 58:9">amatni kowi dow chuh mung maih hown pu lüa den mih lak-e khowm lüa piakta diah.<verse eid="PSA 58:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 58:10" />Ringkaw Thurai miuüa dow maru ngakuüa ka ripra mih khi hanow naawmrawm kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 58:10">amatni dow maru ngakuüa kowh vi hown nasau khawk büah kown.<verse eid="PSA 58:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 58:11" />Nami khita hanow maru kawmuüa natek kown mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 58:11">“Thurai kowi ringkaw miuüa vüi dow awmrawm sung uowi khai nowm!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 58:11">Lusa kowi chet tara mih Thurai uowi lowk ia chekhai nowm!” napa kown.<verse eid="PSA 58:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 58" />
  <chapter number="59" style="c" sid="PSA 59" />
  <para style="s">Ang kowh ransu-uüa hownia lawng ang diah</para>
  <para style="d">Mami dow David kowh meng chekhai. Sawl dow David kowi saita kown nau rakowi David kowh kim re-e kowtow maru khai. Mami meng dow nami khin khe kowh ruiah mih chekhai. Mami meng dow “Hangkow piak diah,” pami meng owi iawng natekah kown.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 59:1" />Aw Thurai, ang kowh ransu-uüa hownia uang lawng ang diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:1">kingküa ang miuüa hownia uang towkala ang diah.<verse eid="PSA 59:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 59:2" />Chang lup ngak miuüa hownia lawng ang diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:2">sai maru miuüa hownia lawng ang diah.<verse eid="PSA 59:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 59:3" />Amatni dow sai ang kownkow hawt pawm ang khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:3">kramra uowima mih maru ngakuüa dow ahawmsang kingküa ang khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 59:3">Aw CHAKRAMANG, naiawng amatni krawi ang mih dow ang changah ngak kowh nadowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 59:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 59:4" />Tawng iawng mih atawi paw ang chang dowi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:4">Nachenganchepaw amatni uang kawikrawi ang hanow uang kingküa ang khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 59:4">Ang kla phih mih sam mü madiah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:4">awr rü hanow uang khowng ang diah.<verse eid="PSA 59:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 59:5" />Aw lang kri lang kraing mih CHAKRAMANG Thurai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:5">en dow Israeluüa kowh Thurai chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 59:5">Awr rü hanow chenchap maten kowi ripah diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:5">kuanlama mih maru ngakuüa kowi mapaw hangkow saksing sanaah diah. [Sela]<verse eid="PSA 59:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 59:6" />Amatni dow iak pra uang plan reng;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:6">kui au klow iawng pla büah reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:6">now marow kowi kowh arah towng kowi krawi len panglang büah reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 59:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 59:7" />Tawng chow amatni tek mih sünta madiah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:7">amatni kowh laiklow dow saidawng iawng pe ngarau reng.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 59:7">Amatni tek mih, “A-i kowh laiklow miapaw ta dowi,” pakhai.<verse eid="PSA 59:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 59:8" />Nachenganchepaw aw CHAKRAMANG, amatni kowi dow en renah khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:8">naiawngün chenchapuüa kowi en prawng renah khai.<verse eid="PSA 59:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 59:9" />Aw Thurai, en kowh kür luk kowi ang owmsak reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:9">en dow ang kowh akhawtma mih kangchawngra kimkrowng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 59:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 59:10" />En dow en kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura hown en nauang sakrau ang kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:10">ang kowh ransu-uüa luk kowi en nape awng ang kown.<verse eid="PSA 59:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 59:11" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, en dow anging kowh kawngma chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:11">ang kowh ransu-uüa kowi alenma hangkow saita diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:11">nadowi now ang kowh maru-uüa mih nami lawnguan natamata kown chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 59:11">Naiawng rakowi en kowh kür hown amatni kowi cham pe powtah panglang diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:11">nami kung kowi phai anging pur kowi amatni kowi pe timah iang.<verse eid="PSA 59:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 59:12" />Amatni dow nawr hown krawi chang ngak khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:12">maru kowi krawi tek dai lai hai krawi pe piati büah khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 59:12">Naiawng rakowi amatni kowh bawri rakowi pacham kla phih lah.<verse eid="PSA 59:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 59:13" />En kowh kunmarau hown amatni kowi piakah diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:13">amatni bowkbowk kowi asaima piakta diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 59:13">Nahanow Jakawb krungchakuüa luk kowi chowm mang mih dow Thurai chowtaih</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:13">pami prenchur nammowt mowr natuk bowk kown towbowt.<verse eid="PSA 59:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 59:14" />Amatni dow iak pra uang plan reng;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:14">kui au klow iawng pla büah reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:14">now marow kowi kowh arah towng kowi krawi len panglang büah reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 59:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 59:15" />Amatni dow mapra lai paipra lai krawi cham chakkham büah reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:15">du pat ka cha chakkham dowi hanow amatni dow ngir sulu reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 59:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 59:16" />Nachenganchepaw ang dow en kowh kür lawnguan kowi ang natek meng kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:16">rau towng apiawma hown en kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura lawnguan kowi ang natek meng kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 59:16">Tawngplawng kowchow panow ang kowh akhawtma mih kangchawngra kimkrowng dow en chowtaih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:16">now ang kla phih khe kowh tatung tanimra paw en chowtaih.<verse eid="PSA 59:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 59:17" />Aw Thurai, en dow ang kowh kür chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:17">en vüi ang natek rowsi meng kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 59:17">Ang kowh akhawtma mih kangchawngra kimkrowng dow en chowtaih;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:17">en dow en kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura uang tüng ang reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 59:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 59" />
  <chapter number="60" style="c" sid="PSA 60" />
  <para style="s">Thurai dow a-i kowh ransu-uüa kowi napiakah kown</para>
  <para style="d">Mami dow David kowh meng chekhai. Aram-Naharaim hai Aram-Zoba hown David tasen mih khin khe Joab dow uang plan hanow Awisa Lawngrawi kowi mih Edawmuüa 12,000 ia kowi saita khai. Mami meng dow naiawng tasen mih khin khe kowh chekhai. Mami meng dow “Kra pau laiklow” pami meng owi iawng natekah kown.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 60:1" />Aw Thurai, en dow nuata anging khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 60:1">en dow pe sum anging khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 60:1">Lainowmma en kunmarau anging khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 60:1">Nachenganchepaw alai kowh iawng plan pe anging iungra iawk diah.<verse eid="PSA 60:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 60:2" />Pren kowi dow lihowng en uang pe uangah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 60:2">now krawng dow awr talak phak khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 60:2">Naiawng hai pren mih piak khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 60:2">Nachenganchepaw kawmat dow naiawngün mih en pe taplimah diah.<verse eid="PSA 60:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 60:3" />En kowh maru-uüa luk kowi dow en uang pawla pe akawm akrat khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 60:3">anging dow kham grep tui kowh pua tim bawilawi mih iawng phaw khai bowt.<verse eid="PSA 60:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 60:4" />Ringkaw en miuüa kowi dow en pe pe tamkhuown lowk khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 60:4">Nami dow ransu-uüa uang krawi sen khe naia powtla kown mih tatukla müa chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 60:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 60:5" />En kowh kür hown uang lawng anging diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 60:5">anging awr lüah mih kowi iu klang anging diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 60:5">nahanow en sakrauah mih en kowh maru-uüa dow naka lawngra kown towbowt.<verse eid="PSA 60:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 60:6" />Thurai dow aia kowh chimsaima mih ming hown takham se tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 60:6">“Awng kowh apiawma hown Sekem marow dow ang naretah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 60:6">Sukawt Lawngrawi dow ang kowh maru-uüa kowi ang naret pe kown.<verse eid="PSA 60:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 60:7" />Gilead süng dow ang kowh, Manase paw ang kowh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 60:7">Efraim dow ang kowh tasen müa lukruk iawng,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 60:7">Juda dow ang kowh mang raitua iawng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 60:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 60:8" />Nachenganchepaw Moab pren kowi dow ang kowh khawk sau müa biatum iawng ang nachangah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 60:8">Edawm pren kowi dow ang kowh phanaikhawk hown ang nakuakah kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 60:8">Now Filistin pren nowng senta rakowi ang dow nahek kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="PSA 60:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 60:9" />Nami khikhawtma mih Edawm pren kowi kowh marow kri kowi mia chow kowpawla ang kown?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 60:9">Edawm pren kowi mangla kown mih tiama mia chow natüng ang kown?<verse eid="PSA 60:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 60:10" />Aw Thurai, en nuata anging khai bowt bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 60:10">Anging kowh siphaiuüa hown en tawi tarü tasen dowi bowt bow?<verse eid="PSA 60:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 60:11" />Aw Thurai, ransu-uüa kowi nasen kown mih tawi khowng anging diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 60:11">lusa maru uang tawi khowng mih taih now tawngpaw asung uowi dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 60:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 60:12" />En tawi khowng anging rakowi anging naawng kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 60:12">en dow anging kowh ransu-uüa kowi napiakah kown.<verse eid="PSA 60:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 60" />
  <chapter number="61" style="c" sid="PSA 61" />
  <para style="s">Tatung tanimra singku huamang kowi tow ang diah</para>
  <para style="d">Mami dow David kowh meng chekhai. Mami meng dow aiang uowi mih tünteu chang müa hown natekah kown mih chekhai.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 61:1" />Aw Thurai, ang kowh kar klow sünta diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 61:1">ang awr lü awr leng mih hawt sünta ang diah.<verse eid="PSA 61:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 61:2" />Prenchur nammowt kowi ang cham uowi khai chepaw,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 61:2">ka tuak ka cha dowi mih khin khe ang nahaw en kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 61:2">Ang kowi dow alowngma mih singku huamang luk kowi kowpawla ang diah.<verse eid="PSA 61:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 61:3" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow ang kowh tatung tanimra dow en chowtaih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 61:3">ransu-uüa sen ang khe kowh ang kowh akhawtma mih kimkrowng dow en chowtaih.<verse eid="PSA 61:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 61:4" />En kowh tangbung kowi chowngchowng saksakma ang pacham ka uowi reng lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 61:4">en lap krüa kowi ang pacham ka tatung tanimra reng lah.<verse eid="PSA 61:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 61:5" />Aw Thurai, ang takham mih maten dow en ta bowk chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 61:5">ringkaw en miuüa kowi kowh en peah mih prasi dow ang kowi paw en pela ang khai.<verse eid="PSA 61:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 61:6" />Mang kowh chownglawng dow adawngma tow pe diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 61:6">aia dow pre sum chowng mowr pacham sing lah.<verse eid="PSA 61:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 61:7" />Aia kowi dow chowngchowng saksakma Thurai pur kowi pe chowmah mang diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 61:7">en kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura hai kaah sakowm mih rah hown aia kowi dow towkala diah.<verse eid="PSA 61:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 61:8" />Nahanow chowngchowng saksakma ang natek en rowsi meng reng kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 61:8">now ang takhamta mih ni towng ang nachang en reng kown.<verse eid="PSA 61:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 61" />
  <chapter number="62" style="c" sid="PSA 62" />
  <para style="s">Ang kowh sak dow Thurai kowi chowtaih chawng khai</para>
  <para style="d">Mami dow David kowh meng chekhai. Mami dow Jeduthun kowh meng owi iawng natekah kown.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 62:1" />Ang kowh sak mih rarimma Thurai kowi hawt chawng khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 62:1">Tawngplawng kowchow panow ang kowh lawng miia dow aia chowtaih.<verse eid="PSA 62:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 62:2" />Ang kowh Singku Huamang hai ang kowh lawngra dow aia chowtaih;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 62:2">aia dow ang kowh akhawtma mih kimkrowng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 62:2">Naiawng rakowi katpaw ang napiak kown nadowi.<verse eid="PSA 62:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 62:3" />Mün ni tak chow enni nasen ang kown?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 62:3">Ang dow chü lowlow mih tap iawng towbowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 62:3">ang dow tapiak nak mih khah iawng towbowt.<verse eid="PSA 62:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 62:4" />Amatni kowh sangkrangra ngak dow ang kowh maru iukra napiakta kown mih chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 62:4">amatni kowh awmrawmra dow ang lawnguan kowi kowh küa dai mih chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 62:4">Amatni dow nawr hown krowngchow taih pe ang prasi reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 62:4">Tawkche sak hownia dow pe ang piati büah reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 62:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 62:5" />Ang kowh sak mih rarimma Thurai kowi hawt chawng khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 62:5">Tawngplawng kowchow panow pe ang sakowmra reng mih dow aia chowtaih.<verse eid="PSA 62:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 62:6" />Ang kowh tatung tanimra Singku Huamang hai ang kowh lawngra dow aia chowtaih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 62:6">ang kowh akhawtma mih kimkrowng dow aia chowtaih.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 62:6">Naiawng rakowi katpaw ang napiak kown nadowi.<verse eid="PSA 62:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 62:7" />Ang kowh lawngra hai kiowrira dow Thurai hownia kowh chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 62:7">Thurai chowtaih ang kowh akhawtma mih kimkrowng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 62:7">aia chowtaih ang kowh thaulangma mih tatung tanimra.<verse eid="PSA 62:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 62:8" />Ang maru-uüa low, Thurai chowtaih a-i kowh tatung tanimra;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 62:8">aia luk kowi atungma neplawng nesak büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 62:8">now enni kowh tuak krat pusara aia kowi phowk pe büa diah. [Sela]<verse eid="PSA 62:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 62:9" />Iawngpa mih maru-uüa dow li iawng chowtaih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 62:9">now asung uowima mih maru-uüa paw tawngpaw nadowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 62:9">Set hown khaiah e amatni dow li lak-e lang howp chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 62:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 62:10" />Enni kowh nowng chang powng changra kür kowi hangkow owmsak büa diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 62:10">kuk rak hown naphaw kown mih kowi mapaw hangkow neplawng nesak büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 62:10">en kowh dawngthawnguan ahuma chepaw mapaw hangkow sakowm diah.<verse eid="PSA 62:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11-12" style="v" sid="PSA 62:11-12" />Thurai tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 62:11-12">“Kürra maten dow ang kowh chowtaih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 62:11-12">now achur uowi dowi mih sakraura paw ang kowh chowtaih,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 62:11-12">Naiawng Thurai tek mih ahuma khowk ang ta.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 62:11-12">Maru maten kowi amatni kowh lup iawng en peah sung reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 62:11-12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 62" />
  <chapter number="63" style="c" sid="PSA 63" />
  <para style="s">Prüa Thurai mih</para>
  <para style="d">Süngrüp süngkangma kowi uowi khe kowh David tekah mih meng.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 63:1" />Aw Thurai, ang kowh Thurai dow en chowtaih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 63:1">süngürma hown ang haw en khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 63:1">Mami akang khawngma mih süng nau tui iawng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 63:1">ang kowh sak dow lainowmma nau en khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 63:1">Ang prüa en lai bowt kowh ang kowh kow paw ngawi khai bowt.<verse eid="PSA 63:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 63:2" />Naiawng rakowi en kim chimsaima mih kowi ang khi en kown ang nau,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 63:2">en kowh kür hai en kowh kraingra mih khi kown ang nau.<verse eid="PSA 63:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 63:3" />En kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura ang ka mih dow lainowmma iung chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 63:3">Nami dow sing uowi mih lak-e paw ang vüi lang iung chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 63:3">Naiawng rakowi ang narowsi en reng kown.<verse eid="PSA 63:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 63:4" />Chownglawng prat ang narowsi en reng kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 63:4">chawk rut se ang nachup en reng kown.<verse eid="PSA 63:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 63:5" />Cham cha pawi mih maru iawng ang kowh sak nata-ih kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 63:5">now ang dow awmrawmma hown natek en rowsi meng kown.<verse eid="PSA 63:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 63:6" />Phangbek kowi mawk khe ang ka tuak en reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 63:6">uar prowt chi en lawnguan kowi ang tuak reng.<verse eid="PSA 63:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 63:7" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow en dow khowng ang reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 63:7">Naiawng rakowi en downg krüa kowi ang natek rowsi meng reng kown.<verse eid="PSA 63:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 63:8" />Ang dow kür uowi mih maten hown dowkta en chenchen khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 63:8">now en kowh hawmlawm rut hown en uang krui ang khai.<verse eid="PSA 63:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 63:9" />Napawta ang asak kownkow krawi lim ang miuüa dow nakowng kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 63:9">now amatni dow kowng miuüa uowi rah kowi nacham uowi büah kown.<verse eid="PSA 63:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 63:10" />Amatni dow saidawng hown nacham kowng büah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 63:10">amatni kowh uak dow brenkhui hawmh kowh chakkham nachowng kown.<verse eid="PSA 63:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 63:11" />Nachenganchepaw mang dow Thurai ming hown napiaw kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 63:11">aia ming hown takham miuüa dow aia kowi narowsiah kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 63:11">Tawkche dailama miuüa kowh nawr dow nakowpta pe hüah kown.<verse eid="PSA 63:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 63" />
  <chapter number="64" style="c" sid="PSA 64" />
  <para style="s">Ransu-uüa hownia lawng ang diah</para>
  <para style="d">Mami dow David kowh meng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 64:1" />Aw Thurai, ang uang chawk lai mih hawt sünta ang diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 64:1">ransu-uüa rut hownia uang lawng ang diah.<verse eid="PSA 64:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 64:2" />Maru ngakuüa kowh sangkrangra ngak hownia uang lawng ang diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 64:2">maru ngakuüa thum hownia uang lawng ang diah.<verse eid="PSA 64:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 64:3" />Amatni dow amatni kowh dai mih saidawng iawng sükah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 64:3">amatni kowh laiklow ngak dow leba sek iawng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 64:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 64:4" />Amatni dow angak uowi dowi mih maru kowi kukpa krawi tek dai lai khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 64:4">kram dowi kowi maru mingmang dowi khe amatni dow akruma mih laiklow krawi tek khai.<verse eid="PSA 64:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 64:5" />Amatni kowh sangkrangra ngak mih kaneuma thawpah büah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 64:5">kukpa nakrawi chakta leng hüah kownkow tape prengia büah khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 64:5">Amatni tatek mih, “Nami leng dow amiapaw nakhi kown nadowi,” pakhai.<verse eid="PSA 64:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 64:6" />Amatni dow nachang ngak kownkow thawp prengia hanow tatek mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 64:6">“Lowra prakowi tuakah kaneu kowh thawpta prengia lowk khowk,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 64:6">Lusa maru kowh saktuak dow abüpma; miapaw krawi ia tuk dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 64:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 64:7" />Nachenganchepaw Thurai dow leba sek hown amatni kowi naap-ah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 64:7">mingmang dowi khe leba sek kak hanow amatni dow natim kown.<verse eid="PSA 64:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 64:8" />Amatni dow amatni kowh dai rakowi nauang pawla piakra kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 64:8">amatni piak mih khi hanow maru maten mih nakhareah kown.<verse eid="PSA 64:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 64:9" />Nakhowk khe dow maru maten sak kowi kramra nauang ting kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 64:9">Thurai changah mih lup maten nakrawi phuang büah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 64:9">now nami lawnguan mih natuakah büah kown.<verse eid="PSA 64:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 64:10" />Thurai kowi ringkaw miuüa dow CHAKRAMANG rakowi napiaw reng kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 64:10">now aia tut-e chowtaih natatung tanim büah reng kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 64:10">Saktuak prawngma miuüa dow aia kowi narowsi reng kown.<verse eid="PSA 64:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 64" />
  <chapter number="65" style="c" sid="PSA 65" />
  <para style="s">CHAKRAMANG kowi chowtaih rowsi kiowri taing</para>
  <para style="d">Mami dow David kowh meng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 65:1" />Aw Thurai, Zaiawn kowi en rowsi meng anging tek reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:1">anging takhamta mih maten dow en vüi anging nachang en reng kown.<verse eid="PSA 65:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 65:2" />Aw anging kowh prasi lük klow hawt sünta reng mih Thurai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:2">en tut-e chowtaih maru uang reng.<verse eid="PSA 65:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 65:3" />Anging dow anging matia kowh lup ngak kowi cham tamir khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:3">Nachenganchepaw anging kowh angak mih en lawtta anging reng.<verse eid="PSA 65:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 65:4" />En ruiah mih maru, en matia tut-e en pawla mih maru-uüa dow prasira uowima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:4">amatni kowi dow en kowh chup kim viadawng kowi naia uowila kownkow en pawla mih chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 65:4">En kim kowi, en kowh arah chimsaima mih kowi en kowh prasi hown sak-ihma hown anging nauowi kown.<verse eid="PSA 65:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 65:5" />Aw anging kowh lawng miia Thurai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:5">anging haw en mih kowi iu klang anging diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:5">now en kowh awdara uowima mih lup hown uang lawng anging diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 65:5">Lusa kowi kowh arah towng kowh maru-uüa dow en luk kowi owmsak reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:5">alakma mih sata pang kowi kowh uowi miuüa paw en luk kowi neplawng nesak reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 65:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 65:6" />Hungma mawngma maten en thawpah mih dow en matia kür hown chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:6">nami hownia dow en akürma pami uang tatüng khai.<verse eid="PSA 65:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 65:7" />Sata tui tün nowk rumrum mih kowi pe rimah mih dow en chowtaih;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:7">sata tui talowng phunglung mih klow pe rimah mih dow en chowtaih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:7">now chenchapuüa taran urlur mih klow pe rimah mih paw en chowtaih.<verse eid="PSA 65:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 65:8" />Lusa kowi kowh maru maten dow en kowh awdara lup khi hanow lakkhia reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:8">now satlawt hownia satkup mowr maru maten dow apiawma hai how sawmlawm reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 65:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 65:9" />En dow lusa mingkhet mih chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:9">lusa kowi en peah uang tui reng hanow bawr ahuma en pe uowiah khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 65:9">Aw kowi dow tui atekma en towah reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:9">nami hownia dow lusa maru ka luprak reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 65:9">Naiawng hai krawng dow en kamrüt pe khai:<verse eid="PSA 65:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 65:10" />Ki thawnta laih khe en uang chin pe uang hanow tui atekma en towah khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:10">uang tui hown akhawtma mih bawn ün anümchow en changah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:10">now cha ru cha pawi kowi ahuma en peah prasi khai.<verse eid="PSA 65:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 65:11" />Khowm bowkta mih akhin towng en prasi hown ahuma luprak phaw reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:11">en krawi mangah mih arah towng dow luprak aiungma phaw reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 65:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 65:12" />Tawncher tawkra dowm dow pram ner asingma chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:12">hungma mawngma kowi paw pram ner tahowng nurlur chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 65:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 65:13" />Dowm towng kowi paw ruapur hawmh atekma kangowh chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:13">lawngrawi kowi paw luprak kangowh tamumla klum khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 65:13">Naiawngün dow tüng awmrawm klow hai tek meng reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 65:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 65" />
  <chapter number="66" style="c" sid="PSA 66" />
  <para style="s">Thurai kowh lup klangiung mih krang</para>
  <para style="d">Mami dow David kowh meng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 66:1" />Aw lusa kowi kowh maru maten,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:1">enni bowkbowk Thurai kowi kiow hai apiawma how büa diah.<verse eid="PSA 66:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 66:2" />Aia kowh kraingra uowima mih ming kowi kiow büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:2">ringkawma hown aia kowi rowsiah diah<verse eid="PSA 66:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 66:3" />Thurai kowi maiawng tek pe büa diah, “En kowh lup dow lainowmma ringkawra hai kramra uowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:3">en kowh kür rakowi en kowh ransu-uüa mih en tut-e nauang khamsum kown.<verse eid="PSA 66:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 66:4" />Lusa kowi kowh maru maten dow nachupiia en kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:4">amatni dow en vüi kowi natek en rowsi meng kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:4">now en ming hown natek rowsi meng kown,” pape diah. [Sela]<verse eid="PSA 66:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 66:5" />Uang büa diah, Thurai changah mih lup maten uang mü büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:5">maru vüi kowi kowh aia changah mih lup dow ringkawra hai kramra uowima chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 66:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 66:6" />Aia dow sata kowi mih akang khawngma changah khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:6">a-i kowh pipu-uüa dow khawk hown nami iawng haipown khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 66:6">Uang büa diah, aia rakowi nami pren kowi a-i piaw diah sik.<verse eid="PSA 66:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 66:7" />Aia kowh kür hown aia dow chowngchowng saksakma chowm mang khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:7">aia kowh mik dow chenchap maten luk kowi krawi tang mü reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 66:7">Thurai kowi kingküa miuüa dow kowmatia kowi aiukma hang pacham tanü lah. [Sela]<verse eid="PSA 66:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 66:8" />Chenchapuüa low, a-i kowh Thurai kowi rowsi büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:8">aia vüi kowi dow atünma tek rowsi meng büa diah.<verse eid="PSA 66:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 66:9" />Aia chowtaih pe a-i singra reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:9">aia dow lawng a-i reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 66:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 66:10" />Aw Thurai, en dow chaing anging reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:10">maih kowi maru chaing tai mih iawng en chaing anging khai.<verse eid="PSA 66:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 66:11" />Anging kowi dow leng kowi en pe tasowk anging khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:11">anging luk kowi kurdik ahuma en tang anging khai.<verse eid="PSA 66:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 66:12" />Anging kowh ransu-uüa kowi dow anging luk kowi en pe changah alow khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:12">maih hai tui dawng kowi cham mang khe kowh iawng en pe mang anging khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 66:12">Nachenganchepaw kawmat dow akhawr uowi dowi mih rah kowi en uang pawla anging khai.<verse eid="PSA 66:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 66:13" />Tikah mih uanap dow en kim kowi ang nauang pawla kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:13">en tut-e kowh ang takhamta mih maten dow ang nachang kown.<verse eid="PSA 66:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 66:14" />Naiawngün takham laiklow dow ang nawr hown kowh ang tekah mih chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:14">Nami dow ang kla phih khe kowh ang nawr hownia ang lawtah mih laiklow chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 66:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 66:15" />En vüi kowi aiuk akauma mih tawncher hown ang nachang en tikah mih uanap kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:15">chia, rua hai ruapur tikah hanow nam iungma mih uanap ang nachang en kown.<verse eid="PSA 66:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 66:16" />Thurai kowi enni ringkaw mih maten uang now uang sünta büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:16">ang vüi kowi kowh aia chang mih maten dow ang nalawp enni kown.<verse eid="PSA 66:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 66:17" />Aia tut-e dow ang awr lü awr leng khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:17">aia kowi dow ang rowsi kiowriah khai.<verse eid="PSA 66:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 66:18" />Ang sak kowi che angak uowi e aia mih ang laiklow nasünta kown nadowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:18">now ang awr lü awr leng mih paw aia mih nahawt sünta ang kown nadowi.<verse eid="PSA 66:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 66:19" />Nachenganchepaw Thurai dow ang awr lü awr leng mih sünta ang khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:19">aia dow ang awr lü awr leng mih kowi pe ang ching khai.<verse eid="PSA 66:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 66:20" />Thurai dow akiow pacham uowi reng lah!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 66:20">Aia dow ang awr lü awr leng mih hawt nuata ang dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:20">now aia kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura paw ang luk hownia aia taingta dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 66:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 66" />
  <chapter number="67" style="c" sid="PSA 67" />
  <para style="s">Aw Thurai, sana anging diah</para>
  <para style="d">Mami dow David kowh meng chekhai. Mami meng dow aiang uowi mih tünteu chang müa hown natekah kown mih chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1-2" style="v" sid="PSA 67:1-2" />Palusama en naukrang nowngia tukla kownkow,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 67:1-2">now chenchap maten nalawngla kown mih kür en tut-e uowi pami naia tukla kownkow,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 67:1-2">aw Thurai, sana anging diah, pe anging prasi diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 67:1-2">now en sanara anowi iawng anging luk kowi uang pe uowiah diah. [Sela]<verse eid="PSA 67:1-2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 67:3" />Aw Thurai, chenchapuüa pacham rowsi en lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 67:3">chenchap maten pacham kiow en lah.<verse eid="PSA 67:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 67:4" />Chenchapuüa luk kowi tara anowmma mih en nachet pe kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 67:4">lusa kowi kowh chenchap maten kowi en nakruitownah kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 67:4">Naiawng rakowi chenchap maten pacham awmrawm lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 67:4">chenchapuüa dow awmrawmma hown pacham tek meng lah. [Sela]<verse eid="PSA 67:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 67:5" />Aw Thurai, chenchapuüa pacham rowsi en lah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 67:5">chenchap maten pacham kiow en lah.<verse eid="PSA 67:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 67:6" />Anging kowh Thurai dow pe anging prasi khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 67:6">krawng dow pe anging luprak khai.<verse eid="PSA 67:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 67:7" />Thurai dow pe anging prasi khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 67:7">palusama maru aia kowi pacham ringkawah lah.<verse eid="PSA 67:7" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 67" />
  <chapter number="68" style="c" sid="PSA 68" />
  <para style="s">Aia kowh ransu-uüa kowi CHAKRAMANG nasetta plawt kown</para>
  <para style="d">Mami dow David kowh meng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 68:1" />Aw Thurai, awr rü hanow en ransu-uüa kowi setta plawt diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:1">kingküa en miuüa maten kowi en pur hownia prütta diah.<verse eid="PSA 68:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 68:2" />Amatni kowi dow maikhük iawng cham pe rownah diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:2">maru ngakuüa dow maih hown iawn maih chawr iawng en pur kowi pacham tapiak lah.<verse eid="PSA 68:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 68:3" />Nachenganchepaw achinawmma miuüa dow pacham awmrawm lah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:3">amatni dow Thurai pur kowi pacham piaw lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:3">now apiaw apama hown pacham awmrawm büah lah.<verse eid="PSA 68:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 68:4" />Thurai vüi kowi tek meng büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:4">aia ming kowi tek rowsi meng büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 68:4">Aia dow uangnim dawng hownia kawrnga kari hown uang tarü khowk.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:4">Naiawng rakowi aia vüi kamrüt pe tiama büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 68:4">Aia ming dow CHAKRAMANG chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:4">aia pur kowi piaw büa diah.<verse eid="PSA 68:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 68:5" />Thurai dow chimsaima mih uowi rah kowi uowi mih chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:5">aia dow saratchowuüa kowi mih pa iawng mingkhetah reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:5">now mamaimowuüa kowi paw mingkhetah reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 68:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 68:6" />Thurai dow kimchak uowi dowi mih maru kowi peah kimchak reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:6">aia dow nar kowi takhang miuüa kowi lawngah hanow peah iungra reng.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 68:6">Tawkche aia kowi kowh kingküaah miuüa kowi dow aia ripah reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:6">amatni kowi dow kangkhawngma panow adenma mih süng kowi aia towah reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 68:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 68:7" />Aw Thurai, en kowh maru-uüa pur kowi en rik mang khe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:7">süngrüp süngkangma iawng en maru-uüa kowi en pawla khai. [Sela]<verse eid="PSA 68:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 68:8" />Nakhowk khe lusa mih chür nukluk khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:8">now mukuang hownia uangchak uang khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 68:8">Naiawng phaw mih dow Sinai hungh kowi kowh Thurai pur kowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:8">en matia pur kowi, Israeluüa kowh Thurai pur kowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 68:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 68:9" />Aw Thurai, uang achakma en uang iu pe anging khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:9">kangkhawngma mih en kowh pren kowi asima en changah khai.<verse eid="PSA 68:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 68:10" />Nami pren kowi dow en kowh maru-uüa changla uowi rah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:10">en kowh iungra hown ngarai miuüa kowi lakke mih sia en peah reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 68:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 68:11" />CHAKRAMANG dow maru kawmuüa kowi peah ana reng;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:11">nahanow nami satang dow masiuüa akawmma krawi phuang reng.<verse eid="PSA 68:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 68:12" />Naiawngün masiuüa hawmh krawi tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:12">“A-i kowh ransu siphaiuüa hai manguüa powt bowk khowk,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 68:12">Now kim kowi uowi mih masiuüa hawmh dow ransu-uüa ta towla mih uanh ta taret büah khai.<verse eid="PSA 68:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 68:13" />Ruapur tung taum lut mih dawnglang kowi uowi miuüa khowm padow kuh hai tai uanh tawi ka khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:13">amatni khowm padow tai hown thawp pe alap hanow kuh hown sow pe apawi mih uatur tawi ka khai.<verse eid="PSA 68:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 68:14" />Pren hownia manguüa kowi lang kri lang kraing mih Thurai setta plawt khe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:14">Zalmawn hungh kowi nangkhe uang kla khai.<verse eid="PSA 68:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 68:15" />Basan hungh dow Thurai kowh hungh chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:15">nami hungh dow akroma chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:15">now nakowi dow chut uowi ahuma chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 68:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 68:16" />Aw Basan hungh, tawngplawng kowchow Zaiawn hungh kowi mik ngak hown en tuk müah khai?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:16">Zaiawn hungh dow chowngchowng saksakma aia nauowiah kownkow Thurai lang kloah mih chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 68:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 68:17" />Thurai dow kawrnga kari athawng aiawng hown uang tarü khowk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:17">aia dow Sinai hungh hownia aia kowh chimsaima mih arah kowi uang tarü khowk.<verse eid="PSA 68:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 68:18" />Aia dow hungh alowngma mih kowi kowpün khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:18">aia dow nar kowi cham takhang miuüa kowi kruila khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 68:18">Aia dow maru-uüa hownia hawt paw awmrawm sung khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:18">aia kowi kingküaah miuüa hownia paw hawt paw awmrawm sung khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 68:18">CHAKRAMANG Thurai dow nakowi nauowi reng kown.<verse eid="PSA 68:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 68:19" />CHAKRAMANG kowi kiow büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:19">aia dow ni towng a-i kowh kurdik kur a-i reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 68:19">Now aia dow a-i kowh lawng miia Thurai chekhai. [Sela]<verse eid="PSA 68:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 68:20" />A-i kowh Thurai dow lawng miia Thurai chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:20">CHAKRAMANG Thurai dow kowngra hownia towkala a-i reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 68:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 68:21" />Tawkche aia dow aia kowh ransu-uüa kowi nadita pe lu naknak kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:21">chang lup ngak miuüa maten kowi aia dow nadita pe lu naknak kown.<verse eid="PSA 68:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 68:22" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “Ransu-uüa kowi Basan pren hownia ang nauang pawla kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:22">sata thing kowi cham uowi chepaw nami hownia amatni kowi ang nauang pawla kown.<verse eid="PSA 68:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 68:23" />Naiawng ang nachangah kown mih dow en kowh ransu-uüa vi hown en naia saula khawk kownkow chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:23">now en kowh kui hawmh mih nau mowr naka biala vi kownkow chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="PSA 68:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 68:24" />Aw Thurai, en kowh awngra dow maru maten khi bowk chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:24">aia kowh chimsaima mih arah pra ang kowh mang Thurai mang mih dow maru khi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 68:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 68:25" />Rik mang miuüa dow meng sarauüa chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:25">amatni kung kowi kowh krawi mang miuüa dow tünteu chang miuüa chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 68:25">nami takra kowi krawi mang miuüa dow sawkchow tep mih masiuüa hawmh chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 68:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 68:26" />Thurai maru-uüa kowh takua kri kowi Thurai kowi rowsiah diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:26">enni Israel krungchakuüa low, CHAKRAMANG kowi rowsi büa diah.<verse eid="PSA 68:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 68:27" />Rik mang mih dow bowkbowk lak-e kowh sawi mih Benjamin krungchak chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 68:27">Nami kung kowi krawi mang mih dow Juda krungchak aluchowuüa chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:27">amatni rut kowi dow mang raitua uowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:27">now amatni kowh dow thumchak aiukma chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 68:27">Nami kung kowi krawi mang mih dow Zebulun krungchak aluchowuüa chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:27">now nami kung kowi krawi mang mih dow Naptali krungchak aluchowuüa chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 68:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 68:28" />Aw Thurai, en kowh kürra uang tüng diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:28">alai kowh en tangila anging khe kowh iawng en kowh kür uang tüng anging iawk diah.<verse eid="PSA 68:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 68:29" />En kowh chup kim dow Jerusalem marow kowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:29">nakowi en tut-e manguüa nauang pawla en awmrawm sung kown.<verse eid="PSA 68:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 68:30" />Amatni hai amatni uang pawla mih tai di tai sek ün dow thuata pe nak diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 68:30">Uaklung taw kowi kowh tapet mih kaurawng uaramchak kowi en nangah iawng</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:30">Aigupta chenchapuüa kowi dow nangah diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 68:30">Now chia iia kowi akürma mih chiala nowngah iawng</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:30">akürma mih chenchapuüa kowi nowngah diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 68:30">Tasen dawma mih chenchapuüa maten kowi dow piakah reng diah.<verse eid="PSA 68:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 68:31" />Mang kowh ria mang miuüa dow Aigupta pren hownia nauang kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:31">Ethiawpiauüa dow nalü khowng kownkow Thurai tut-e alenma naiaw rut kown.<verse eid="PSA 68:31" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 68:32" />Aw lusa kowi kowh pren maten, Thurai vüi kowi tek meng büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:32">enni bowkbowk CHAKRAMANG vüi kowi tek rowsi meng büa diah. [Sela]<verse eid="PSA 68:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 68:33" />Aia dow alai kowh aia thawpah mih mukuang kowi kawrnga kari hown krawi mang khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:33">sünta büa diah, aia dow atün atünma tek lai khowk.<verse eid="PSA 68:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 68:34" />Thurai dow akürma chekhai pami krawi phuang büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:34">aia kowh kraingra dow Israeluüa luk kowi uowi reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:34">now aia kowh kür dow mukuang kowi atekma uowi reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 68:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 68:35" />Aw Thurai, en kowh chimsaima mih arah dow ringkawma hown kramra uowima chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:35">Israeluüa kowh Thurai dow aia maru-uüa kowi nowng changra hai kürra peah reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 68:35" />
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 68:35">Thurai dow akiow pacham uowi reng lah.<verse eid="PSA 68:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 68" />
  <chapter number="69" style="c" sid="PSA 69" />
  <para style="s">Aw CHAKRAMANG, ransu-uüa hownia lawng ang diah</para>
  <para style="d">Mami dow David kowh meng chekhai. Mami meng dow “Kra pau” meng owi iawng natekah kown.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 69:1" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, uang lawng ang diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:1">tui kowi tamir mih iawng ang uowi khai bowt.<verse eid="PSA 69:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 69:2" />Neng abüpma mih kowi ang tamir khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:2">nakowi dow ang ka iowngra dowi bowt chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 69:2">Abüpma mih tui dawng kowi ang uang towm khai bowt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:2">tui lawt khe kowh tui dow ang luk iawng uang hawr khai bowt.<verse eid="PSA 69:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 69:3" />Ang haw en lai bowt kowh ang kow uak khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:3">ang kowh kraw paw kang khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 69:3">Ang kowh Thurai nauang lawng ang kown mih kowi ang hawt tang mü mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:3">ang kowh mik paw apuarunma towbowt.<verse eid="PSA 69:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 69:4" />Aiawnglowma sui ang miuüa dow ang kowh samiang lak-e lang hu chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:4">piak ang kown nau miuüa dow akürma kangowh chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 69:4">Amatni dow aiawnglowma ang lawnguan kowi tek dai lai khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:4">amatni dow ang cham kuah dowi mih uanh paw pe iaw ang khai.<verse eid="PSA 69:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 69:5" />Aw Thurai, ang dow bualama pami en aiawng tuk chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:5">ang kowh angak dow en tut-e ia tapet dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 69:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 69:6" />Aw lang kri lang kraing mih CHAKRAMANG, cham en reng miuüa dow ang rakowi hang pacham ka rukrai lah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:6">Aw Israeluüa kowh Thurai, tuk en kown sakkrai miuüa dow ang rakowi hang pacham ka rukrai büah lah.<verse eid="PSA 69:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 69:7" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow tangila en rakowi ang kham rukrai khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:7">rukrai rakowi ang ka lumowr towk rah dowi bowt.<verse eid="PSA 69:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 69:8" />Ang tainau-uüa tut-e khowm padow ang chowng maru lang khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:8">ang kowh machakuüa khowm changla ang prenlang maru khai bowt.<verse eid="PSA 69:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 69:9" />En kowh kim kowi lainowmma ang sakrau khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:9">Naiawng rakowi ang kowh sak dow kam iawmlawm khai</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 69:9">En kowi kowh pe en mih rukrai ang luk kowi uang kla khai.<verse eid="PSA 69:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 69:10" />Kar hai hawm khang hown akawmma ang uowi khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:10">nami khin khe maru kawmuüa dow prawngren ang khai.<verse eid="PSA 69:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 69:11" />Uowila uiting uangtak mih natüngla kownkow</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:11">ang khup sala uan khe maru khare ang khai.<verse eid="PSA 69:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 69:12" />Marow tapplawt kowi kowh chowm miuüa pat prawngren ang khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:12">pua miuüa khowm padow changla ang amatni kowh meng lai khai.<verse eid="PSA 69:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 69:13" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, en tut-e ang uang lü uang leng khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:13">en khowm bowkta mih khin kowi uang klang ang reng diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 69:13">Aw Thurai, en kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura hai kaah sakowm mih rah hown uang lawng ang diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:13">ang awr lü awr leng mih hawt sünta ang hanow uang lawng ang diah.<verse eid="PSA 69:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 69:14" />Suplawk dawng kowi tadup mih hownia uang lawng ang diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:14">nami suplawk dawng kowi hauang pe tadupta ang hüah diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 69:14">Ang kowh ransu-uüa rut hownia uang lawng ang diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:14">hawr klunglung mih tui hownia uang lawng ang diah.<verse eid="PSA 69:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 69:15" />Tui lawt khe kowh tui mih ang luk kowi hauang pe hawrah diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:15">abüpma mih tui dawng kowi hauang pe tamir ang diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 69:15">Kowngra kuam kowi hauang pe tadup ang diah.<verse eid="PSA 69:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 69:16" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, en kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura iung hown uang klang ang diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:16">en kowh achur uowi dowi mih saksing sanara hown ang prakowi uang dang diah.<verse eid="PSA 69:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 69:17" />En kowh nar hownia en kowh lumowr mih hangkow cham dangta khai diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:17">ang kla phih khai bowt! Alenma uang khowng ang diah!<verse eid="PSA 69:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 69:18" />Ang tut-e uang now uang lawng ang diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:18">ang kowh ransu-uüa hownia uang lawng ang diah.<verse eid="PSA 69:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 69:19" />Mün khowt chow maru sui ang hai pe ang rukrai mih en tuk towbowt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:19">En dow ang kowh ransu-uüa maten kowi tuk bowk chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 69:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 69:20" />Maru sui ang lai bowt rakowi ang kowh sak piak khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:20">Naiawng rakowi ang arau uowi prang towbowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 69:20">Ang krat mih khin khe maru saksing sana ang kown mih chowdiah ang nau.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:20">Nachenganchepaw ang nauah iawng ang ka dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 69:20">Nape ang sakkhawtra kown mih maru ang nau chowdiah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:20">Tawkchedow mia kowi paw ang ka dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 69:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 69:21" />Amatni dow ang kowh chakkham kowi the ang ket khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:21">now ang tui sakkrai khe amatni dow pe kham ang tui sur khai.<verse eid="PSA 69:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 69:22" />Amatni kowh chakkham pawi dow amatni vüi tasowk müa leng pacham chowng lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:22">“Thaulangma anging uowi,” pahai amatni tatuak mih dow amatni takhuowk müa pacham chowng lah.<verse eid="PSA 69:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 69:23" />Amatni nakhila dowi kownkow amatni kowh mik pacham du lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:23">now amatni kowh kelang dow pacham uak lah.<verse eid="PSA 69:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 69:24" />Amatni luk kowi dow en kowh kunmaraura uang pe klaah diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:24">en kowh maih iawng lün pluplup mih kunmaraura dow amatni luk kowi uang pe tingah diah.<verse eid="PSA 69:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 69:25" />Amatni kowh uowi rah dow akhaw aklaima pauowi lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:25">amatni kowh tangbung kowi amiapaw hang pauowi lah.<verse eid="PSA 69:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 69:26" />Amatni dow en ripah mih maru kowi changah nowng khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:26">en peah arau miuüa kowi amatni dow changla talawp müa khai.<verse eid="PSA 69:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 69:27" />Amatni kowi dow pe changah angak ngamlam diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:27">amatni dow en kowh lawngra hang pacham tawi ka lah.<verse eid="PSA 69:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 69:28" />Amatni kowh ming dow Masing Bowih hownia phiawkta pe diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:28">Thurai kowi ringkaw miuüa ming tang bowih kowi amatni kowh ming dow hang pacham tawi uowi lah.<verse eid="PSA 69:28" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 69:29" />Ang dow tuak krat hai arau dawng kowi ang uowi khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:29">Aw Thurai, krüng ang diah, now lawng ang diah.<verse eid="PSA 69:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 69:30" />Meng hown Thurai kowi ang narowsiah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:30">awmrawmma hown aia kowi ang nakiowriah kown;<verse eid="PSA 69:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 69:31" />chiala, anang hai akeh uowi mih chiala phuchua lak-e,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:31">ang kowh rowsira CHAKRAMANG nalang sak-ih kown.<verse eid="PSA 69:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 69:32" />Ang kowh lawngra khi hanow khamsum khamdawma miuüa dow naawmrawm kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:32">now Thurai kowi krawi cham reng miuüa dow naka süngürra kown.<verse eid="PSA 69:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 69:33" />CHAKRAMANG dow akhawr hown uowi miuüa kowh laiklow hawt sünta pe reng;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:33">nar kowi cham takhang mih aia maru-uüa kowi aia dow asowmchow müah dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 69:33" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 69:34" />Mukuang hai lusa dow CHAKRAMANG kowi pacham kiowah lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:34">sata hai sata kowi kowh uowi mih maten aia kowi pacham rowsiah lah.<verse eid="PSA 69:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 69:35" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow Thurai dow Zaiawn kowi nalawngah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:35">aia dow Judauüa kowh marow naplan thawpah iawk kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 69:35">Nakhowk khe dow aia maru-uüa mih nakowi nauowi iawk kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:35">now nami marow dow aia maru-uüa naka powng iawk kown.<verse eid="PSA 69:35" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 69:36" />Nami alow dow aia kowh nar krungchakuüa chowtaih naka kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:36">nakowi dow aia kowi kowh sakrau miuüa nauowi kown.<verse eid="PSA 69:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 69" />
  <chapter number="70" style="c" sid="PSA 70" />
  <para style="s">Aw Thurai, hang kra tham bowt</para>
  <para style="d">Mami dow David kowh meng chekhai. Mami meng dow natuakla reng kown mih meng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 70:1" />Aw Thurai, uang lawng ang diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 70:1">aw CHAKRAMANG, alenma uang khowng ang diah.<verse eid="PSA 70:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 70:2" />Saita ang kown kamrüt miuüa dow pacham rukrai lah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 70:2">ang piak mih khi kown nau miuüa dow mum tulu se pacham plan lah.<verse eid="PSA 70:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 70:3" />“Cham na bowt lah,” pahai chit ang miuüa pacham ka rukrai lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 70:3">amatni dow ka rukrai hanow pacham plan büah bowk lah.<verse eid="PSA 70:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 70:4" />Tawkche en low iawng mang miuüa dow en hown pacham awmrawm lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 70:4">amatni dow en hown pacham piaw reng lah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 70:4">En kowh lawngra lup kowi sakrau miuüa dow pacham tek awmrawm lai lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 70:4">amatni dow, “Thurai dow kiow pauowi lah,” pahai chowngchowng saksakma pacham tek lah.<verse eid="PSA 70:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 70:5" />Ang dow tuak kawm tuak krat hai akhawr hown ang uowi khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 70:5">aw Thurai, alenma ang tut-e uang diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 70:5">En dow ang kowh khowng miia hai lawng miia chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 70:5">aw CHAKRAMANG, alenma uang khowng ang bowt.<verse eid="PSA 70:5" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 70" />
  <chapter number="71" style="c" sid="PSA 71" />
  <para style="s">Ang kowh kür khowk mih khin khe hangkow nuata ang diah</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 71:1" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, en tut-e chowtaih ang tatung tanim reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:1">Naiawng rakowi katpaw hauang pe ka ang rukrai diah.<verse eid="PSA 71:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 71:2" />En dow achinawmma chekhai rakowi uang lawng ang diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:2">ang kowh laiklow sünta ang hanow uang takhula ang diah.<verse eid="PSA 71:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 71:3" />Ang naia tapetla reng kownkow uang chowng singku huamang diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 71:3">En dow natakhula ang kownkow kramamu-uüa kowi peah ana khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 71:3">Tawngplawng kowchow panow en dow ang kowh singku huamang,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:3">now ang kowh akhawtma mih kangchawngra kimkrowng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 71:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 71:4" />Aw ang kowh Thurai, maru ngakuüa rut hownia uang lawng ang diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:4">angakma hai sangching khawmma miuüa rut hownia uang lawng ang diah.<verse eid="PSA 71:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 71:5" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, ang kowh sakowmra dow en chowtaih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:5">ang klanguüa krowngchow hownia en luk kowi chowtaih ang neplawng nesak reng.<verse eid="PSA 71:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 71:6" />Ang dow uang dia hownia en luk kowi neplawng nesak reng chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:6">au mu lak kowi hownia en dow uang mingkhet ang reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 71:6">Naiawng rakowi atungma ang nakiow en reng kown.<verse eid="PSA 71:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 71:7" />Tawngbak mih maru-uüa dow khi ang now mik ngak hown mü ang khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:7">Tawngplawng kowchow panow ang kowh akhawtma mih tatung tanimra dow en chowtaih.<verse eid="PSA 71:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 71:8" />Ang nawr kowi mih en kiowri meng hing uowi hüah chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:8">ni chut chi en kri kraing mih lawnguan ang hing phuangta hüah chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 71:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 71:9" />Lawngtang prakowi hauang kuakta ang hüah diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:9">ang kowh dow kür uowi dowi bowt khe hauang nuata ang hüah diah.<verse eid="PSA 71:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 71:10" />Ang kowh ransu-uüa dow kingküa ang kown mih laiklow tatek khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:10">saita ang kown nau miuüa maten takrüpah hanow thawp prengia ngak khai.<verse eid="PSA 71:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 71:11" />Amatni tatek mih, “Aia kowi dow Thurai nuata mih chowbowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:11">aia kowi dow kawikrawiah hanow khümta bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 71:11">Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia kowi nalawngah kown mih miapaw uowi dowk,” pakhai.<verse eid="PSA 71:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 71:12" />Aw Thurai, ang hownia alakma kowi hang cham uowi diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:12">aw ang kowh Thurai, nalawng ang kownkow alenma uang diah.<verse eid="PSA 71:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 71:13" />Ang kowh ransu-uüa mih pacham ka rukrai hai pacham piak lah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:13">pe kla ang phih kown kamrüt miuüa kowi dow maru suiah hai pacham prawng renah lah.<verse eid="PSA 71:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 71:14" />Nachenganchepaw ang dow atungma en luk kowi naowmsak kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:14">ang dow nakiow en ngamlam kown.<verse eid="PSA 71:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 71:15" />En kowh lup iung hai en kowh lawngra lup lawnguan ni chut chi ang nawr kowi nauowi kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:15">Tawngplawng kowchow panow naiawngün laiklow dow tek reng chepaw achur uowi dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 71:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 71:16" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, en kowh kri kraingra lup lawnguan natek kownkow en kim kowi ang nakup kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:16">ang dow en kowh lup chowtaih, en matia kowh lup iung lawnguan chowtaih ang natek kown.<verse eid="PSA 71:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 71:17" />Aw Thurai, ang klanguüa krowngchow hownia tüngsang ang mih dow en chowtaih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:17">ani mowr pat en kowh awdara lup lawnguan ang krawi chia krawi phuang reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 71:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 71:18" />Aw Thurai, ang lawngtang kowh sam pau khai bowt chepaw hauang nuata ang diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:18">ang chauüa hai chu-uüa kowi mih en kowh kür hai kri kraingra lawnguan pe phuang ang diah.<verse eid="PSA 71:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 71:19" />Aw Thurai, en kowh tachi tanawmra dow mukuang kowi tawk khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:19">kri kraingma mih lup maten dow en chowtaih chang reng.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 71:19">Aw Thurai, en hown tale mih miapaw uowi dowi bowt chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 71:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 71:20" />Ang luk kowi akrat pusara hai phih ahuma en uang pe tingah khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:20">nachenganchepaw en nauang pe ang kür iawk kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:20">now krawng dak hownia krüngah mih iawng en nakrüng ang iawk kown.<verse eid="PSA 71:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 71:21" />Ringkawra en nape ka ang ngamlam kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:21">en nape ang sakkhawtra iawk kown.<verse eid="PSA 71:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 71:22" />Aw ang kowh Thurai, en dow kaah sakowmma chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:22">Naiawng rakowi tepla taraw se ang narowsi en kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 71:22">Aw Israel pren kowi kowh chimsaima mih Thurai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:22">tepla tingteng se ang natek en rowsi meng kown.<verse eid="PSA 71:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 71:23" />En kiow müa meng ang tek mih khin khe atünma ang natekah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:23">ang kowh sak paw en rowsi meng natek kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 71:23">Tawngplawng kowchow panow uang lawng ang mih dow en chowtaih.<verse eid="PSA 71:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 71:24" />Nape kla ang phih kownkow kamrüt miuüa maten dow ka rukrai khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:24">Naiawng rakowi ang kowh nawr mih ni chut chi en kowh lup tachi tanawmra naphuang kown.<verse eid="PSA 71:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 71" />
  <chapter number="72" style="c" sid="PSA 72" />
  <para style="s">Mang vüi chup pe Thurai mih</para>
  <para style="d">Mami dow Sawlawmawn vüi kowi kowh meng.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 72:1" />Aw Thurai, mami mang kowi en kowh tara nowm pe kaah diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:1">mami mang chapa kowi en kowh tachi tanawmra peah diah.<verse eid="PSA 72:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 72:2" />Aia mih en maru-uüa kowi achinawmma pacham nowng chet pe tara lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:2">now ngarawng ngaraima miuüa kowi pacham chet pe tara nowm lah.<verse eid="PSA 72:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 72:3" />Hungh kowi dow iungra pacham uowi lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:3">mawng kowi dow tachi tanawmra pacham uowi lah.<verse eid="PSA 72:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 72:4" />Ngarawng ngarai miuüa kowi aia pacham takhula lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:4">akhowng takla miuüa kowi aia pacham khowngah lah;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 72:4">krawi chang nowng miuüa kowi aia pacham piakta bowk lah.<verse eid="PSA 72:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 72:5" />Sat hai lama uowi mowr aia kowi maru pacham ringkawah lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:5">chowngchowng saksakma aia kowi maru pacham kramah lah.<verse eid="PSA 72:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 72:6" />Pram vüi uang uang mih lainowmma iung chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:6">now krawng vüi uang sirinchow uang mih lainowmma iung chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 72:6">Nami iawng aia dow aia maru-uüa tut-e pacham iung lah.<verse eid="PSA 72:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 72:7" />Aia chowng kowi ringkaw Thurai miuüa dow ahuma pacham ka prasi lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:7">lama uowi mowr amatni kowh chownglawng dow iungra hown atekma pacham uowi lah.<verse eid="PSA 72:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 72:8" />Aia kowh pren sünghi dow mami sata hownia paimi sata mowr pacham chowng lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:8">aia kowh pren dow Iufratis aw hownia prenchur nammowt mowr pacham chowng lah.<verse eid="PSA 72:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 72:9" />Süngrüp süngkangma kowi kowh uowi miuüa mih aia pur kowi pacham khamsum khamdaw lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:9">aia kowi dow aia kowh ransu-uüa mih tabawk krawm se pacham chupah lah.<verse eid="PSA 72:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 72:10" />Tarsis marow hai süngdum kowi kowh manguüa mih aia kowi pacham peah mangmu lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:10">Seba pren hai Sheba pren kowi kowh manguüa paw aia kowi pacham peah awmrawm sung lah.<verse eid="PSA 72:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 72:11" />Manguüa maten mih tabawk krawm se aia kowi pacham chupah lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:11">now chenchapuüa maten aia kowi pacham chang pe lup lah.<verse eid="PSA 72:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 72:12" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia dow ngaraima miuüa kowi nakrawi khowngah reng kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:12">nowng chang powng changra kowi uowi miuüa kowi aia nakrawi lawngah reng kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:12">now lü khowng miuüa kowi aia nakrawi khowngah reng kown.<verse eid="PSA 72:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 72:13" />Now aia dow kür uowi dowi mih alawng takla miuüa kowi nasaksing sanaah reng kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:13">aia dow akhowng takla miuüa kowi nakrawi lawngah reng kown.<verse eid="PSA 72:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 72:14" />Amatni kowi dow nowng chang powng chang miuüa rut hownia aia natowkala reng kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:14">Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia mik kowi dow naiawngünuüa kowh vi asung uowima chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 72:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 72:15" />Mang dow chowngdawng sakklangma pacham sing reng lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:15">aia kowi dow Sheba pren kowi kowh kuh maru pacham peah lah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 72:15">Aia vüi kowi atungma maru pacham chup pe Thurai lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:15">ni chut chi, “En pakaah prasi,” pahai maru pacham tek pe lah.<verse eid="PSA 72:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 72:16" />Aia kowh pren kowi dow chakkham ahuma pacham uowi lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:16">hungma mawngma süng kowi paw luprak ahuma pacham phaw lah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 72:16">Üa hai laih kowi mih Lebanawn süng kowi kowh luprak iawng pacham phaw lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:16">now marow kowi kowh maru-uüa mih dowm kowi kowh pram iawng atekma pacham uowi lah.<verse eid="PSA 72:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 72:17" />Aia kowh ming iung nang iung dow chowngchowng saksakma anikma pauowi reng lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:17">sat kowh anowi uowi mowr aia kowh ming iung nang iung dow pacham uowi reng lah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 72:17">Aia hownia dow chenchap maten pacham tawi ka prasi lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:17">aia kowi dow, “En dow prasira uowima,” pahai maru pacham tek pe lah.<verse eid="PSA 72:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 72:18" />CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh Thurai dow akiow pauowi lah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:18">awdara uowima mih lup chang reng mih dow aia chowtaih chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 72:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 72:19" />Kri kraingra uowima mih aia kowh ming dow chowngchowng saksakma akiow pacham uowi lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:19">aia kowh kri kraingra dow palusama kowi atekma pacham uowi reng lah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 72:19">Amen! Amen!<verse eid="PSA 72:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 72:20" />(Jese chapa David kowh Thurai chup maten dow mami mowr kowi chur mih chowbowt).<verse eid="PSA 72:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 72" />
  <chapter number="73" style="c" sid="PSA 73" />
  <para style="ms">BOWIH 3</para>
  <para style="mr">(<ref loc="PSA 73-89">Meng Lai 73-89</ref>)</para>
  <para style="s">Thurai dow ang kowh kür hai dawngthawnguan</para>
  <para style="d">Asaf kowh meng.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 73:1" />Thurai dow Israeluüa tut-e lainowmma iung khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:1">aia dow saktuak achinawmma miuüa tut-e lainowmma iung khai.<verse eid="PSA 73:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 73:2" />Nachenganchepaw ang dow tim kown nau ditchow towbowt diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:2">ang kowh owmra tama kown nau ditchow towbowt diah.<verse eid="PSA 73:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 73:3" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow maru ngakuüa dow asowrma ka uowi reng chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:3">naiawngün bawrima miuüa kowi ang khi hanow ang irsi khai.<verse eid="PSA 73:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 73:4" />Amatni kowh dow tawng iawng mih krat pusara uowi dowi chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:4">amatni kowh kow paw aiungma hai akürma chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 73:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 73:5" />Akeng mih maru kla phih iawng amatni dow kla phih dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:5">akeng miuüa kawmkrat iawng amatni dow kawmkrat dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 73:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 73:6" />Naiawng rakowi amatni dow amatni kowh bawri mih kuh leng iawng krawi tüngah büah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:6">now amatni krawi chang nowng mih dow khup dawnguan sar iawng krawi tüngah büah khai.<verse eid="PSA 73:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 73:7" />Amatni dow kau lai bowt kowh mik tapit prang towbowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:7">amatni kowh sak kowi dow sangkrangra ngak kangowh chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 73:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 73:8" />Amatni dow maru kowi prawngren laiklow hai lai ngak chowtaih krawi tek reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:8">abawrima hown maru kowi chang nowng kownkow thawp prengia ngak reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 73:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 73:9" />Amatni dow mukuang Thurai kowi kingküala mih laiklow tek reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:9">now lusa kowi kowh maru maten kowi amatni low iawng krawi pe uowiah khai.<verse eid="PSA 73:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 73:10" />Naiawng rakowi Thurai maru-uüa dow tiama ngak prakowi plan büah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:10">now maru ngakuüa tekah mih laiklow anowm pahai ka tuak büah khai.<verse eid="PSA 73:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 73:11" />Amatni dow tek mih, “Tawng iawng chow Thurai tuk kown pe?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:11">Tawng chow own mih tawngpaw Thurai tuk dowi,” pakhai.<verse eid="PSA 73:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 73:12" />Maru ngakuüa dow maiawng chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:12">amatni dow asowrma hown dawngthawnguan mih pawngah büah khai.<verse eid="PSA 73:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 73:13" />Saktuak chinawmma ang uowi mih tawngpaw asung uowi dowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:13">chang lup ngak dowi hown ang uowi mih tawngpaw mrawk dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 73:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 73:14" />Ni chut chi ang kham ngare khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:14">rau towng ang ka ripra reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 73:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 73:15" />“Thurai tuk kown pe bow?” pami ang krawi tek dowi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:15">ang krawi tek e en maru-uüa tut-e kaah sakowm dowi mih maru ang nachowng kown.<verse eid="PSA 73:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 73:16" />Maru ngakuüa ka iungra mih lawnguan kowi natuk kownkow ang paw tuak chowdiah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:16">Tawkche naiawngün lawnguan mih ang tut-e lainowmma krat chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 73:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 73:17" />Nachenganchepaw aw Thurai, en kowh kim chimsaima mih kowi ang uowi khe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:17">achur kowi naiawngün maru-uüa tawng chow naown kown mih ang tuk khai.<verse eid="PSA 73:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 73:18" />Amatni kowi dow aklaima mih rah kowi en towah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:18">amatni kowi dow piak rakowi en kuakah mih chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 73:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 73:19" />Amatni dow linlanma sang natapiak kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:19">amatni dow kramra uowima mih phih hown asaima natama kown.<verse eid="PSA 73:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 73:20" />Mang lak kowi khi-ah mih maten dow thowr müi hanow tama bowk chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:20">aw CHAKRAMANG, en awr rü hanow nami iawng maru ngakuüa paw natama kown.<verse eid="PSA 73:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21-22" style="v" sid="PSA 73:21-22" />Ang kunmarau lai kowh sak kowi rau mih khin khe abualama ang uowi khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:21-22">now tawngpaw asung uowi dowi mih iawng ang uowi khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 73:21-22">Nami khin khe en pur kowi prengia uowi dowi mih tawncher iawng ang na khai.<verse eid="PSA 73:21-22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 73:23" />Nachenganchepaw atungma en hown ang taiua uowi reng chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:23">en dow ang kowh hawmlawm rut kowi dowk ang reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 73:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 73:24" />En low iawng hai en kruitown ang reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:24">achur kowi ang naka kraingra kownkow en kruitown ang mih chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 73:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 73:25" />Mukuang pren kowi dow en chowtaih ang kowh lowra sia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:25">ang ka en rakowi lusa kowi paw tawngpaw ang nau mih sia uowi dowi bowt.<verse eid="PSA 73:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 73:26" />Ang kowh kow hai sak dow napiak rürü chepaw naia;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:26">nachenganchepaw aw Thurai, en chowtaih ang kowh kürra,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:26">now en chowtaih ang kowh chowngchowng saksakma mih dawngthawnguan.<verse eid="PSA 73:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 73:27" />Aw Thurai, en hownia alakma kowi uowi miuüa dow nachur bowk kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:27">en kaah sakowm iawng uowi dowi miuüa kowi dow en napiakta bowk kown.<verse eid="PSA 73:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 73:28" />Nachenganchepaw ang vüi dow Thurai hown taiua uowi mih lainowmma iung;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:28">CHAKRAMANG Thurai kowi mih ang kowh tatung tanimra ang changla khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:28">Naiawng rakowi aia kowh lup lawnguan maten ang naphuang reng kown.<verse eid="PSA 73:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 73" />
  <chapter number="74" style="c" sid="PSA 74" />
  <para style="s">CHAKRAMANG dow alai hownia anging kowh mang</para>
  <para style="d">Asaf kowh meng.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 74:1" />Aw Thurai, chowngchowng saksakma vüi tawngplawng kowchow en nuata anging khai?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:1">En kowh maru-uüa luk kowi tawngplawng kowchow naiawng khowt en tuk kunmarauah khai?<verse eid="PSA 74:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 74:2" />En kowh maru en nachangla kownkow achük alai khe kowh en lang kloah miuüa lawnguan sam tuak madiah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:2">nar lup changra hownia en uang klanla mih en kowh krungchakuüa lawnguan sam tuak madiah;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 74:2">en changla en matia uowi rah mih Zaiawn hungh lawnguan sam tuak madiah.<verse eid="PSA 74:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 74:3" />Apiaknama mih en kowh chimsaima mih arah kowi uang krawi len madiah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:3">nami arah kowi kowh uanh maten ransu-uüa piakta nak khowk chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 74:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 74:4" />Nami arah kowi dow en hown anging takrum reng chowdiah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:4">nami arah kowi dow awng khe kowh iawng ransu-uüa krawi how sawmlawm khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:4">now amatni awng mih amatra natüngla kownkow krawi ruang tamkhuown büah khai.<verse eid="PSA 74:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 74:5" />Amatni dow singh krip miuüa iawng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:5">amatni dow marek hown kaurawng kowi krawi krip singh miuüa iawng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 74:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 74:6" />Amatni dow Thurai chup kim kowi kowh singh hown kowh thawpah mih uanh ün krawi piakta khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:6">naiawngün uanh dow marek hai matul hown krawi piakta büah khai.<verse eid="PSA 74:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 74:7" />Amatni dow en kowh chimsaima mih arah mih towkah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:7">amatni dow nami en kowh uowi rah mih kaah tawng dowi pat sürlawkah büah khai.<verse eid="PSA 74:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 74:8" />Sakdawng kowi tek büah mih, “Kowbüah kowi asaima a-i napiakta kown,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:8">Amatni dow en hown kowh anging takua talawmla mih rah krawi towkta bowk khai.<verse eid="PSA 74:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 74:9" />Anging vüi kowi tawng iawng mih awdara lup paw chang mih anging khi dowi bowt chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:9">risiuüa uowi dowi bowt rakowi mün ni tak chow naiawng naown kown mih anging tuk dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 74:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 74:10" />Aw Thurai, mün ni tak chow ransu-uüa prawngren anging kown?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:10">Chowngchowng saksakma bow en ming kowi ransu-uüa nü dowi klowk dowi kown?<verse eid="PSA 74:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 74:11" />Tawngplawng kowchow en kowh hawmlawm rut akürma mih en plan kawpta khai?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:11">En kowh rut akürma mih laiah hanow amatni kowi asaima uang chumta bowt.<verse eid="PSA 74:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 74:12" />Aw Thurai, alai hownia en dow anging kowh Mang chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:12">en dow mami lusa kowi lawngra lup en uang tüng anging reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 74:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 74:13" />En kowh kür hown sata tui mih en changah pre bak khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:13">sata kowi kowh rua mang lu mih en dita pe naknak khai.<verse eid="PSA 74:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 74:14" />Leviathan<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">74:14 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Leviathan </char><char style="ft" closed="false">pami dow sata kowi kowh uowi mih rua mang chekhai.</char></note> kowh lu dita pe naknak mih paw en chowtaih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:14">now aia kowh buk dow süngrüp süngkangma kowi kowh asaduauüa kowi en pe chaah khai.<verse eid="PSA 74:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 74:15" />Krawng dawng tui hai awchawng tui hawr rah tia en thawp pe khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:15">alai hownia kowh hawr klunglung mih aw en pe kangah khai.<verse eid="PSA 74:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 74:16" />Ni paw en kowh chekhai, now uar paw en kowh chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:16">krek, lama hai sat paw en thawpah mih chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 74:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 74:17" />Lusa kowi kowh rihi maten en khowm bowkah mih chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:17">chungrau khin hai satma khin paw en towah mih chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 74:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 74:18" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, ransu-uüa prawngren en mih hangkow tamata diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:18">prengia uowi dowi miuüa dow en ming kowi nü dowi klowk dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 74:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 74:19" />En kowh ngarema mih maru-uüa kowi kaurawng uaramchak rut kowi hangkow ap-ah diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:19">nowng changra kowi uowi mih en maru-uüa kowi chowngchowng saksakma hangkow tamata diah.<verse eid="PSA 74:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 74:20" />En kowh sangbowk laitawm laiklow ka tuakah diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:20">tawngplawng kowchow panow pren kowi dow nowng chang powng chang kangowh towbowt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:20">aiiuma mih arah kowi dow nowng chang powng mih atekma towbowt chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 74:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 74:21" />Nowng changra kowi uowi miuüa kowi tawmpa rukrai hauang pe planah diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:21">ngarawng ngaraima miuüa hai akhowng takla miuüa kowi en ming kowi pe rowsiah diah.<verse eid="PSA 74:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 74:22" />Aw Thurai, en kowh anowm mih tungah diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:22">ni chut chi abualama miuüa khare en mih lawnguan hangkow tamata diah.<verse eid="PSA 74:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 74:23" />En kowh ransu-uüa dow atungma hing kingküata en hüah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:23">nami kingküa klow mih mapaw hangkow tamata diah.<verse eid="PSA 74:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 74" />
  <chapter number="75" style="c" sid="PSA 75" />
  <para style="s">CHAKRAMANG chowtaih tara chet mih</para>
  <para style="d">Mami dow Asaf kowh meng chekhai. Mami meng dow “Hangkow piak diah” pami meng owi iawng natekah kown takla.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 75:1" />Aw Thurai, anging tek en awmrawm lai reng.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 75:1">Tawngplawng kowchow panow en dow anging hown atawnchow uowi reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 75:1">anging dow en kowh awdara lup lawnguan krawi phuang reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 75:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 75:2" />En tek mih, “Tara chet khin ang khowm bowkta khowk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 75:2">anowmma hai ang nauang chet tara kown.<verse eid="PSA 75:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 75:3" />Lusa chü nurlur khe lusa maru dow lainowmma kram chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 75:3">Nami khin khe lusa chüng town mih dow ang chowtaih. [Sela]<verse eid="PSA 75:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 75:4" />“Bawrima miuüa kowi ang tek pe mih, ‘Hang chang bawri büah,’ pakhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 75:4">Now maru ngakuüa kowi ang tek pe mih, ‘Hang tanü büa diah.<verse eid="PSA 75:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 75:5" />Hang chang bawri büah naknak diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 75:5">hang chang owrow büa diah,’ pape khai” pakhai.<verse eid="PSA 75:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 75:6" />Tara chet mih dow satlawt hai satkup hownia uang dowi tham,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 75:6">now süngrüp süngkangma hownia paw amiapaw uang dowi tham.<verse eid="PSA 75:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 75:7" />Tara chet miia dow Thurai chowtaih chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 75:7">aia chowtaih mia chow awng mih hai mia chow sum mih naphuang kown.<verse eid="PSA 75:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 75:8" />Aia rut kowi dow rak tui atekma mih bia uowi lowk chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 75:8">nami arak pawp chualua mih dow Thurai kowh kunmaraura chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 75:8">Nami arak dow lusa kowi aia nauang iu khükah kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 75:8">Nami dow maru ngakuüa maten mih achir pat nakhamta kown.<verse eid="PSA 75:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 75:9" />Nachenganchepaw ang dow chowngchowng saksakma en lawnguan nakrawi phuang kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 75:9">Jakawb kowh Thurai vüi ang natek rowsi meng reng kown.<verse eid="PSA 75:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 75:10" />Thurai tek mih, “Maru ngakuüa kowh kür mih ang napiakta pe kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 75:10">Tawkche achinawmma miuüa kowi dow ang nahu pe kür ngamlam kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="PSA 75:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 75" />
  <chapter number="76" style="c" sid="PSA 76" />
  <para style="s">CHAKRAMANG pur kowi miapaw ia iowng dowi</para>
  <para style="d">Mami dow Asaf kowh meng chekhai. Mami meng dow aiang uowi mih tünteu chang müa hown natekah kown mih chekhai.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 76:1" />Juda chenchapuüa dow Thurai lawnguan tuk bowk chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 76:1">aia ming dow Israel chenchapuüa tut-e kri kraingma chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 76:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 76:2" />Aia kowh taklowp taklangra te dow Jerusalem marow kowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 76:2">now aia kowh uowi rah dow Zaiawn hungh kowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 76:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 76:3" />Aia dow nakowi ransu-uüa kowh tawk pluplup mih salangba sek klowkta pe bowk khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 76:3">now amatni kowh kawngma, saidawng hai tasen müa uanh maten piakta pe khai. [Sela]<verse eid="PSA 76:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 76:4" />Aw Thurai, en dow lainowmma kri kraing chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 76:4">ki senla ransu kowh hungh hownia uang plan mih mang iawng</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 76:4">en dow kri kraingma chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 76:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 76:5" />Sakkraingma mih ransu siphaiuüa kowh dawngthawnguan dow pawta pe bowk khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 76:5">amatni dow müi mih iawng kowng kowh tamawngla klip towbowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 76:5">now amatni kowh rut dow tawngpaw kaah atawng dowi bowt chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 76:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 76:6" />Aw Jakawb kowh Thurai, kawrnga hai kawrnga kari te miuüa kowng khai bowt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 76:6">amatni dow en nangah rakowi kowng kowh müi mih iawng takuakla kun towbowt.<verse eid="PSA 76:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 76:7" />Aw anging kowh Thurai, en dow lainowmma kramra uowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 76:7">en kunmarau mih khin khe amiapaw en pur kowi nowng iowng dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 76:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8-9" style="v" sid="PSA 76:8-9" />En chetah mih tara dow mukuang pren hownia en iu phuangah reng.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 76:8-9">Aw Thurai, chang ngak miuüa kowi ripah kownkow en awr rü khe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 76:8-9">now khamsum khamdaw miuüa kowi natowkala kownkow en awr rü khe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 76:8-9">lusa kowi kowh uowi miuüa mih kram kowh ririmma uowi reng chekhai. [Sela]<verse eid="PSA 76:8-9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 76:10" />En kunmarauah miuüa kowi en ripah mih khin khe en maru-uüa dow narowsi en kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 76:10">now ta sing uowi miuüa dow en rowsi pawi khe nachupiia en kown.<verse eid="PSA 76:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 76:11" />CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai tut-e takham büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 76:11">now enni takhamta mih iawng chang büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 76:11">CHAKRAMANG dow kramra uowima chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 76:11">ariaret kowi kowh uowi mih maten aia vüi uang pawla pe awmrawm sung diah.<verse eid="PSA 76:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 76:12" />Kruitown miuüa kowh bawrira rimta pe mih dow aia chowtaih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 76:12">palusama kowi kowh manguüa khowm aia kowi kram reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 76:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 76" />
  <chapter number="77" style="c" sid="PSA 77" />
  <para style="s">Ang kla phih khe ang haw CHAKRAMANG mih</para>
  <para style="d">Meng krui mih Jeduthun kowh meng owi iawng natekah kown mih Asaf kowh meng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 77:1" />Ang dow Thurai tut-e atünma ang awr kar khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:1">naiawng ang awr kar mih dow aia pauang klang ang lah pakowh chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 77:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 77:2" />Ang kla phih mih khin khe CHAKRAMANG kowi ang hawah khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:2">chawkla rut se uar prowt ang awr chup Thurai khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 77:2">Nachenganchepaw ang kowh saktuak dow <char style="w">thaulang</char> dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 77:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 77:3" />Thurai kowi ang tuak mih khin khe lainowmma ang tuak kawm sulu khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:3">now aia lawnguan kowi ang tuak mih khin khe ang tanua sak uang ting khai.<verse eid="PSA 77:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 77:4" />Aia dow pe müi ang dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:4">ang tuak krat lai kowh lai khowm ang nowng tek dowi bowt.<verse eid="PSA 77:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 77:5" />Achük alai khe kowh laiklow ün ang krawi tuak khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:5">kung prakowi klenta mih laiklow ün ang krawi tuak khai.<verse eid="PSA 77:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 77:6" />Achük alai khe kowh ang tekah mih meng uan ang krawi tuak khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:6">abüpma ang tuakah hanow sakdawng kowi ang talünta mih,<verse eid="PSA 77:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 77:7" />“Chowngchowng saksakma vüi CHAKRAMANG nuata a-i khai bowt bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:7">Katpaw aia saksing sana anging dowi bowt tham bow?<verse eid="PSA 77:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 77:8" />Aia kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura chowngchowng saksakma vüi chur khai bowt bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:8">Aia kowh laikham paw chowngchowng saksakma vüi uang tachi dowi bowt mih chowbowt bow?<verse eid="PSA 77:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 77:9" />Saksing sana kown mih Thurai tamata khai bowt bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:9">Aia kowh sanara aia taingta khai bowt bow?” pakhai. [Sela]<verse eid="PSA 77:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 77:10" />Now ang tek mih, “Ang sak kowi rau mih auan dow maiawng:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:10">Lang kri lang kraing mih Thurai kowh kür uowi dowi bowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="PSA 77:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 77:11" />Nachenganchepaw aw CHAKRAMANG, en changah mih lup lawnguan maten ang naka tuak reng kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:11">achük alai khe kowh en changah mih awdara lup lawnguan ang naka tuak reng kown.<verse eid="PSA 77:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 77:12" />En kowh kri kraingma lup lawnguan maten ang natuakah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:12">en kowh akürma mih lup lawnguan ang natuakah kown.<verse eid="PSA 77:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 77:13" />Aw Thurai, en kowh tiama dow chimsaima chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:13">anging kowh Thurai iawng kri kraingma mih thurai miapaw uowi dowi bowt chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 77:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 77:14" />Awdara lup chang mih Thurai dow en chowtaih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:14">chenchap maten tut-e en kowh kür dow en tüngah khai.<verse eid="PSA 77:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 77:15" />En kowh maru Jakawb hai Josef krungchakuüa kowi en lawngah khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:15">amatni kowi dow en kowh rut akürma mih hown en lawngah khai. [Sela]<verse eid="PSA 77:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 77:16" />Aw Thurai, sata Rik tui mih khi en khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:16">khi en hanow tui mih kram en kowh chür khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:16">nami sata tui dow abüpma kowi kowh re phai mowr pat chür khai.<verse eid="PSA 77:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 77:17" />Uangnim dow uang iu khük uang khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:17">mukuang kowi dow kaikreng tün nowk rumrum khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 77:17">En hownia kowh pla nowi mih mapra ne paipra ne krawi nowi khai.<verse eid="PSA 77:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 77:18" />Liku kowi en kowh kaikreng tün mih taah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:18">en kowh pla nowi mih lusa kowi krawi nowi pluplup khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 77:18">Lusa dow chür nurlur hai tahowng nukluk khai.<verse eid="PSA 77:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 77:19" />Sata dawnglang iawng en thawp tiama khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:19">tui abüpma mih iawng en kruitown anging khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 77:19">Tawkche en kowh khawk kung dow khi-ah dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 77:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 77:20" />Mosi hai Arawn iüah kowi en changah aluchow hanow,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:20">en kowh maru-uüa kowi mih ruapur hawmh iawng en kruitownah khai.<verse eid="PSA 77:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 77" />
  <chapter number="78" style="c" sid="PSA 78" />
  <para style="s">Aia maru-uüa angakma chepaw Thurai dow aiungma</para>
  <para style="d">Asaf kowh meng.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 78:1" />Ang chenchapuüa low, ang kowh prengia iung laiklow sünta diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:1">ang nawr hownia kowh laiklow kowi pe param büa diah.<verse eid="PSA 78:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 78:2" />Laiuat hown ang natek lai kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:2">alai chowng khe kowh laipet lawnguan ang naphuang kown.<verse eid="PSA 78:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 78:3" />Maiawngün laiklow maten a-i ta reng hai a-i tuk reng khowk chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:3">a-i kowh pipu-uüa mih maiawngün laiklow tekla a-i khowk chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 78:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 78:4" />Nami dow a-i kowh chauüa tut-e a-i naitah kown nadowi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:4">nauang ta ting kown mih krungchakuüa tut-e paw a-i natekla pe kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 78:4">CHAKRAMANG kowh kri kraingra atekma mih lup lawnguan a-i natek pe kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:4">aia kowh kür hai aia changah mih awdara lup lawnguan maten a-i natekla kown.<verse eid="PSA 78:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 78:5" />Aia dow Jakawb krungchakuüa tut-e aia kowh ana pek peah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:5">Israel chenchap vüi aia kowh ari aiang mih towla pe khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 78:5">Nami ari aiang dow amatni kowh chauüa kowi natüngsangah kownkow</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:5">aia mih a-i kowh pipu-uüa tut-e pela ana khai.<verse eid="PSA 78:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 78:6" />Naiawng aia pela ana mih dow uang ta uowi kown mih krungchakuüa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:6">kawmat kowh dia dowi tak miuüa pacham tuk lah pakowh chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:6">now amatni paw amatni kowh chauüa kowi pacham tekla pe lah pakowh chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 78:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 78:7" />Nahanow kowbüah paw Thurai luk kowi neplawng nesak kown towbowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:7">now Thurai kowh lup lawnguan tamata dowi kowi Thurai ana pek nachün kown towbowt.<verse eid="PSA 78:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 78:8" />Nami klen kowi amatni pipu-uüa iawng lai üa kürma hai kingküa dawma naphaw kown nadowk.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:8">Amatni pipu-uüa kowh sak dow Thurai tut-e anikma hai kaah sakowmma nadowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 78:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 78:9" />Efraim krungchakuüa dow salangba dowkma kangowh chepaw</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:9">tasen mih khin khe amatni dow kung pra sut takla khai.<verse eid="PSA 78:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 78:10" />Amatni dow Thurai kowh sangbowk laitawm chün dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:10">aia kowh rirow paw chün kown nau büah dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 78:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 78:11" />Tawng ngai chow Thurai chang mih amatni dow tamata khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:11">amatni kowi Thurai tüng pe awdara lup mih amatni dow tamata khai.<verse eid="PSA 78:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 78:12" />Israeluüa kowh pipu-uüa pur kowi Thurai chang pe awdara lup khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:12">nami awdara lup aia chang pe mih dow Aigupta pren kowi kowh Zoan dowm kowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 78:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 78:13" />Aia dow sata kowi pe taakah lang now nami iawng amatni kowi pawla khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:13">sata tui kowi mih tap iawng aia changah khai.<verse eid="PSA 78:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 78:14" />Ni-e khe dow uangnim hown amatni kowi aia kruila khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:14">now uar-e khe dow maih nowi hown amatni kowi aia tüng pe tiama khai.<verse eid="PSA 78:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 78:15" />Süngrüp süngkangma kowi huaklu pe talakah phak hanow</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:15">krawng dawng tui iawng uang lawt iualua mih amatni kowi aia pe khamah khai.<verse eid="PSA 78:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 78:16" />Huaklu hownia tui hawr iualua aia changah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:16">nami tui dow aw kowi kowh tui iawng hawr klunglung aia changah khai.<verse eid="PSA 78:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 78:17" />Nachenganchepaw amatni dow Thurai kowi kingküala mih angak chang reng tak chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:17">Lang kri lang kraing mih Thurai kowi süngrüp süngkangma kowi kingküaah büah khai.<verse eid="PSA 78:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 78:18" />Amatni dow amatni nau mih chakkham Thurai tut-e kük büah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:18">naiawng hai amatni dow sakdawng hownia Thurai kowi chaingah khai.<verse eid="PSA 78:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 78:19" />Amatni dow Thurai kowi kingküala mih laiklow maiawng tek khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:19">“Süngrüp süngkangma kowi Thurai nowng pe a-i chakkham tak pabow?<verse eid="PSA 78:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 78:20" />Huaklu kowi bawpah hanow tui lawt iualua aia changah khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:20">naiawng aia nowng chang khai pache kawm hai chaknga aia nowng pe a-i kown pe bow?” pakhai.<verse eid="PSA 78:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 78:21" />Nami laiklow tata hanow CHAKRAMANG kowh kunmarau dow lün pluplup khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:21">Jakawb luk kowi kunmarau kowh aia kowh sak mih kam iawmlawm khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:21">Israel luk kowi aia kowh kunmarau dow lün pluplup khai.<verse eid="PSA 78:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 78:22" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni dow Thurai kowi owm büah dowi chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:22">amatni dow aia nalawngah kown pami kowi owm büah dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 78:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 78:23" />Nachenganchepaw amatni vüi uangnim kowi aia peah ana khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:23">now mukuang kimplawt dow aia pe tauowah khai.<verse eid="PSA 78:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 78:24" />Aia maru-uüa chak müa uangchak iawng aia iu peah manna kawm khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:24">amatni kowi mih mukuang chakkham aia pe chaah khai.<verse eid="PSA 78:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 78:25" />Nahanow amatni dow kramamu-uüa kowh chakkham tawi cha khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:25">amatni nowng cha mowr chi aia iu peah chakkham khai.<verse eid="PSA 78:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 78:26" />Aia dow mukuang hownia uang chin pe satlawt li khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:26">now mrawkphak li kowi paw aia kowh kür hown aia uang pe uangah khai.<verse eid="PSA 78:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 78:27" />Aia dow uangchak iawng amatni kowi uang iu sa pe chaknga khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:27">sata pang kowi kowh sema iawng ahuma aia uang chin pe uakling khai.<verse eid="PSA 78:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 78:28" />Naiawngün dow amatni kowh tangbung khupra kowi uang chin pe khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:28">naiawngün dow tangbung tavir lut aia uang pe dowah khai.<verse eid="PSA 78:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 78:29" />Nami dow du pat amatni cha khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:29">aia dow amatni prüaah mih sia peah khai.<verse eid="PSA 78:29" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 78:30" />Nachenganchepaw amatni prüaah mih chakkham ki cha dowi rawn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:30">amatni nawr kowi khowm uowi reng tak khe,<verse eid="PSA 78:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 78:31" />amatni luk kowi mih Thurai kunmaraura uang ting khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 78:31">Thurai dow amatni kowh akürma mih klanguüa hawmh kowi kowngta pe ne khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:31">Israeluüa kowi kowh kow ru lang iung mih klanguüa hawmh kowi aia saita pe ne khai.<verse eid="PSA 78:31" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 78:32" />Nachenganchepaw amatni dow chang ngak rengreng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:32">Thurai kowh awdara lup khi khowk chepaw Thurai kowi owm büah dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 78:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 78:33" />Naiawng rakowi amatni kowh ni mih lup chawn dowi kowi aia pe churah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:33">amatni kowh ning dow kramring tahowrma hown aia pe kowiah khai.<verse eid="PSA 78:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 78:34" />Amatni kowi aia saita kung kowi ta lat miuüa aia kowh laiklow ta ka tuak khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:34">amatni dow dia sar hanow süngürma hown aia kowi plan haw khai iawk.<verse eid="PSA 78:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 78:35" />Nakhowk khe dow Thurai chowtaih amatni kowh Singku Huamang pami ka tuak büah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:35">lang kri lang kraing mih Thurai chowtiah amatni kowh lawng miia pami ka tuak büah khai.<verse eid="PSA 78:35" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 78:36" />Tawkche amatni dow nawr hown aia kowi kuanah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:36">now dai hown aia kowi daiah büah khai.<verse eid="PSA 78:36" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 78:37" />Amatni kowh sak dow aia prakowi anikma uowi dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:37">aia kowh sangbowk laitawm kowi kaah sakowmma uowi büah dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 78:37" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 78:38" />Nachenganchepaw aia kowh dow saksing sanara achur uowi dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:38">Naiawng rakowi aia dow amatni kowi piakah dowi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 78:38">Aia dow aia kowh kunmaraura mih plan plan pe prowngah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:38">aia kowh kunmaraura maten aia pe lawtah dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 78:38" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 78:39" />Ah! kowbüah dow kowng kown mih maru chowtaih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:39">kowbüah dow uang hutla phun now tama mih li iawng chowtaih pahai aia ka tuak khai.<verse eid="PSA 78:39" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 78:40" />Nachenganchepaw mün kat chow süngrüp süngkangma kowi aia kowi kingküaah büah mih ia tekah dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:40">aia sak kowi rau iawng mün kat chow uowi büah mih ia tekah dowi mowr chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 78:40" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 78:41" />Thurai kowi amatni dow plan plan chaingah büah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:41">Israeluüa kowh chimsaima mih Thurai kowi towkah sak kawm büah khai.<verse eid="PSA 78:41" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 78:42" />Amatni dow aia kowh kür lawnguan sak kowi towah dowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:42">ransu-uüa rut hownia amatni kowi aia lawngah mih paw sak kowi towah büah dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 78:42" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 78:43" />Amatni dow Aigupta pren kowi aia tüng pe mih amatra tamata khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:43">now Zoan dowm kowi awdara lup aia chang pe mih paw tamata büah khai.<verse eid="PSA 78:43" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="PSA 78:44" />Aia dow Aigupta pren kowi kowh aw tui maten aia changta pe vi bowk khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:44">now nami tui dow nowng kham büah dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 78:44" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="PSA 78:45" />Amatni tut-e aia dow kowchin pe ving kawm khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:45">naiawngün dow amatni kowi krawi towk krat khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 78:45">Now pur hawmh paw aia kowchin pe khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:45">naiawngün paw amatni kowi krawi piakta pren nak khai.<verse eid="PSA 78:45" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="PSA 78:46" />Amatni kowh uih-ak dow plawng hawmh kowi aia pe piakah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:46">now amatni kowh luprak dow plawng hawmh kowi aia pe piakah khai.<verse eid="PSA 78:46" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="PSA 78:47" />Ria hown amatni kowh grep ruih aia piakta pe nak khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:47">now nang tui hown uidut singh dow aia piakta pe nak khai.<verse eid="PSA 78:47" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="PSA 78:48" />Amatni kowh chia hawmh kowi dow ria hown aia kowngta pe bowk khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:48">now amatni kowh tawncher hawmh kowi dow kaikreng hown aia saita pe bowk khai.<verse eid="PSA 78:48" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="PSA 78:49" />Aia dow aia kowh kunmarau lün pluplup mih hai sak kowi rau mih maten amatni luk kowi uang chin pe khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:49">naiawngün piakra lup nauang chang kownkow kramamu-uüa kowi aia towah khai.<verse eid="PSA 78:49" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="PSA 78:50" />Aia dow aia kowh kunmarau mih pe prowngah dowi chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:50">aia dow Aiguptauüa kowi lawtah dowi kowi makowng hawi hown pe kowngah khai.<verse eid="PSA 78:50" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="PSA 78:51" />Aia dow Aigupta pren kowi kowh chapa ta maten kowi kowngta pe bowk khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:51">Aigupta pren kowi kowh kimchak towng chapa ta maten kowi kowngta bowk khai.<verse eid="PSA 78:51" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="PSA 78:52" />Nami kung kowi aia dow Aigupta pren hownia aia maru-uüa kowi ruapur hawmh iawng uang lawtla khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:52">amatni kowi dow ruapur kowi iawng süngrüp süngkangma kowi aia kruitownla khai.<verse eid="PSA 78:52" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="PSA 78:53" />Amatni kowi dow kramra uowi dowi kowi thaulangma hown aia pawla khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:53">Nachenganchepaw amatni kowh ransu-uüa kowi dow sata tui limta bowk khai.<verse eid="PSA 78:53" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="PSA 78:54" />Amatni kowi dow aia kowh chimsaima mih pren kowi aia uang pawla khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:54">aia kowh kür hown aia powngah mih hungh kowi amatni kowi mih aia uang pawla khai.<verse eid="PSA 78:54" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="PSA 78:55" />Akeng chenchapuüa kowi dow amatni pur kowi aia prütta pe khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:55">now akeng chenchapuüa kowh krawng bawn dow aia maru-uüa kowi aia ret pe khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 78:55">Amatni kowi dow akeng chenchapuüa kowh tangbung kowi aia pe uowiah khai.<verse eid="PSA 78:55" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="PSA 78:56" />Nachenganchepaw amatni dow lang kri lang kraing mih Thurai kowi chaingah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:56">now amatni dow aia kowi kingküaah khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 78:56">Amatni dow aia kowh ari arow mih chün dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 78:56" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="PSA 78:57" />Amatni dow amatni kowh pipu-uüa iawng tiama nowm hownia powt hanow aia kowi kuanah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:57">amatni dow akhawnma mih leba sek rawah mih prakowi mang dowi mih iawng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 78:57" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="PSA 78:58" />Amatni dow arah kroma mih kowi kowh chupiiara krawi tawng mih hown aia kowi towkah kunmarau khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:58">amatni kowh arup aren kowi chup mih hown Thurai kowh khowrbown dawra pe huah khai.<verse eid="PSA 78:58" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="PSA 78:59" />Naiawngün khi hanow Thurai dow lainowmma kunmarau khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:59">Naiawng rakowi aia dow Israel kowi hing nuata khai.<verse eid="PSA 78:59" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="PSA 78:60" />Silo marow kowi kowh aia kowh taklowp taklangra te hownia aia dow powt khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:60">nami taklowp taklangra te kowi dow maru pungmadawng kowi aia tawi uowi chowdiah.<verse eid="PSA 78:60" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="PSA 78:61" />Aia dow sangbowk laitawm tawkpla mih ransu-uüa rut kowi apta pe khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:61">aia kowh kür hai kri kraingra dow ransu-uüa rut kowi aia apta khai.<verse eid="PSA 78:61" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="PSA 78:62" />Aia dow aia maru-uüa kowi ransu-uüa kowh saidawng rut kowi ap-ah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:62">aia dow amatia kowh maru-uüa luk kowi aia kowh kunmaraura ue prang khük pe khai.<verse eid="PSA 78:62" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="PSA 78:63" />Amatni kowh klanguüa hawmh kowi maih hown aia towkah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:63">amatni kowh malauüa hawmh dow ka tek sutawng meng dowi bowt chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 78:63" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="PSA 78:64" />Amatni kowh uamowuüa dow saidawng rut kowi kowng khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:64">amatni kowh mamaimowuüa dow ka uowila uiting uangtak dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 78:64" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="PSA 78:65" />Nami kung kowi dow thowr müi mih iawng CHAKRAMANG mih kutplan rü khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:65">aia dow grep tui pua prowng mih tasen kiakma mih iawng awr rü khai bowt.<verse eid="PSA 78:65" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="PSA 78:66" />Now ransu-uüa kowi dow pe sumah khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:66">amatni kowi dow achowngma vüi rukrai rakowi towah khai.<verse eid="PSA 78:66" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="PSA 78:67" />Nachenganchepaw Josef krungchak süng mih aia nuata khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:67">now Efraim krungchak süng paw aia pawah dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 78:67" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="PSA 78:68" />Tawkche Juda krungchak kowi dow aia lang kloah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:68">aia dow aia lang sakrauah mih Zaiawn hungh kowi lang kloah khai.<verse eid="PSA 78:68" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="PSA 78:69" />Nakowi dow aia kowh kim chimsaima mih mukuang iawng anikma aia thawpah khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:69">Nami dow lusa iawng anikma aia thawpah khai.<verse eid="PSA 78:69" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="PSA 78:70" />Aia dow aia kowh nar David kowi uang ruiah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:70">aia kowi dow ruapur tung hownia aia uang pawla khai.<verse eid="PSA 78:70" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="PSA 78:71" />Aia kowi dow ruapurmauüa kowi mingkhet mih lup changra hownia uang pawla khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:71">nami dow CHAKRAMANG kowh maru Jakawb krungchakuüa kowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:71">CHAKRAMANG kowh dawngthawnguan Israel chenchapuüa kowi nanowng khetla kownkow chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 78:71" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="PSA 78:72" />David dow amatni kowi anowmma mingkhetah khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:72">aia dow amatni kowi mih prengiama hown kruitownla khai.<verse eid="PSA 78:72" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 78" />
  <chapter number="79" style="c" sid="PSA 79" />
  <para style="s">Aw CHAKRAMANG, mün ni tak chow en kunmarau anging kown?</para>
  <para style="d">Asaf kowh meng.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 79:1" />Aw Thurai, akeng chenchapuüa mih en changla dawngthawnguan mih maru-uüa kowi uang senah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:1">amatni dow en kowh pren kowi uang kup khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 79:1">Amatni dow en kowh kim chimsaima mih uang sürlawkta nak khowk;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:1">Jerusalem marow dow apiaknama changah büah khai.<verse eid="PSA 79:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 79:2" />En kowh naruüa uak dow kuang dawng kowi kowh uaklinguüa kowi pe chaah büah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:2">en kowh maru-uüa nga dow kaurawng uaramchak kowi pe chaah büah khai.<verse eid="PSA 79:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 79:3" />En maru-uüa kowh vi dow tui iawng Jerusalem marow kowi hawr iualua khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:3">amatni kowh uak nadup kown mih maru khowm miapaw uowi dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 79:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 79:4" />Aria aret kowi kowh chenchapuüa dow prawngren anging khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:4">amatni dow changla anging rensi kau khai.<verse eid="PSA 79:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 79:5" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, chowngchowng saksakma bow en kunmarau anging kown?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:5">En kowh kunmaraura maih iawng nalün pluplup reng kown chekhai bow?<verse eid="PSA 79:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 79:6" />En kowh kunmaraura dow tuk en dowi mih chenchapuüa luk kowi khük pe diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:6">Nami dow chupiia en kown nau dowi mih prenchakuüa luk kowi iu hüng pe diah.<verse eid="PSA 79:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 79:7" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow Jakawb krungchak kowi piak mih dow kowbüah chowtaih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:7">Jakawb krungchakuüa kowh uowi rah apiaknama changta pe mih dow amatni chowtaih.<verse eid="PSA 79:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 79:8" />Anging pipu-uüa kowh angak rakowi hauang rip anging diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:8">en kowh saksing sanara mih alenma uang tüng anging diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 79:8">Tawngplawng kowchow panow mapaw anging kowh sakowmra uowi dowi bowt chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 79:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 79:9" />Aw anging kowh lawng miia Thurai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:9">en kowh kri kraingra nachowngla kownkow uang khowng anging diah;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 79:9">en kowh ming iung nang iung nauowila reng kownkow uang lawng anging diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:9">now anging kowh angak mih uang lawtta anging diah.<verse eid="PSA 79:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 79:10" />“Tawng kowi chow kowbüah kowh Thurai?” pahai tawngplawng akeng chenchapuüa natek kown?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:10">Amatni luk kowi kowh en naruüa kowh lu klai en paw pe mih tüng anging diah.<verse eid="PSA 79:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 79:11" />Nar lup changra kowi cham takhang miuüa kowh kar klow dow en param kowi pacham ting lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:11">kowngta kownkow khowm bowkta khowk miuüa kowi en kowh kür akraingma mih hown lawngah diah.<verse eid="PSA 79:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 79:12" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, ariaret kowi kowh chenchapuüa mih tha en nang en khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:12">Naiawng rakowi amatni kowi dow ranit phow mowr ripah diah.<verse eid="PSA 79:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 79:13" />Nahanow ruapur hawmh iawng en mingkhetah mih maru-uüa natek en awmrawm lai kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:13">chowngchowng saksakma anging narowsi kiowri en reng kown.<verse eid="PSA 79:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 79" />
  <chapter number="80" style="c" sid="PSA 80" />
  <para style="s">Aw Thurai, alai kowh iawng plan tow anging iawk diah</para>
  <para style="d">Mami dow Asaf kowh meng chekhai. Mami meng dow “Kra pau saksi” pami meng owi iawng natekah kown mih chekhai.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 80:1" />Aw Israeluüa kowh mingkhet miia, anging kowh laiklow kowi pe param diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:1">en dow Josef krungchak kowi ruapur hawmh kowi iawng kruitownla khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 80:1">En dow cherupuüa luk kowi chowm khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:1">en kowh anowi dow en krawi sawtah reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 80:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 80:2" />Efraim, Benjamin hai Manase krungchak pur kowi en kowh kür tüng pe diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:2">now nauang lawng anging kownkow uang tarü diah.<verse eid="PSA 80:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 80:3" />Aw Thurai, alai kowh iawng plan tow anging iawk diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:3">en kowh sanara mih anowi iawng anging luk kowi pauang sawt lah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 80:3">Nahanow anging naka lawngra kown towbowt.<verse eid="PSA 80:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 80:4" />Aw lang kri lang kraing mih CHAKRAMANG Thurai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:4">anging awr lü awr leng mih mün ni tak chow en sak-ih dowi kown?<verse eid="PSA 80:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 80:5" />Anging kowi dow akrat pusara mih chakkham iawng en pe chaah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:5">now mik tui ahuma en pe kham anging khai.<verse eid="PSA 80:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 80:6" />Nauang khün anging pren kownkow chenchapuüa lala en pe taranah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:6">anging kowh ransu-uüa mih anging lawnguan kowi prawngren anging khai.<verse eid="PSA 80:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 80:7" />Aw lang kri lang kraing mih Thurai, alai kowh iawng plan tow anging iawk diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:7">en kowh sanara mih anowi iawng anging luk kowi pauang sawt lah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 80:7">Nahanow anging naka lawngra kown towbowt.<verse eid="PSA 80:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 80:8" />Aigupta pren hownia grep ruih atut chow iawng en uang pawla anging khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:8">akeng chenchapuüa kowi prütta hanow nami dow en chowkah khai.<verse eid="PSA 80:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 80:9" />Nami grep tut kowi dow en tu pe mawh khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:9">nami grep prün dow abüpma paprenma kowi krawi thow khai.<verse eid="PSA 80:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 80:10" />Nami grep mung klim dow hungma mawngma kowi krawi tamum klum khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:10">nami ruih prek dow aiuk aiukma mih sidar singh kowi krawi mumta klum khai.<verse eid="PSA 80:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 80:11" />Nami grep ruih prek dow sata mowr cham krawi tarawk khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:11">nami taprek mih ruih sar dow Iufratis aw mowr cham krawi ting khai.<verse eid="PSA 80:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 80:12" />Tawngplawng kowchow nami taka müa khah en khueta pe khai?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:12">En khueta pe khah rakowi aria iawng uang mang mih maru maten dow nami uih lüngla khai.<verse eid="PSA 80:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 80:13" />Kaurawng pak hawmh paw uangah now nami uih mih uang cha khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:13">now dowm kowi kowh asaduauüa paw nami uih dow uang cha khai bowt.<verse eid="PSA 80:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 80:14" />Aw lang kri lang kraing mih Thurai, uang plan diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:14">mukuang hownia uang iu mü diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:14">now mami grep ruih mih uang mingkhet diah.<verse eid="PSA 80:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 80:15" />En matia rut hown kowh en chowkah mih singh pawi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:15">en matia vüi nami mia prek akhawtma en changah mih,<verse eid="PSA 80:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 80:16" />nami singh dow ransu-uüa kripah hanow maih hown towkta khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 80:16">Maru-uüa dow en kunmarauah rakowi piak bowk khowk.<verse eid="PSA 80:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 80:17" />En lang ruiah mih maru-uüa kowi peah kür diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:17">amatni kowi dow en matia vüi akürma en changah mih chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 80:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 80:18" />Nahanow en hownia katpaw anging nacham powt kown nadowi bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 80:18">Uang plan pe sing anging iawk diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:18">now en ming kowi anging nalük nalau iawk kown.<verse eid="PSA 80:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 80:19" />Aw lang kri lang kraing mih Thurai, alai kowh iawng plan tow anging iawk diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:19">en kowh sanara mih anowi iawng anging luk kowi pauang sawt lah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 80:19">Nahanow anging naka lawngra kown towbowt.<verse eid="PSA 80:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 80" />
  <chapter number="81" style="c" sid="PSA 81" />
  <para style="s">Enni pungmadawng kowi akeng thuraiuüa hang pacham uowi lah</para>
  <para style="d">Mami dow Asaf kowh meng chekhai. Mami dow “Gitit” pami meng owi iawng natekah kown mih meng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 81:1" />Pe a-i kür mih Thurai kowi awmrawmma hown rowsiah diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:1">Jakawb kowh Thurai vüi atünma tek rowsi meng büa diah.<verse eid="PSA 81:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 81:2" />Tepla sawkchow se tarowng meng tek büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:2">tingteng hai taraw tün aiungma tep büa diah.<verse eid="PSA 81:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 81:3" />A-i kowh Lacher Pawi ni towng tum baw büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:3">now lacher pawi towng paw tum baw büa diah.<verse eid="PSA 81:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 81:4" />Naiawng nachang kown mih dow Israeluüa kowh rirow chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:4">Nami dow Jakawb kowh Thurai ari aiang chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 81:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 81:5" />Nami ari aiang dow nachünah kownkow aia pe a-i mih chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:5">Nami dow Aigupta prenchakuüa kowi aia ripah khe aia pe a-i mih chekhai.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 81:5" />
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 81:5">Katpaw ang taah dowi mih maru kowh laiklow ang ta lowk khai.<verse eid="PSA 81:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 81:6" />Aia tek mih, “Enni pangkawt kowi kowh kurdik ang uowtta enni khowk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:6">adikma mih kharang krowng hownia ang pe khalatta enni khowk.<verse eid="PSA 81:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 81:7" />Enni kla phih khe enni haw ang hanow ang uang lawng enni khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:7">uangnim iiuma mih hownia ang uang klang enni khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 81:7">Now süngrüp süngkangma kowi kowh Meriba tuikuam re-e ang chaing enni khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:7">Nami dow ang nowng pe enni tui mih enni owm tak chünchü pakowh chekhai. [Sela]<verse eid="PSA 81:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 81:8" />“Ang maru-uüa low, ang kowh pringhawi lai sünta büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:8">Israeluüa low, ang kowh laiklow kowi enni pe ching kown mih ang nau.<verse eid="PSA 81:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 81:9" />Enni pungmadawng kowi akeng thuraiuüa hang pacham uowi lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:9">akeng thuraiuüa kowi chup paw hang cham chup büa diah.<verse eid="PSA 81:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 81:10" />Ang CHAKRAMANG dow enni kowh Thurai chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:10">Aigupta pren hownia uang lawtla enni mih dow ang chowtaih.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 81:10">Naiawng rakowi enni nau mih sia ang tut-e uang lü büa diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:10">nahanow enni lü mih srui ang nape enni kown taih.<verse eid="PSA 81:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 81:11" />“Nachenganchepaw ang maru-uüa mih ang kowh laiklow sünta dowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:11">Israeluüa mih ang kowh laiklow chün kown nau dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 81:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 81:12" />Naiawng rakowi amatni kowi dow saktuak khawtma hown ang pe changah lup khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:12">amatni kowi dow amatni nau iawng ang pe changah khai.<verse eid="PSA 81:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 81:13" />“Owh, ang maru-uüa che ang laiklow chün khai panü,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:13">Israeluüa che ang tiama kowi mang khai panü dow,<verse eid="PSA 81:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 81:14" />amatni kowh ransu-uüa kowi alenma ang nape sumah kown chowdiah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:14">ang kowh hawmlawm rut hown amatni kowh ransu-uüa kowi ang nakingküaah kown chowdiah.<verse eid="PSA 81:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 81:15" />“Sui ang miuüa kowi dow ang pur kowi ang nape khamah sum kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:15">amatni kowi dow chowngchowng saksakma ang naripah kown.<verse eid="PSA 81:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 81:16" />Nachenganchepaw Israeluüa kowi dow lang iung mih püm ang nape chaah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:16">now thia takra kowi kowh kuai tui hown aduma amatni kowi ang natowah kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="PSA 81:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 81" />
  <chapter number="82" style="c" sid="PSA 82" />
  <para style="s">Ngarai miuüa hai saratchowuüa kowi chet pe tara nowm diah</para>
  <para style="d">Asaf kowh meng.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 82:1" />Thurai dow aia kowh tara pu kowi iowng khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 82:1">aia dow pren kruitown mih thuraiuüa pungmadawng kowi chet tara khai.<verse eid="PSA 82:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 82:2" />Aia tek pe mih, “Mün khowt tak chow angak hown enni nakruitown pren kown?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 82:2">Mün ni tak chow maru ngakuüa kowi enni natawi tangila kown? [Sela]<verse eid="PSA 82:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 82:3" />Ngarawng ngarai miuüa hai saratchowuüa kowi chet pe tara nowm büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 82:3">ngarema hai akhawr hown uowi miuüa kowi takhula büah reng diah.<verse eid="PSA 82:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 82:4" />Kür uowi dowi miuüa hai akhowng takla miuüa kowi lawngah büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 82:4">amatni kowi dow maru ngakuüa rut hownia uang lawtla büa diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="PSA 82:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 82:5" />Pren kruitown mih thuraiuüa kowh dow chanlaira hai prengia iung hing uowi dowi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 82:5">Naiawng rakowi amatni dow iiu dawng kowi mangla pang khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 82:5">Naiawng rakowi lusa kowi mih anowm uowi dowi bowt chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 82:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 82:6" />Amatni kowi ang tek pe mih, “Enni dow thuraiuüa chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 82:6">enni dow lang kri lang kraing mih Thurai chauüa kangowh chowdiah.<verse eid="PSA 82:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 82:7" />Nachenganchepaw enni mih lusa maru iawng nakowng kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 82:7">lusa kowi kowh kruitown miuüa iawng enni napiak kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="PSA 82:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 82:8" />Aw Thurai, awr rü diah, lusa maru-uüa kowi chet pe tara diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 82:8">Tawngplawng kowchow panow chenchap maten dow en low kowi uowi mih chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 82:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 82" />
  <chapter number="83" style="c" sid="PSA 83" />
  <para style="s">Aw Thurai, ririmma hang uowi diah</para>
  <para style="d">Asaf kowh meng.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 83:1" />Aw Thurai, ririmma hang uowi diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:1">aw Thurai, nawr kowpma hang uowi diah.<verse eid="PSA 83:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 83:2" />Mü madiah, sui en mih ransu-uüa chang ran mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:2">amatni dow downg rawngrawng se chang bawri khai.<verse eid="PSA 83:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 83:3" />Amatni dow en maru-uüa kowi kingküaah kownkow thawp prengia khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:3">en takhula miuüa kowi kingküaah kownkow thawp sangkrangra ngak büah khai.<verse eid="PSA 83:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 83:4" />Amatni tatek mih, “Chu, Israel chenchap kowi a-i chumta bowt lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:4">amatni kowh ming khowm miapaw hang pacham tuk tham bowt lah,” pakhai.<verse eid="PSA 83:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 83:5" />Amatni dow takrüpah hanow thawp sangkrangra ngak khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:5">kingküa en kownkow takham miuüa dow maiawngün chekhai:<verse eid="PSA 83:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6-7" style="v" sid="PSA 83:6-7" />Edawmuüa, Ismaeluüa, Moabuüa hai Hagaruüa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:6-7">Gebaluüa, Amawnuüa, Amalekuüa, Filistinuüa hai Turauüa chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 83:6-7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 83:8" />Nami klen kowi Asuriauüa paw amatni hown tawi tabawng khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:8">amatni dow Lawt krungchak Moabuüa hai Amawnuüa kowh kür pek mih chekhai. [Sela]<verse eid="PSA 83:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 83:9" />Aw Thurai, amatni kowi dow Midianuüa kowi en changah iawng changah diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:9">Kisawn aw pang kowi Sisera hai Jabin iüah kowi en changah iawng changah diah.<verse eid="PSA 83:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 83:10" />Sisera hai Jabin iüah kowi dow Endawr marow kowi en piakah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:10">amatchi kowh uak dow krawng kowi su kowh chowng bawr khai bowt.<verse eid="PSA 83:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 83:11" />Ransu-uüa kowh maru iukuüa kowi dow Oreb hai Zeb iüah kowi en changah iawng changah diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:11">amatni kowh pren kruitown miuüa kowi dow Zeba hai Zalmuna iüah kowi iawng changah diah.<verse eid="PSA 83:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 83:12" />Amatni dow tek mih, “Israeluüa kowh pren a-i khünta pe lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:12">Israeluüa kowi Thurai peah mih pren a-i powngta pe lah,” pakhai.<verse eid="PSA 83:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 83:13" />Aw ang kowh Thurai, amatni kowi dow li rownla dinchow iawng changah diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:13">amatni kowi dow li cham rownla chapli iawng changah diah.<verse eid="PSA 83:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 83:14" />Kaurawng kowi dow maih kak now singh kau kam reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:14">hungh kowi dow maih cham tachan now hungma mawngma kam reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 83:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 83:15" />Nami iawng dow en kowh liku uangchak hown amatni kowi krawiah diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:15">en kowh liku kramra uowima mih hown amatni kowi pe kramah diah.<verse eid="PSA 83:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 83:16" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, en krüa kowi uang khamsum pat,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:16">amatni kowi dow pe chamang peah rukrai diah.<verse eid="PSA 83:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 83:17" />Amatni dow chowngchowng saksakma pacham ka rukrai hai pacham kram lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:17">amatni dow tawmpa rukrai pacham tapiak lah.<verse eid="PSA 83:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 83:18" />Nahanow en kowh ming dow CHAKRAMANG pami natuk büah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:18">now en chowtaih palusama kowi kowh lang kri lang kraing mih Thurai pami natuk büah kown.<verse eid="PSA 83:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 83" />
  <chapter number="84" style="c" sid="PSA 84" />
  <para style="s">CHAKRAMANG kim kowi uowi miuüa dow prasira uowima</para>
  <para style="d">Mami dow Kora krungchakuüa kowh meng chekhai. Mami dow “Gitit” pami meng owi iawng natekah kown mih meng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 84:1" />Aw mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:1">en kowh uowi rah dow lainowmma klangiung chekhai!<verse eid="PSA 84:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 84:2" />Ang kowh sak mih CHAKRAMANG kim viadawng nakhi kownkow lainowmma prüa khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:2">Naiawng rakowi ang kowh sak that kown chowbowt mih iawng towbowt chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 84:2">Masing Thurai vüi kowi ang kowh buk hai sak mih tek awmrawm meng khai.<verse eid="PSA 84:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 84:3" />Aw mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:3">en dow ang kowh mang hai ang kowh Thurai chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 84:3">En kowh phuchuara re-e dow kimpuk ua ka bai khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:3">en kowh kim kowi dow charak ka bai changra khai.<verse eid="PSA 84:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 84:4" />En chup kim kowi uowi miuüa dow prasira uowima chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:4">amatni dow atungma rowsi kiowri en reng chekhai. [Sela]<verse eid="PSA 84:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 84:5" />En hownia ka kür miuüa dow prasira uowima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:5">Zaiawn hungh kowi kowkowi kown tuak miuüa dow prasira uowima.<verse eid="PSA 84:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 84:6" />Baka lawngrawi iawng mang büah khe amatni kowi dow en peah tui khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:6">nami lawngrawi kowi dow manawng uang tui hown en pe phawah kanh khai.<verse eid="PSA 84:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 84:7" />Amatni kowi dow tiama rawng kowi en peah kür ngamlam khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:7">amatni dow Zaiawn hungh kowi Thurai pur kowi kowting büah bowk khai.<verse eid="PSA 84:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 84:8" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, lowra nowng chang mih Thurai, ang awr lü mih sünta diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:8">aw Jakawb kowh Thurai, ang laiklow kowi pe ching diah. [Sela]<verse eid="PSA 84:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 84:9" />Aw anging kowh Thurai, en dow anging kowh kawngma chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:9">en nümnapah mih maru kowi saksing sanaah diah.<verse eid="PSA 84:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 84:10" />Akeng kowi athawng ni cham uowi mih lak-e</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:10">en kim viadawng kowi ka uowi panichow mih lang iung chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 84:10">Maru ngakuüa kowh tangbung kowi asowrma uowi mih lak-e</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:10">en kowh kimplawt mawm re-e iowng mih lang iung chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 84:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 84:11" />CHAKRAMANG Thurai dow sat hai kawngma iawng chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:11">aia dow saksing sana a-i reng, now pe a-i ringkawra reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:11">now achinawmma miuüa kowi peah uanh iung reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 84:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 84:12" />Aw mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:12">en luk kowi neplawng nesak miuüa dow prasira uowima chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 84:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 84" />
  <chapter number="85" style="c" sid="PSA 85" />
  <para style="s">En plan pe anging kür dowi bowt tham bow?</para>
  <para style="d">Mami dow Kora krungchakuüa kowh meng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 85:1" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, achük alai khe en maru-uüa kowh pren kowi en sanaah khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 85:1">Jakawb krungchakuüa kowi dow en plan peah iungra khai iawk.<verse eid="PSA 85:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 85:2" />En maru-uüa kowh angak dow en lawtta pe khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 85:2">amatni kowh angak maten dow en khuta pe khai bowt. [Sela]<verse eid="PSA 85:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 85:3" />Amatni luk kowi en kowh kunmaraura maten en prowngta khai bowt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 85:3">now en kowh kunmaraura lün pluplup mih dow en rimta khai bowt.<verse eid="PSA 85:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 85:4" />Aw anging kowh lawng miia Thurai, alai kowh iawng kawmat paw pe anging iungra diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 85:4">anging luk kowi kowh en kowh kunmaraura mih taingta bowt diah.<verse eid="PSA 85:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 85:5" />Anging luk kowi en kunmarau mih chowngchowng saksakma bow en towah kown?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 85:5">chowngchowng saksakma bow anging luk kowi sak-ih dowi kowi en nauowi kown?<verse eid="PSA 85:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 85:6" />En plan pe anging kür dowi bowt tham bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 85:6">en luk kowi en maru-uüa ka awmrawmra dowi bowt tham bow?<verse eid="PSA 85:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 85:7" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, en kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura tüng anging diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 85:7">now uang lawng anging diah.<verse eid="PSA 85:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 85:8" />CHAKRAMANG Thurai natek kown mih laiklow srui ang nasünta kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 85:8">kaah sakowmma mih aia maru-uüa tut-e aia dow natek pe thaulangra laiklow kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 85:8">Tawkche amatni mih athukma mih lup prakowi plan dowi bowt kown takla.<verse eid="PSA 85:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 85:9" />Aia kowi kowh kram miuüa kowi aia nauang lawngah kown mih khin dow tawn mih nowm khowk chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 85:9">nahanow aia kowh kri kraingra dow a-i kowh pren kowi nauowi reng bowt kown.<verse eid="PSA 85:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 85:10" />Achur uowi dowi mih sakraura hai kaah sakowm mih rah dow natakrum bowt kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 85:10">tachi tanawmra hai thaulangra mih lowkkowlowk natanam bowt kown.<verse eid="PSA 85:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 85:11" />Nakhowk khe dow pren kowi kaah sakowm mih nauang ru bowt kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 85:11">mukuang hownia tachi tanawmra mih adak prakowi naiu mü bowt kown.<verse eid="PSA 85:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 85:12" />Aiung chap dow CHAKRAMANG mih nape a-i nowm bowt kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 85:12">now a-i pren kowi luprak ahuma aia nape phawah bowt kown.<verse eid="PSA 85:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 85:13" />Tachi tanawmra mih aia pur kowi narik mang reng kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 85:13">Nami dow aia vüi narik kamrüt pe tiama reng kown.<verse eid="PSA 85:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 85" />
  <chapter number="86" style="c" sid="PSA 86" />
  <para style="s">Thurai ching dow en chowtaih</para>
  <para style="d">David chup Thurai mih.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 86:1" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, ang laiklow sünta diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:1">now iu klang ang diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 86:1">Ang dow ngarema hai akhawr hown ang uowi khai.<verse eid="PSA 86:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 86:2" />Ang dow ringkaw en reng chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:2">naiawng rakowi nakowng kown mih hownia uang lawng ang diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 86:2">Aw ang kowh Thurai, ang dow en luk kowi neplawng nesak mih en kowh nar chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:2">naiawng rakowi en mih uang takhula ang diah.<verse eid="PSA 86:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 86:3" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, uang saksing sana ang diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:3">Tawngplawng kowchow panow ni towng en tut-e ang uang kar reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 86:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 86:4" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, en tut-e ang awr lü awr leng khowk.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:4">Naiawng rakowi uang pe ang awmrawmra diah.<verse eid="PSA 86:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 86:5" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, en dow aiungma chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:5">now en dow pe lawtra reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 86:5">Uang lü khowng miuüa kowi dow en sakrauah reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:5">amatni kowi dow en kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura en tüng pe reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 86:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 86:6" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, ang awr lü awr leng mih sünta ang diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:6">kar se ang awr lü khowng mih hawt sünta ang diah.<verse eid="PSA 86:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 86:7" />Ang kla phih mih khin khe ang nauang haw en reng kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:7">now en nauang klang ang reng kown mih ang tuk chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 86:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 86:8" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, en iawng mih dow akeng thuraiuüa pungmadawng kowi miapaw uowi dowi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:8">en changah mih lup dow amiapaw tawi nowng chang dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 86:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 86:9" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, en thawpah mih chenchap maten dow en pur kowi nauang büah kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:9">amatni dow krawng kowi tabawk krawm se nauang chupiia en kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:9">amatni dow en ming chimsaima mih kowi nauang kiowri kown.<verse eid="PSA 86:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 86:10" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow en dow kri kraingma chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:10">now en dow chang awdara lup reng;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:10">Thurai ching dow en chowtaih.<verse eid="PSA 86:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 86:11" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, en kowh tiama uang tüng ang diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:11">nahanow en kowh anowmma mih kowi ang naia mang kown towbowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 86:11">Ang kowi saktuak lowkchow chang ang diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:11">nahanow ang naringkaw en kown towbowt.<verse eid="PSA 86:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 86:12" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, ang kowh Thurai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:12">ang kowh sak maiow hown ang narowsi en reng kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:12">chowngchowng saksakma en ming kowi ang nakiow reng kown.<verse eid="PSA 86:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 86:13" />Ang luk kowi kowh en kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura dow kri kraingma chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:13">kowng kown mih hownia en uang lawng ang khai.<verse eid="PSA 86:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 86:14" />Aw Thurai, abawrima miuüa dow uang kingküa ang khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:14">chang nowng chang powng miuüa dow saita ang kownkow sangkrang büah khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 86:14">Naiawngün maru-uüa dow mapaw ringkaw en dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 86:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 86:15" />Nachenganchepaw aw CHAKRAMANG, en dow saksing sanara atekma mih Thurai;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 86:15">En dow kunmarau naklak dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:15">En kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura dow anikma chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:15">now en kowh kaah sakowm mih rah paw atekma chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 86:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 86:16" />Ang prakowi uang iu dang diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:16">now uang saksing sana ang diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 86:16">En kowh kür dow en nar kowi uang peah diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:16">en kowh narma chapa kowi uang takhula diah.<verse eid="PSA 86:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 86:17" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, en sana ang mih amatra uang tüng ang diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 86:17">En khowng ang mih hai pe ang sakkhawtra mih khita hanow</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:17">sui ang miuüa dow narukrai kown.<verse eid="PSA 86:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 86" />
  <chapter number="87" style="c" sid="PSA 87" />
  <para style="s">Nachowng Zaiawn marowchak kown mih</para>
  <para style="d">Kora krungchakuüa kowh meng.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 87:1" />CHAKRAMANG dow thawp aia kowh marow lowk chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 87:1">Nami dow chimsaima mih hungh kowi aia thawpah khai.<verse eid="PSA 87:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 87:2" />Israel pren kowi kowh akeng mih marow maten lak-e</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 87:2">aia dow Zaiawn kowi lang sakrauah khai.<verse eid="PSA 87:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 87:3" />Aw Thurai kowh marow,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 87:3">en lawnguan kowi ahuma Thurai tek en kraingra laiklow khai. [Sela]<verse eid="PSA 87:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 87:4" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “Tuk ang miuüa maten kowi dow Jerusalem marowchak ang naklowkla kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 87:4">Aigupta, Babulawn hai Filistin prenchak tuk ang miuüa dow Jerusalem marowchak natawi chowng kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 87:4">now Tura hai Ethiawpia prenchak paw tuk ang miuüa dow Jerusalem marowchak natawi chowng kown” pakhai.<verse eid="PSA 87:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 87:5" />Nakhowk khe Zaiawn marow lawnguan kowi maru kawmuüa natek kown mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 87:5">“Nakowi kowh maru maten dow ka chowng marowchak rakowi piaw khai,” napa kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 87:5">Nami marow kowi dow lang kri lang kraing mih CHAKRAMANG ngengche napeah prasi kown.<verse eid="PSA 87:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 87:6" />Chenchapuüa kowi CHAKRAMANG tang pe ming khe natek kown mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 87:6">“Amatni dow chowng Jerusalem marowchak khai bowt,” napa kown. [Sela]<verse eid="PSA 87:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 87:7" />Amatni dow plai se plai se natek meng kown mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 87:7">“Anging kowh singra tut dow Zaiawn marow chekhai,” napa kown.<verse eid="PSA 87:7" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 87" />
  <chapter number="88" style="c" sid="PSA 88" />
  <para style="s">Tawngplawng kowchow en nuata ang khai?</para>
  <para style="d">Mami dow Kora krungchakuüa kowh meng chekhai. Mami dow Zera chapa Heman tekah mih meng chekhai. Mami meng dow “Mahalat-Leanawt” pami meng owi iawng natekah kown.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 88:1" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, ang kowh lawng miia Thurai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:1">en tut-e dow ni towng iak towng ang uang kar reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 88:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 88:2" />Ang awr lü awr leng mih hawt sünta ang diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:2">kar se ang uang lü khowng mih hawt sünta ang diah.<verse eid="PSA 88:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 88:3" />Ang kowh chownglawng dow kawmkrat huma chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:3">ang kowh dow kowng khin uang towm iawlaw khowk.<verse eid="PSA 88:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 88:4" />Ang kowh dow mapaw kür uowi dowi bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:4">ang dow kowng kown mih maru iawng towbowt.<verse eid="PSA 88:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 88:5" />Ang dow kowng miuüa pungmadawng kowi kuakta ang hüah mih iawng towbowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:5">ang dow tadupra kowi kowh mawk hüah mih uak iawng towbowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 88:5">Kowng miuüa kowi iawng en tamata ang khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:5">amatni kowi iawng en khowng ang dowi bowt chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 88:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 88:6" />Kowng miuüa uowi rah kowi en tow ang khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:6">aiiuma hai abüpma mih rah krawng dak kowi en tow ang khai bowt.<verse eid="PSA 88:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 88:7" />En kowh kunmaraura dow sata tuilowng iawng plan plan ang luk kowi uang kla khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:7">nami en kowh kunmaraura hown en piak ang khai. [Sela]<verse eid="PSA 88:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 88:8" />En rakowi ang kowh auiuauüa mih nuata ang khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:8">amatni tut-e dow suiiaima en chang ang khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 88:8">Ang takhang khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:8">ang uang nowng lawt dowi bowt chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 88:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 88:9" />Tuak krat lai rakowi ang kowh mik paw chim dowi bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 88:9">Aw CHAKRAMANG, ni towng ang awr haw en reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:9">awr iaw rut se ang awr lü awr leng reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 88:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 88:10" />Kowng khowk miuüa vüi en chang pe awdara lup bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:10">Kowng miuüa awr rü hanow rowsi en bow? [Sela]<verse eid="PSA 88:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 88:11" />Tadupra kowi en kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura lawnguan mia chow nowng phuang?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:11">Kowng miuüa uowi rah kowi en kowh kaah sakowm mih laiklow mia chow nowng phuang?<verse eid="PSA 88:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 88:12" />Aiiuma mih arah kowi en kowh awdara lup mia chow nowng khi?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:12">Maru tamata reng mih maru-uüa pren kowi en kowh lup nowm lawnguan mia chow nowng tek?<verse eid="PSA 88:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 88:13" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, en tut-e kar se ang uang lü khowng reng;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:13">rau towng en tut-e ang awr lü awr leng reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 88:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 88:14" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, tawngplawng kowchow en nuata ang khai?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:14">Tawngplawng kowchow en cham dangta ang khai?<verse eid="PSA 88:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 88:15" />Ang kowh dow asowmchow hownia akawm akrat kangowh chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:15">now ang dow hüm kowng ngialia chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 88:15">Ang luk kowi dow en kowh kramra uowima mih ripra uang kla khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:15">nami ripra dow mapaw ang nowng kham dowi bowt chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 88:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 88:16" />En kowh kramra uowima mih kunmaraura dow ang luk kowi uang kla khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:16">en kowh kramra uowima mih kunmaraura dow uang piakta ang nak khai.<verse eid="PSA 88:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 88:17" />Nami kunmaraura dow tui lawt khe kowh iawng umta ang lut khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:17">nami kunmaraura dow ni chut chi uang rumta ang hüah khai.<verse eid="PSA 88:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 88:18" />Ang lang sakrauah miuüa hownia en praita ang khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:18">ang kowh auiuauüa hownia dow alakma kowi en lang tow ang khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 88:18">Ang kowh lang tasin mih auiua dow aiiu towbowt chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 88:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 88" />
  <chapter number="89" style="c" sid="PSA 89" />
  <para style="s">CHAKRAMANG kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura</para>
  <para style="d">Ezra krungchak Ethan kowh meng.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 89:1" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, en kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura lawnguan kowi chowngchowng saksakma ang natek meng reng kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:1">en kowh kaah sakowm mih laiklow dow chowngchowng saksakma maru-uüa tut-e ang naphuang reng kown.<verse eid="PSA 89:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 89:2" />En kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura dow chowngchowng saksakma nauowi reng kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:2">en kowh kaah sakowm mih rah dow mukuang iawng anikma nauowi kown.<verse eid="PSA 89:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 89:3" />En tek mih, “Ang kloah mih ang kowh nar David kowi ang tow pe sangbowk laitawm lowk khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:3">aia kowi dow maiawng ang takham pe khai:<verse eid="PSA 89:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 89:4" />‘En krungchak hownia dow mang nauang pawk reng kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:4">amatni dow chowngchowng saksakma nachowm mang reng kown,’ pape khai,” pakhai. [Sela]<verse eid="PSA 89:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 89:5" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, mukuang kowi kowh uowi mih maten dow en kowh kri kraingma mih lup kowi kiow en reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:5">chimsaima mih kramamu-uüa dow en kowh kaah sakowm mih rakowi kiow en reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 89:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 89:6" />CHAKRAMANG hown tuah kown mih mukuang kowi mia chow uowi?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:6">Kramamu-uüa pungmadawng kowi CHAKRAMANG hown tale mih mia chow uowi?<verse eid="PSA 89:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 89:7" />Chimsaima mih kramamu-uüa takua talawmra kowi Thurai dow ka ringkawra reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:7">aia kowi tapat lut iowng miuüa dow aia kowi ringkawma hown kramah reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 89:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 89:8" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, en dow lang kri lang kraing mih Thurai chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:8">aw CHAKRAMANG, en khowt kür mih mia chow uowi?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 89:8">En dow lowra prakowi kaah sakowmma chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 89:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 89:9" />Talowng phunglung mih sata tui dow en low kowi uowi reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:9">tuilowng awr talowng hanow en pe sutah reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 89:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 89:10" />Sata kowi kowh uowi mih Rahab kowi dow en piakta naknak khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:10">en kowh ransu-uüa kowi dow en kowh akürma mih rut hown en dita naknak khai.<verse eid="PSA 89:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 89:11" />Mukuang dow en kowh, lusa paw en kowh chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:11">mami lusa hai nakowi kowh uowi mih maten en thawpah mih chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 89:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 89:12" />Tawngphak hownia mrawkphak mowr kowi kowh uowi mih maten dow en thawpah mih chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:12">Tabawr hungh hai Hermawn hungh dow en ming kowi tek rowsi meng reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 89:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 89:13" />En kowh bawng dow akürma chekhai!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:13">En kowh hawmlawm rut dow lainowmma kür chekhai!<verse eid="PSA 89:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 89:14" />En dow mang chowm rah hownia achinawmma hai anowmma kruitownah reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:14">en dow en kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura hown kaah sakowmma chang lup reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 89:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 89:15" />Meng hown uang kiow en miuüa dow prasira uowima chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:15">aw CHAKRAMANG, amatni dow en tawi uowi mih anowi kowi mang reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 89:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 89:16" />Amatni dow ni chut chi en ming kowi piaw büah reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:16">en peah iungra khai rakowi amatni dow kiow en khai.<verse eid="PSA 89:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 89:17" />En dow anging kowh kraingra uowima mih kürra chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:17">anging ka kür mih dow en saksing sana anging rakowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 89:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 89:18" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, nauang lawng anging kownkow en khowm bowk anging maru lowk ia khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:18">Israeluüa kowh chimsaima mih dow pe anging mang lowk ia khai.<verse eid="PSA 89:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 89:19" />Akat khe ringkaw en miuüa tut-e mukmang kowi en uang tek pe mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:19">“Tasen kiakma mih lowk ia kowi ang khowngah khowk;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:19">aia kowi dow nape chowmah mang kownkow maru kawmuüa pungmadawng hownia ang klota khowk.<verse eid="PSA 89:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 89:20" />Nami ang kowh nar David kowi dow ang kata khowk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:20">aia kowi dow ang kowh chimsaima mih kanrawn sau hown ang nümnapah khowk.<verse eid="PSA 89:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 89:21" />Ang kowh kür dow aia tut-e natawi uowi reng kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:21">ang kowh kür hown aia natawi kür kown.<verse eid="PSA 89:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 89:22" />Ransu-uüa dow aia kowi nanowngah kown nadowi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:22">maru ngak dow aia kowi nanowng sumah kown nadowi.<verse eid="PSA 89:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 89:23" />Aia kowi kowh kingküa miuüa kowi dow aia pur kowi ang napiakta nak kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:23">aia kowi sui miuüa kowi dow ang nathuata nak kown.<verse eid="PSA 89:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 89:24" />Ang kowh kaah sakowm mih rah hai achur uowi dowi mih sakraura dow aia tut-e nauowi reng kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:24">aia dow ang ming hown nakür ngamlam kown.<verse eid="PSA 89:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 89:25" />Aia kowi dow Mediteranean sata hownia Iufratis aw mowr ang nape powngah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:25">nami takra kowi kowh süng maten dow aia naka powng kown.<verse eid="PSA 89:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 89:26" />David dow haw ang hanow natek ang kown mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:26">‘Ang kowh pa dow en chowtaih, ang kowh Thurai dow en chowtaih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:26">now ang kowh lawng miia Singku Huamang dow en chowtaih,’ napa kown.<verse eid="PSA 89:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 89:27" />Aia kowi dow chapa ta rah ang napeah kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:27">aia kowi dow lusa kowi kowh mang maten kowi kowh lang kri mih ang nachangah kown.<verse eid="PSA 89:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 89:28" />Aia kowi dow ang kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura chowngchowng saksakma ang natow pe kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:28">aia hown kowh ang tatowah mih sangbowk laitawm dow anikma nauowi reng kown.<verse eid="PSA 89:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 89:29" />Aia kowh krungchak hownia dow mang nauang pawk lowk ia kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:29">nami mang dow mukuang uowi mowr naka chowm mang reng kown.<verse eid="PSA 89:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 89:30" />Nachenganchepaw aia kowh krungchakuüa che ang kowh alow pek chün dowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:30">ang kowh rirow iawng chang dowi,<verse eid="PSA 89:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 89:31" />ang kowh ari aiang nuata khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:31">now ang kowh ana pek chün dowi hanow,<verse eid="PSA 89:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 89:32" />amatni kowh ngak rakowi müa hown ang naripah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:32">amatni lai üa sung ang napeah ripra kown.<verse eid="PSA 89:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 89:33" />Tawkche David kowi dow ang kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura ang napawta pe kown nadowi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:33">aia kowi kowh ang kham pe mih lai dow ang natown pe reng kown.<verse eid="PSA 89:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 89:34" />Aia hown kowh ang tatowah mih sangbowk laitawm dow ang napiakta kown nadowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:34">ang tekah mih laiklow dow anawrchow khowm ang naklowiah kown nadowi.<verse eid="PSA 89:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 89:35" />Akat khe ang ming chimsaima mih hown maiawng ang takham sawi khai:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:35">David kowi dow katpaw ang daiah kown nadowi.<verse eid="PSA 89:35" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 89:36" />Aia krungchak hownia dow mang nauang pawk lowk ia kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:36">nami mang kowh mang chowm rah dow sat iawng anikma nauowi reng kown.<verse eid="PSA 89:36" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 89:37" />Nami mang chowm rah dow lama iawng anikma nauowi reng kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:37">ang kowh kaah sakowm mih sangbowk laitawm saksi dow lama chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="PSA 89:37" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 89:38" />Nachenganchepaw kawmat dow en nümnapah mih mang kowi en kunmarauah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:38">aia kowi dow en kingküaah hanow en nuata khai.<verse eid="PSA 89:38" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 89:39" />En nar hown kowh en tatowah mih sangbowk laitawm dow en piakta pe khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:39">aia kowh mang lukruk dow krawng kowi en kuakta pe khai.<verse eid="PSA 89:39" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 89:40" />Aia kowh marow tap maten dow en khueta pe khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:40">aia kowh akhawtma mih kangchawngra kim dow en piakta bowk khai.<verse eid="PSA 89:40" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 89:41" />Aia pren iawng kowmang miuüa dow aia kowh uanh maten rupla pe khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:41">aia kowh kimping namkhetuüa dow aia kowi changla rensi kau khai.<verse eid="PSA 89:41" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 89:42" />Aia kowh ransu-uüa kowi akürma en changah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:42">amatni kowi dow en pe piawah khai.<verse eid="PSA 89:42" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 89:43" />Aia kowh saidawng bür dow en nuata pe khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:43">aia kowi dow en tawi khowngah tasen dowi bowt chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 89:43" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="PSA 89:44" />Aia kowh mangra dow en piakta pe khai bowt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:44">aia kowh mang chowm rah dow krawng kowi en kuakta pe khai bowt.<verse eid="PSA 89:44" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="PSA 89:45" />Akhin nadowi tak khe aia kowi dow en pe lawngtangah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:45">aia kowi dow rukraira hown en mumta klum khai. [Sela]<verse eid="PSA 89:45" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="PSA 89:46" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, mün ni tak chow naiawng en nachang kown?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:46">Chowngchowng saksakma en tapet kown bow?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 89:46">Mün ni tak chow lün pluplup mih maih iawng en nakunmarau kown?<verse eid="PSA 89:46" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="PSA 89:47" />Mün khowt chow ang kowh chownglawng town mih sam tuak madiah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:47">lusa maru kowh chownglawng dow tawngpaw asung uowi dowi chekhai!<verse eid="PSA 89:47" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="PSA 89:48" />Kowng dowi kowi chowngchowng saksakma nowng sing mih maru mia chow uowi?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:48">Kowngra hownia kowmatia kowi nowng towkala mih maru mia chow uowi? [Sela]<verse eid="PSA 89:48" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="PSA 89:49" />Aw Thurai, en kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura tawng kowi chow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:49">Kaah sakowmma hown David kowi en sakrauah kown en takham khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:49">nami sakraura tawng kowi chow?<verse eid="PSA 89:49" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="PSA 89:50" />Aw Thurai, en nar ka rukrai mih lawnguan kowi tuakah reng diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:50">chenchapuüa tut-e ang ka rukrai mih lawnguan tuakah reng diah.<verse eid="PSA 89:50" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="PSA 89:51" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, en kowh ransu-uüa dow en nümnapah mih mang kowi peah rukrai khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:51">aia cham kowi rah maten kowi amatni dow aia kowi khareah khai.<verse eid="PSA 89:51" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="PSA 89:52" />CHAKRAMANG dow chowngchowng saksakma akiow pauowi lah!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:52">Amen! Amen!<verse eid="PSA 89:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 89" />
  <chapter number="90" style="c" sid="PSA 90" />
  <para style="ms">BOWIH 4</para>
  <para style="mr">(<ref loc="PSA 90-106">Meng Lai 90-106</ref>)</para>
  <para style="s">Thurai dow chowngchowng saksakma uowi reng</para>
  <para style="d">Thurai maru Mosi awr lü awr leng mih.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 90:1" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, en dow anging krungchak towng kowh uowi rah chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 90:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 90:2" />En thawp hungma mawngma dowi tak hownia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:2">en thawp lusa dowi tak hownia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:2">en dow chowngchowng saksakma mih Thurai chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 90:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 90:3" />Lusa maru kowi dow en plan pe chowngah bawn reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:3">en tek mih, “Aw lusa maru-uüa, bawn kowi kowplan büah iawk diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="PSA 90:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 90:4" />Athawng ning dow en tut-e panichow iawng taih.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:4">Nami dow paiak chow mih khin iawng nawngchow taih chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 90:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 90:5" />Lusa maru kowi dow alenma en pe kowngah reng khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:5">amatni kowh chownglawng dow mang iawng tama reng.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 90:5">Amatni dow rau-e kowh awr awm mih bawrchak iawng:<verse eid="PSA 90:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 90:6" />Nami dow rau-e khe awr awm hanow awr sa reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:6">Tawkche iak pra dow ngawi hanow kowng reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 90:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 90:7" />Maih iawng lün pluplup mih en kowh kunmaraura kowi lainowmma anging kram khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:7">en kowh kunmarau hown en piak anging reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 90:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 90:8" />Anging kowh angak maten dow en khi bowk chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:8">kukpa anging changah mih angak maten paw en khi bowk chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 90:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 90:9" />En kunmarau rakowi anging kowh chowng dow town khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:9">anging kowh ning dow kawli powt mih iawng powt len mih nowm khowk.<verse eid="PSA 90:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 90:10" />Anging kowh chowng dow 70 ningchow towbowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:10">kow iung lak iung mih dow 80 ning sing mih paw nauowi kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 90:10">Tawkche anging sing uowi mowr dow akawm akrat kangowh;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:10">anging kowh ning dow lainowmma kowi len khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:10">now anging paw tawi tama reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 90:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 90:11" />En kowh kunmaraura kür mia chow nowng tuk?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:11">En kowh kramra uowima mih kunmaraura mia chow ia tuk?<verse eid="PSA 90:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 90:12" />Anging kowh chowng atownchow pami uang pe tuk anging diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:12">nahanow aiungma nachowm uowi kown mih chanlaira anging naka kown towbowt.<verse eid="PSA 90:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 90:13" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, uang plan bowt!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:13">Mün khowt tak chow en nakra kown?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 90:13">En kowh naruüa kowi uang saksing sanaah bowt.<verse eid="PSA 90:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 90:14" />En kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura hown rau towng uang pe anging sak-ihra reng diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:14">nahanow anging naia tek awmrawm meng bowt kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:14">now apiawma anging naia uowi kown towbowt.<verse eid="PSA 90:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 90:15" />En towk anging akrat mih hai anging kla phih mih dow khin krama chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:15">naiawngün ni khowt khaleng dow aiungma pe uowi anging bowt.<verse eid="PSA 90:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 90:16" />En kowh awdara lup tüng anging diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:16">anging kowh chauüa kowi en kowh kraingra tüng pe diah.<verse eid="PSA 90:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 90:17" />CHAKRAMANG anging kowh Thurai dow pacham saksing sana anging reng lah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:17">anging changah mih lup maten dow aiungma pe phaw anging diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:17">aw CHAKRAMANG, anging kowh lup maten aiungma pe phaw anging bowt.<verse eid="PSA 90:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 90" />
  <chapter number="91" style="c" sid="PSA 91" />
  <para style="s">Thurai dow ang kowh tatung tanimra</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 91:1" />Lang kri lang kraing mih Thurai nimkrüa kowi uowi mih kowi dow Thurai peah thaulangra khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:1">amatni kowi dow lowra nowng chang mih Thurai mih thaulangma pe uowiah reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 91:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 91:2" />CHAKRAMANG lawnguan kowi maiawng ang natek kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:2">“Ang kowh tatung tanimra hai ang kowh akhawtma mih kimkrowng dow aia chowtaih;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:2">ang neplawng nesak reng mih ang kowh Thurai dow aia chowtaih,” napa kown.<verse eid="PSA 91:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 91:3" />Aia dow chakta hüah mih leng hownia nalawng en kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:3">now makowng hawi hownia natowkala en kown.<verse eid="PSA 91:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 91:4" />Alap hown uakling takhula chauüa iawng aia nakhula en kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:4">now aia tut-e athaulangma en naka tatung tanimra kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 91:4">Aia kowh kaah sakowm mih rah dow kawngma hai tasen tawnguat iawng natowkala en reng kown.<verse eid="PSA 91:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 91:5" />Iak-e khe phih nauang ting kown mih kowi hangkow kram diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:5">ni-e khe salangba hown nauang sen en kown mih kowi hangkow kram diah.<verse eid="PSA 91:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 91:6" />Iak-e khe makowng hawi nauang ting kown mih kowi hangkow kram diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:6">now ni ür thüm khe piakra uang ting kown mih kowi paw hangkow kram diah.<verse eid="PSA 91:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 91:7" />En ria kowi maru kowng 1,000 ia chepaw naia kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:7">now akeng prakowi maru kowng 10,000 ia chepaw naia kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 91:7">Nachenganchepaw nami piakra dow en tut-e nauang ting kown nadowi.<verse eid="PSA 91:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 91:8" />Krawi tang mü diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:8">nahanow maru ngakuüa ka ripra mih en nakhi kown.<verse eid="PSA 91:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 91:9" />CHAKRAMANG tut-e en tatung tanim khai hanow,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:9">lang kri lang kraing mih Thurai tut-e en uowi khai hanow,<verse eid="PSA 91:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 91:10" />tawng iawng mih piakra paw en luk kowi nauang ting kown nadowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:10">tawng iawng mih hawi paw en kim kowi nauang kla kown nadowi.<verse eid="PSA 91:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 91:11" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow CHAKRAMANG dow aia kowh kramamu-uüa kowi napeah ana kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:11">nahanow amatni dow en cham kowi rah towng kowi nakrawi takhula en reng kown.<verse eid="PSA 91:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 91:12" />Amatni dow amatni kowh rut hown nadowk en kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:12">nahanow en kowh klowng dow hua kowi naka arau kown nadowi bowt.<verse eid="PSA 91:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 91:13" />Krangsi iawng akürma mih en kowh ransu-uüa kowi dow en nanowngta kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:13">rua iawng kramra uowima mih ransu-uüa kowi paw en nanowngta kown.<verse eid="PSA 91:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 91:14" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “Sakrau ang miuüa kowi dow ang natakhula kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:14">ang kowh ming tuk miuüa kowi dow phih hownia ang natowkala kown.<verse eid="PSA 91:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 91:15" />Amatni haw ang khai hanow amatni kowi ang naklangah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:15">amatni kla phih mih khin khe amatni tut-e ang natawi uowila reng kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 91:15">Amatni kowi dow ang takhula reng kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:15">now ang napeah ringkawra reng kown.<verse eid="PSA 91:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 91:16" />Chowngdawng sakklangma ang pe singah mih hownia amatni kowi dow ang nape sak-ihah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:16">amatni kowi dow ang kowh lawngra lup ang nape khi-ah kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="PSA 91:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 91" />
  <chapter number="92" style="c" sid="PSA 92" />
  <para style="s">CHAKRAMANG kiow meng</para>
  <para style="d">Tanai Ni khe kowh natekah kown mih meng.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1-3" style="v" sid="PSA 92:1-3" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, lang kri lang kraing mih Thurai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 92:1-3">hamüt iang mih tingteng tün hai prui tün hown</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 92:1-3">natek en awmrawm lai kown mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 92:1-3">en ming kowi natek rowsi meng kown mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 92:1-3">rau towng en kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakrau laiklow natek kown mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 92:1-3">iak towng en kowh kaah sakowm mih laiklow naphuang kown mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 92:1-3">naiawngün dow lainowmma iung chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 92:1-3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 92:4" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, en kowh kri kraingma mih lup dow pe ang awmrawmra khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 92:4">en changah mih lup maten vüi kowi ang natek en awmrawm meng reng kown.<verse eid="PSA 92:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 92:5" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, en kowh lup maten dow kri kraing lai kowbow!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 92:5">now en kowh saktuak dow büp lai kowbow!<verse eid="PSA 92:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 92:6" />Naiawngün dow abualama mih maru tuk dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 92:6">aiung angak tukra uowi dowi mih maru dow naiawngün tuk dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 92:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 92:7" />Maru ngakuüa dow pram iawng alenma awr sa reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 92:7">chang lup ngak miuüa dow amatni kowh lup hown chawn reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 92:7">Tawkche amatni dow chowngchowng saksakma vüi asaima napiak kown.<verse eid="PSA 92:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 92:8" />Nachenganchepaw en dow chowngchowng saksakma anging bowkbowk kowi nakruitown reng kown.<verse eid="PSA 92:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 92:9" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, en kowh ransu-uüa dow napiak bowk kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 92:9">chang ngak mih maru-uüa dow nakrawi taset plawt kown.<verse eid="PSA 92:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 92:10" />En dow chiarowngla iawng akürma chang ang khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 92:10">aiungma mih sau hown en <char style="w">nümnap</char> ang khai.<verse eid="PSA 92:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 92:11" />Ang kowh ransu-uüa sum mih dow ang matia mik hown ang khi khowk;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 92:11">kingküa ang miuüa kowh kar klow dow ang matia param hown ang ta khowk.<verse eid="PSA 92:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 92:12" />Thurai kowi ringkaw miuüa dow chekmarawng singh iawng awr iuk awr sown reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 92:12">amatni dow Lebanawn hungh kowi kowh sidar singh iawng awr sah reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 92:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 92:13" />Amatni dow CHAKRAMANG a-i kowh Thurai kim kowi kowh chowkah mih singh iawng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 92:13">amatni dow aia kowh viadawng kowi awr iuk awr sown reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 92:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 92:14" />Lawngtang khe paw amatni dow uih pau reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 92:14">amatni dow akhawtma hai aram keu dowi mih singh iawng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 92:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 92:15" />Amatni dow en lawnguan kowi natek kown mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 92:15">“CHAKRAMANG dow anowmma chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 92:15">aia dow ang kowh Singku Huamang chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 92:15">aia tut-e dow tawng iawng mih angak uowi dowi chekhai,” napa kown.<verse eid="PSA 92:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 92" />
  <chapter number="93" style="c" sid="PSA 93" />
  <para style="s">Mang dow CHAKRAMANG chowtaih</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 93:1" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, mang dow en chowtaih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 93:1">en kowh kraingra hai kür dow mang tawnguat iawng en khupah khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 93:1">Lusa dow anikma en towah khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 93:1">Nami dow katpaw nachü kown nadowi bowt.<verse eid="PSA 93:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 93:2" />En dow auown hownia chowm mang reng chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 93:2">en dow achük alai hownia aiawng uowi reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 93:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 93:3" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, tui lawt mih klow dow tachak pheklek khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 93:3">tui awr talowng mih klow dow nowk phunglung khai.<verse eid="PSA 93:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 93:4" />Naiawngün tui lawt hai tuilowng lak-e khowm</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 93:4">mukuang kowi kowh Thurai dow lang kür chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 93:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 93:5" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, en kowh laiklow maten dow sakowmra uowima chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 93:5">en kowh kim dow chowngchowng saksakma chimsaima uowi reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 93:5" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 93" />
  <chapter number="94" style="c" sid="PSA 94" />
  <para style="s">CHAKRAMANG dow aia kowh maru-uüa kowi nuaah dowi</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 94:1" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, en dow maru ngakuüa kowi pe ripra reng mih Thurai chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:1">amatni kowi dow en kowh kunmarau uang tüng pe diah.<verse eid="PSA 94:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 94:2" />Aw lusa kowi kowh tara chet miia, awr rü diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:2">chang bawri miuüa kowi dow amatni kowh angak sung peah diah.<verse eid="PSA 94:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 94:3" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, mün ni tak chow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:3">Mün ni tak chow maru ngakuüa nahow sawmlawm kown?<verse eid="PSA 94:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 94:4" />Mün ni tak chow amatni nachang owrow kown?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:4">Mün ni tak chow amatni nachang bawri kown?<verse eid="PSA 94:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 94:5" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, amatni dow en kowh maru-uüa kowi kowpiakta nak khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:5">en changla dawngthawnguan mih en kowh maru-uüa kowi amatni changah nowng khai.<verse eid="PSA 94:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 94:6" />Mamaimow hai prenlang maru-uüa kowi amatni kowngta khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:6">now saratchowuüa kowi paw amatni saita khai.<verse eid="PSA 94:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 94:7" />Amatni tek mih, “CHAKRAMANG khi a-i dowi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:7">tawng chow a-i chang mih paw Israeluüa kowh Thurai tuk dowi,” pabüah khai.<verse eid="PSA 94:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 94:8" />Abualama mih maru-uüa low, mün khowt tak chow enni nabua kown?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:8">aiung angak tukra uowi dowi miuüa low, tawng khe tak chow enni natawi ka prengia iung kown?<verse eid="PSA 94:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 94:9" />A-i kowh param thawp miia Thurai ta dowi pabow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:9">A-i kowh mik thawp miia Thurai khi dowi pabow?<verse eid="PSA 94:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 94:10" />Aia dow chenchap maten kowi kruitown reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:10">aia dow rip enni dowi tham pabow?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 94:10">Aia dow maru-uüa kowi peah chanlaira reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:10">tawng chow enni chang mih aia tuk dowi tham pabow?<verse eid="PSA 94:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 94:11" />CHAKRAMANG dow maru kowh saktuak tuk chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:11">aia dow nami saktuak asung uowi dowi pami tuk chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 94:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 94:12" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, en pring hawiah mih maru dow prasira uowima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:12">en kowh rirow en sangah mih maru dow prasira uowima chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 94:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 94:13" />Aia kowi dow phih hownia en lawngah reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:13">maru ngakuüa vüi ki thai kuam dowi mowr en lawngah reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 94:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 94:14" />CHAKRAMANG dow aia maru-uüa kowi katpaw nanuata kown nadowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:14">aia changla dawngthawnguan mih aia kowh maru-uüa kowi aia nakuakta kown nadowi.<verse eid="PSA 94:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 94:15" />Tara chetra kowi tara nowm naplan uowi iawk kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:15">Nami dow achinawmma miuüa nachün kown.<verse eid="PSA 94:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 94:16" />Maru ngakuüa uang kingküa ang mih khin khe mia chow uang khowng ang?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:16">Amatni uang kingküa ang mih khin khe mia chow uang tangila ang?<verse eid="PSA 94:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 94:17" />CHAKRAMANG khowng ang dowi e dow ang nakowng prang bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:17">now ririm raramma mih makownguüa uowi rah kowi ang cham ki uowi prang bowt.<verse eid="PSA 94:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 94:18" />Ang tatheu khai pahai ang tek mih khin khe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:18">aw CHAKRAMANG, en kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura hown en uang dowk ang khai.<verse eid="PSA 94:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 94:19" />Ang tuak kawm tuak krat lai bowt khe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:19">en uang pe ang sakkhawtra hanow en pe awmrawm ang khai.<verse eid="PSA 94:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 94:20" />Angakma mih kruitown miuüa hown dow tawngpaw en kowh tatukra uowi dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:20">amatni dow nachangla ngak kownkow thawp rirow reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 94:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 94:21" />Amatni dow anowmma miuüa kowi nakrawi kingküa kownkow takrüp büah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:21">achinawmma miuüa kowi nakowngta kownkow amatni dow krawi bek angak khai.<verse eid="PSA 94:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 94:22" />Nachenganchepaw ang kowh akhawtma mih kim dow CHAKRAMANG chowtaih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:22">ang kowh tatung tanimra Singku Huamang dow ang kowh Thurai chowtaih.<verse eid="PSA 94:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 94:23" />CHAKRAMANG dow maru ngakuüa kowh angak sung amatni luk kowi nauang pawla pe kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:23">amatni kowh lup ngak rakowi amatni kowi aia napiakah kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 94:23">CHAKRAMANG a-i kowh Thurai dow amatni kowi asaima napiakah kown.<verse eid="PSA 94:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 94" />
  <chapter number="95" style="c" sid="PSA 95" />
  <para style="s">Lang kri lang kraing mih Thurai dow CHAKRAMANG chowtaih</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 95:1" />Chu, CHAKRAMANG vüi a-i tek rowsi meng diah sik!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 95:1">A-i kowh lawng miia Singku Huamang vüi a-i tek awmrawm meng diah sik.<verse eid="PSA 95:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 95:2" />Chu, awmrawmma hown Thurai kim kowi a-i kowkowi diah sik,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 95:2">now meng hown aia kowi a-i kiowah diah sik.<verse eid="PSA 95:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 95:3" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow CHAKRAMANG chowtaih lang kri lang kraing mih Thurai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 95:3">akeng mih thuraiuüa luk kowi kowh lang kri mih mang dow aia chowtaih.<verse eid="PSA 95:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 95:4" />Aia dow lusa kowi kowh uowi mih maten luk kowi chang alow reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 95:4">aia dow abüpma mih arah hownia alowngma mih hungh maten luk kowi chang alow reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 95:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 95:5" />Aia dow aia thawpah mih sata luk kowi paw chang alow reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 95:5">aia thawpah mih krawng bawn luk kowi paw aia chang alow reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 95:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 95:6" />Chu, tabawk krawm se aia kowi a-i chupiiaah diah sik,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 95:6">thawp a-i miia CHAKRAMANG pur kowi tua kung se a-i tabawk diah sik.<verse eid="PSA 95:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 95:7" />A-i kowh Thurai dow aia chowtaih, a-i dow aia kowh maru chowtaih;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 95:7">aia dowm kowi kowh thingah mih ruapur hawmh iawng aia dow mingkhet a-i reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 95:7" />
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 95:7">Ani mih aia kowh laiklow sünta diah.<verse eid="PSA 95:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8-9" style="v" sid="PSA 95:8-9" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “Enni kowh saktuak dow enni kowh pipu-uüa iawng akhawtma hangkow changah diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 95:8-9">Amatni dow ang kowh lup khi khowk chowdiah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 95:8-9">Nachenganchepaw süngrüp süngkangma kowi kowh Meriba hai Masa pami arah kowi chaing ang büah khai.<verse eid="PSA 95:8-9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 95:10" />Naiawng rakowi amatni kowi dow 40 ning mowr ang kunmarauah khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 95:10">ang tek mih, ‘Naiawngün maru-uüa kowh saktuak dow angak prakowi kangowh chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 95:10">amatni dow ang kowh ana pek chün dowi chekhai,’ pakhai.<verse eid="PSA 95:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 95:11" />Naiawng rakowi kunmarauma hown takham se ang tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 95:11">‘Amatni dow ang nape tanaiah kown mih pren kowi naka kup kown nadowi,’ pape khai,” pakhai.<verse eid="PSA 95:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 95" />
  <chapter number="96" style="c" sid="PSA 96" />
  <para style="s">CHAKRAMANG vüi tek meng sar diah</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 96:1" />CHAKRAMANG vüi kowi tek meng sar büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 96:1">aw lusa kowi kowh maru maten, CHAKRAMANG vüi tek meng büa diah.<verse eid="PSA 96:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 96:2" />CHAKRAMANG vüi tek meng diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 96:2">aia ming kowi kiow diah;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 96:2">Aia lawng a-i mih satang iung dow ni towng krawi phuang büa diah.<verse eid="PSA 96:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 96:3" />Aia kowh kraingra lawnguan dow chenchapuüa tut-e krawi phuang diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 96:3">aia kowh awdara lup lawnguan dow maru maten tut-e krawi phuang diah.<verse eid="PSA 96:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 96:4" />CHAKRAMANG dow kri kraingma, aia dow ahuma kiowri kak taing chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 96:4">aia dow akeng mih thuraiuüa lak-e paw kramra lang uowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 96:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 96:5" />Akeng chenchapuüa kowh thuraiuüa dow arup krowngchow taih.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 96:5">Tawkche CHAKRAMANG dow mukuang thawp miia chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 96:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 96:6" />Aia riaret kowi dow kiowrira hai kraingra tavir lut chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 96:6">aia kowh kim chimsaima mih kowi dow kürra hai klangiungra atekma chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 96:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 96:7" />Aw chen towng chap towng maru-uüa, CHAKRAMANG kowi kiow büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 96:7">aia kowh kiowrira hai kür kowi kiow büa diah.<verse eid="PSA 96:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 96:8" />CHAKRAMANG ming dow kri kraingma pami taphuang büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 96:8">uang pawla uanap hanow aia viadawng kowi uang büa diah.<verse eid="PSA 96:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 96:9" />CHAKRAMANG kowh chimsaira dow klangiungma rakowi aia kowi chupiiaah büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 96:9">palusama kowi kowh maru-uüa low, enni mih aia pur kowi chür büa diah.<verse eid="PSA 96:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 96:10" />Chenchapuüa tut-e maiawng krawi phuang diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 96:10">“CHAKRAMANG chowtaih mang.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 96:10">Lusa dow anikma aia towah khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 96:10">Nami dow katpaw nachü kown nadowi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 96:10">Aia dow chenchap maten kowi tara nowm nachet pe kown,” pabüah diah.<verse eid="PSA 96:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 96:11" />Mukuang hai lusa dow pacham piaw lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 96:11">sata hai sata kowi kowh uowi mih maten paw pacham how sawmlawm lah,<verse eid="PSA 96:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 96:12" />dowm hai dowm kowi kowh uowi mih maten dow pacham piaw lah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 96:12">nahanow kaurawng kowi kowh singh kau maten paw awmrawmma hown natawi piaw kown,<verse eid="PSA 96:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 96:13" />amatni dow CHAKRAMANG pur kowi natek meng kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 96:13">Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia dow lusa kowi nauang chet tara kownkow uang tarü khowk;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 96:13">aia dow lusa kowi nauang chet tara nowm kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 96:13">chenchapuüa kowi dow kaah sakowmma hown aia nachet pe tara kown.<verse eid="PSA 96:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 96" />
  <chapter number="97" style="c" sid="PSA 97" />
  <para style="s">CHAKRAMANG dow akeng thuraiuüa lak-e lang kür</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 97:1" />CHAKRAMANG dow mang chekhai!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 97:1">lusa dow pacham piaw lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 97:1">süngdum maten dow pacham awmrawm lah.<verse eid="PSA 97:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 97:2" />Aia riaret kowi dow uangnim hai aiiu kangowh chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 97:2">aia kowh mang chowm rah chüng dow achinawmma hai anowmma chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 97:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 97:3" />Aia pur kowi dow maih rik mang khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 97:3">nami maih dow aia kowh ransu-uüa maten kowi kamla bowk khai.<verse eid="PSA 97:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 97:4" />Aia kowh pla nowi dow palusama kowi krawi nowi khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 97:4">nami khita hanow lusa dow kram kowh chür khai.<verse eid="PSA 97:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 97:5" />Palusama kowi kowh CHAKRAMANG pur kowi dow hungma mawngma chawr reng chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 97:5">aia pur kowi dow hungma mawngma mih iawn maih iawng chawr reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 97:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 97:6" />Mukuang dow Thurai kowh tachi tanawmra phuang reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 97:6">now chenchap maten dow aia kowh kraingra khi reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 97:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 97:7" />Arup aren kowi chup miuüa dow pacham ka rukrai reng lah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 97:7">akeng mih thuraiuüa hown chang bawri miuüa paw pacham ka rukrai reng lah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 97:7">Tawngplawng kowchow panow akeng mih thuraiuüa dow CHAKRAMANG pur kowi nauang tabawk kown.<verse eid="PSA 97:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 97:8" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, en chet tara nowm mih ta hanow</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 97:8">Zaiawn kowi kowh maru-uüa dow awmrawm khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 97:8">Juda pren kowi kowh maru-uüa dow piaw khai bowt.<verse eid="PSA 97:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 97:9" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, en dow palusama kowi kowh lang kri lang kraing mih Thurai chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 97:9">en dow akeng mih thuraiuüa maten lak-e paw lang kür chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 97:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 97:10" />CHAKRAMANG kowi sakrau miuüa dow angak kowi pacham sui lah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 97:10">Aia kowi ringkaw miuüa kowh sak dow aia towkala pe reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 97:10">now maru ngakuüa hownia dow amatni kowi aia lawngah reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 97:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 97:11" />CHAKRAMANG kowi ringkaw miuüa luk kowi dow anowi sawt reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 97:11">saktuak chinawmma miuüa dow ka piawra reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 97:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 97:12" />Aw Thurai kowi ringkaw mih maru-uüa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 97:12">CHAKRAMANG hown awmrawm büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 97:12">now aia kowh ming chimsaima mih kowi kiow büa diah.<verse eid="PSA 97:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 97" />
  <chapter number="98" style="c" sid="PSA 98" />
  <para style="s">CHAKRAMANG vüi atünma tek meng diah</para>
  <para style="d">Meng.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 98:1" />CHAKRAMANG vüi tek meng sar büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 98:1">Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia dow awdara lup ahuma chang khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 98:1">Aia dow aia kowh akürma mih rut hown uang lawng enni khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 98:1">aia kowh chimsaima mih bawng hown uang lawng enni khai.<verse eid="PSA 98:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 98:2" />CHAKRAMANG dow aia kowh lawngra lup mih maru-uüa kowi uang tüng pe khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 98:2">aia kowh nalawngla kown mih kür dow chenchapuüa kowi aia uang phuang pe khai.<verse eid="PSA 98:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 98:3" />Israeluüa vüi kowi kowh aia kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura hai kaah sakowm mih rah laiklow dow aia tuakla reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 98:3">aia maru-uüa kowi aia lawngah mih dow palusama maru khi bowk khowk chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 98:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 98:4" />Palusama maru-uüa low, CHAKRAMANG vüi apiawma tek meng büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 98:4">awmrawmma hown atünma tek rowsi meng büa diah.<verse eid="PSA 98:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 98:5" />Tep taraw se CHAKRAMANG vüi tek rowsi meng büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 98:5">taraw tün hown CHAKRAMANG vüi tek kiow meng büa diah.<verse eid="PSA 98:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 98:6" />A-i kowh mang pur kowi tum baw büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 98:6">a-i kowh CHAKRAMANG pur kowi apiawma tek meng diah.<verse eid="PSA 98:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 98:7" />Sata hai sata kowi kowh uowi mih maten dow aia kowi atünma pacham kiowah lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 98:7">lusa hai lusa kowi kowh uowi mih maten paw atünma aia kowi pacham kiowah lah.<verse eid="PSA 98:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 98:8" />Awchawng awlang maten dow phek rut se pacham awmrawm lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 98:8">hungma mawngma maten paw ahawmsang pacham tek awmrawm meng lah.<verse eid="PSA 98:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 98:9" />Amatni dow CHAKRAMANG pur kowi naiawng pacham chang lah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 98:9">Tawngplawng kowchow panow CHAKRAMANG dow lusa kowi nauang chet tara kownkow uang tarü khowk.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 98:9">Aia dow lusa kowi nachet tara nowm kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 98:9">chenchapuüa kowi dow anowmma aia nachet pe tara kown.<verse eid="PSA 98:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 98" />
  <chapter number="99" style="c" sid="PSA 99" />
  <para style="s">CHAKRAMANG a-i kowh Thurai dow chimsaima</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 99:1" />CHAKRAMANG dow mang chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 99:1">chenchap maten dow kram hown pacham chür lah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 99:1">Aia kowh mang chowm rah dow cherupuüa luk kowi chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 99:1">lusa dow pacham chü lah.<verse eid="PSA 99:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 99:2" />Zaiawn kowi kowh CHAKRAMANG dow kri kraingma chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 99:2">aia dow chenchap maten luk kowi kowh lang kri mih chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 99:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 99:3" />Chenchapuüa dow aia kowi pacham kiowah lah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 99:3">aia dow kri kraingma chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 99:3">now aia kowh ming dow ringkawma hown kramra uowima chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 99:3">Aia dow chimsaima chekhai!<verse eid="PSA 99:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 99:4" />Aw akürma mih mang, en dow anowm kowi sakrau reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 99:4">anowm kowi dow anikma en towah khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 99:4">Israel pren kowi dow anowm hai tachi tanawmra en towah khai.<verse eid="PSA 99:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 99:5" />CHAKRAMANG a-i kowh Thurai kowi kiow büa diah!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 99:5">Aia kowh mang chowm rah pur kowi tabawkah krawm se chupiiaah diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 99:5">Aia dow chimsaima chekhai!<verse eid="PSA 99:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 99:6" />Aia kowh uamowuüa pungmadawng kowi Mosi hai Arawn paw na chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 99:6">aia tut-e awr lü awr leng miuüa pungmadawng kowi Samuel paw na chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 99:6">Amatni dow CHAKRAMANG tut-e awr lü awr leng reng chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 99:6">nahanow CHAKRAMANG dow amatni kowi iu klangah reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 99:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 99:7" />Aia dow uangnim iowng chunglung mih hownia amatni kowi klangah reng chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 99:7">nahanow amatni dow aia kowh ana pek hai aia kowh rirow chün reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 99:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 99:8" />Aw CHAKRAMANG anging kowh Thurai, amatni kowi dow en klangah reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 99:8">now amatni kowh angak dow en lawtta pe reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 99:8">Tawkche amatni chang ngak khe dow en ripah reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 99:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 99:9" />CHAKRAMANG anging kowh Thurai kowi kiowah büa diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 99:9">now Jerusalem marow kowi kowh aia kowh chimsaima mih hungh kowi chupiiaah diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 99:9">Tawngplawng kowchow panow CHAKRAMANG anging kowh Thurai dow chimsaima chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 99:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 99" />
  <chapter number="100" style="c" sid="PSA 100" />
  <para style="s">A-i dow aia kowh ruapur hawmh chekhai.</para>
  <para style="d">Awmrawm meng.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 100:1" />Aw lusa kowi kowh maru maten,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 100:1">CHAKRAMANG vüi kowi apiawma tek meng büa diah.<verse eid="PSA 100:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 100:2" />Awmrawmma hown CHAKRAMANG kowi chupiia büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 100:2">awmrawm meng tekla se aia pur kowi uang büa diah.<verse eid="PSA 100:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 100:3" />CHAKRAMANG chowtaih Thurai pami tukah büa reng diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 100:3">aia chowtaih thawp a-i miia, a-i dow aiamat kowh maru chowtaih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 100:3">a-i dow aia kowh maru, aia kowh ruapur hawmh chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 100:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 100:4" />Tekla awmrawm lai se tapplawt iawng aia chup kim kowi uang kup büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 100:4">aia kowi kiowla se aia kowh viadawng kowi uang kup büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 100:4">Aia kowi tek pe awmrawm lai diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 100:4">aia kowi rowsiah diah.<verse eid="PSA 100:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 100:5" />CHAKRAMANG dow aiungma chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 100:5">aia kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura dow anikma chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 100:5">aia kowh kaah sakowm mih rah dow chowngchowng saksakma nauowi reng kown.<verse eid="PSA 100:5" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 100" />
  <chapter number="101" style="c" sid="PSA 101" />
  <para style="s">Ang dow tiama nowm kowi namang reng kown</para>
  <para style="d">Mami dow David kowh meng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 101:1" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, en vüi kowi ang natek en rowsi meng kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 101:1">en kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura hai tara nowm lawnguan kowi ang natek meng kown.<verse eid="PSA 101:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 101:2" />Tawng khe chow nauang khowng ang kownkow ang tut-e en nauang kown?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 101:2">Achinawmma nauowi kown mih prakowi ang nape ching bowt kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 101:2">now ang matia kim kowi achinawmma mih saktuak hown ang namang reng kown.<verse eid="PSA 101:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 101:3" />Suiiai kaniaima mih chap maten ang pur kowi ang natowah kown nadowi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 101:3">Maru ngakuüa changah mih lup dow ang sui khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 101:3">Nami dow katpaw ang natawi chang kown nadowi.<verse eid="PSA 101:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 101:4" />Ang sak kowi dow angak ang natowah kown nadowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 101:4">tawng iawng mih lup ngak paw ang natawi chang kown nadowi.<verse eid="PSA 101:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 101:5" />Kimping namkhetuüa kowi kukpa krawi prawngren miuüa kowi ang napiakah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 101:5">chang owrow hai chang bawri miuüa kowi dow ang nakham pe sum kown nadowi.<verse eid="PSA 101:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 101:6" />Ang kaah sakowmma mih maru-uüa kowi dow aiungma ang namüah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 101:6">nahanow amatni dow ang hown nataiua uowi kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 101:6">Ang kowh lup dow achinawmma mih maru-uüa chowtaih nachang kown.<verse eid="PSA 101:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 101:7" />Kuanlama miuüa dow ang kim kowi naka uowi kown nadowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 101:7">dailama miuüa dow ang kowh lup natawi ka chang kown nadowi.<verse eid="PSA 101:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 101:8" />Pren kowi kowh maru ngakuüa kowi dow rau towng ang napiakah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 101:8">nahanow CHAKRAMANG kowh marow kowi maru ngakuüa nauowi kown nadowi bowt.<verse eid="PSA 101:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 101" />
  <chapter number="102" style="c" sid="PSA 102" />
  <para style="s">Ang kla phih khe hangkow cham dangta ang diah</para>
  <para style="d">Mami dow kawmkrat hown uowi mih maru kowh prasi lük chekhai. Tuak kawm tuak krat khe CHAKRAMANG tut-e aia awr lü awr lengah mih chekhai.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 102:1" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, ang awr lü awr leng mih hawt sünta ang diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:1">nakala khowng kownkow ang awr kar mih klow hawt sünta ang diah.<verse eid="PSA 102:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 102:2" />Ang kla phih mih khin khe hangkow cham dangta ang diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 102:2">Ang uang lü uang leng mih kowi hawt sünta ang diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:2">ang uang haw en hown krowksang uang klang ang diah.<verse eid="PSA 102:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 102:3" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow ang kowh chownglawng dow maikhük tama mih iawng towbowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:3">now ang kowh hut paw maih kowi kam mih iawng towbowt.<verse eid="PSA 102:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 102:4" />Sat den hown kowh ngawi mih pram iawng ang kowh sak ngawi khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:4">chakkham chak khowm padow ang talawt dowi bowt chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 102:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 102:5" />Ang dow kar lai rakowi pik hai hut klen kowi tawngpaw uowi dowi bowt.<verse eid="PSA 102:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 102:6" />Ang dow süngrüp süngkangma kowi kowh bungku iawng ang phaw khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:6">apiaknama mih arah kowi kowh bungku iawng ang phaw khai bowt.<verse eid="PSA 102:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 102:7" />Tuak krat lai bowt kowh ang tamüi dowi bowt chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:7">ang dow kimluk kowi kowh auiua uowi dowi mih uakling iawng towbowt.<verse eid="PSA 102:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 102:8" />Ransu-uüa dow ni towng ni towng prawngren ang khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:8">amatni dow changla ang rensi kau hanow ang ming hown cham krawi pe piati khai.<verse eid="PSA 102:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 102:9" />Ang dow kawmkrat lai bowt kowh plawi khowm ang changla chakkham khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:9">now ang kowh mik tui khowm ang khamah mih tui kowi tawi talawk khai bowt.<verse eid="PSA 102:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 102:10" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow en kunmarau ang khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:10">Naiawng rakowi mawngchawng kuak iawng en kuak ang khai.<verse eid="PSA 102:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 102:11" />Ang kowh chownglawng dow sat kowi khe kowh klim uang takuak iawng uang kowi khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:11">ang dow sat den hown kowh pram ngawi mih iawng uang phaw khai bowt.<verse eid="PSA 102:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 102:12" />Nachenganchepaw aw CHAKRAMANG,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:12">en dow chowngchowng saksakma en mang chowm rah kowi uowi reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:12">en ming dow chowngchowng saksakma maru natuakah reng kown.<verse eid="PSA 102:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 102:13" />En dow Zaiawn marow kowi nasaksing sanaah kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:13">Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia kowi nasaksing sanaah kown mih khin dow uang na khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:13">nami khowm bowkta mih khin dow uang towm khai bowt.<verse eid="PSA 102:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 102:14" />Nami marow kowi kowh hua ün dow en naruüa tut-e asung uowima chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:14">nakowi kowh dinchow kowi khowm amatni dow saksing sanaah khai.<verse eid="PSA 102:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 102:15" />Nakhowk khe CHAKRAMANG ming ta hanow akeng chenchapuüa maten dow nakram kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:15">en kowh kraingra khi hanow lusa kowi kowh mang maten dow nakram kown.<verse eid="PSA 102:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 102:16" />CHAKRAMANG dow Zaiawn marow naplan thawpah iawk kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:16">nakowi dow aiamat kowh kraingra aia nauang plan tüngah iawk kown.<verse eid="PSA 102:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 102:17" />Aia dow ngarawng ngaraima miuüa kowh prasi lük klow nasünta pe kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:17">amatni awr lü awr lengah mih dow aia nanuata pe kown nadowi.<verse eid="PSA 102:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 102:18" />Maiawngün laiklow dow pur prakowi kowh krungchakuüa vüi pacham ruiah lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:18">nahanow kawmat kowh uang dia dowi tak miuüa paw CHAKRAMANG kowi naia rowsi kown towbowt:<verse eid="PSA 102:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19-20" style="v" sid="PSA 102:19-20" />Nar kowi takhang miuüa kowh kar klow aia nasünta pe kownkow CHAKRAMANG dow aia kowh chimsaima mih arah hownia lusa kowi uang iiu tang mü khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:19-20">kowngla mih ripra ka miuüa kowi nalawtah kownkow aia kowh chimsaima mih arah hownia lusa kowi aia uang iiu tang mü khai.<verse eid="PSA 102:19-20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21-22" style="v" sid="PSA 102:21-22" />Nahanow akeng chenchap hai prenchakuüa dow CHAKRAMANG kowi nachupiia kownkow takua talawm khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:21-22">amatni dow CHAKRAMANG kowh ming iung nang iung mih Zaiawn hungh kowi phuang khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:21-22">aia kowh rowsira laiklow dow Jerusalem marow kowi amatni phuang khai bowt.<verse eid="PSA 102:21-22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 102:23" />Aia dow ang klanguüa reng tak khe uang e ta ang kür khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:23">ang kowh chownglawng dow aia uang townta ang khai.<verse eid="PSA 102:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 102:24" />Naiawng rakowi ang tek mih, “Aw ang kowh Thurai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:24">ang klanguüa reng tak khe hauang pe kowng ang diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 102:24">En dow chowngchowng saksakma uowi reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 102:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 102:25" />“Lusa dow auown hownia en thawpah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:25">mukuang paw en rut hown kowh en thawpah mih chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 102:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 102:26" />Naiawngün dow pani mih khin khe napiak bowk kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:26">tawnguat iawng natu bowk kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 102:26">Cham le tawnguat khe kowh iawng naiawngün dow en naleah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:26">now naiawngün dow en nanuata kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 102:26">Nachenganchepaw en dow chowngchowng saksakma nauowi reng kown.<verse eid="PSA 102:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 102:27" />En dow aiawng uowi khe kowh iawng nauowi reng kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:27">en dow chowngchowng saksakma uowi mih Thurai chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 102:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 102:28" />En naruüa kowh chauüa dow thaulangma nauowi reng kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:28">amatni krungchakuüa dow en pur kowi anikma nauowi reng kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="PSA 102:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 102" />
  <chapter number="103" style="c" sid="PSA 103" />
  <para style="s">Aw ang kowh sak, CHAKRAMANG kowi rowsi diah</para>
  <para style="d">Mami dow David kowh meng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 103:1" />Aw ang kowh sak, CHAKRAMANG kowi rowsi diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:1">aw ang kowh saktuak maten, aia ming chimsaima mih kowi kiow diah.<verse eid="PSA 103:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 103:2" />Aw ang kowh sak, CHAKRAMANG kowi rowsi diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:2">aia chang en mih lup iung maten hangkow tamata diah.<verse eid="PSA 103:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 103:3" />Aia dow en kowh ngak maten lawtta en reng;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:3">en kowh rawka maten paw aia iungta en reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 103:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 103:4" />Kowngra hownia aia dow uang lawng en reng;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:4">aia kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura hai sanara dow en luk kowi uowi reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 103:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 103:5" />Aiung chap hown aia dow pe sak-ih en reng;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:5">aia dow uamu kür iawng pe en kür sar reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 103:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 103:6" />CHAKRAMANG dow anowmma mih lup chang reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:6">aia dow chang nowng miuüa kowi tara nowm chet pe reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 103:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 103:7" />CHAKRAMANG dow aia kowh sangkrangra Mosi kowi phuang pe khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:7">now aia kowh lup dow Israeluüa kowi aia tüng pe khai.<verse eid="PSA 103:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 103:8" />CHAKRAMANG dow saksing sanara atekma;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:8">aia dow kunmarau naklak dowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:8">aia kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura dow akhowk uowi dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 103:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 103:9" />Changta angak khowk miuüa kowi aia dow atungma chawk towkah dowi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:9">aia kowh kunmaraura dow chowngchowng saksakma sak kowi aia towah dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 103:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 103:10" />A-i kowh angak ripra kak taing mowr khowm aia pe a-i dowi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:10">a-i changah mih angak khowt aia ripah a-i dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 103:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 103:11" />Krawng hai mukuang mün khowt chow tala mih achur uowi dowi iawng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:11">aia kowi ringkaw miuüa luk kowi aia kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura dow kri kraingma chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 103:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 103:12" />Satlawt hai satkup mün khowt chow tala mih iawng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:12">a-i kowh angak maten paw alakma kowi aia henta a-i reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 103:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 103:13" />Chauüa kowi upa-uüa sakrauah mih iawng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:13">CHAKRAMANG paw aia kowi ringkaw miuüa kowi sakrauah reng.<verse eid="PSA 103:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 103:14" />A-i dow aiamat kowh uanh thawp pami aia tuk;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:14">dinchow klen kowi a-i dow tawngpaw nadowi pami aia sak kowi uowi reng.<verse eid="PSA 103:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 103:15" />Lusa maru kowh asak dow pram iawng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:15">Nami dow dowm kowi kowh pau iawng uang awr thar reng;<verse eid="PSA 103:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 103:16" />Pau luk kowi li uang hut hanow pau dow taklek reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:16">nahanow nami pau thar rah khowm aia kowi tukah dowi bowt chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 103:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17-18" style="v" sid="PSA 103:17-18" />Nachenganchepaw CHAKRAMANG kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura hai iungra dow maiawng mih maru luk kowi chowngchowng saksakma nauowi reng kown:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:17-18">naiawngün dow aia kowi kowh ringkaw mih, aia kowh sangbowk laitawm chün mih hai aia kowh ari arow prakowi pe ching mih maru kowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 103:17-18">Nami dow amatni chuprek chaprekuüa kowh chuprek chaprekuüa luk kowi paw nauowi reng kown.<verse eid="PSA 103:17-18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 103:19" />CHAKRAMANG dow aia kowh mang chowm rah mih mukuang kowi towah khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:19">aia dow bowkbowk luk kowi chowm mang reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 103:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 103:20" />Aw CHAKRAMANG kowh akürma mih kramamu-uüa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:20">aia laiklow chün hai aia ana pek chün miuüa low,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:20">CHAKRAMANG kowi rowsi büa diah.<verse eid="PSA 103:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 103:21" />Aia nau iawng chang mih CHAKRAMANG kowh siphai akürma miuüa low,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:21">CHAKRAMANG kowi rowsi büa diah.<verse eid="PSA 103:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 103:22" />Aw lusa kowi kowh uowi mih CHAKRAMANG kowh uanh thawp maiow,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:22">CHAKRAMANG kowi rowsi büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 103:22">Aw ang kowh sak, CHAKRAMANG kowi rowsi diah.<verse eid="PSA 103:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 103" />
  <chapter number="104" style="c" sid="PSA 104" />
  <para style="s">En dow kri kraing lai kowbow!</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 104:1" />Aw ang kowh sak, CHAKRAMANG kowi rowsiah diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:1">aw CHAKRAMANG, ang kowh Thurai, en dow kri kraing lai kowbow!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 104:1">En kowh kraingra hai ringkawra dow tawnguat iawng en khupah khai.<verse eid="PSA 104:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 104:2" />Tawnguat hown maru takhu iawng anowi hown en takhu khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:2">mukuang dow khupta tangbung hüah mih iawng en changah khai.<verse eid="PSA 104:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 104:3" />En kowh uowi rah chüng dow mukuang kowi kowh uangnim luk kowi en towah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:3">uangnim kowi dow en changla kawrnga kari hanow li hown en krawi len khai.<verse eid="PSA 104:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 104:4" />Li kowi dow en changla en kowh kramamu khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:4">lün pluplup mih maih kowi dow en changla en kowh nar khai.<verse eid="PSA 104:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 104:5" />Lusa kowi dow aia kowh akhawtma mih achüng luk kowi en towah khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:5">Naiawng rakowi nami dow katpaw nachü kown nadowi bowt.<verse eid="PSA 104:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 104:6" />Uan hown khuah mih iawng lusa dow sata tui hown en khuah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:6">now hungma mawngma kowi paw nami sata tui hown en khuah khai.<verse eid="PSA 104:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 104:7" />Nachenganchepaw en ana hown nami tui dow sut khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:7">Nami dow en kowh muk tün rakowi cham powt khai.<verse eid="PSA 104:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 104:8" />Hungma mawngma dow nami tui lak-e uang lang lowng khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:8">now lawngrawi ün paw uang lang nem khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 104:8">Naiawngün dow en khowm bowkta mih arah mowr uang towm khai.<verse eid="PSA 104:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 104:9" />Naiawng hai tui rihi dow en khowm bowkah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:9">naiawng en chang mih dow lusa naplan lim dowi kownkow chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 104:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 104:10" />Lawngrawi kowi dow tui hawr klunglung mih aw en thawpah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:10">nami tui dow lawngrawi takra iawng uang hawr khai.<verse eid="PSA 104:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 104:11" />Nami hownia kaurawng uaramchak hawmh dow ka tui khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:11">now kaurawng kowi kowh kawrngaramchük paw ka tui khai.<verse eid="PSA 104:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 104:12" />Uakling uaber hawmh dow aw pang kowi chang bai khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:12">now amatni dow singh mia towng chang klow sawmlawm khai.<verse eid="PSA 104:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 104:13" />En uowi rah hownia hungma mawngma luk kowi uang en uang pe uangah khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:13">Naiawng rakowi lusa dow en kowh prasira hown atekma chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 104:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 104:14" />Tawncher hawmh vüi kowi dow pram en awr pe awmah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:14">maru nalupah kown mih vüi kowi cha ru cha pawi en awr pe ruah khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 104:14">Naiawng en changah mih dow krawng bawn hownia maru naka chakkham kownkow chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 104:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 104:15" />Grep tui kham dow maru piaw reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:15">kanrawn sau phawk dow pik mia klangiung reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 104:15">Now chakkham hownia dow maru ka kür reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 104:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 104:16" />CHAKRAMANG thawpah mih singh kau maten dow ahuma ka uang reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:16">now Lebanawn süng kowi kowh en chowkah mih sidar singh paw ka uang reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 104:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 104:17" />Naiawngün singh mia kowi dow uaklinguüa chang bai reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:17">tuipai paw karpowng singh kowi chang bai reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 104:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 104:18" />Kaurawng rua dow alowng alowngma mih hungh kowi ün krawi uowi reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:18">ngaia hawmh dow hungh kowi kowh puk kowi tatung tanim reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 104:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 104:19" />Lama dow akhin natukla kownkow en thawpah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:19">now sat dow aia kowh kup khin khe kup reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 104:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 104:20" />En uang pawla aiiu hanow uariiu reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:20">Nakhowk khe kaurawng uaramchak maten dow krawi lenla pang reng.<verse eid="PSA 104:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 104:21" />Krangsila powrchow dow cham krawi kram chak khe hek reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:21">amatni dow Thurai tut-e awr lü chakkham reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 104:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 104:22" />Amatni dow sat lawt now amatni kowh puk kowi powt reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:22">now nakowi cham mawkla phu büah reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 104:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 104:23" />Nakhowk khe maru-uüa dow amatni kowh lup cham chang reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:23">now amatni dow sat kup pat cham chang lup reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 104:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 104:24" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, en dow achap akawm uanh en thawpah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:24">naiawngün dow en kowh chanlaira hown en thawpah mih chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 104:24">En kowh uanh thawp dow lusa kowi atekma chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 104:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 104:25" />Sata prakowi tang mü madiah! Nami dow mün khowt chow phia mih!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:25">nakowi dow aiuk asowm lenla pang mih asak uowi mih chap atekma chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 104:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 104:26" />Sata kowi dow chawnlawngün sanh khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:26">now <char style="w">Leviathan</char> paw nakowi uowi khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 104:26">Aia kowi dow nakowi ngawk kownkow en thawpah khai.<verse eid="PSA 104:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 104:27" />Akhin khe naia kala chakkham reng kownkow,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:27">naiawngün asak uowi mih chap dow en luk kowi owmsak reng.<verse eid="PSA 104:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 104:28" />En iu peah chakkham hanow amatni dow cha reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:28">en iu peah chakkham hanow amatni dow sak-ih reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 104:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 104:29" />Tawkche en petta pe lumowr hanow amatni dow kram reng.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 104:29">En pawta pe asak hanow amatni dow kowng now plan chowng dinchow reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 104:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 104:30" />En uang suang pe kawli hanow amatni dow sing reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:30">naiawng hai lusa kowi dow en peah chownglawng sar khai.<verse eid="PSA 104:30" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 104:31" />CHAKRAMANG kowh kiowrira dow chowngchowng saksakma pacham uowi lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:31">aia dow aiamat kowh uanh thawp kowi pacham awmrawm reng lah.<verse eid="PSA 104:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 104:32" />Aia che lusa prakowi iu mü hanow lusa dow chü reng;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:32">hungma mawngma kowi aia iu kak hanow nami hownia akhük uang lawt reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 104:32" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 104:33" />Chownglawng prat CHAKRAMANG vüi kowi ang natek meng kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:33">ang sing uowi mowr ang kowh Thurai vüi kowi ang natek rowsi meng kown.<verse eid="PSA 104:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 104:34" />Ang kowh tuak maten dow aia tut-e aiungma pacham phaw lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:34">ang dow CHAKRAMANG hown chowtaih napiaw reng kown.<verse eid="PSA 104:34" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 104:35" />Lusa hownia maru ngakuüa dow pacham tama lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:35">chang lup ngak miuüa pacham piak bowk lah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 104:35">Aw ang kowh sak, CHAKRAMANG kowi rowsi diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:35">CHAKRAMANG kowi kiow diah.<verse eid="PSA 104:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 104" />
  <chapter number="105" style="c" sid="PSA 105" />
  <para style="s">CHAKRAMANG kowh awdara lup maten phuang diah</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 105:1" />CHAKRAMANG tut-e tek awmrawm lai diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:1">aia kri kraing mih lawnguan phuang diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:1">now aia changah mih lup maten chen towng chap towng tut-e phuang büa diah.<verse eid="PSA 105:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 105:2" />Aia vüi kowi tek meng diah, aia kiow meng tek diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:2">aia changah mih awdara lup lawnguan maten krawi phuang büa diah.<verse eid="PSA 105:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 105:3" />Aia ming chimsaima mih kowi kiow büa diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:3">CHAKRAMANG kowi cham miuüa dow pacham piaw lah!<verse eid="PSA 105:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 105:4" />CHAKRAMANG kowi owmsak diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:4">aia kowh kür kowi owmsak diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:4">now atungma aia kowi cham diah.<verse eid="PSA 105:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5-6" style="v" sid="PSA 105:5-6" />Aw CHAKRAMANG kowh nar Abraham krungchakuüa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:5-6">aia changah mih awdara lup tuakah reng diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 105:5-6">Aw Thurai kloah mih Jakawb krungchakuüa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:5-6">aia kowh tara laiklow sak kowi towah reng diah.<verse eid="PSA 105:5-6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 105:7" />CHAKRAMANG dow a-i kowh Thurai chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:7">aia kowh ana pek dow chen towng chap towng vüi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 105:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 105:8" />Thurai kowh ana pek dow chowngchowng saksakma vüi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:8">aia dow aia kowh sangbowk laitawm mih katpaw natamata kown nadowi.<verse eid="PSA 105:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 105:9" />Nami sangbowk laitawm dow Abraham hown kowh aia tatowah mih chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:9">Isak tut-e kowh aia khamah mih sangbowk laitawm paw nami chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 105:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 105:10" />CHAKRAMANG dow Jakawb hown tatow sangbowk laitawm khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:10">nami sangbowk laitawm dow Israeluüa tut-e chowngchowng saksakma vüi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 105:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 105:11" />Aia tek mih, “Ang nape en Kanan pren kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:11">Nami dow en kowh dawngthawnguan naown kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="PSA 105:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 105:12" />Nami khin khe a-i kowh pipu-uüa dow maru iun a-echow chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:12">Nakhowk khe amatni dow Kanan pren kowi prenlang maru chowreng tak.<verse eid="PSA 105:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 105:13" />Amatni dow pachen süng hownia akeng mih chen süng kowi cham lenla pang khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:13">papren hownia akeng mih pren kowi cham mangla pang khai.<verse eid="PSA 105:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 105:14" />Nachenganchepaw amatni luk kowi dow mia iawng mih kowi paw aia pe changah nowng dowi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:14">amatni kowi nalawngah kownkow manguüa kowi Thurai hangah reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 105:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 105:15" />Aia tek pe mih, “Ang lang kloah mih maru-uüa kowi enni naia kak kown nadowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:15">ang kowh risiuüa kowi paw enni naia piak kown nadowi,” pakhai.<verse eid="PSA 105:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 105:16" />Nami kung kowi aia dow amatni pren kowi uang pawla pe khown khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:16">nahanow amatni dow khawr chakkham khai.<verse eid="PSA 105:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 105:17" />Tawkche aia dow atainau-uüa dowi rawn Aigupta pren kowi Josef kowi kowchinah khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:17">Josef kowi dow atainau-uüa mih nar iawng hai sumah khai.<verse eid="PSA 105:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 105:18" />Aia kowh khawk kowi dow lawngha leng hown tawmah büah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:18">now aia ngawng kowi dow lawngha leng kuar krua pe büah khai.<verse eid="PSA 105:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 105:19" />CHAKRAMANG dow Josef lawnguan aia tekah mih laiklow uang tachi dowi mowr,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:19">aia dow Josef kowh chowm krang uowi krang chaingah khai.<verse eid="PSA 105:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 105:20" />Aigupta pren mang kowh ana pek hown Josef kowi tawmla mih lawngha leng dow latta pe khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:20">now pren kruitown mih dow thawngrum hownia aia kowi lawtta khai.<verse eid="PSA 105:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 105:21" />Mang dow Josef kowi mang kim mingkhet mih towah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:21">now mang kowh dawngthawnguan mingkhet mih aia towah khai,<verse eid="PSA 105:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 105:22" />tawngplawng kowchow panow Josef nau iawng maru iukuüa kowi naia kruitownla kownkow chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:22">now lawngtang aluchowuüa kowi paw aia naia pela prengia kownkow chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 105:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 105:23" />Nami kung kowi dow Israel mih Aigupta pren kowi kowkowi khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:23">Jakawb dow Ham pren kowi prenlang maru iawng kowuowi sangrum khai.<verse eid="PSA 105:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 105:24" />CHAKRAMANG dow aia maru-uüa kowi akawmma changah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:24">now ransu-uüa lak-e amatni kowi dow akürma aia changah khai.<verse eid="PSA 105:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 105:25" />Aia dow aia maru-uüa kowi suiah kown mih saktuak ransu-uüa kowi chang pe khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:25">nahanow ransu-uüa dow aia kowh maru-uüa kowi kuanah khai.<verse eid="PSA 105:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 105:26" />CHAKRAMANG dow aia maru-uüa kowi nalawngah kownkow Mosi kowi Aigupta pren kowi uang chinah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:26">now aia lang kloah mih Arawn kowi paw aia uang chinah khai.<verse eid="PSA 105:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 105:27" />Amatchi dow Aigupta pren kowi CHAKRAMANG kowh amatra lup maiow tüng iüah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:27">Ham<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">105:27 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ham </char><char style="ft" closed="false">pami dow Aigupta pren kowh ming uowi lowk tak mih chekhai.</char></note> prenchakuüa pungmadawng kowi aia kowh awdara lup maiow tüng iüah khai.<verse eid="PSA 105:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 105:28" />CHAKRAMANG dow Aigupta pren kowi uang chin pe aiiu khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:28">amatni dow aia kowh laiklow sünta kown nau dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 105:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 105:29" />Aia dow Aigupta pren kowi kowh tui maten vi kangowh changta pe khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:29">nahanow nakowi kowh dam maten dow kowng bowk khai.<verse eid="PSA 105:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 105:30" />Amatni pren kowi dow pur kawm chetla prung khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:30">naiawngün pur dow mang kim kowi pat kowkrawi kup khai.<verse eid="PSA 105:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 105:31" />Aia pe ana hanow ving kawm dow uang ting khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:31">now pren kowi dow changpauma kangowh chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 105:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 105:32" />Amatni luk kowi dow uang takcha kowi ria aia uang pe klaah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:32">now paprenma kowi dow pla nowi pluplup khai.<verse eid="PSA 105:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 105:33" />Amatni kowh grep ruih hai uidut singh dow aia piakta pe khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:33">now pren kowi kowh singh kau maten paw aia uang piakta pe khai.<verse eid="PSA 105:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 105:34" />Aia pe ana hanow plawng hawmh dow akawmma uang khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:34">now tuiselengkeng nammow paw nowngia rüaah dowi mowr uang khai.<verse eid="PSA 105:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 105:35" />Naiawngün dow pren kowi kowh singh kau maten krawi kremta bowk khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:35">now üa hai laih kowi kowh luprak maten paw krawi kremta bowk khai.<verse eid="PSA 105:35" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 105:36" />Nami kung kowi dow Aigupta prenchakuüa kowh chapa ta maten aia kowngta pe bowk khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:36">aia dow pren kowi kowh kachakuüa chah ta maten saita pe bowk khai.<verse eid="PSA 105:36" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 105:37" />Aia dow Israeluüa kowi mih kuh hai tai hailawm nami pren hownia uang lawtla khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:37">amatni krungchakuüa pungmadawng kowi amiapaw kür uowi dowi kowh tawi ia mang dowi mih uowi dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 105:37" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 105:38" />Israeluüa powt mih khi hanow Aiguptauüa dow lainowmma awmrawm khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:38">Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni dow Israeluüa kowi kram khai.<verse eid="PSA 105:38" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 105:39" />Aia dow Israeluüa kowi natungah kownkow uang phat pe uangnim khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:39">now iak-e khe dow napeah nowi kownkow uang peah maih khai.<verse eid="PSA 105:39" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 105:40" />Israeluüa lü chakkham khe aia uang chin pe uamuk khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:40">mukuang hownia kowh kawmpah hown amatni kowh sakkraira dow aia rim pe khai.<verse eid="PSA 105:40" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 105:41" />Aia dow huaklu pe talakah phak hanow tui uang pe lawt khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:41">süngrüp süngkangma kowi nami tui dow aw tui iawng hawr dawilawi khai.<verse eid="PSA 105:41" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 105:42" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia dow aia kowh chimsaima mih laikham ka tuak khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:42">aia nar Abraham tut-e kowh aia takhamta mih laiklow dow aia ka tuak khai.<verse eid="PSA 105:42" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 105:43" />Thurai dow aia lang kloah mih maru-uüa kowi Aigupta pren hownia uang lawtla khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:43">amatni kowi dow apiaw apama hown tekla meng se aia uang lawtla khai.<verse eid="PSA 105:43" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="PSA 105:44" />Akeng chenchapuüa kowh pren dow Israeluüa kowi aia peah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:44">now akeng chenchapuüa kawmah mih luprak dow aia maru-uüa kowi aia peah khai.<verse eid="PSA 105:44" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="PSA 105:45" />Naiawng aia changah mih dow aia kowh ari arow nachün büah kownkow chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:45">now aia kowh ari aiang paw nachün büah kownkow chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 105:45">CHAKRAMANG kowi kiow büa diah.<verse eid="PSA 105:45" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 105" />
  <chapter number="106" style="c" sid="PSA 106" />
  <para style="s">CHAKRAMANG kowh sakraura dow achur uowi dowi</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 106:1" />CHAKRAMANG kowi kiow büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:1">CHAKRAMANG kowi tek awmrawm lai büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 106:1">Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia dow aiungma chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:1">aia kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura dow chowngchowng saksakma anikma chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 106:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 106:2" />CHAKRAMANG kowh kri kraingra lup amia chow nowng tek?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:2">Aia kala kiowrira mih lup amia chow nowng tek?<verse eid="PSA 106:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 106:3" />Thurai kowh ana pek chün miuüa dow prasira uowima chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:3">now chang lup iung miuüa paw prasira uowima chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 106:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 106:4" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, en maru-uüa kowi en saksing sanaah mih khin khe hangkow tamata ang diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:4">amatni kowi en lawngah mih khin khe ang kowi paw khowngla ang diah.<verse eid="PSA 106:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 106:5" />Nahanow en lang kloah miuüa kowh iungra dow ang natawi khi kown towbowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:5">en chenchapuüa piaw mih khin khe ang paw natawi ka piaw kown towbowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:5">now en changla dawngthawnguan mih maru-uüa kiow en khe ang paw tawi ka kiow en kown towbowt.<verse eid="PSA 106:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 106:6" />Anging pipu-uüa iawng anging paw chang angak khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:6">anging chang lup ngak khai, now angakma anging chowm uowi khai.<verse eid="PSA 106:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 106:7" />Anging kowh pipu-uüa dow Aigupta pren kowi en kowh awdara lup khi khowk chepaw tuk büah dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:7">en kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura laiklow paw sak kowi towah büah dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 106:7">Amatni dow Sata Rik pang kowi kingküa en khai.<verse eid="PSA 106:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 106:8" />Nachenganchepaw aia kowh ming iung nang iung natownla kownkow amatni kowi aia lawngah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:8">aia kowh kri kraingma mih kür tüng pe kownkow amatni kowi aia lawngah khai.<verse eid="PSA 106:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 106:9" />Aia kowh ana pek hown sata Rik dow uang kang khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:9">süngrüp süngkangma kowi mang khe kowh iawng</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:9">abüpma mih sata iawng amatni kowi aia pawla khai.<verse eid="PSA 106:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 106:10" />Suiah miuüa hownia amatni kowi dow aia takhula khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:10">ransu-uüa rut hownia amatni kowi dow aia lawngah khai.<verse eid="PSA 106:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 106:11" />Amatni kowh ransu-uüa dow nami sata tui kowi tamir bowk khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:11">amatni dow lowk iachow paw nowngia plai büah dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 106:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 106:12" />Nami kung kowi dow amatni mih CHAKRAMANG kowh laiklow owm büah khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:12">now aia kiow müa meng tek büah khai bowt.<verse eid="PSA 106:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 106:13" />Nachenganchepaw amatni dow aia changah mih lup alenma tamata khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:13">aia nauang pe prengia iung kown mih kowi khowm nowng chawng büah dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 106:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 106:14" />Amatni dow süngrüp süngkangma kowi chakkham sakkrai khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:14">Naiawng rakowi amatni dow Thurai kowi aplan plan chawk lai khai.<verse eid="PSA 106:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 106:15" />Amatni lü mih srui aia dow iu peah khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:15">Tawkche amatni kow kowi dow kramra uowi mih rawka paw aia uang chin pe khai.<verse eid="PSA 106:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 106:16" />Tangbung kowi amatni uowi mih khin khe amatni dow Mosi kowi irsiah büa khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:16">now CHAKRAMANG vüi kowi lang kloah mih uamow Arawn kowi paw irsiah büa khai.<verse eid="PSA 106:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 106:17" />Krawng dow awr talak phak hanow Dathan kowi iawnta khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:17">now Abiram kowh thumchakuüa kowi paw kowpta rap khai.<verse eid="PSA 106:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 106:18" />Amatni thumchakuüa pungmadawng kowi Thurai dow uang chin pe maih khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:18">nami maih dow maru ngakuüa kowi kamta bowk khai.<verse eid="PSA 106:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 106:19" />Israel krungchak aluchowuüa dow Sinai hungh kowi thawp chia chah rup lowk khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:19">now amatni dow nami sowah mih arup kowi chupiia büah khai.<verse eid="PSA 106:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 106:20" />Amatni dow kiowrira uowima mih Thurai kowi nuata khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:20">now cha pram mih chia rup kowi cham chupiia büah khai.<verse eid="PSA 106:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 106:21" />Amatni dow amatni kowh lawng miia Thurai kowi tamata büah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:21">Aigupta pren kowi awdara uowima mih lup chang mih Thurai kowi tamata büa khai.<verse eid="PSA 106:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 106:22" />Ham pren kowi kowh aia changah mih awdara lup dow tamata büah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:22">sata Rik pang kowi kowh aia changah mih kramra uowima mih lup maten paw tamata büah khai.<verse eid="PSA 106:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 106:23" />Naiawng rakowi Thurai dow amatni kowi napiakah kown pahai tek khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:23">nachenganchepaw aia lang kloah mih maru Mosi dow aia pur kowi hawt tahan khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:23">Nami dow amatni kowi piakah kown mih Thurai kowh kunmarau narimta pe kownkow chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 106:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 106:24" />Nami kung kowi amatni dow klangiungma mih Kanan pren kowi nakup kown nau dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:24">Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni dow CHAKRAMANG laiklow owm dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 106:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 106:25" />Amatni dow tangbung lak kowi CHAKRAMANG kowi kingküala mih laiklow tek büah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:25">CHAKRAMANG laiklow prakowi dow pe ching büah dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 106:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 106:26" />Naiawng rakowi aia dow kunmarau kowh amatni kowi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:26">süngrüp süngkangma kowi nakowngta kown mih takham khai.<verse eid="PSA 106:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 106:27" />Nami klen kowi amatni krungchakuüa kowi mih akeng chenchapuüa pungmadawng kowi nape kowngah kown mih takham khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:27">pren towng nam towng kowi nauetah plawt kown mih paw aia dow takham khai.<verse eid="PSA 106:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 106:28" />Nami kung kowi Israeluüa dow Peor hungh kowi kowh Baal thurai kowi cham chupiia büah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:28">now kowng miuüa vüi kowi kowh phuchuaah mih ngar paw cham tawi cha büah khai.<verse eid="PSA 106:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 106:29" />Naiawngün lup ngak hown amatni dow CHAKRAMANG kowi towkah kunmarau khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:29">Naiawng rakowi CHAKRAMANG dow amatni pungmadawng kowi uang chin pe makowng hawi khai.<verse eid="PSA 106:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 106:30" />Nakhowk khe uamow Pinehas dow awr rü hanow amatni kowi ripah khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:30">nahanow makowng hawi dow taing khai.<verse eid="PSA 106:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 106:31" />Naiawng chang rakowi Thurai dow Pinehas kowi achinawmma pahai dowkah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:31">aia kowi dow chowngchowng saksakma achinawmma pahai dowkah khai.<verse eid="PSA 106:31" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 106:32" />Meriba tuikuam re-e amatni dow Thurai kowi towkah kunmarau khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:32">naiawng amatni chang rakowi Mosi dow tauowk khai.<verse eid="PSA 106:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 106:33" />Amatni dow Mosi kowi towkah kunmarau khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:33">Naiawng rakowi atek iung dowi mih laiklow pat aia tekta khai.<verse eid="PSA 106:33" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 106:34" />Amatni dow Thurai kowh ana pek chün dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:34">Thurai pe piakah mih chenchapuüa kowi piakah büah dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 106:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 106:35" />Naiawng nachang lak dow amatni dow kowbüah hown tawi taiua khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:35">now amatni chowm krang uowi krang iawng tawi uowi büah khai.<verse eid="PSA 106:35" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 106:36" />Israeluüa dow amatni kowh arup aren kowi cham tawi chupiia khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:36">naiawngün dow amatni vüi takhuowk müa leng iawng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 106:36" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 106:37" />Amatni dow amatni kowh chapauüa kowi lümla ngakuüa vüi kowi changla phuchua khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:37">now amatni kowh chamauüa kowi paw lümla ngakuüa vüi kowi changla phuchua büa khai.<verse eid="PSA 106:37" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 106:38" />Amatni dow angak uowi dowi mih amatni kowh chauüa kowi saiah khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:38">amatni kowh chauüa kowi dow Kanan pren kowi kowh arup aren vüi changla phuchua müa khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 106:38">Nahanow Kanan pren dow naiawngün vi hown tasür talawk khai.<verse eid="PSA 106:38" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 106:39" />Amatni dow amatni kowh lup rakowi asür alawkma phaw büah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:39">amatni dow arup aren kowi sakrau mih hown CHAKRAMANG kowi kuanah khai.<verse eid="PSA 106:39" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 106:40" />Naiawng rakowi CHAKRAMANG dow aia maru-uüa luk kowi kunmarau lün pluplup khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:40">aia changla dawngthawnguan mih aia kowh maru-uüa kowi dow aia suiah khai.<verse eid="PSA 106:40" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 106:41" />Amatni kowi dow akeng chenchapuüa rut kowi aia ap-ah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:41">amatni kowi suiah miuüa dow amatni kowi kruitownah khai.<verse eid="PSA 106:41" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 106:42" />Amatni kowh ransu-uüa dow amatni kowi changah anowng apowng khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:42">now amatni dow ransu-uüa nimkrüa kowi uowi khai.<verse eid="PSA 106:42" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 106:43" />Amatni kowi dow Thurai mih plan plan lawngah khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:43">Nachenganchepaw amatni dow aia kowi kingküaah khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 106:43">Amatni kowh angak rakowi amatni dow piak khai.<verse eid="PSA 106:43" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="PSA 106:44" />Nachenganchepaw amatni awr kar mih khin khe aia sünta pe reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:44">now amatni krat pusara prakowi dow aia iu tang müah reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 106:44" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="PSA 106:45" />Amatni hown kowh aia tatowah mih sangbowk laitawm dow aia ka tuak khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:45">now aia kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura hown amatni kowi dow aia saksing sanaah khai.<verse eid="PSA 106:45" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="PSA 106:46" />Israeluüa kowi kowh khümla miuüa kowi dow Thurai leta pe saktuak khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:46">amatni kowi dow Israeluüa kowi saksing sanaah kown mih saktuak aia peah khai.<verse eid="PSA 106:46" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="PSA 106:47" />Aw CHAKRAMANG anging kowh Thurai, uang lawng anging diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:47">akeng chenchap hownia kua anging hanow arasang tow anging diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 106:47">Nahanow en ming chimsaima mih vüi kowi anging natek awmrawm lai kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:47">now apiawma hown anging natek en rowsi meng kown.<verse eid="PSA 106:47" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="PSA 106:48" />CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh Thurai dow akiow pauowi lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:48">aia dow achük alai hownia chowngchowng saksakma akiow pauowi reng lah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 106:48">Maru kawmuüa dow “Amen!” pahai pacham tek büah lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:48">CHAKRAMANG kowi kiow büa diah.<verse eid="PSA 106:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 106" />
  <chapter number="107" style="c" sid="PSA 107" />
  <para style="ms">BOWIH 5</para>
  <para style="mr">(<ref loc="PSA 107-150">Meng Lai 107-150</ref>)</para>
  <para style="s">CHAKRAMANG dow aia maru-uüa tut-e aiungma</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 107:1" />CHAKRAMANG kowi tek pe awmrawm lai büa diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:1">tawngplawng kowchow panow aia dow aiungma chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:1">aia kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura dow chowngchowng saksakma anikma chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 107:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 107:2" />CHAKRAMANG lawngah mih maru-uüa dow naiawngün laiklow pacham tek lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:2">amatni kowi dow ransu-uüa rut hownia aia lawngah khai.<verse eid="PSA 107:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 107:3" />Amatni kowi dow prenlang hownia arasang aia uang pawla khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:3">satlawt hai satkup, tawngphak hai mrawkphak hownia aia uang pawla khai.<verse eid="PSA 107:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 107:4" />Amatni pungmadawng kowi maru sangrum dow süngrüp süngkangma kowi krawi lenla pang khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:4">Nachenganchepaw amatni nauowiah kown mih marow dow krawi ka cham büah dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 107:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 107:5" />Amatni dow hawm sakkrai hai tui sakkrai hown kawm büah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:5">amatni dow sakkrai lai bowt kowh kow uakma phaw khai bowt.<verse eid="PSA 107:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 107:6" />Kla phih hanow amatni dow CHAKRAMANG tut-e awr kar khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:6">now amatni kratra hownia CHAKRAMANG dow uang lawngah khai.<verse eid="PSA 107:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 107:7" />Amatni kowi dow tiama tengma mih iawng aia pawla khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:7">amatni uowiah kown mih marow kowi aia pawla khai.<verse eid="PSA 107:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 107:8" />Maru vüi CHAKRAMANG changah mih awdara lup rakowi maru pacham tek pe awmrawm lai lah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:8">aia kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura rakowi maru pacham tek pe awmrawm lai lah.<verse eid="PSA 107:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 107:9" />Tui sakkrai miuüa kowi dow du pat aia pe khamah tui reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:9">now hawm sakkrai miuüa kowi dow chakkham iung hown aia pe duah reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 107:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 107:10" />Maru sangrum dow aiiuma mih arah kowi uowi khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:10">amatni dow lawngha leng hown tatawm hüah chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:10">now amatni dow tuak kawm tuak krat hown uowi khai.<verse eid="PSA 107:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 107:11" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni dow CHAKRAMANG laiklow kowi kingküa büah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:11">lang kri lang kraing mih Thurai kowh prengia iung laiklow sui büah khai.<verse eid="PSA 107:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 107:12" />Naiawng rakowi aia dow kawmkrat hown amatni kowh bawrira mih piakta pe khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:12">amatni piak mih khin khe amatni kowi amiapaw khowngah dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 107:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 107:13" />Kla phih hanow amatni dow CHAKRAMANG tut-e awr kar khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:13">now amatni kratra hownia CHAKRAMANG dow uang towkala khai.<verse eid="PSA 107:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 107:14" />Aiiu iawng mih kratra hownia amatni kowi aia uang lawtla khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:14">amatni kowi tawmla mih leng dow aia raita pe khai.<verse eid="PSA 107:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 107:15" />Maru vüi CHAKRAMANG changah mih awdara lup rakowi maru pacham tek pe awmrawm lai lah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:15">aia kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura rakowi maru pacham tek pe awmrawm lai lah.<verse eid="PSA 107:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 107:16" />Aia dow thawngrum kowi kowh kri tapplawt mih piakta pe khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:16">now tapplawt klia müa lawngha dung paw aia klowkta pe khai.<verse eid="PSA 107:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 107:17" />Abualama miuüa dow Thurai kowi kingküa rakowi kawm khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:17">now amatni dow amatni chang ngak rakowi kawm khai.<verse eid="PSA 107:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 107:18" />Amatni dow kawm lai bowt kowh chakkham khowm daw büah dowi bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:18">now makowng kimplawt re-e uang towm büah khai bowt.<verse eid="PSA 107:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 107:19" />Kla phih hanow amatni dow CHAKRAMANG tut-e awr kar khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:19">now amatni kratra hownia CHAKRAMANG dow uang towkala khai.<verse eid="PSA 107:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 107:20" />Aia kowh laiklow hown amatni kowi dow aia iungah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:20">now amatni kowi dow kowngra hownia aia lawngah khai.<verse eid="PSA 107:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 107:21" />Maru vüi CHAKRAMANG changah mih awdara lup rakowi maru pacham tek pe awmrawm lai lah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:21">aia kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura rakowi maru pacham tek pe awmrawm lai lah.<verse eid="PSA 107:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 107:22" />Amatni dow tekla awmrawm lai kown mih uanap pacham chang büah lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:22">aia changah mih lup lawnguan maten dow awmrawm meng hown pacham tek büah lah.<verse eid="PSA 107:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 107:23" />Tawngbak mih maru dow chawnlawng hown sata kowi krawi kowi reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:23">now amatni dow sata kowi chang kun reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 107:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 107:24" />Naiawngün maru-uüa dow CHAKRAMANG kowh awdara lup khi reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:24">amatni dow sata kowi kowh liku uangchak dawng kowi ün aia kowh awdara lup khi reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 107:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 107:25" />Aia kowh ana pek hown uangchak mang uang khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:25">nahanow sata tui mih awr talowng phunglung khai.<verse eid="PSA 107:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 107:26" />Nami tuilowng hown chawnlawng mih mukuang kowi pat awr tapowng khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:26">now sata phai mowr pat iu plan dowh khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 107:26">Naiawng rakowi chawnlawng kowi kowh lup chang miuüa dow lainowmma takrow khai.<verse eid="PSA 107:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 107:27" />Amatni dow pua mih iawng tim bawilawi khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:27">now tawng chow nachang kown mih tuk büah dowi bowt chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 107:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 107:28" />Kla phih hanow amatni dow CHAKRAMANG tut-e awr kar khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:28">now amatni kratra hownia CHAKRAMANG dow uang lawngah khai.<verse eid="PSA 107:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 107:29" />Aia dow uang taingta pe liku uangchak khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:29">nahanow sata tuilowng dow uang rim khai bowt.<verse eid="PSA 107:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 107:30" />Sata tui uang rim hanow amatni dow awmrawm khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:30">now amatni kowiah kown mih chawnlawng naira kowi dow aia pawla khai bowt.<verse eid="PSA 107:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 107:31" />Maru vüi CHAKRAMANG changah mih awdara lup rakowi maru pacham tek pe awmrawm lai lah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:31">aia kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura rakowi maru pacham tek pe awmrawm lai lah.<verse eid="PSA 107:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 107:32" />Amatni dow takua talawmra kowi aia kowi pacham kiowah lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:32">lawngtang aluchowuüa takua talawmra kowi aia kowi pacham rowsiah lah.<verse eid="PSA 107:32" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 107:33" />Aia dow aw kowi ün süngrüp süngkangma iawng changah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:33">now tui kla sawmlawm mih awchawng kowi ün kangkhawngma mih krawng aia changah khai.<verse eid="PSA 107:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 107:34" />Aia dow asi uowi mih krawng kowi asi uowi dowi iawng changah khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:34">Tawngplawng kowchow panow nakowi kowh uowi miuüa chang ngak rakowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 107:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 107:35" />Süngrüp süngkangma kowi dow kanh aia changah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:35">now kangkhawngma mih krawng kowi dow tui kla sawmlawm mih aw iawng aia changah khai.<verse eid="PSA 107:35" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 107:36" />Sakkrai miuüa kowi dow nami pren kowi aia pe uowiah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:36">now amatni dow nakowi thawp marow khai.<verse eid="PSA 107:36" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 107:37" />Amatni dow lai kowi sawt aliu khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:37">now grep ruih paw chowk büah khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 107:37">Nahanow amatni dow luprak ahuma ka büah khai.<verse eid="PSA 107:37" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 107:38" />Aia dow amatni kowi peah prasi khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:38">amatni kowh maru iun dow uang kawm khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:38">now amatni kowh tawncher paw uang hu khai.<verse eid="PSA 107:38" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 107:39" />Nachenganchepaw Thurai maru-uüa dow nowng changra,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:39">phih hai tuak kratra hown maru iun uang plan e khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 107:39">Nahanow amatni kowh chownglawng dow uang nga khai.<verse eid="PSA 107:39" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 107:40" />Amatni kowi changah nowng miuüa kowi dow CHAKRAMANG peah rukrai khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:40">amatni kowi dow tiama uowi dowi mih süngrüp süngkangma kowi aia pe mangah khai.<verse eid="PSA 107:40" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 107:41" />Tawkche ngarawng ngarai miuüa kowi dow krat pusara hownia aia lawngah reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:41">amatni kowi dow ruapur hawmh prung iawng aia pe prungah reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 107:41" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 107:42" />Thurai kowi ringkaw miuüa dow naiawngün khi hanow awmrawm khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:42">Tawkche maru ngakuüa dow ka laira dowi bowt chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 107:42" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 107:43" />Chanlaima mih maru dow naiawngün lawnguan kowi pacham pe ching reng lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:43">now CHAKRAMANG kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura lawnguan kowi pacham paw tuak büah reng lah.<verse eid="PSA 107:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 107" />
  <chapter number="108" style="c" sid="PSA 108" />
  <para style="s">Thurai kowh khowngra hownia anging naawng kown</para>
  <para style="d">Mami dow David kowh meng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 108:1" />Aw Thurai, en luk kowi ang kowh owmra akhawtma chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 108:1">ang kowh sak maiow hown tek meng se ang nakiow en kown.<verse eid="PSA 108:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 108:2" />Ang dow nathowr bowt kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 108:2">sat lawt dowi rawn ang narü bowt kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 108:2">now tingteng hai taraw ang natep kown.<verse eid="PSA 108:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 108:3" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, chenchapuüa pur kowi ang natek en awmrawm lai kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 108:3">amatni pur kowi meng hown ang nakiow en kown.<verse eid="PSA 108:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 108:4" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow en kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura dow lainowmma hu khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 108:4">nami dow hu krang mukuang kowi tawk prang chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 108:4">Now en kowh kaah sakowm mih paw hu krang uangnim kowi tawk prang chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 108:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 108:5" />Aw Thurai, en kowh kri kraingra dow mukuang kowi pacham tatüng lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 108:5">palusama kowi dow en kowh kraingra pacham tatüng lah.<verse eid="PSA 108:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 108:6" />En kowh kür hown uang lawng anging diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 108:6">anging awr lüah mih kowi iu klang anging diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 108:6">Nahanow en sakrauah mih en kowh maru-uüa dow naka lawngra kown towbowt.<verse eid="PSA 108:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 108:7" />Thurai dow aia kowh chimsaima mih ming hown takham se tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 108:7">“Awng kowh apiawma hown Sekem marow dow ang naretah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 108:7">Sukawt Lawngrawi dow ang kowh maru-uüa kowi ang naret pe kown.<verse eid="PSA 108:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 108:8" />Gilead dow ang kowh, Manase paw ang kowh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 108:8">Efraim dow ang kowh tasen müa lukruk iawng,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 108:8">Juda dow ang kowh mang raitua iawng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 108:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 108:9" />Nachenganchepaw Moab pren kowi dow ang kowh khawk sau müa biatum iawng ang nachangah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 108:9">Edawm pren kowi dow ang kowh phanaikhawk hown ang nakuakah kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 108:9">Now Filistin pren nowng senta rakowi ang dow nahek kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="PSA 108:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 108:10" />Nami khikhawtma mih Edawm pren kowi kowh marow kri kowi mia chow kowpawla ang kown?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 108:10">Edawm pren kowi mangla kown mih tiama mia chow natüng ang kown?<verse eid="PSA 108:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 108:11" />Aw Thurai, en nuata anging khai bowt bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 108:11">Anging kowh siphaiuüa hown en tawi tarü tasen dowi bowt bow?<verse eid="PSA 108:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 108:12" />Aw Thurai, ransu-uüa kowi nakingküa kown mih tawi khowng anging diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 108:12">lusa maru uang tawi khowng mih taih now tawngpaw asung uowi dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 108:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 108:13" />En tawi khowng anging rakowi anging naawng kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 108:13">en dow anging kowh ransu-uüa kowi napiakah kown.<verse eid="PSA 108:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 108" />
  <chapter number="109" style="c" sid="PSA 109" />
  <para style="s">Aw CHAKRAMANG, ririmma hang uowi diah</para>
  <para style="d">Mami dow David kowh meng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 109:1" />Aw Thurai, ang dow kiow en reng chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:1">naiawng rakowi ririmma hang uowi diah.<verse eid="PSA 109:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 109:2" />Maru ngakuüa dow ang lawnguan kowi tek dai lai khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:2">amatni dow ang lawnguan kowi küa dai khai.<verse eid="PSA 109:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 109:3" />Amatni dow suiiai kaniaima mih laiklow hing tekta ang hüah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:3">alow akan uowi dowi matchang amatni dow kingküa ang khai.<verse eid="PSA 109:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 109:4" />Ang sakrauah chepaw amatni dow changla ang ransu khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:4">Tawkche amatni vüi kowi dow ang chupla pe Thurai reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 109:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 109:5" />Ang changah iung chepaw amatni dow chang ang ngak khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:5">ang sakrauah chepaw amatni dow sui ang khai.<verse eid="PSA 109:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 109:6" />Naiawng rakowi amatni luk kowi angakma mih tara chet mih uang tow pe lowk diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:6">now nami tara chet mih dow amatni kowh ngak pacham tüng pe lah.<verse eid="PSA 109:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 109:7" />Amatni kowi dow tara chetra kowi pacham dowk pe angak lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:7">amatni kowh Thurai chup paw angak pahai pacham dowk pe lah.<verse eid="PSA 109:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 109:8" />Amatni kowh chownglawng dow pacham town lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:8">amatni kowh aiukma mih arah dow maru pacham khünta pe lah.<verse eid="PSA 109:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 109:9" />Amatni kowh chauüa dow hang pacham ka pa lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:9">amatni kowh masi hawmh paw pacham chowng mamaimow lah.<verse eid="PSA 109:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 109:10" />Amatni kowh chauüa dow tiama rawng towng pacham krawi lü lu lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:10">now amatni kowh piaknama mih kim hownia alakma kowi pacham krawi kram chakkham lah.<verse eid="PSA 109:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 109:11" />Pe lowi miuüa dow amatni kowh uowi mih maten pacham pawla pe bowk lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:11">amatni kowh kawm rak dow akeng maru-uüa pacham pawla pe bowk lah.<verse eid="PSA 109:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 109:12" />Amatni kowi saksing sanaah kown mih maru hang pacham uowi lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:12">amatni kowh <char style="w">saratchow</char> chauüa kowi amiapaw hang pacham sanaah lah.<verse eid="PSA 109:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 109:13" />Amatni kowh krungchakuüa kowi pacham kowngta bowk lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:13">amatni kowh krungchakuüa ming dow maru pacham tamata bowk lah.<verse eid="PSA 109:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 109:14" />Amatni pipu-uüa kowh angak dow CHAKRAMANG sak kowi pacham uowi reng lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:14">amatni u-uüa kowh angak paw aia hangkow pacham tamata lah.<verse eid="PSA 109:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 109:15" />Naiawngün angak dow CHAKRAMANG mih sak kowi pacham towah reng lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:15">nahanow lusa hownia amatni kowh ming dow natama kown towbowt.<verse eid="PSA 109:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 109:16" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni dow maru kowi saksing sana dowi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:16">amatni dow maru kowi nasaksing sana kown mih katpaw tuak dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 109:16">natuak lak dow tuak kawm tuak krat mih, ngaraima mih hai sak piak miuüa kowi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:16">nakowngta kownkow changah nowng büah khai.<verse eid="PSA 109:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 109:17" />Amatni dow maru kowi nape piati kown mih lang nau khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:17">Naiawng rakowi nami piati dow amatni luk kowi uang kla khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 109:17">Amatni dow maru kowi nape prasi kown mih nau dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:17">Naiawng rakowi amatni dow ka prasi dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 109:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 109:18" />Amatni kowh piati pek kiang dow tawnguat khup iawng hing tekta hüah chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:18">nami kiang dow tui kham iawng towbowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:18">now kow kowi phawk sau mih iawng towbowt.<verse eid="PSA 109:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 109:19" />Nami piati dow amatni khupah mih uanchow iawng amatni tut-e pacham uowi lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:19">now amatni kowh kekawm iawng amatni tut-e atungma pacham uowi reng lah.<verse eid="PSA 109:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 109:20" />Ang ransu-uüa kowi dow CHAKRAMANG pacham ripah lah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:20">Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni dow ang lawnguan kowi tek lai ngak khai.<verse eid="PSA 109:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 109:21" />Tawkche aw CHAKRAMANG ang kowh Thurai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:21">en kowh ming iung nang iung naia townla kownkow saksing sana ang diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 109:21">En kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura dow aiungma chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:21">Naiawng rakowi uang lawng ang diah.<verse eid="PSA 109:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 109:22" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow ang dow tuak kawm tuak kratma chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:22">now ang dow ngaraima mih maru chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 109:22">Ang kowh dow sak kowi arau kangowh chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 109:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 109:23" />Ang kowh chownglawng dow sat kowi khe kowh klim uang takuak iawng uang kowi khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:23">now prüt plawng hawmh khe kowh iawng prütta ang khai bowt.<verse eid="PSA 109:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 109:24" />Cha dowi kham dowi lai bowt kowh ang kowh kung paw uak khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:24">now ang dow rawng lai bowt kowh pik hai hut kangowh towbowt uowi.<verse eid="PSA 109:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 109:25" />Ang ransu-uüa tut-e dow ang chowng rensi kau khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:25">amatni dow khi ang hanow pe ang rukrai khai bowt.<verse eid="PSA 109:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 109:26" />Aw CHAKRAMANG ang kowh Thurai, uang khowng ang diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:26">en kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura hown uang takhula ang diah.<verse eid="PSA 109:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 109:27" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, lawng ang mih dow en chowtaih.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:27">Nami dow en kowh lup pami ang ransu-uüa pacham tuk lah.<verse eid="PSA 109:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 109:28" />Amatni dow pacham pe ang piati lah taih.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:28">Tawkche en dow nape ang prasi kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 109:28">Amatni dow kingküa ang hanow naka rukrai kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:28">Tawkche en nar ang dow naawmrawm kown.<verse eid="PSA 109:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 109:29" />Ang kowh ransu-uüa dow rukrai rakowi pacham kla lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:29">nami rukraira dow amatni khup uanchow khe kowh iawng pacham uowi lah.<verse eid="PSA 109:29" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 109:30" />CHAKRAMANG kowi dow maru kawmuüa pur kowi ang natek pe awmrawm lai kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:30">aia kowi dow maru kawmuüa pungmadawng kowi ang nakiowah kown.<verse eid="PSA 109:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 109:31" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia dow ngarai miuüa kowi tawi tangila reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:31">now chet tara nowm dowi miuüa hownia amatni kowi aia lawngah reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 109:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 109" />
  <chapter number="110" style="c" sid="PSA 110" />
  <para style="s">Ang hawmlawm prakowi chowm diah</para>
  <para style="d">Mami dow David kowh meng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 110:1" />CHAKRAMANG dow ang kowh mang chakramang kowi tek pe mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 110:1">“En ransu-uüa kowi en khawk daw kowi ang uang pawla dowi mowr</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 110:1">ang hawmlawm prakowi chowm diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="PSA 110:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 110:2" />CHAKRAMANG dow Zaiawn hownia en kowh mangra kür nauang huah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 110:2">aia natek en kown mih, “En ransu-uüa kowi dow en nakruitownah kown,” napa kown.<verse eid="PSA 110:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 110:3" />
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">110:3 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Mami uan kowi kowh laiklow dow Hebrai lai hown chim dowi chekhai.</char>
    </note>En cham tasen mih khin khe en maru-uüa dow natawi tarü tasen kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 110:3">en kowh klanguüa hawmh dow rau-e khe kowh nang kla iawng en tut-e nauang kown.<verse eid="PSA 110:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 110:4" />CHAKRAMANG dow takham se tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 110:4">“En dow chowngchowng saksakma vüi Melkizedek iawng mih uamow chekhai,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 110:4">Aia dow nami lawnguan kowi saktuak naklowiah kown nadowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 110:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 110:5" />CHAKRAMANG dow natowkala en kownkow en hawmlawm prakowi tawi uowi reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 110:5">now aia kunmarau mih khin khe aia mih manguüa kowi napiakah kown.<verse eid="PSA 110:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 110:6" />Aia dow chenchapuüa kowi naripah kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 110:6">lusa kowi kowh ransu-uüa kowi dow aia napiakta nak kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 110:6">Now lusa kowi dow kowng uak apanma aia nachangah kown.<verse eid="PSA 110:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 110:7" />Mang dow ransu-uüa kowi kawikrawiah mih khin khe tiama rawng kowi nakham awchawng tui kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 110:7">now aia plan kür hanow amatni kowi aia nanowngta kown.<verse eid="PSA 110:7" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 110" />
  <chapter number="111" style="c" sid="PSA 111" />
  <para style="s">CHAKRAMANG kowh lup dow kri kraingma</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 111:1" />CHAKRAMANG kowi kiow büa diah.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 111:1" />
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 111:1">Ang kowh sak maiow hown CHAKRAMANG kowi ang nakiow kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 111:1">aia kowh maru-uüa takua talawmra kowi aia kowi ang nakiow kown.<verse eid="PSA 111:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 111:2" />CHAKRAMANG kowh lup dow kri kraingma chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 111:2">aia kowh lup kowi awmrawm miuüa dow aia kowh lup lawnguan tuak reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 111:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 111:3" />Aia changah mih lup maten dow aia kowh rowsira hai kraingra uang tüng reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 111:3">aia kowh tachi tanawmra dow chowngchowng saksakma anikma uowi reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 111:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 111:4" />CHAKRAMANG dow aia kowh awdara lup mih pe tamata a-i dowi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 111:4">aia tut-e dow saksing sanara atekma chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 111:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 111:5" />Aia kowi ringkaw miuüa kowi dow aia peah chakkham reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 111:5">aia towah mih sangbowk laitawm dow katpaw aia tamata dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 111:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 111:6" />Aia dow akeng chenchapuüa kowh pren aia maru-uüa kowi pe powngah reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 111:6">naiawng hai aia dow aia kowh nowng changra kür aia maru-uüa kowi tüng pe reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 111:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 111:7" />Aia changah mih lup maten dow kaah sakowmma hai aiungma kangowh chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 111:7">aia kowh ana pek maten dow sakowmra uowima kangowh chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 111:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 111:8" />Naiawngün alow pek dow chowngchowng saksakma anikma uowi reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 111:8">naiawngün dow kaah sakowmma hai anowmma aia thawpah mih chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 111:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 111:9" />Aia maru-uüa kowi dow aia uang klanla khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 111:9">now amatni hown dow chowngchowng saksakma vüi aia tatow sangbowk laitawm khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 111:9">Aia dow chimsaima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 111:9">aia kowh ming dow ringkawra hai kramra uowima chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 111:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 111:10" />CHAKRAMANG kowi ringkawma hown kram mih dow chanlaira uown tarowng mih chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 111:10">aia kowh ana chün miuüa maten dow ka prengia iung reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 111:10">CHAKRAMANG dow chowngchowng saksakma pacham ka rowsira lah.<verse eid="PSA 111:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 111" />
  <chapter number="112" style="c" sid="PSA 112" />
  <para style="s">CHAKRAMANG kowi ringkaw miuüa dow prasira uowima</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 112:1" />CHAKRAMANG kowi kiow büa diah.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 112:1" />
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 112:1">CHAKRAMANG kowi ringkawma hown kram mih dow ka prasi reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 112:1">aia kowh ana pek chün kown mih kowi awmrawm mih dow ka prasi reng:<verse eid="PSA 112:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 112:2" />Aia kowh chauüa dow lusa kowi akürma naphaw kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 112:2">aia kowh krungchakuüa dow naka prasi kown;<verse eid="PSA 112:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 112:3" />aia kowh kimchak dow kurengma hai dawngthawnguan atekma nauowi kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 112:3">aia kowh tachi tanawmra dow chowngchowng saksakma anikma nauowi reng kown.<verse eid="PSA 112:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 112:4" />Achinawmma mih maru vüi dow iiu dawng kowi anowi uowi reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 112:4">aia dow saksing sana maru reng, now nowm paw anowmma chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 112:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 112:5" />Saksing sana maru reng mih hai pe lowi reng mih maru dow ka iungra reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 112:5">now chang lup nowm reng mih paw ka iungra reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 112:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 112:6" />Achinawmma mih maru dow anikma nauowi reng kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 112:6">aia kowi dow chowngchowng saksakma maru natuakah reng kown.<verse eid="PSA 112:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 112:7" />Aia dow ta satang ngak kown mih kowi nakram kown nadowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 112:7">aia dow anikma CHAKRAMANG luk kowi neplawng nesak reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 112:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 112:8" />Aia kowh saktuak dow anikma rakowi aia dow kram dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 112:8">achur kowi aia dow aia kowh ransu-uüa sum mih nakhi kown.<verse eid="PSA 112:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 112:9" />Aia dow kawklawma hown ngarai miuüa kowi khowng reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 112:9">aia kowh lup iung chang lawnguan dow chowngchowng saksakma maru natuakah reng kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 112:9">Aia kowh kürra hai ringkawra dow nahu ngamlam kown.<verse eid="PSA 112:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 112:10" />Maru ngakuüa dow nami khita hanow nakunmarau büah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 112:10">amatni kunmarau rakowi nakrit iüng kown, now nachum büah kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 112:10">Amatni nauah mih iawng katpaw nauang phaw kown nadowi.<verse eid="PSA 112:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 112" />
  <chapter number="113" style="c" sid="PSA 113" />
  <para style="s">A-i kowh Thurai iawng mia chow uowi?</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 113:1" />CHAKRAMANG kowi kiow büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 113:1">CHAKRAMANG lup chang miuüa low, CHAKRAMANG kowi kiow diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 113:1">CHAKRAMANG ming kowi kiow büa diah.<verse eid="PSA 113:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 113:2" />CHAKRAMANG ming dow akiow pauowi lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 113:2">kawmat hownia chowngchowng saksakma akiow pauowi lah.<verse eid="PSA 113:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 113:3" />Satlawt hownia satkup mowr</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 113:3">CHAKRAMANG ming dow akiow pauowi lah.<verse eid="PSA 113:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 113:4" />Chenchap maten luk kowi CHAKRAMANG dow chowm mang khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 113:4">aia kraingra dow mukuang luk kowi paw uowi khai.<verse eid="PSA 113:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 113:5" />CHAKRAMANG a-i kowh Thurai iawng mia chow uowi?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 113:5">Aia kowh uowira dow mukuang luk kowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 113:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 113:6" />Aia dow mukuang hai lusa kowi iu tang müah reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 113:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 113:7" />Mawngchawng kuakra kowi kowh uowi mih ngarai miuüa kowi aia dow krüngah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 113:7">dinchow dawng kowi kowh uowi mih ngarema miuüa kowi paw aia dow krüngah khai.<verse eid="PSA 113:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 113:8" />Amatni kowi dow mang chapauüa hown aia pe tawi taiua chowmah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 113:8">now aia maru kowh mang chapauüa hown paw aia pe tawi taiua chowmah khai.<verse eid="PSA 113:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 113:9" />Ka chah dowi mih masiuüa kowi dow aia pe kaah chah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 113:9">naiawng hai naiawng mih masiuüa kowi dow aia pe awmrawmah khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 113:9">CHAKRAMANG kowi kiow büa diah.<verse eid="PSA 113:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 113" />
  <chapter number="114" style="c" sid="PSA 114" />
  <para style="s">CHAKRAMANG pur kowi chür diah</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 114:1" />Aigupta pren hownia Israeluüa kowi Thurai uang lawtla khe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 114:1">akeng chenchapuüa pungmadawng hownia Jakawb krungchakuüa kowi aia uang lawtla khe,<verse eid="PSA 114:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 114:2" />Juda süng kowi dow aia kowh chimsaima mih uowi rah aia changla khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 114:2">Israel luk kowi dow aia chowm mang khai.<verse eid="PSA 114:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 114:3" />Naiawng kowbüah uang lawt mih sata Rik khita hanow tui taah lang khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 114:3">Jawrdan aw kowi kowh hawr klunglung mih tui sa dow tatat ban khai.<verse eid="PSA 114:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 114:4" />Nami khita hanow aiuk aiukma mih hungma mawngma dow kram khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 114:4">now asowm asowmchow mih hungh paw takrow khai.<verse eid="PSA 114:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 114:5" />Sata ow, tawngplawng kowchow en taak lang khai?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 114:5">Jawrdan ow, tawngplawng kowchow en kowh tui sa tatat ban khai?<verse eid="PSA 114:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 114:6" />Aiuk aiukma mih hungma mawngma ow,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 114:6">tawngplawng kowchow ruapur iawng en chet khai?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 114:6">Asowm asowmchow mih hungh ow,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 114:6">tawngplawng kowchow ruapur chah iawng en tapowr dawklawk khai?<verse eid="PSA 114:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 114:7" />Lusa ow, CHAKRAMANG pur kowi chür diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 114:7">Jakawb kowh Thurai pur kowi chür diah.<verse eid="PSA 114:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 114:8" />Aia dow huamang kowi changla kanh khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 114:8">aia dow huaklu akhawtma mih hownia tui mih uang pe lawtah khai.<verse eid="PSA 114:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 114" />
  <chapter number="115" style="c" sid="PSA 115" />
  <para style="s">Thurai ching dow en lowkchow taih</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 115:1" />Anging nadowi, aw CHAKRAMANG, anging nadowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:1">en lowkchow taih akiow kak taing.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 115:1">Tawngplawng kowchow panow en dow kaah sakowmma chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:1">now en kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura dow akhowk uowi dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 115:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 115:2" />“Tawng kowi chow enni kowh Thurai?” pahai</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:2">tawng rakowi chow akeng chenchapuüa natek anging kown?<verse eid="PSA 115:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 115:3" />Anging kowh Thurai dow mukuang kowi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:3">lup matiow dow aia nau iawng changah mih chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 115:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 115:4" />Akeng chenchapuüa kowh arup aren dow kuh hai tai hown kowh thawpah mih taih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:4">naiawngün arup aren dow rut hown kowh maru thawpah mih chowtaih.<verse eid="PSA 115:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 115:5" />Amatni kowh dow nawr uowi tawkche nowng lai dowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:5">mik uowi tawkche khi dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 115:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 115:6" />Amatni kowh dow param uowi tawkche ta dowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:6">nakawng uowi tawkche ta anam dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 115:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 115:7" />Amatni kowh dow rut uowi tawkche ia dowk dowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:7">klowng uowi tawkche ia mang dowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:7">kraw uowi tawkche ia chang atün dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 115:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 115:8" />Naiawngün arup aren thawp miuüa hai naiawngün luk kowi owm miuüa paw</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:8">naiawngün arup aren iawng natawi own kown.<verse eid="PSA 115:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 115:9" />Israeluüa low, CHAKRAMANG luk kowi neplawng nesak büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:9">enni kowh akhowng miia hai kawngma dow aia chowtaih.<verse eid="PSA 115:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 115:10" />Arawn krungchakuüa low, CHAKRAMANG luk kowi neplawng nesak büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:10">enni kowh akhowng miia hai kawngma dow aia chowtaih.<verse eid="PSA 115:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 115:11" />CHAKRAMANG kowi ringkaw miuüa low, CHAKRAMANG luk kowi neplawng nesak büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:11">enni kowh akhowng miia hai kawngma dow aia chowtaih.<verse eid="PSA 115:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 115:12" />CHAKRAMANG dow ka tuak a-i reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:12">aia dow nape a-i prasi kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 115:12">Aia dow Israeluüa kowi napeah prasi kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:12">aia dow Arawn krungchakuüa kowi napeah prasi kown.<verse eid="PSA 115:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 115:13" />Aia dow aia kowi kowh ringkaw miuüa maten kowi napeah prasi kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:13">aia dow aiuk asowm bowkbowk kowi napeah prasi kown.<verse eid="PSA 115:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 115:14" />CHAKRAMANG dow pacham pe prung enni reng lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:14">aia dow enni kowh krungchakuüa kowi paw pacham pe prungah reng lah.<verse eid="PSA 115:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 115:15" />CHAKRAMANG dow mukuang pren hai lusa thawp miia chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:15">aia dow pacham pe enni prasi reng lah.<verse eid="PSA 115:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 115:16" />Mukuang pren dow CHAKRAMANG kowh chowtaih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:16">now lusa dow maru-uüa kowi aia peah khai.<verse eid="PSA 115:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 115:17" />Kowng miuüa dow CHAKRAMANG kowi kiow dowi bowt chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:17">tadup kuam kowi tadup khowk miuüa dow aia kowi rowsiah dowi bowt chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 115:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 115:18" />Nachenganchepaw a-i sing uowi reng tak miuüa dow CHAKRAMANG kowi nakiow kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:18">aia kowi dow kawmat hownia chowngchowng saksakma pat a-i nakiowah reng kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 115:18">CHAKRAMANG kowi kiow büa diah.<verse eid="PSA 115:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 115" />
  <chapter number="116" style="c" sid="PSA 116" />
  <para style="s">CHAKRAMANG kowi tawng chow ang napeah kown?</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 116:1" />CHAKRAMANG kowi ang sakrauah khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:1">Tawngplawng kowchow panow ang awr lü mih aia hawt sünta ang khai.<verse eid="PSA 116:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 116:2" />Ang kowh laiklow dow nasünta kownkow aia pe param khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:2">Naiawng rakowi ang sing uowi mowr aia kowi ang nahaw kown.<verse eid="PSA 116:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 116:3" />Kramra uowima mih kowngra dow umta ang lut khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:3">tadupra kowi kowh kramra dow ang luk kowi uang ting khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 116:3">Taprüa taiia hai akrat pusa hown ang uowi khai.<verse eid="PSA 116:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 116:4" />Nakhowk khe CHAKRAMANG ming kowi maiawng ang awr haw khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:4">“Aw CHAKRAMANG, en tut-e ang uang lü khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:4">sakrauma hown uang lawng ang diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="PSA 116:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 116:5" />CHAKRAMANG dow saksing sana dawma hai achinawmma chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:5">anging kowh Thurai dow saksing sanara atekma chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 116:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 116:6" />CHAKRAMANG dow sakowmra uowi dowi bowt miuüa kowi takhula reng;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:6">ang kla phih mih khin khe aia dow uang lawng ang khai.<verse eid="PSA 116:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 116:7" />Ang kowh sak ow, thaulangma uowi bowt.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:7">Tawngplawng kowchow panow CHAKRAMANG mih ahuma pe ang iungra khai.<verse eid="PSA 116:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 116:8" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, kowngra hownia en towkala ang khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:8">ang kowh mik tui vüng mih dow en taingta ang khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:8">now ang natatheu kown mih hownia en town ang khai.<verse eid="PSA 116:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 116:9" />Naiawng rakowi lusa kowi ang uowi mowr dow CHAKRAMANG nau iawng ang nauowi kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:9">ang sing uowi sak uowi mowr dow CHAKRAMANG nau iawng ang namang reng kown.<verse eid="PSA 116:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 116:10" />“Ang kowh akrat pusa hu lai,” pahai ang tek mih khin khe paw</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:10">en luk kowi ang owm reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 116:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 116:11" />“Lusa maru dailama kangowh,” pah ang tek mih khin khe paw</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:11">en luk kowi ang owmsak reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 116:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 116:12" />CHAKRAMANG dow ahuma pe ang iungra khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:12">nami takcha aia kowi tawng chow ang napeah kown?<verse eid="PSA 116:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 116:13" />Aia dow phih hownia uang lawng ang khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:13">naiawng rakowi aia tut-e khamah mih uanap ang nachang kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:13">now aia ming kowi ang nakiow kown.<verse eid="PSA 116:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 116:14" />CHAKRAMANG tut-e ang takhamta mih uanap dow ang nachangta kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:14">nami dow aia maru-uüa maten pur kowi ang nachangah kown.<verse eid="PSA 116:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 116:15" />Aia maru-uüa kowng mih kowi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:15">CHAKRAMANG dow lainowmma sak tawi rau reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 116:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 116:16" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, ang dow achingma mih en kowh nar chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:16">ang dow en kowh nar chekhai, ang dow en kowh narma chapa chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 116:16">Kowngra hownia lawng ang mih dow en chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 116:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 116:17" />En vüi kowi awmrawmra uanap ang nachang kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:17">now en ming kowi ang nahaw kown.<verse eid="PSA 116:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 116:18" />CHAKRAMANG tut-e ang takhamta mih uanap maten dow ang nachangta kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:18">nami dow aia maru-uüa maten pur kowi ang nachangah kown.<verse eid="PSA 116:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 116:19" />Nami dow Jerusalem marow kowi kowh</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:19">CHAKRAMANG kim viadawng kowi ang nachang kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 116:19">CHAKRAMANG kowi kiow büa diah.<verse eid="PSA 116:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 116" />
  <chapter number="117" style="c" sid="PSA 117" />
  <para style="s">Aia kowh kaah sakowm mih rah dow anikma</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 117:1" />Aw chenchap maten, CHAKRAMANG kowi kiow büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 117:1">aw maru maten, aia kowi kiow büa diah.<verse eid="PSA 117:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 117:2" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow CHAKRAMANG kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura dow kri kraingma chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 117:2">now aia kowh kaah sakowm mih rah dow chowngchowng saksakma anikma nauowi reng kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 117:2">CHAKRAMANG kowi kiow büa diah.<verse eid="PSA 117:2" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 117" />
  <chapter number="118" style="c" sid="PSA 118" />
  <para style="s">CHAKRAMANG kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 118:1" />CHAKRAMANG kowi tek pe awmrawm lai diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:1">Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia dow aiungma chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:1">aia kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura dow chowngchowng saksakma anikma chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 118:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 118:2" />Israeluüa dow maiawng hek se pacham tek büah lah:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:2">“Aia kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura dow chowngchowng saksakma anikma chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="PSA 118:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 118:3" />Arawn krungchakuüa dow maiawng pacham tek büah lah:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:3">“Aia kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura dow chowngchowng saksakma anikma chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="PSA 118:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 118:4" />CHAKRAMANG kowi ringkaw miuüa paw maiawng pacham tek büah lah:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:4">“Aia kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura dow chowngchowng saksakma anikma chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="PSA 118:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 118:5" />Ang kla phih khe CHAKRAMANG kowi ang hawah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:5">now aia dow uang klang ang hanow uang lawt ang khai.<verse eid="PSA 118:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 118:6" />CHAKRAMANG dow tawi tangila ang reng rakowi ang nakram kown nadowi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:6">tawng chow lusa maru nowng chang ang kown?<verse eid="PSA 118:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 118:7" />Ang kowh akhowng mih CHAKRAMANG dow tawi tangila ang reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:7">Naiawng rakowi ang kowh ransu-uüa sum mih dow ang nakhi kown.<verse eid="PSA 118:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 118:8" />Lusa maru luk kowi neplawng nesak mih lak-e</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:8">CHAKRAMANG luk kowi neplawng nesak mih lang iung chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 118:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 118:9" />Maru iukuüa luk kowi neplawng nesak mih lak-e</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:9">CHAKRAMANG luk kowi neplawng nesak mih lang iung chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 118:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 118:10" />Chenchapuüa maten dow umta ang lut khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:10">Nachenganchepaw CHAKRAMANG kür hown amatni kowi ang nowngta khai.<verse eid="PSA 118:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 118:11" />Chenchapuüa maten dow umta ang lut khai nowm.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:11">Tawkche amatni kowi dow CHAKRAMANG kür hown ang nowngta khai.<verse eid="PSA 118:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 118:12" />Amatni dow kuai hawmh iawng umta ang lut khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:12">amatni dow chuh mung maih kam alenma mih iawng kingküa ang khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 118:12">Nachenganchepaw CHAKRAMANG kür hown amatni kowi ang nowngta khai.<verse eid="PSA 118:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 118:13" />Amatni dow ang pacham tim lah pakowh nawt ang büah khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:13">Nachenganchepaw CHAKRAMANG dow uang khowng ang khai.<verse eid="PSA 118:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 118:14" />Ang kowh kür hai ang kowh meng dow CHAKRAMANG chowtaih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:14">ang kowh lawngra dow aia tut-e chowtaih.<verse eid="PSA 118:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 118:15" />Thurai maru-uüa uowi rah tangbung kowi dow ka lawngra mih piaw meng klow ta reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:15">Amatni dow tek mih, “CHAKRAMANG dow aia kowh kür hown kri kraingma mih lup chang reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 118:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 118:16" />Anging awng mih dow CHAKRAMANG kowh kür hown chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:16">CHAKRAMANG dow aia kowh kür hown kri kraingma mih lup chang reng chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="PSA 118:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 118:17" />Ang nakowng kown nadowi, ang nasing reng kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:17">now CHAKRAMANG changah mih lawnguan ang naphuang reng kown.<verse eid="PSA 118:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 118:18" />CHAKRAMANG dow akraingma rip ang khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:18">Tawkche kowng pat dow aia rip ang dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 118:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 118:19" />CHAKRAMANG kim kowi kowkup hanow aia tut-e kowtek awmrawm lai kown ang nau.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:19">Naiawng rakowi CHAKRAMANG kowh kimbüng kowho ang diah.<verse eid="PSA 118:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 118:20" />Mami chowbowt lowmow CHAKRAMANG kowh kimplawt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:20">achinawmma miuüa uang kup mih dow mami iawng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 118:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 118:21" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, ang natek en awmrawm lai kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:21">tawngplawng kowchow panow en dow ang kowh laiklow sünta ang khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:21">now en dow pe ang lawngra khai.<verse eid="PSA 118:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 118:22" />Kim chang miuüa nuata mih hua dow pankrima uang chowng khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:22">nami dow lang pankri mih hua uang chowng khai.<verse eid="PSA 118:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 118:23" />Nami dow CHAKRAMANG changah mih chowtaih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:23">nami dow a-i mik kowi awdara uowima chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 118:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 118:24" />Mami dow CHAKRAMANG thawpah mih ni chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:24">chu, mami ni kowi a-i awmrawm diah sik, now piaw diah sik.<verse eid="PSA 118:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 118:25" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, sakrauma hown uang lawng anging diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:25">aw CHAKRAMANG, sakrauma hown uang pe awng anging diah.<verse eid="PSA 118:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 118:26" />CHAKRAMANG ming hown uang mih maru dow akiow pauowi lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:26">CHAKRAMANG kim hownia anging pe en prasi khowk.<verse eid="PSA 118:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 118:27" />CHAKRAMANG chowtaih Thurai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:27">pe a-i anowi reng mih dow aia chowtaih.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 118:27">Phuchua chang müa uang pawla tawncher büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:27">now nami dow phuchuara nang kowi uang klikah diah.<verse eid="PSA 118:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 118:28" />En chowtaih ang kowh Thurai, ang natek en awmrawm lai kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:28">en chowtaih ang kowh Thurai, ang nakiow en kown.<verse eid="PSA 118:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 118:29" />CHAKRAMANG kowi tek pe awmrawm lai diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:29">Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia dow aiungma chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:29">aia kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura dow chowngchowng saksakma anikma chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 118:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 118" />
  <chapter number="119" style="c" sid="PSA 119" />
  <para style="s">CHAKRAMANG kowh rirow dow akiow pacham uowi lah</para>
  <para style="d">Alef</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 119:1" />Chownglawng kowi ngak uowi dowi miuüa dow prasira uowima chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:1">CHAKRAMANG kowh ari aiang chün miuüa dow prasira uowima chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 119:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 119:2" />Now aia kowh laiklow chün miuüa dow prasira uowima chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:2">sak maiow hown aia naukrang iawng chang miuüa paw prasira uowima chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 119:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 119:3" />Amatni dow tawng angak paw chang dowi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:3">amatni dow CHAKRAMANG tiama kowi chowtaih mang reng.<verse eid="PSA 119:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 119:4" />En tiama kowi anging namang kaneu kownkow</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:4">en pe anging ana khai.<verse eid="PSA 119:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 119:5" />En kowh rirow iawng namangla kownkow</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:5">ang kowh sak mih anikma uowi dit panü!<verse eid="PSA 119:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 119:6" />Naiawng e dow en kowh ana pek maten ang nowng chün diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:6">now ang naka rukrai kown nadowi tham diah.<verse eid="PSA 119:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 119:7" />En kowh anowmma mih rirow tasang hanow</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:7">achinawmma mih sak hown ang natek en awmrawm lai kown.<verse eid="PSA 119:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 119:8" />En kowh ari aiang iawng ang namang kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:8">en mih hauang nuata ang diah.</para>
  <para style="d" vid="PSA 119:8">Bet<verse eid="PSA 119:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 119:9" />Klanguüa dow tawng iawng chow aia kowh chownglawng achinawmma nowng tow kown?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:9">Aia dow en kowh laiklow chün mih hownia chowtaih nowng tow kown.<verse eid="PSA 119:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 119:10" />Ang kowh sak maiow hown ang krawi cham en khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:10">en kowh ana pek hownia alakma hauang pe uowi ang diah.<verse eid="PSA 119:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 119:11" />Kingküala en mih angak ang nachang dowi kownkow</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:11">en kowh laiklow mih sak kowi ang krümta hüah khowk.<verse eid="PSA 119:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 119:12" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, ang kiow en,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:12">en kowh rirow tüngsang ang reng diah.<verse eid="PSA 119:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 119:13" />En pe anging mih rirow maten dow naphuangah kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:13">naiawngün dow ang nawr hown ang naphuangah reng kown.<verse eid="PSA 119:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 119:14" />Ahuma ka dawngthawnguan mih lak-e</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:14">en kowh laiklow kowi ang sak lang piaw khai.<verse eid="PSA 119:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 119:15" />En ana pek lawnguan kowi ang natuak reng kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:15">now en tiama kowi namang kown mih ang nape ching reng kown.<verse eid="PSA 119:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 119:16" />En kowh rirow kowi ang sak piaw reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:16">en kowh laiklow ang natamata kown nadowi.</para>
  <para style="d" vid="PSA 119:16">Gimel<verse eid="PSA 119:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 119:17" />Ang naia singla kownkow hai en kowh laiklow naia chünla kownkow</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:17">en kowh nar kowi peah iungra diah.<verse eid="PSA 119:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 119:18" />En kowh ari aiang kowi awdara lawnguan ang nakhila kownkow</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:18">ang kowh mik mih en uang thowi ang diah.<verse eid="PSA 119:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 119:19" />Ang dow lusa kowi khari kowi mih iawng krowngchow taih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:19">en kowh ana pek mih ang hownia hangkow petah diah.<verse eid="PSA 119:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 119:20" />En kowh rirow natuk kown mih lainowmma ang sakkrai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:20">Nami dow ang kowh sak mih atungma hing nauta hüah chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 119:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 119:21" />Chang bawri miuüa kowi dow en nangah reng;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:21">en kowh ana pek chün dowi miuüa dow pacham ka piati lah.<verse eid="PSA 119:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 119:22" />Amatni pe ang rukrai kown mih hai prawngren ang kown mih hownia alakma tow ang diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:22">Tawngplawng kowchow panow ang dow en kowh laiklow chün reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 119:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 119:23" />Pren kruitown miuüa dow tapu hanow kingküa ang büah khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:23">Tawkche en nar ang dow en rirow lawnguan atungma tuak reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 119:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 119:24" />Ang dow en kowh laiklow kowi ang sak piaw reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:24">nami laiklow dow pe ang prengia iung reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="d" vid="PSA 119:24">Dalet<verse eid="PSA 119:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 119:25" />Ang dow dinchow dawng kowi taiüa khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:25">en kowh laikham iawng plan pe ang kür sar diah.<verse eid="PSA 119:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 119:26" />Ang kowh akrat pusa ang uang phowk en hanow en klang ang khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:26">kawmat dow en kowh rirow uang tüngsang ang diah.<verse eid="PSA 119:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 119:27" />En kowh tiama ang natukla kownkow uang khowng ang diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:27">nahanow en kowh awdara lup lawnguan ang natuak kown towbowt.<verse eid="PSA 119:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 119:28" />Tuak kawm tuak krat hown ang sak kawm mih nowm khowk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:28">en takhamta mih iawng pe ang kür diah.<verse eid="PSA 119:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 119:29" />Kuanlama mih saktuak ang hownia henta ang diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:29">en kowh saksing sanara hown en kowh ari aiang tüngsang ang diah.<verse eid="PSA 119:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 119:30" />Kaah sakowmma tiama kowi nauowi kown mih ang khowmta khowk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:30">en kowh rirow iawng nauowi kown mih ang tatuak khowk chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 119:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 119:31" />En kowh laiklow ang dowkta chen khowk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:31">Aw CHAKRAMANG, hauang pe ka ang rukrai diah.<verse eid="PSA 119:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 119:32" />En kowh ana pek dow süngürma hown ang nachün kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:32">Tawngplawng kowchow panow en dow pe ang tukra khai.</para>
  <para style="d" vid="PSA 119:32">He<verse eid="PSA 119:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 119:33" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, en kowh ari aiang tüngsang ang diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:33">Nami dow ang sing uowi mowr ang nachün kown.<verse eid="PSA 119:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 119:34" />En kowh ari aiang iawng ang naia mangla kownkow pe ang tukra diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:34">now nami dow ang kowh sak maiow hown ang nachünla kownkow pe ang tukra diah.<verse eid="PSA 119:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 119:35" />Ang dow en kowh ana pek kowi ang sak piaw reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:35">Naiawng rakowi en kowh ana pek iawng mang kownkow krui ang diah.<verse eid="PSA 119:35" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 119:36" />Angak hown kureng kown mih tuak lak-e</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:36">en kowh laiklow nachün kown mih sakkraira phai pe ang diah.<verse eid="PSA 119:36" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 119:37" />Asung uowi dowi mih uanh hownia plengta ang mik diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:37">en tiama kowi namangla kownkow pe ang kür sar diah.<verse eid="PSA 119:37" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 119:38" />Ringkaw en miuüa tut-e kowh en takhamta mih iawng</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:38">mami en kowh nar tut-e uang pe tachiah diah,<verse eid="PSA 119:38" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 119:39" />Ang kramah mih rukraira dow henta ang diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:39">en kowh rirow dow aiungma chekhai nowm!<verse eid="PSA 119:39" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 119:40" />En kowh ari aiang nachün kown mih lainowmma ang süngür khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:40">en dow achinawmma chedow pe ang kür sar diah.</para>
  <para style="d" vid="PSA 119:40">Vau<verse eid="PSA 119:40" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 119:41" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, en kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura tüng ang diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:41">en takhamta mih iawng dow uang lawng ang diah.<verse eid="PSA 119:41" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 119:42" />Nahanow khare ang miuüa kowi ang naia klangah kown towbowt.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:42">Tawngplawng kowchow panow ang dow en laiklow kowi neplawng nesak mih chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 119:42" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 119:43" />En kowh anowmma mih laiklow ang nawr hownia hauang rupta ang diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:43">Tawngplawng kowchow panow ang dow en kowh rirow kowi owmsak mih chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 119:43" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="PSA 119:44" />Ang dow atungma en kowh ari aiang nachün reng kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:44">Nami dow chowngchowng saksakma ang nachün reng kown.<verse eid="PSA 119:44" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="PSA 119:45" />Ang dow en kowh tiama prakowi pe ching reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:45">Naiawng rakowi athaulangma hown ang nauowi reng kown.<verse eid="PSA 119:45" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="PSA 119:46" />En tekah mih laiklow maten manguüa pur kowi ang natek kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:46">mapaw ang narukrai kown nadowi.<verse eid="PSA 119:46" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="PSA 119:47" />En kowh ana pek kowi ang sak piaw reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:47">Tawngplawng kowchow panow nami kowi ang sakrau chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 119:47" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="PSA 119:48" />En kowh ana pek nachün kown mih lainowmma ang süngür khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:48">Tawngplawng kowchow panow naiawngün kowi ang sakrau chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 119:48">En kowh rirow lawnguan dow abüpma ang tuakah reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="d" vid="PSA 119:48">Zain<verse eid="PSA 119:48" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="PSA 119:49" />En nar tut-e kowh en takhamta mih sam tuakah madiah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:49">ang kowh sakowmra dow nami takhamta mih lai kowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 119:49" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="PSA 119:50" />En kowh laikham hownia dow ang ka singra reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:50">Naiawng rakowi akrat pusa hown ang uowi chepaw ang ka sakkhawtra reng.<verse eid="PSA 119:50" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="PSA 119:51" />Chang bawri miuüa dow khare nichak ang reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:51">Nachenganchepaw en kowh ari aiang hownia ditchow khowm ang süt dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 119:51" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="PSA 119:52" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, achük alai kowh rirow ang ka tuak reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:52">now nami rirow dow pe ang sakklamra reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 119:52" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="PSA 119:53" />Maru ngakuüa chang lup ngak mih ang khi hanow lainowmma ang kunmarau khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:53">Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni dow en kowh ari aiang mih nuata büah khai.<verse eid="PSA 119:53" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="PSA 119:54" />En kowh rirow lawnguan kowi ang tek meng reng chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:54">nami meng dow mami lusa kowi kawmat mowr ang tek reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 119:54" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="PSA 119:55" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, uar-e khe en lawnguan kowi ang tuak reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:55">Naiawng rakowi en kowh ari aiang mih ang chün reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 119:55" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="PSA 119:56" />Ang chownglawng kowi ang ka prasira khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:56">nami dow en kowh laiklow ang chün mih chekhai.</para>
  <para style="d" vid="PSA 119:56">Het<verse eid="PSA 119:56" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="PSA 119:57" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, en dow ang kowh dawngthawnguan chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:57">en laiklow ang nachün reng kownkow ang takham khowk.<verse eid="PSA 119:57" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="PSA 119:58" />Saksing sana ang kownkow sak maiow hown ang uang lü khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:58">en kowh laikham iawng en mih uang saksing sana ang diah.<verse eid="PSA 119:58" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="PSA 119:59" />En kowh tiama kowi ang mang mih krang ang tatuak khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:59">now en kowh laiklow nachün kown mih ang takham khai.<verse eid="PSA 119:59" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="PSA 119:60" />En kowh ana pek nachün kownkow alenma ang tarowng khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:60">mapaw ang awi-ai dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 119:60" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="PSA 119:61" />Maru ngakuüa kowh leng kowi ang cham tasowk khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:61">Nachenganchepaw en kowh ari aiang mih ang tamata dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 119:61" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="PSA 119:62" />En kowh rirow dow achinawmma chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:62">Naiawng rakowi nakiow en kownkow uar dawng khe ang rü reng.<verse eid="PSA 119:62" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="PSA 119:63" />Ang dow ringkawma hown kram en miuüa maten kowh auiua chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:63">ang dow en kowh tiama kowi mang miuüa maten kowh auiua chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 119:63" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="PSA 119:64" />En kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura dow lusa kowi atekma chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:64">aw CHAKRAMANG, en kowh rirow tüngsang ang diah.</para>
  <para style="d" vid="PSA 119:64">Tet<verse eid="PSA 119:64" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="PSA 119:65" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, iungra ahuma en pe ang khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:65">en kowh laikham iawng mami nar kowi en peah iungra khai.<verse eid="PSA 119:65" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="PSA 119:66" />Aiung angak tukra hai chanlaira nauowila kownkow tüngsang ang diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:66">Tawngplawng kowchow panow en kowh ana pek kowi ang neplawng nesak reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 119:66" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="PSA 119:67" />En rip ang dowi rawn dow tiama tawi kowi ang cham mang khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:67">Nachenganchepaw kawmat dow en laiklow ang chün reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 119:67" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="PSA 119:68" />En dow aiungma chekhai, now chang lup iung reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:68">en kowh rirow tüngsang ang reng diah.<verse eid="PSA 119:68" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="PSA 119:69" />Bawrima miuüa dow ang lawnguan kowi krawi küa dai khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:69">Nachenganchepaw ang dow sak maiow hown en kowh rirow chün reng.<verse eid="PSA 119:69" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="PSA 119:70" />Amatni kowh sak dow aiung angak tuk dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:70">Nachenganchepaw ang dow en kowh ari aiang kowi ang sak piaw reng.<verse eid="PSA 119:70" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="PSA 119:71" />Ang ka ripra mih ang vüi lainowmma iung chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:71">Tawngplawng kowchow panow nami hownia en kowh rirow ang ka tasang khai.<verse eid="PSA 119:71" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="PSA 119:72" />En kowh ari aiang dow ang tut-e lainowmma asung uowi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:72">Nami dow kuh hai tai athawng aiawng mih lak-e asung uowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="d" vid="PSA 119:72">Iawd<verse eid="PSA 119:72" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="PSA 119:73" />En kowh rut hown en thawp ang hanow en tawng ang khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:73">en kowh ana pek ang natukla bowk kownkow pe ang tukra diah.<verse eid="PSA 119:73" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="PSA 119:74" />Ringkawma hown kram en miuüa dow khi ang hanow napiaw kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:74">Tawngplawng kowchow panow ang dow en kowh laikham kowi neplawng nesak mih chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 119:74" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="75" style="v" sid="PSA 119:75" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, en kowh tara chet dow achinawmma pami ang tuk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:75">en dow kaah sakowmma mih chekhai rakowi en rip ang mih chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 119:75" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="76" style="v" sid="PSA 119:76" />Mami en kowh nar tut-e en takhamta mih iawng</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:76">en kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura hown ang pacham ka sakklamra lah.<verse eid="PSA 119:76" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="77" style="v" sid="PSA 119:77" />Ang naia singla kownkow en mih uang saksing sana ang diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:77">Tawngplawng kowchow panow ang dow en kowh ari aiang kowi ang sak piaw khai.<verse eid="PSA 119:77" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="78" style="v" sid="PSA 119:78" />Bawrima hai dai lai hown piak ang kown nau miuüa dow pacham ka rukrai lah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:78">Nachenganchepaw ang dow en kowh tiama lawnguan abüpma natuakah kown.<verse eid="PSA 119:78" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="79" style="v" sid="PSA 119:79" />Ringkawma hown kram en miuüa dow ang tut-e pauang lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:79">nahanow en kowh laiklow natawi tuk büah kown.<verse eid="PSA 119:79" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="80" style="v" sid="PSA 119:80" />En kowh rirow chün kowi ang kowh aser auowk hang pauowi lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:80">nahanow ang narukrai kown nadowi bowt.</para>
  <para style="d" vid="PSA 119:80">Kaf<verse eid="PSA 119:80" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="81" style="v" sid="PSA 119:81" />En nauang takhula ang kown mih kowi chawng kangowh ang kowh kür khowk khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:81">Nachenganchepaw en kowh laiklow kowi ang owmsak reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 119:81" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="82" style="v" sid="PSA 119:82" />En kowh laikham nauang tachih kown mih hawt tang mü kangowh ang kowh mik ri khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:82">tawng khe chow en nape ang sakklamra kown?<verse eid="PSA 119:82" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="83" style="v" sid="PSA 119:83" />Towla grep tui mih im maikhük hown piak mih iawng ang piak khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:83">Nachenganchepaw en kowh rirow ang tamata dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 119:83" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="84" style="v" sid="PSA 119:84" />Mün ni tak chow ang achawng natakla tak kown?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:84">Chang ang nowng miuüa kowi tawng khe chiang chow en nachet pe tara kown?<verse eid="PSA 119:84" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="85" style="v" sid="PSA 119:85" />Bawrima miuüa dow ang dowla müa thai kuam khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:85">amatni dow en kowh ari aiang chün dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 119:85" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="86" style="v" sid="PSA 119:86" />En kowh ana pek maten dow sakowmra uowima kangowh chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 119:86">Dai lai hown maru chang ang anowng apowng khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:86">Naiawng rakowi sakrauma hown uang khowng ang diah.<verse eid="PSA 119:86" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="87" style="v" sid="PSA 119:87" />Amatni dow kowngta ang kown chowbowt diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:87">Nachenganchepaw en kowh tiama mih ang nuata dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 119:87" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="88" style="v" sid="PSA 119:88" />En kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura hown pe ang singra diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:88">nahanow en nawr hown kowh laiklow ang nachün kown towbowt.</para>
  <para style="d" vid="PSA 119:88">Lamed<verse eid="PSA 119:88" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="89" style="v" sid="PSA 119:89" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, en kowh laiklow dow anikma chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:89">Nami dow mukuang tama dowi mowr nauowi reng kown.<verse eid="PSA 119:89" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="90" style="v" sid="PSA 119:90" />En kowh kaah sakowm mih rah dow chowngchowng saksakma uowi reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:90">en thawpah mih lusa dow anikma uowi reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 119:90" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="91" style="v" sid="PSA 119:91" />En kowh ana pek rakowi lowra sia kawmat mowr paw anikma reng tak chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:91">Tawngplawng kowchow panow naiawngün dow en low kowi kowh uowi mih chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 119:91" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="92" style="v" sid="PSA 119:92" />En kowh ari aiang kowi ang kowh sak piaw reng chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:92">naiawng nadowi e dow akrat pusara hown ang napiak prang bowt.<verse eid="PSA 119:92" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="93" style="v" sid="PSA 119:93" />En kowh rirow dow katpaw ang natamata kown nadowi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:93">Tawngplawng kowchow panow en pe ang singra mih dow nami hown chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 119:93" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="94" style="v" sid="PSA 119:94" />Ang dow en kowh chowtaih; naiawng rakowi uang takhula ang diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:94">Tawngplawng kowchow panow ang dow en tiama prakowi pe ching reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 119:94" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="95" style="v" sid="PSA 119:95" />Maru ngakuüa dow napiakta ang kownkow pawm ang khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:95">Nachenganchepaw en kowh laiklow mih abüpma ang tuak reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 119:95" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="96" style="v" sid="PSA 119:96" />Tawng chap paw achinawmma mih uowi dowi chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:96">tawkche en kowh ari aiang dow lowra prakowi achinawmma chekhai.</para>
  <para style="d" vid="PSA 119:96">Mem<verse eid="PSA 119:96" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="97" style="v" sid="PSA 119:97" />En kowh ari aiang kowi lainowmma ang sakrau khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:97">Nami dow ni chut chi abüpma ang tuakah reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 119:97" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="98" style="v" sid="PSA 119:98" />En kowh ana pek maten dow ang ransu-uüa kowi lak-e chanlaima chang ang khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:98">Tawngplawng kowchow panow nami dow ang hown atungma hing uowi hüah chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 119:98" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="99" style="v" sid="PSA 119:99" />Ang kowh tüngsang miuüa maten lak-e ang lang chanlai chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:99">Tawngplawng kowchow panow ang dow en kowh laiklow abüpma ang tuak reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 119:99" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="100" style="v" sid="PSA 119:100" />Lawngtanguüa lak-e paw ang lang tuk chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:100">Tawngplawng kowchow panow ang dow en tiama kowi mang reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 119:100" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="101" style="v" sid="PSA 119:101" />Ang dow en kowh laiklow naia chünla reng kownkow</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:101">tiama ngak maten hownia ang kowh khawk mih ang lang sütta reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 119:101" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="102" style="v" sid="PSA 119:102" />Ang kowi dow en matia ngengche tüngsang ang khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:102">Naiawng rakowi en kowh rirow hownia ang süt dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 119:102" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="103" style="v" sid="PSA 119:103" />En kowh laikham maten dow ang dai kowi lainowmma ding khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:103">Nami dow ang nawr kowi kuai tui lak-e khowm lang ding chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 119:103" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="104" style="v" sid="PSA 119:104" />En kowh tiama hownia dow aiung angak tukra ang ka reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:104">Naiawng rakowi anowm nadowi mih tiama maten ang sui chekhai.</para>
  <para style="d" vid="PSA 119:104">Nun<verse eid="PSA 119:104" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="105" style="v" sid="PSA 119:105" />En kowh laiklow dow ang kowh tiama tüng mih maibu chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:105">Nami dow ang mangra tiama kowi kowh anowi pek mih chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 119:105" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="106" style="v" sid="PSA 119:106" />En kowh rirow achinawmma mih nachün kown ang takham khowk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:106">now nami laikham dow akhawtma ang takhamta mih chowbowt.<verse eid="PSA 119:106" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="107" style="v" sid="PSA 119:107" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, lainowmma ang kham ngare khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:107">Naiawng rakowi en kowh laikham iawng pe ang singra diah.<verse eid="PSA 119:107" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="108" style="v" sid="PSA 119:108" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, ang sak nau hown ang kiow en khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:108">Nami dow en vüi ang uang pawla mih uanap chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 119:108">Naiawng rakowi nami dow hawt paw ang diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:108">now en kowh rirow tüngsang ang diah.<verse eid="PSA 119:108" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="109" style="v" sid="PSA 119:109" />Masing makowng nimkrüa kowi atungma ang uowi khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:109">Nachenganchepaw en kowh ari aiang mih ang tamata dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 119:109" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="110" style="v" sid="PSA 119:110" />Maru ngakuüa dow ang vüi chak ang leng khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:110">Nachenganchepaw en kowh tiama hownia ang süt dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 119:110" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="111" style="v" sid="PSA 119:111" />En kowh laiklow dow chowngchowng saksakma vüi ang kowh dawngthawnguan chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:111">Tawngplawng kowchow panow nami dow ang sak kowi kowh awmrawmra chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 119:111" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="112" style="v" sid="PSA 119:112" />En kowh rirow atungma nachün kown mih ang tatuak khowk.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:112">Nami dow ang kowng dowi mowr ang nachünah reng kown.</para>
  <para style="d" vid="PSA 119:112">Samek<verse eid="PSA 119:112" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="113" style="v" sid="PSA 119:113" />Saktuak pre chaing miuüa kowi ang sui chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:113">Nachenganchepaw en kowh ari aiang kowi dow ang sakrau reng.<verse eid="PSA 119:113" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="114" style="v" sid="PSA 119:114" />Ang kowh tatung tanimra hai kawngma dow en chowtaih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:114">ang owmsak reng mih dow en kowh laiklow kowi chowtaih.<verse eid="PSA 119:114" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="115" style="v" sid="PSA 119:115" />Enni chang lup ngak miuüa low, ang hownia lang powt büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:115">nahanow ang kowh Thurai kowh ana pek ang naia chün kown towbowt.<verse eid="PSA 119:115" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="116" style="v" sid="PSA 119:116" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, en kowh laikham iawng dowk ang reng diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:116">nahanow ang nasing reng kown towbowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 119:116">En luk kowi ang sakowm mih lawnguan kowi hauang pe ka ang rukrai diah.<verse eid="PSA 119:116" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="117" style="v" sid="PSA 119:117" />Dowkta ang hüah diah; nahanow ang naplai kown towbowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:117">now en kowh rirow atungma ang nachün kown towbowt.<verse eid="PSA 119:117" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="118" style="v" sid="PSA 119:118" />En rirow hownia alakma süt miuüa kowi dow en nuata khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:118">Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni dow amatni lala takuan mih chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 119:118" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="119" style="v" sid="PSA 119:119" />Lusa kowi kowh maru ngakuüa maten kowi dow mawngchawng iawng en henah reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:119">Naiawng rakowi en kowh laiklow maten ang chün reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 119:119" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="120" style="v" sid="PSA 119:120" />Ang kram en rakowi ang chür reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:120">en kowh tara chet dow ringkawma hown ang kram reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="d" vid="PSA 119:120">Aiien<verse eid="PSA 119:120" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="121" style="v" sid="PSA 119:121" />Ang dow chang lup iung reng, now chet tara nowm reng chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:121">chang ang nowng miuüa rut kowi hauang ap ang diah.<verse eid="PSA 119:121" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="122" style="v" sid="PSA 119:122" />En kowh nar naiungla kown mih kurdik en paw diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:122">bawrima miuüa hangkow pacham ka chang ang anowng lah.<verse eid="PSA 119:122" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="123" style="v" sid="PSA 119:123" />En kowh laikham nauang tachih kown mih kowi chawng kangowh ang kowh mik ri khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:123">en uang lawng ang kown mih kowi hawt chawng kangowh ang kowh mik rau khai bowt.<verse eid="PSA 119:123" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="124" style="v" sid="PSA 119:124" />Mami en kowh nar kowi en kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura hown khetah diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:124">now en kowh rirow mih uang tüng uang sang ang reng diah.<verse eid="PSA 119:124" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="125" style="v" sid="PSA 119:125" />Ang dow en kowh nar chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:125">en kowh laiklow natuktala kownkow pe ang tukra diah.<verse eid="PSA 119:125" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="126" style="v" sid="PSA 119:126" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, kawmat mih en nachang lup kown mih khin chowbowt.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:126">Tawngplawng kowchow panow maru kawmuüa mih en kowh ari aiang chün dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 119:126" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="127" style="v" sid="PSA 119:127" />Ang dow en kowh ana pek maten kowi ang sakrau reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:127">Nami dow achangma mih kuh kowi lak-e khowm ang lang sakrau chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 119:127" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="128" style="v" sid="PSA 119:128" />Naiawng rakowi en kowh ari aiang maten ang chün reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:128">now anowm nadowi mih tiama maten dow ang sui reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="d" vid="PSA 119:128">Pe<verse eid="PSA 119:128" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="129" style="v" sid="PSA 119:129" />En kowh laiklow dow lainowmma iung.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:129">Naiawng rakowi nami dow ang chün reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 119:129" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="130" style="v" sid="PSA 119:130" />En kowh laiklow dow maru ta hanow ka anowi reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:130">Nami dow saktuak prawngma miuüa kowi peah tukra reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 119:130" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="131" style="v" sid="PSA 119:131" />En kowh ana pek ka kown mih lainowmma ang prüa khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:131">ang prüa lai bowt kowh ang hawt chawng hüah towbowt.<verse eid="PSA 119:131" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="132" style="v" sid="PSA 119:132" />En ming kowi kowh sakrau miuüa kowi en saksing sanaah reng iawng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:132">ang prakowi uang dang diah, now saksing sana ang diah.<verse eid="PSA 119:132" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="133" style="v" sid="PSA 119:133" />En kowh laiklow iawng anowmma mih tiama kowi naia mangla kownkow</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:133">ang kowh khawk anikma chang ang diah;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 119:133">nahanow ang luk kowi dow tawng iawng mih angak chap paw nauang kla kown nadowi bowt.<verse eid="PSA 119:133" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="134" style="v" sid="PSA 119:134" />En tiama kowi ang nanowng mangla reng kownkow</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:134">maru nowng changra rut hownia uang lawng ang diah.<verse eid="PSA 119:134" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="135" style="v" sid="PSA 119:135" />En kowh sanara mih anowi iawng en nar luk kowi pauang kla lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:135">en kowh rirow maten uang tüng uang sang ang diah.<verse eid="PSA 119:135" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="136" style="v" sid="PSA 119:136" />Ang kowh mik tui mih hawr dawilawi towbowt.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:136">Tawngplawng kowchow panow en kowh ari aiang dow maru chün dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="d" vid="PSA 119:136">Sadhe<verse eid="PSA 119:136" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="137" style="v" sid="PSA 119:137" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, en dow achinawmma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:137">now en kowh tara chet paw anowmma chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 119:137" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="138" style="v" sid="PSA 119:138" />En kowh laiklow dow achinawmma chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:138">Nami dow kaah sakowmma chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 119:138" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="139" style="v" sid="PSA 119:139" />Ang kowh ransu-uüa dow en kowh laiklow tamata khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:139">Naiawng rakowi en kowh ringkawra natown en kown mih lainowmma ang süngür khai.<verse eid="PSA 119:139" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="140" style="v" sid="PSA 119:140" />En kowh laikham dow tachi reng pami kaah amat khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:140">nami laikham ang sakrau mih dow naiawng rakowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 119:140" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="141" style="v" sid="PSA 119:141" />Ang dow tawngpaw nadowi, maru kaah anü aklowk dowi mih chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:141">Nachenganchepaw en kowh tiama mih ang tamata dowi.<verse eid="PSA 119:141" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="142" style="v" sid="PSA 119:142" />En dow chowngchowng saksakma achinawmma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:142">now en kowh ari aiang maten dow anowmma chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 119:142" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="143" style="v" sid="PSA 119:143" />Akrat pusara mih ang luk kowi uang ting khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:143">Nachenganchepaw en kowh ana pek kowi ang sak piaw reng.<verse eid="PSA 119:143" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="144" style="v" sid="PSA 119:144" />En kowh laiklow maten dow chowngchowng saksakma anowmma chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:144">ang naia singla reng kownkow nami ari aiang natukla kown mih kür pe ang diah.</para>
  <para style="d" vid="PSA 119:144">Kaf<verse eid="PSA 119:144" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="145" style="v" sid="PSA 119:145" />Ang kowh sak maiow hown ang haw en khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 119:145">Aw CHAKRAMANG, uang klang ang diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:145">nahanow en kowh rirow maten ang nachün kown towbowt.<verse eid="PSA 119:145" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="146" style="v" sid="PSA 119:146" />En kowi chowtaih ang haw en khai, uang lawng ang diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:146">nahanow en kowh laiklow ang nachün kown towbowt.<verse eid="PSA 119:146" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="147" style="v" sid="PSA 119:147" />Uarthowi dowi rawn ang rü hanow naka khowng kownkow ang uang kar reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:147">ang dow en kowh laikham luk kowi owmsak reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 119:147" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="148" style="v" sid="PSA 119:148" />En kowh laikham maten abüpma ang natuakah kownkow</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:148">uar kowi dowi rawn ang thowr müi reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 119:148" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="149" style="v" sid="PSA 119:149" />En kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura hown ang kowh laiklow sünta diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:149">aw CHAKRAMANG, en kowh ari aiang kowi uowi iawng pe ang singra diah.<verse eid="PSA 119:149" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="150" style="v" sid="PSA 119:150" />Chang ang nowng mih maru ngakuüa dow uang tarü khowk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:150">amatni dow en kowh ari aiang hownia alakma chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 119:150" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="151" style="v" sid="PSA 119:151" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, en dow ang hown atawnchow taih chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:151">now en kowh ana pek maten dow anowmma kangowh chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 119:151" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="152" style="v" sid="PSA 119:152" />En kowh laiklow dow chowngchowng saksakma nauowi reng kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:152">Nami dow achük alai hownia en kowh ari aiang sangra hown ang tuk khowk chekhai.</para>
  <para style="d" vid="PSA 119:152">Res<verse eid="PSA 119:152" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="153" style="v" sid="PSA 119:153" />Ang kowh akrat pusara sam mü madiah, now uang takhula ang diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:153">Tawngplawng kowchow panow en kowh ari aiang ang tamata dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 119:153" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="154" style="v" sid="PSA 119:154" />Uang tangila ang hanow ang kowh angak uowi dowi mih uang tüng diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:154">now en kowh laikham iawng uang pe ang singra diah.<verse eid="PSA 119:154" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="155" style="v" sid="PSA 119:155" />Maru ngakuüa dow naka lawngra kown mih alakma chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:155">Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni dow en rirow prakowi pe ching dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 119:155" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="156" style="v" sid="PSA 119:156" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, en kowh sanara dow lainowmma hu chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:156">en kowh ari aiang kowi uowi iawng pe ang singra diah.<verse eid="PSA 119:156" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="157" style="v" sid="PSA 119:157" />Ang ransu-uüa hai chang nowng miuüa dow lainowmma kawm khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:157">Nachenganchepaw en kowh laiklow hownia ang süt dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 119:157" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="158" style="v" sid="PSA 119:158" />Kuanlama miuüa kowi khi now lainowmma ang sui lawt.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:158">Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni dow en kowh ari aiang iawng mang dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 119:158" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="159" style="v" sid="PSA 119:159" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, en tiama kowi mün khowt chow ang sakrau mih sam mü madiah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:159">now en kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura hown pe ang kür sar diah.<verse eid="PSA 119:159" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="160" style="v" sid="PSA 119:160" />En kowh laiklow maten dow anowmma kangowh chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:160">en kowh anowmma mih rirow maten dow chowngchowng saksakma anikma chekhai.</para>
  <para style="d" vid="PSA 119:160">Sin<verse eid="PSA 119:160" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="161" style="v" sid="PSA 119:161" />Pren kruitown miuüa dow aiawnglowma chang ang nowng khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:161">Nachenganchepaw ang kowh sak mih en kowh laiklow kowi ringkawma hown kram reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 119:161" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="162" style="v" sid="PSA 119:162" />Cham dowk tasen khe kala uanh now lainowmma maru awmrawm reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:162">nami powm iawng dow en kowh laikham kowi ang sak piaw reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 119:162" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="163" style="v" sid="PSA 119:163" />Dai lai kowi ang sui reng; nami dow suiiai kaniaima ang tuakah khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:163">Nachenganchepaw en kowh ari aiang kowi dow ang sakrau reng.<verse eid="PSA 119:163" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="164" style="v" sid="PSA 119:164" />Pani kowi ranit kat chi ang kiow en khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:164">Tawngplawng kowchow panow en kowh rirow dow achinawmma chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 119:164" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="165" style="v" sid="PSA 119:165" />En kowh ari aiang kowi sakrau miuüa dow ka thaulangra reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:165">amatni kowi dow tawng chap paw nowng chüah dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 119:165" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="166" style="v" sid="PSA 119:166" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, en nauang lawng ang kown mih kowi sakowmma ang uowi khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:166">now en kowh ana pek maten ang chün reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 119:166" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="167" style="v" sid="PSA 119:167" />En kowh ari aiang maten ang chün reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:167">Tawngplawng kowchow panow nami dow lainowmma ang sakrau chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 119:167" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="168" style="v" sid="PSA 119:168" />Ang dow en tiama kowi mang reng hai en laiklow maten ang chün reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:168">Tawngplawng kowchow panow ang changah mih maten en khi bowk chekhai.</para>
  <para style="d" vid="PSA 119:168">Tav<verse eid="PSA 119:168" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="169" style="v" sid="PSA 119:169" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, ang kowh kar klow hawt sünta ang diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:169">en kowh laiklow kowi uowi iawng pe ang tukra diah.<verse eid="PSA 119:169" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="170" style="v" sid="PSA 119:170" />Ang awr lü awr leng mih maten hawt sünta ang diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:170">en kowh laikham kowi uowi iawng uang lawng ang diah.<verse eid="PSA 119:170" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="171" style="v" sid="PSA 119:171" />Ang kowh ve hownia en kowh rowsi lai pacham ue reng lah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:171">Tawngplawng kowchow panow en kowh rirow tüngsang ang mih dow en chowtaih.<verse eid="PSA 119:171" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="172" style="v" sid="PSA 119:172" />Ang kowh nawr dow en kowh laikham hown pacham tek meng lah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:172">Tawngplawng kowchow panow en kowh ana pek maten dow anowmma chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 119:172" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="173" style="v" sid="PSA 119:173" />En kowh rut mih nakhowng ang kownkow kamrütma pacham uowi lah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:173">Tawngplawng kowchow panow en tiama kowi namang kown mih ang kamrüt khowk.<verse eid="PSA 119:173" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="174" style="v" sid="PSA 119:174" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, en nalawng ang kown mih kowi süngürma ang chawng khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:174">en kowh ari aiang kowi ang sak piaw reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 119:174" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="175" style="v" sid="PSA 119:175" />Ang naia kiow en reng kownkow pe sing ang reng diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:175">now en kowh rirow mih pacham khowng ang reng lah.<verse eid="PSA 119:175" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="176" style="v" sid="PSA 119:176" />Tama mih ruapur iawng dow tiama tawi kowi ang cham mang khai bowt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:176">en kowh nar kowi uang krawi chamah diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:176">en kowh ana pek mih ang tamata dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 119:176" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 119" />
  <chapter number="120" style="c" sid="PSA 120" />
  <para style="s">Ang kaucha nga lai kowbow!</para>
  <para style="d">Mami dow Thurai chup kim kowi kowkowi khe kowh meng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 120:1" />Ang kla phih khe CHAKRAMANG kowi ang hawah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 120:1">nahanow aia dow uang klang ang khai.<verse eid="PSA 120:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 120:2" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, dailama mih nawr hownia uang towkala ang diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 120:2">now kuanlama mih dai hownia paw uang towkala ang diah.<verse eid="PSA 120:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 120:3" />Aw kuanlalu, tawng chow Thurai pe en kown?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 120:3">Aia pe en ripra ngamlam dowi tham pabow?<verse eid="PSA 120:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 120:4" />Aia dow tasen müa achukma mih leba sek hown naap en kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 120:4">now mairing hown aia natowk en kown.<verse eid="PSA 120:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 120:5" />Uh! Ang kaucha nga lai kowbow!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 120:5">Saksing sana dowi mih Mesek hai Kedaruüa uowi rah kowi pache ang tuk ka uowi khai.<verse eid="PSA 120:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 120:6" />Thaulangra kowi maru kawmuüa dow sui khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 120:6">naiawng mih maru-uüa hown dow taiua uowi kown ang nau dowi chowdiah.<verse eid="PSA 120:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 120:7" />Ang dow thaulangma uowi kown ang lang nau chowdiah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 120:7">Nachenganchepaw thaulangma nauowi kown mih ang tek hanow</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 120:7">amatni dow hau ang tasen reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 120:7" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 120" />
  <chapter number="121" style="c" sid="PSA 121" />
  <para style="s">CHAKRAMANG dow katpaw müi dowi</para>
  <para style="d">Mami dow Thurai chup kim kowi kowkowi khe kowh meng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 121:1" />Hungh prakowi ang tang mü khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 121:1">“Tawng hownia chow ang naka khowngra kown,” padow ang tatuak khai.<verse eid="PSA 121:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 121:2" />CHAKRAMANG hownia chowtaih ang naka khowngra kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 121:2">aia dow krawng hai mukuang thawp miia chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 121:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 121:3" />En kowh mingkhet miia dow katpaw müi dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 121:3">Naiawng rakowi aia mih katpaw pe tatheu en kown nadowi.<verse eid="PSA 121:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 121:4" />Israeluüa kowh kruitown miia dow katpaw müi dowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 121:4">now katpaw sunguk dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 121:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 121:5" />Takhula en miia dow CHAKRAMANG chowtaih.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 121:5">Aia dow nim iawng en tut-e tawi uowila en reng.<verse eid="PSA 121:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 121:6" />Ni-e khe sat mih tawngpaw napiak en kown nadowi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 121:6">uar-e khe paw lama mih tawngpaw napiak en kown nadowi.<verse eid="PSA 121:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 121:7" />Phih maten hownia CHAKRAMANG chowtaih natowkala en kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 121:7">en kowh chownglawng dow athaulangma aia natow en reng kown.<verse eid="PSA 121:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 121:8" />CHAKRAMANG dow ni towng nachawng en reng kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 121:8">kawmat hownia chowngchowng saksakma natawi uowila en reng kown.<verse eid="PSA 121:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 121" />
  <chapter number="122" style="c" sid="PSA 122" />
  <para style="s">Chu, CHAKRAMANG chup kim kowi a-i kowkowi lah</para>
  <para style="d">Mami dow David kowh meng chekhai. Mami dow Thurai chup kim kowi kowkowi khe kowh meng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 122:1" />“Chu, CHAKRAMANG kim kowi a-i kowkowi lah,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 122:1">pahai maru tek ang khe lainowmma ang awmrawm khai.<verse eid="PSA 122:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 122:2" />Aw Jerusalem, en tapplawt lak kowi anging uang kup khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 122:2">now nakowi dow anging uang iowng khai.<verse eid="PSA 122:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 122:3" />Jerusalem marow dow klangiungma thawpah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 122:3">nami marow dow akhawtma thawpah khai.<verse eid="PSA 122:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 122:4" />Nami marow kowi dow Israel chenchap maten kowkowi khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 122:4">now CHAKRAMANG kowh maru maten paw nakowi kowkowi khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 122:4">Nakowi amatni kowkowi mih dow Israeluüa kowi peah ana iawng</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 122:4">CHAKRAMANG kowi nakowtek pe awmrawm lai kownkow chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 122:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 122:5" />Nakowi dow chetla tara reng mih mang chowm rah maten uowi bowk chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 122:5">nami mang chowm rah hownia David krungchakuüa kowi dow chet pe tara reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 122:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 122:6" />Jerusalem marow thaulangma nauowila kownkow maiawng chup Thurai büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 122:6">“Jerusalem marow kowi sakrau miuüa dow aiungma pauowi lah.<verse eid="PSA 122:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 122:7" />Jerusalem marow tap lak kowi kowh uowi miuüa dow thaulangma pacham uowi lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 122:7">now mang kimkrowng kowi kowh uowi miuüa tut-e paw phih hang pacham uowi lah,” pahai tek büa diah.<verse eid="PSA 122:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 122:8" />Ang tainau-uüa hai auiuauüa kowi tuakla se ang natek kown mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 122:8">“Jerusalem marow kowi dow thaulangra pacham uowi lah,” napa kown.<verse eid="PSA 122:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 122:9" />CHAKRAMANG anging kowh Thurai chup kim dow Jerusalem marow kowi uowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 122:9">ang dow Jerusalem marow iung müa vüi ang nalü prasi reng kown.<verse eid="PSA 122:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 122" />
  <chapter number="123" style="c" sid="PSA 123" />
  <para style="s">Ang dow en prakowi chowtaih tang mü reng</para>
  <para style="d">Mami dow Thurai chup kim kowi kowkowi khe kowh meng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 123:1" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, ang dow en prakowi chowtaih tang mü reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 123:1">en dow mukuang kowi kowh mang chowm rah kowi uowi reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 123:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 123:2" />Kim iah luk kowi naruüa dow neplawng nesak reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 123:2">now narmauüa paw kim iah masi luk kowi neplawng nesak reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 123:2">Nami iawng dow a-i paw CHAKRAMANG a-i kowh Thurai</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 123:2">saksing sana a-i dowi mowr aia luk kowi a-i neplawng nesak kown.<verse eid="PSA 123:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 123:3" />Saksing sana anging diah, aw CHAKRAMANG, saksing sana anging diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 123:3">Tawngplawng kowchow panow anging kowh ransu-uüa dow lainowmma sui anging khai.<verse eid="PSA 123:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 123:4" />Kurengma miuüa dow prawngren anging khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 123:4">abawrima miuüa dow lainowmma sui anging khai.<verse eid="PSA 123:4" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 123" />
  <chapter number="124" style="c" sid="PSA 124" />
  <para style="s">CHAKRAMANG hownia chowtaih anging ka khowngra reng</para>
  <para style="d">Mami dow David kowh meng chekhai. Mami dow Thurai chup kim kowi kowkowi khe kowh meng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 124:1" />Israeluüa maiawng pacham tek lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 124:1">“CHAKRAMANG che tawi tangila anging dowi e dow,<verse eid="PSA 124:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2-3" style="v" sid="PSA 124:2-3" />ransu-uüa uang sen anging mih khin khe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 124:2-3">amatni kunmarau anging mih khin khe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 124:2-3">amatni dow asing nachata anging kown chowdiah.<verse eid="PSA 124:2-3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 124:4" />Tui lawt khe kowh iawng amatni dow nawmla anging kown chowdiah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 124:4">hawr dawilawi mih tui sa hown nawmla anging kown chowdiah.<verse eid="PSA 124:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 124:5" />Talowng phunglung mih tui anging luk iawng nauang hawr kown chowdiah,” pahai pacham tek lah.<verse eid="PSA 124:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 124:6" />CHAKRAMANG dow ransu-uüa rut hownia towkala anging khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 124:6">Naiawng rakowi CHAKRAMANG dow akiow pacham uowi lah.<verse eid="PSA 124:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 124:7" />Chakmit mih leng hownia uakling ia powt iawng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 124:7">ransu-uüa hownia anging paw ia powt khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 124:7">Ransu-uüa thang anging mih leng dow tarai khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 124:7">now nami hownia anging ia powt khai.<verse eid="PSA 124:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 124:8" />Anging kowh khowngra uang ting mih dow CHAKRAMANG hownia chowtaih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 124:8">aia dow krawng hai mukuang thawp miia chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 124:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 124" />
  <chapter number="125" style="c" sid="PSA 125" />
  <para style="s">CHAKRAMANG kowh maru-uüa thaulangra</para>
  <para style="d">Mami dow Thurai chup kim kowi kowkowi khe kowh meng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 125:1" />CHAKRAMANG luk kowi kowh neplawng nesak miuüa dow anikma nauowi reng kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 125:1">amatni dow Zaiawn hungh iawng anikma hai chowngchowng saksakma nauowi reng kown.<verse eid="PSA 125:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 125:2" />Jerusalem marow riaret kowi dow hungma mawngma tapat lut chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 125:2">nami iawng dow CHAKRAMANG mih aia maru-uüa kowi umta lut khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 125:2">Aia dow aia maru-uüa kowi kawmat hownia chowngchowng saksakma natakla reng kown.<verse eid="PSA 125:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 125:3" />Maru ngakuüa dow achinawmma miuüa kowi nakruitown kown nadowi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 125:3">Naiawng rakowi achinawmma miuüa dow nachang lup ngak kown nadowi bowt.<verse eid="PSA 125:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 125:4" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, maru iunguüa kowi dow peah iungra diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 125:4">now saktuak achinawmma miuüa kowi paw peah iungra diah.<verse eid="PSA 125:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 125:5" />Tawkche maru ngakuüa kowi dow CHAKRAMANG naripah kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 125:5">nami khin khe aia tiama nuata miuüa kowi paw aia mih naripla kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 125:5">Israeluüa luk kowi taking tasangra pacham uowi lah!<verse eid="PSA 125:5" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 125" />
  <chapter number="126" style="c" sid="PSA 126" />
  <para style="s">Thurai tut-e plan lü iungra mih</para>
  <para style="d">Mami dow Thurai chup kim kowi kowkowi khe kowh meng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 126:1" />Nar kowi <char style="w">takhangra</char> hownia CHAKRAMANG dow Jerusalem marow kowi uang plan pawla anging khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 126:1">Nami dow khi mang mih iawng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 126:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 126:2" />Nakhowk khe anging dow awmrawm kowh renla sawm khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 126:2">now anging tek awmrawm meng khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 126:2">Nakhowk khe akeng chenchapuüa dow tatek mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 126:2">“CHAKRAMANG dow kowbüah vüi kri kraingma mih lup ahuma chang pe khai,” pakhai.<verse eid="PSA 126:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 126:3" />CHAKRAMANG dow anging vüi kri kraingma mih lup chang anging khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 126:3">Naiawng rakowi anging dow lainowmma piaw khai.<verse eid="PSA 126:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 126:4" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, alai khe kowh iawng uang plan pe anging iungra diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 126:4">Negeb süngrüp süngkangma kowi tui hawr iawng aiungma plan chang anging diah.<verse eid="PSA 126:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 126:5" />Hawkla mik tui se sawt liu miuüa dow nangen luprak kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 126:5">amatni dow apiawma hown nangen luprak kown.<verse eid="PSA 126:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 126:6" />Kar se sawt liu mih maru dow apiawma nangen luprak kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 126:6">aia dow apiawma hown aia kim kowi napawla luprak kown.<verse eid="PSA 126:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 126" />
  <chapter number="127" style="c" sid="PSA 127" />
  <para style="s">CHAKRAMANG kowi sakrau mih maru dow ka iungra reng</para>
  <para style="d">Mami dow Sawlawmawn kowh meng chekhai. Mami dow Thurai chup kim kowi kowkowi khe kowh meng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 127:1" />CHAKRAMANG che thawp kim dowi hanow kim chang miuüa kowh lup aiawnglowma taih chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 127:1">CHAKRAMANG che towkala dowi hanow marow chawng miuüa kowh lup aiawnglowma taih chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 127:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 127:2" />Nacham chang lup kownkow murpa awr rü mih dow iawm khin mih chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 127:2">now uar dawng klowng lowng chang lup mih paw iawm khin mih chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 127:2">Tawngplawng kowchow panow CHAKRAMANG dow aia sakrau miuüa kowi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 127:2">müi khe paw amatni lakke mih srui aia peah reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 127:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 127:3" />Chauüa dow CHAKRAMANG hownia kowh kaah mih dawngthawnguan chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 127:3">mu lak kowi kowh chauüa dow aia hownia kowh kaah mih awmrawm sung chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 127:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 127:4" />Klanguüa khe kowh kaah mih chauüa dow maratra lang uowi chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 127:4">amatni dow siphai rut kowi kowh leba sek iawng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 127:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 127:5" />Leba rowng kowi leba sek atekma mih iawng chauüa kawmma mih maru dow prasira uowima chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 127:5">amatni dow marow tapplawt ria kowi ransu-uüa hown chet tara chepaw rukrai büah dowi tham.<verse eid="PSA 127:5" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 127" />
  <chapter number="128" style="c" sid="PSA 128" />
  <para style="s">CHAKRAMANG kowi ringkaw mih dow prasira uowima</para>
  <para style="d">Mami dow Thurai chup kim kowi kowkowi khe kowh meng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 128:1" />CHAKRAMANG kowi ringkawma hown kram mih maru dow prasira uowima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 128:1">now aia tiama kowi mang mih maru paw prasira uowima chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 128:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 128:2" />En kowh kawm rak dow en naka cha kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 128:2">asowrma hai aiungma en naka uowi kown.<verse eid="PSA 128:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 128:3" />En masi mih auih chakma mih grep ruih iawng naka chah kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 128:3">en kowh chauüa dow kanrawn pawi awr iuk iawng</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 128:3">pawitang riaret kowi naiuk nasown kown.<verse eid="PSA 128:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 128:4" />CHAKRAMANG kowi ringkawma hown kram mih maru dow naiawng hai naka prasi kown.<verse eid="PSA 128:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 128:5" />CHAKRAMANG dow Zaiawn hownia pacham pe en prasi lah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 128:5">Jerusalem marow dow chownglawng prat aiungma pacham khi en lah.<verse eid="PSA 128:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 128:6" />En kowh chu cheuüa kowi dow en pacham khila lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 128:6">Israeluüa luk kowi dow thaulangra pauang cham ting lah.<verse eid="PSA 128:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 128" />
  <chapter number="129" style="c" sid="PSA 129" />
  <para style="s">Asowmchow hownia ransu-uüa dow chang ang nowng khai</para>
  <para style="d">Mami dow Thurai chup kim kowi kowkowi khe kowh meng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 129:1" />Israel dow maiawng pacham tek lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 129:1">“Asowmchow hownia ransu-uüa dow lainowmma chang ang nowng khai.<verse eid="PSA 129:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 129:2" />Amatni dow asowmchow hownia lainowmma chang ang nowng khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 129:2">Nachenganchepaw amatni dow nowng sum ang dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 129:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 129:3" />Amatni dow ka ma pat kumlawng kowi bawp ang khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 129:3">ang kowh ma büp krang dow laithawn tim hown kowh laithawn ia iawng towbowt.<verse eid="PSA 129:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 129:4" />Nachenganchepaw CHAKRAMANG dow achinawmma chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 129:4">aia dow maru ngakuüa rut hownia uang klan ang khai,” pahai pacham tek lah.<verse eid="PSA 129:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 129:5" />Zaiawn kowi sui miuüa dow pacham ka rukrai lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 129:5">now amatni dow kung prakowi pacham plan lah.<verse eid="PSA 129:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 129:6" />Kimluk kowi kowh awm mih bawrchak dow awr sa dowi rawn keu reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 129:6">nami iawng amatni paw akhin nadowi khe pacham piak reng lah.<verse eid="PSA 129:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 129:7" />Nami bawrchak dow laih chang miuüa krawi ngenah dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 129:7">now nami bawrchak dow nungra kowi paw amiapaw pawla dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 129:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 129:8" />Zaiawn kowi kowh ransu-uüa ria iawng mang miuüa dow,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 129:8">“CHAKRAMANG pacham pe enni prasi lah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 129:8">CHAKRAMANG dow pacham pe enni iungra lah,” pahai natek kown nadowi.<verse eid="PSA 129:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 129" />
  <chapter number="130" style="c" sid="PSA 130" />
  <para style="s">Ang kowh sak dow CHAKRAMANG kowi hawt chawngah reng</para>
  <para style="d">Mami dow Thurai chup kim kowi kowkowi khe kowh meng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 130:1" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, ang dow lainowmma krat pusa khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 130:1">Naiawng rakowi nauang khowng ang kownkow ang haw en khai.<verse eid="PSA 130:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 130:2" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, ang kowh hawk klow sünta diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 130:2">ang kowh kar klow kowi pe param diah.<verse eid="PSA 130:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 130:3" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, en che anging kowh angak klowk anging khai hanow</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 130:3">en pur kowi amia chow nowng iowng kown?<verse eid="PSA 130:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 130:4" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, lawt anging diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 130:4">nahanow anging mih ringkawma hown nakram en kown.<verse eid="PSA 130:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 130:5" />Ang dow CHAKRAMANG kowi hawt chawngah reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 130:5">ang kowh sak dow aia kowi hawt chawngah reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 130:5">Ang dow aia kowh laiklow kowi owmsak reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 130:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 130:6" />Kangchawng miuüa dow chawng uar thowi reng chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 130:6">nami lak-e ang kowh sak dow CHAKRAMANG kowi lang chawng rowt chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 130:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 130:7" />Aw Israel, CHAKRAMANG luk kowi owmsak diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 130:7">tawngplawng kowchow panow CHAKRAMANG kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura dow anikma chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 130:7">now aia dow nalawng maru kown mih atungma nau reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 130:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 130:8" />Israeluüa kowi dow aia nalawngah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 130:8">amatni kowh angak maten hownia aia nalawngah kown.<verse eid="PSA 130:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 130" />
  <chapter number="131" style="c" sid="PSA 131" />
  <para style="s">CHAKRAMANG luk kowi owmsak diah</para>
  <para style="d">Mami dow David kowh meng chekhai. Mami dow Thurai chup kim kowi kowkowi khe kowh meng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 131:1" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, ang kowh sak dow bawrima nadowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 131:1">now ang kowh mik kowi paw bawrira uowi dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 131:1">Aiukma hai akratma mih lup ang nowng chang dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 131:1">ang dow nami lawnguan kowi hing tuak dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 131:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 131:2" />Nami lak-e ang dow ang kowh sak kowi aklamma hai ririmma ang towah khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 131:2">iawn kham towng mih ngeuüa dow a-u tut-e aklamma chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 131:2">nami iawng dow ang tut-e ang kowh sak mih aklamma chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 131:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 131:3" />Aw Israel, CHAKRAMANG luk kowi owmsak diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 131:3">kawmat hownia chowngchowng saksakma owmsak diah.<verse eid="PSA 131:3" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 131" />
  <chapter number="132" style="c" sid="PSA 132" />
  <para style="s">Zaiawn marow kowi CHAKRAMANG lang kloah mih</para>
  <para style="d">Mami dow Thurai chup kim kowi kowkowi khe kowh meng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 132:1" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, mang David kowi hangkow tamata diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:1">aia kowh akrat pusara laiklow maten ka tuakah diah.<verse eid="PSA 132:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 132:2" />Aia dow en tut-e takham khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:2">aia dow Jakawb kowh akürma mih Thurai tut-e maiawng takham khai,<verse eid="PSA 132:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3-5" style="v" sid="PSA 132:3-5" />“CHAKRAMANG vüi ang ka pe uowi rah dowi mowr,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:3-5">Jakawb kowh akürma mih Thurai vüi ang ka pe uowi rah dowi mowr,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 132:3-5">ang kim kowi ang nakup kown nadowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:3-5">mawk rah kowi paw ang namawk kown nadowi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 132:3-5">Mik kowi paw ang nape müi rauah kown nadowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:3-5">mik khowm padow ang naklipah kown nadowi,” pakhai.<verse eid="PSA 132:3-5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 132:6" />Sangbowk laitawm tawkpla uowi mih satang Efrat kua kowi anging ta khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:6">now nami sangbowk laitawm tawkpla dow Jaar dowm kowi anging kowka khai.<verse eid="PSA 132:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 132:7" />Anging tek mih, “Chu, CHAKRAMANG kim kowi a-i kowkowi lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:7">now aia khawk towk rah kowi tabawk krawm se a-i kowchupah lah,” pakhai.<verse eid="PSA 132:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 132:8" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, awr rü diah, en kowh tanaira kowi uang uowi diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:8">now en kowh kür matra, en kowh sangbowk laitawm tawkpla paw kupla diah.<verse eid="PSA 132:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 132:9" />En kowh uamowuüa achinawmma mih tawnguat pacham khup lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:9">now en kowh maru-uüa mih awmrawmma hown pacham tek meng lah.<verse eid="PSA 132:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 132:10" />En kowh nar David rakowi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:10">en nümnapah mih mang kowi hangkow nuata diah.<verse eid="PSA 132:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 132:11" />Mapaw napiakah dowi kown mih laikham David tut-e maiawng en takham khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:11">“En kowh chapa lowk ia kowi en kowh mang chowm rah kowi ang nape chowmah kown.<verse eid="PSA 132:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 132:12" />En kowh chapauüa che ang kowh sangbowk laitawm chün hai ang natüngsangah kown mih ang kowh laiklow chün khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:12">nahanow amatni kowh chauüa kowi paw chowngchowng saksakma en kowh mang chowm rah kowi ang nape chowmah kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="PSA 132:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 132:13" />CHAKRAMANG mih Zaiawn kowi lang kloah khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:13">nami marow dow aia nachangla uowi rah kownkow aia nauah mih chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 132:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 132:14" />Aia tek mih, “Mami dow chowngchowng saksakma vüi ang kowh tanaira chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:14">makowi ang nauowi kown; tawngplawng kowchow panow makowi chekhai uowi kown ang nau.<verse eid="PSA 132:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 132:15" />Zaiawn marow kowi chakkham ahuma hown ang napeah prasi kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:15">nakowi kowh ngarai miuüa kowi dow chakkham hown ang nape duah kown.<verse eid="PSA 132:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 132:16" />Zaiawn kowi kowh uamowuüa kowi dow prasira tawnguat ang nakhup pe kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:16">nakowi kowh ringkaw ang miuüa dow awmrawmma hown atün atünma natek meng kown.<verse eid="PSA 132:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 132:17" />Nakowi mih David vüi akürma mih krungchak ang narüng pe kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:17">ang nümnapah mih mang dow ang maru vüi anowi iawng naphaw kown.<verse eid="PSA 132:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 132:18" />Aia kowh ransu-uüa kowi dow ang nakhup pe rukraira tawnguat kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:18">Nachenganchepaw aia lu kowi dow mang lukruk tawk pluplup mih ang nakruk pe kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="PSA 132:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 132" />
  <chapter number="133" style="c" sid="PSA 133" />
  <para style="s">Takrüp tangi mih iung krang</para>
  <para style="d">Mami dow David kowh meng chekhai. Mami dow Thurai chup kim kowi kowkowi khe kowh meng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 133:1" />Thurai maru-uüa akrüp angi sang taiua uowi khe lainowmma iung khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 133:1">now lainowmma sowr uowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 133:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 133:2" />Amatni akrüp sang uowi mih dow lainowmma klangiung khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 133:2">Nami dow Arawn lu kowi kowh phawkah mih asung khakma mih sau iawng aiungma chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 133:2">Nami dow mawmpawi iawng iu iar hanow</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 133:2">kowrmow ngawng kowi sisürchow mih iawng klangiungma chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 133:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 133:3" />Nami dow Harmawn hungh kowi kowh nang tui</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 133:3">Zaiawn hungh kowi iu iat mih iawng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 133:3">Tawngplawng kowchow panow nakowi dow CHAKRAMANG peah prasi khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 133:3">nami prasira dow chowngchowng saksakma sing müa chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 133:3" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 133" />
  <chapter number="134" style="c" sid="PSA 134" />
  <para style="s">Mukuang hai lusa thawp mih dow CHAKRAMANG chekhai</para>
  <para style="d">Mami dow Thurai chup kim kowi kowkowi khe kowh meng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 134:1" />CHAKRAMANG kowh lup chang miuüa low, aia kowi rowsi büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 134:1">CHAKRAMANG kim kowi uar-e chang lup miuüa low, aia kowi rowsi büa diah.<verse eid="PSA 134:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 134:2" />Arah chimsaima mih prakowi iaw rut se</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 134:2">CHAKRAMANG kowi rowsi büa diah.<verse eid="PSA 134:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 134:3" />Mukuang hai lusa thawp miia dow CHAKRAMANG chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 134:3">aia dow Zaiawn hungh hownia pacham pe enni prasi lah.<verse eid="PSA 134:3" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 134" />
  <chapter number="135" style="c" sid="PSA 135" />
  <para style="s">CHAKRAMANG dow aiungma rakowi aia kowi kiowah diah</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1-2" style="v" sid="PSA 135:1-2" />CHAKRAMANG kowi kiow büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:1-2">CHAKRAMANG ming kowi rowsi büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 135:1-2">CHAKRAMANG kim kowi kowh lup chang miuüa low,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:1-2">CHAKRAMANG kowi rowsi büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 135:1-2">Anging kowh Thurai chup kim viadawng kowi chang lup miuüa low,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:1-2">CHAKRAMANG kowi rowsi büa diah.<verse eid="PSA 135:1-2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 135:3" />CHAKRAMANG dow aiungma.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:3">Naiawng rakowi aia kowi kiow büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 135:3">Aia dow saksing sana reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:3">Naiawng rakowi aia ming kowi rowsi meng tek büa diah.<verse eid="PSA 135:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 135:4" />CHAKRAMANG dow aiamat vüi Jakawb kowi kloah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:4">aia dow asung uowima mih dawngthawnguan nachangla kownkow Israel kowi kloah khai.<verse eid="PSA 135:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 135:5" />CHAKRAMANG dow kri kraingma pami ang tuk chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:5">anging kowh CHAKRAMANG dow akeng mih thurai lak-e kri kraing chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 135:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 135:6" />CHAKRAMANG dow lowra kowi aia nau iawng krawi chang lup reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:6">aia dow mukuang kowi, lusa kowi hai sata abüpma mih kowi aia nau iawng krawi chang lup reng.<verse eid="PSA 135:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 135:7" />Aia dow prenchur nammowt hownia uang pawla uangnim reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:7">aia dow pla nowi hailawm uangchak kowi uang pe klaah reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 135:7">Now li kowi dow aia uowi rah hownia uang pe hutah reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 135:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 135:8" />Aigupta pren kowi kowh chapa ta maten kowi saita mih dow aia chowtaih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:8">aia dow chapa ta hai tawncher kowi kowh rik pen mih ala maten kowi saita pe khai.<verse eid="PSA 135:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 135:9" />Aia dow Faraw hai aia kowh maru iukuüa kowi naripah kownkow</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:9">Aigupta pren kowi amatra hai awdara lup chang pe khai.<verse eid="PSA 135:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 135:10" />Aia dow chenchap ahuma kowi piakah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:10">now akürma mih manguüa kowi saita khai.<verse eid="PSA 135:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 135:11" />Aia dow Amawruüa kowh mang Sihun hai Basan pren mang Awg kowi saita khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:11">now Kanan pren kowi kowh manguüa maten kowi paw aia saita bowk khai.<verse eid="PSA 135:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 135:12" />Aia dow amatni kowh pren maten powngta pe bowk khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:12">now naiawngün pren mih aia maru Israeluüa kowi aia peah khai.<verse eid="PSA 135:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 135:13" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, en kowh ming dow atungma maru natuakah reng kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:13">Aw CHAKRAMANG, en kowh ming iung nang iung dow chowngchowng saksakma anikma chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 135:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 135:14" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow CHAKRAMANG dow aia maru-uüa kowi nachet pe tara nowm kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:14">now aia kowh naruüa kowi nasaksing sanaah reng kown.<verse eid="PSA 135:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 135:15" />Akeng chenchapuüa kowh thurai dow kuh hai tai hown kowh thawpah mih chowtaih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:15">naiawngün dow lusa maru rut hown kowh thawpah mih chowtaih.<verse eid="PSA 135:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 135:16" />Amatni kowh dow nawr uowi chowdiah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:16">Tawkche nowng tek lai dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 135:16">Mik paw uowi chowdiah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:16">tawngpaw ia khi dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 135:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 135:17" />Amatni kowh dow param uowi chepaw ia ta dowi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:17">now amatni dow nawr hownia nowng hü sak dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 135:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 135:18" />Naiawngün arup aren thawp miuüa dow naiawngün arup aren iawng naown kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:18">now naiawngün luk kowi owm miuüa hai neplawng nesak miuüa paw naiawngün arup iawng naown kown.<verse eid="PSA 135:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 135:19" />Israel krungchakuüa low, CHAKRAMANG kowi kiow büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:19">Arawn kowh krungchakuüa low, CHAKRAMANG kowi kiow büa diah.<verse eid="PSA 135:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 135:20" />Levi krungchakuüa low, CHAKRAMANG kowi kiow büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:20">CHAKRAMANG kowi ringkaw miuüa low, aia kowi kiow büa diah,<verse eid="PSA 135:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 135:21" />Zaiawn marow kowi CHAKRAMANG kowi rowsiah büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:21">Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia dow Jerusalem marow kowi uowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 135:21">CHAKRAMANG kowi kiow büa diah.<verse eid="PSA 135:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 135" />
  <chapter number="136" style="c" sid="PSA 136" />
  <para style="s">CHAKRAMANG kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 136:1" />CHAKRAMANG dow aiungma chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:1">Naiawng rakowi aia kowi dow tek pe awmrawm lai diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 136:1">Aia kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura dow chowngchowng saksakma anikma chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 136:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 136:2" />Thurai dow thuraiuüa maten lak-e lang kri lang kraing chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:2">Naiawng rakowi aia kowi dow tek pe awmrawm lai diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 136:2">Aia kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura dow chowngchowng saksakma anikma chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 136:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 136:3" />CHAKRAMANG dow chakramang maten lak-e lang kri lang kraing chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:3">Naiawng rakowi aia kowi dow tek pe awmrawm lai diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 136:3">Aia kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura dow chowngchowng saksakma anikma chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 136:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 136:4" />Awdara lup chang mih dow Thurai lowkchow taih chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:4">aia kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura dow chowngchowng saksakma anikma chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 136:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 136:5" />Aia dow aiamat kowh chanlaira hown mukuang mih thawpah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:5">aia kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura dow chowngchowng saksakma anikma chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 136:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 136:6" />Aia dow tui abüpma mih luk kowi thawp lusa miia chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:6">aia kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura dow chowngchowng saksakma anikma chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 136:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 136:7" />Aia dow aiuk aiukma mih anowi thawpah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:7">aia kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura dow chowngchowng saksakma anikma chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 136:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 136:8" />Aia dow ni-e nachang alow kownkow sat kowi thawpah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:8">aia kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura dow chowngchowng saksakma anikma chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 136:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 136:9" />Aia dow uar-e nachang alow kownkow krek hai lama kowi thawpah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:9">aia kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura dow chowngchowng saksakma anikma chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 136:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 136:10" />Aia dow Aigupta prenchakuüa kowh chapa ta maten kowi saita pe khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:10">aia kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura dow chowngchowng saksakma anikma chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 136:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 136:11" />Aia dow Aigupta pren hownia Israeluüa kowi uang lawtla khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:11">aia kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura dow chowngchowng saksakma anikma chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 136:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 136:12" />Aia dow aia kowh akürma mih rut hown Israeluüa kowi uang lawtla khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:12">aia kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura dow chowngchowng saksakma anikma chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 136:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 136:13" />Aia dow Sata Rik kowi pe taakah hanow changah pre bak khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:13">aia kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura dow chowngchowng saksakma anikma chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 136:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 136:14" />Aia dow sata tui takra iawng Israeluüa kowi uang pawla khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:14">aia kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura dow chowngchowng saksakma anikma chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 136:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 136:15" />Aia dow Faraw hai aia kowh siphaiuüa kowi sata tui kowi pe tamirah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:15">aia kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura dow chowngchowng saksakma anikma chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 136:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 136:16" />Aia dow aia maru-uüa kowi süngrüp süngkangma iawng kruila khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:16">aia kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura dow chowngchowng saksakma anikma chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 136:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 136:17" />Aia dow akür akürma mih manguüa kowi nowngta khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:17">aia kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura dow chowngchowng saksakma anikma chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 136:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 136:18" />Aia dow aming anang iukma mih manguüa kowi saita khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:18">aia kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura dow chowngchowng saksakma anikma chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 136:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 136:19" />Aia dow Amawruüa kowh mang Sihun kowi saita khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:19">aia kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura dow chowngchowng saksakma anikma chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 136:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 136:20" />Aia dow Basan marow kowi kowh mang Awg kowi saita khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:20">aia kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura dow chowngchowng saksakma anikma chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 136:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 136:21" />Aia dow Israeluüa kowi mih Basan hai Amawruüa kowh pren pe powngah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:21">aia kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura dow chowngchowng saksakma anikma chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 136:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 136:22" />Aia dow aia ransu-uüa kowh pren anar Israeluüa kowi pe powngah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:22">aia kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura dow chowngchowng saksakma anikma chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 136:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 136:23" />Akrat pusa hown anging uowi khe paw CHAKRAMANG dow tuk anging reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:23">aia kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura dow chowngchowng saksakma anikma chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 136:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 136:24" />Aia dow ransu-uüa rut hownia lawng anging reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:24">aia kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura dow chowngchowng saksakma anikma chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 136:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 136:25" />Aia dow asak uowi mih chap maten kowi peah chakkham reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:25">aia kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura dow chowngchowng saksakma anikma chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 136:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 136:26" />Mukuang kowi kowh uowi mih Thurai kowi tek pe awmrawm lai büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:26">aia kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura dow chowngchowng saksakma anikma chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 136:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 136" />
  <chapter number="137" style="c" sid="PSA 137" />
  <para style="s">Takhang rakowi Israeluüa taprüa tanguk mih</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 137:1" />Babulawn pren kowi anging cham takhang khe nakowi kowh aw pang kowi anging cham chowm reng;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 137:1">nakhowk khe Zaiawn marow lawnguan anging ka tuak hanow kar hai mik tui hown anging uowi reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 137:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 137:2" />Nakhowk khe anging sak nga lai rakowi tep taraw kown khowm anging talawt dowi chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 137:2">naiawng rakowi anging kowh taraw mih anging cham batta khai.<verse eid="PSA 137:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 137:3" />Khümla anging miuüa dow kür hown pe tek anging meng khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 137:3">chang anging nowng miuüa dow awmrawm meng ün pe tek anging khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 137:3">Amatni dow, “Zaiawn marow lawnguan kowi tek meng büa lowk madiah,” pahai chin anging reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 137:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 137:4" />Nachenganchepaw anging dow prenlang kowi cham takhang mih chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 137:4">tawng iawng chow CHAKRAMANG lawnguan kowi anging nowng tek meng chow?<verse eid="PSA 137:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 137:5" />Aw Jerusalem marow, ang che tamata en khai hanow</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 137:5">ang mih hang pacham nowng tep taraw tham bowt lah.<verse eid="PSA 137:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 137:6" />Ang che ka tuak en reng dowi hanow,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 137:6">ang lang awmrawmah mih uanh lak-e ang lang tow en asung dowi hanow</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 137:6">ang kowh dai mih ia tek meng dowi pat krang kowi pacham tadan hüah lah.<verse eid="PSA 137:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 137:7" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, Jerusalem piak khe tawng chow Edawmuüa chang mih tuakah diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 137:7">amatni tek mih, “Piakta bowt, achüng lawi khowm uowi dowi pat piakta bowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="PSA 137:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 137:8" />Aw Babulawnuüa, enni dow napiak kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 137:8">enni chang anging iawng nachang enni kown mih maru dow kaucha iuk lai kowbow!<verse eid="PSA 137:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 137:9" />Enni kowh chauüa kowi dowkah hanow</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 137:9">hua luk kowi natheuah kown mih maru dow kaucha iuk lai kowbow!<verse eid="PSA 137:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 137" />
  <chapter number="138" style="c" sid="PSA 138" />
  <para style="s">CHAKRAMANG dow bowkbowk luk kowi chekhai</para>
  <para style="d">Mami dow David kowh meng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 138:1" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, ang kowh sak maiow hown ang nakiow en kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 138:1">akeng mih thuraiuüa pur kowi paw ang natek en rowsi meng kown.<verse eid="PSA 138:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 138:2" />En kowh chimsaima mih kim prakowi tabawk krawm se ang nachupiia en kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 138:2">en kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura hai kaah sakowm mih ming kowi ang nakiow kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 138:2">Tawngplawng kowchow panow en kowh laikham en pe tachiah mih hown en matia kowi en tungah khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 138:2">nami dow en kowh ming iung nang iung lak-e lang kri lang kraing chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 138:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 138:3" />Ang uang haw en hanow en uang klang ang reng chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 138:3">en pe ang kür hanow sakkraingma en chang ang khai.<verse eid="PSA 138:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 138:4" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, en nawr hownia kowh laiklow ta hanow</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 138:4">lusa kowi kowh manguüa maten narowsi kiowri en reng kown.<verse eid="PSA 138:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 138:5" />Amatni dow CHAKRAMANG changah mih lup lawnguan kowi natek meng kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 138:5">Tawngplawng kowchow panow CHAKRAMANG kowh kraingra dow kri kraingma chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 138:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 138:6" />CHAKRAMANG dow bowkbowk luk kowi uowi mih chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 138:6">Nachenganchepaw aia dow khamsum khamdaw miuüa kowi mingkhetah reng.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 138:6">Tawkche alakma hownia paw aia dow bawrima miuüa tawng chow chang mih khi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 138:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 138:7" />Ang riaret kowi akrat pusara kangowh mih khin khe en uang takhula ang reng chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 138:7">ang ransu-uüa kunmarau mih khin khe amatni kowi en senah reng khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 138:7">now en kowh hawmlawm rut akürma mih hown en lawng ang reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 138:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 138:8" />CHAKRAMANG dow ang vüi kowi kowh khowm bowkta mih iawng nachang ang kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 138:8">aw CHAKRAMANG, en kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura dow chowngchowng saksakma nauowi reng kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 138:8">En uownta mih lup dow chur pat changah diah.<verse eid="PSA 138:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 138" />
  <chapter number="139" style="c" sid="PSA 139" />
  <para style="s">Aw CHAKRAMANG, chaing ang diah</para>
  <para style="d">Mami dow David kowh meng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 139:1" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, en chaing ang khowk chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:1">now ang lawnguan kowi en tuk bowk khowk.<verse eid="PSA 139:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 139:2" />Ang changah mih maten dow en tuk bowk khowk;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:2">en dow ang tuak mih ün alakma hownia en tuk chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 139:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 139:3" />Ang cham mang mih hai ang tanai mih en khi bowk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:3">ang changah mih lup maten dow en tuk bowk chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 139:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 139:4" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, ang tek lai dowi rawn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:4">tawng chow ang natek kown mih en rik tuk bowk.<verse eid="PSA 139:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 139:5" />Ang hawmlawm lakuai, kung pra pur pra en uowi reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:5">now en kowh kür hown en uang towkala ang reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 139:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 139:6" />Ang lawnguan kowi en tuk mih dow abüpma chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:6">Nami dow ang kowh tukra hown ang nowng um dowi.<verse eid="PSA 139:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 139:7" />En kowh lümla hownia ang nowng powt dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:7">en pur hownia tawng kowi paw ang nowng powt dowi.<verse eid="PSA 139:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 139:8" />Mukuang kowi ang kowpün chepaw nakowi en uowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:8">tadupra kowi ang cham uowi chepaw nakowi paw en uowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 139:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 139:9" />Satlawt prakowi ang cham iow ving chepaw,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:9">satkup pra sata paipra pown kowi ang cham uowi chepaw,<verse eid="PSA 139:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 139:10" />nakowi paw en kowh rut hown en nakrui ang kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:10">en kowh hawmlawm rut hown akhawtma en nadowk reng kown.<verse eid="PSA 139:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 139:11" />“Aiiu mumta ang klum kown chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:11">now ang ria kowi kowh anowi paw naiiu kown chekhai,” pahai ang tek chepaw tawngpaw mrawkra nauowi kown nadowi.<verse eid="PSA 139:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 139:12" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow nami iiu dow en tut-e iiu dowi chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:12">en tut-e dow uar-e paw ni-e iawng anowima tawk pluplup chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:12">now en tut-e dow aiiu hai anowi katsang taih chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 139:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 139:13" />Ang kowh buk kow maiow thawp mih dow en chowtaih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:13">au mu lak kowi en rut hown ang kowh buk en tawng ang khai.<verse eid="PSA 139:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 139:14" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, en chaing ang khowk chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:14">now ang lawnguan kowi en tuk bowk khowk chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 139:14">Awdara uowima hown en thawp ang khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:14">Naiawng rakowi ang kiow en khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 139:14">En kowh lup maten dow awdara uowima kangowh.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:14">Nami dow aiungma ang tuk chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 139:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 139:15" />Miapaw khi-ah dowi mih arah kowi thawp ang reng tak khe ia en khi ang reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:15">naukim kowi ang kowh buk kow awr tarowng phaw khe ia en khi ang reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 139:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 139:16" />En dow ang uang dia dowi rawn hownia khi ang chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:16">ang kowh chownglawng uown tarowng dowi rawn hownia</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:16">ang chownglawng kowi naphaw kown mih maten en kowh chabowih kowi arui uowi bowk chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 139:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 139:17" />Aw Thurai, en kowh taukra dow ang tut-e asung uowima chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:17">Nami dow hu krang nowng rüaah dowi mowr chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 139:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 139:18" />Naiawngün ang rüaah e dow sata pang kowi kowh sema lak-e nahu kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 139:18">Ang rü müi khe paw ang re-e en tawi uowi reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 139:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 139:19" />Aw Thurai, maru ngakuüa kowi en saita bowk kown mih ang nau,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:19">sai maru sak miuüa low, ang hownia alakma kowi powt büa diah.<verse eid="PSA 139:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 139:20" />Ransu-uüa dow saktuak ngak hown en lawnguan kowi tek naklak chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:20">amatni dow en ming rük naklak chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 139:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 139:21" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, sui en miuüa kowi ang suiah dowi pabow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:21">Now kingküa en miuüa kowi ang suiah dowi pabow?<verse eid="PSA 139:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 139:22" />Amatni kowi dow sui chamang ang suiah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:22">amatni kowi dow ang nüla ang kowh ransu reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 139:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 139:23" />Aw Thurai, chaing ang diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:23">now ang kowh saktuak nowkah khaiah diah.<verse eid="PSA 139:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 139:24" />Ang tut-e angak chap uowi khai ne chünchü sam mü madiah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:24">now achowngma kala singra mih tiama kowi krui ang diah.<verse eid="PSA 139:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 139" />
  <chapter number="140" style="c" sid="PSA 140" />
  <para style="s">CHAKRAMANG chowtaih ang kowh Thurai</para>
  <para style="d">Mami dow David kowh meng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 140:1" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, maru ngakuüa rut hownia uang lawng ang diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:1">now chang nowng chang powng miuüa rut hownia uang towkala ang diah.<verse eid="PSA 140:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 140:2" />Amatni dow chang lup ngak kown mih kangowh tuak reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:2">now ni towng maru kowi krawi towk ran reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 140:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 140:3" />Amatni kowh dai dow rua kru uowima mih iawng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:3">now amatni kowh ve krüa kowi dow rua kru iawng akru kangowh chekhai. [Sela]<verse eid="PSA 140:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 140:4" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, maru ngakuüa rut hownia uang towkala ang diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:4">now chang nowng chang powng miuüa rut hownia uang lawng ang diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 140:4">Amatni dow napiak ang kownkow thawp prengia ngak reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 140:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 140:5" />Bawrima miuüa dow ang vüi kowi krawi chak ang leng khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:5">amatni dow ang vüi tiama kowi krawi thang ang powk khai. [Sela]<verse eid="PSA 140:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 140:6" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, “En chowtaih ang kowh Thurai” pami ang tek en khowk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:6">aw CHAKRAMANG, kar se ang awr lü mih hawt sünta ang diah.<verse eid="PSA 140:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 140:7" />Aw CHAKRAMANG Thurai, en dow ang kowh akürma mih lawng miia chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:7">tasen mih khin khe uang towkala ang reng mih dow en chowtaih.<verse eid="PSA 140:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 140:8" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, maru ngakuüa kowh sangkrangra dow hangkow pe tachiah diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:8">amatni naia chang bawri dowi kownkow</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:8">amatni kowh sangkrangra ngak hangkow pe chawnah diah. [Sela]<verse eid="PSA 140:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 140:9" />Ang kowh ransu-uüa kowi hangkow pe awngah diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:9">ang vüi amatni kamrütta mih angak dow amatni luk kowi pe klaah diah.<verse eid="PSA 140:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 140:10" />Amatni luk kowi mairing pacham uang kla lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:10">nowng plai dowi bowt pat kuam abüpma mih kowi kuakah diah.<verse eid="PSA 140:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 140:11" />Dailama miuüa dow hangkow pacham tawi ka powng pren lah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:11">chang nowng chang powng miuüa kowi dow phih pacham krawiah reng lah.<verse eid="PSA 140:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 140:12" />CHAKRAMANG dow maru changah nowng powng miuüa kowi natawi tangila reng kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:12">now ngarawng ngarai miuüa kowi nachet pe tara nowm reng kown pami ang tuk chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 140:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 140:13" />Achinawmma miuüa dow narowsi en ngengche kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:13">now amatni dow en hown natawi taiua uowi reng kown.<verse eid="PSA 140:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 140" />
  <chapter number="141" style="c" sid="PSA 141" />
  <para style="s">Ang natek naklak dowi kownkow khak ang reng diah</para>
  <para style="d">Mami dow David kowh meng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 141:1" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, nauang khowng ang kownkow ang uang haw en khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 141:1">Alenma uang khowng ang diah!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 141:1">Ang haw en mih khin khe ang kowh hawk klow hawt sünta ang diah.<verse eid="PSA 141:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 141:2" />Ang awr lü awr leng mih dow nam iungma mih maikhük iawng en tut-e pacham chowng lah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 141:2">Nami dow sat kowi khe kowh phuchua iawng en tut-e pacham chowng lah.<verse eid="PSA 141:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 141:3" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, ang natek naklak dowi kownkow khak ang reng diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 141:3">ang kowi dow hauang pe tek ang lai ngak diah.<verse eid="PSA 141:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 141:4" />Ang kowh sak kowi dow nachang lup ngak kown mih saktuak hauang pe tingah diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 141:4">now maru ngakuüa kowh chakkham iung paw hauang pe cha ang diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 141:4">Nahanow maru ngakuüa hown ang natawi chang lup ngak kown nadowi bowt.<verse eid="PSA 141:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 141:5" />
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">141:5-7 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Uan kowi kowh laiklow dow Hebrai lai hown chim dowi rakowi akeng Baibul kowi paw alangma kangowh chekhai.</char>
    </note> Ringkaw Thurai mih maru dow saksing sana ang rakowi pacham bawp ang lah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 141:5">Aia nang ang mih dow ang lu kowi phawk ang sau mih iawng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 141:5">Tawkche lup ngak chang miuüa vüi dow naka ripra kownkow ang nachup pe Thurai reng kown.<verse eid="PSA 141:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 141:6" />Amatni kowh pren kruitown miuüa kowi dow alowngma mih hungh hownia naiu kuakta kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 141:6">Nakhowk khe dow ang kowh laiklow aching pami maru natuk bowt kown.<verse eid="PSA 141:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 141:7" />Thawn laih khe laithawn tim thowk lawi hownia bawn awr talowi reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 141:7">nami iawng dow anging kowh hut paw tadupra mowr kowi takuakla pan khai.<verse eid="PSA 141:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 141:8" />Nachenganchepaw aw CHAKRAMANG, ang dow en prakowi tang mü reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 141:8">ang dow en tut-e chowtaih uang tatung tanim reng.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 141:8">Naiawng rakowi hauang pe kowng ang diah.<verse eid="PSA 141:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 141:9" />Ang vüi kowi amatni chakah mih leng hownia uang hen ang diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 141:9">maru ngakuüa chak ang mih leng hownia uang lawng ang diah.<verse eid="PSA 141:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 141:10" />Maru ngakuüa dow amatni matia chakah mih leng kowi pacham tasowk lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 141:10">nahanow athaulangma ang naia mang kown towbowt.<verse eid="PSA 141:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 141" />
  <chapter number="142" style="c" sid="PSA 142" />
  <para style="s">Thurai dow ang kowh tatung tanimra</para>
  <para style="d">Mami dow David kowh meng chekhai. Mami dow puk kowi uowi khe kowh David awr chup Thurai mih meng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 142:1" />Ang dow CHAKRAMANG tut-e atünma ang uang kar khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 142:1">aia nauang saksing sana ang kownkow ang uang lü uang leng khai.<verse eid="PSA 142:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 142:2" />Ang kowh tuak kawm tuak kratra laiklow maten aia pur kowi ang uang tek khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 142:2">ang kowh akrat pusara laiklow maten aia pur kowi ang uang phowk pe khai.<verse eid="PSA 142:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 142:3" />Ang sak nen mih khin khe ang lawnguan kowi en tuk chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 142:3">Maru ngakuüa dow ang manglan kowi ku chak ang leng khai.<verse eid="PSA 142:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 142:4" />Ang ria ang ret kowi ang krawi tang mü khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 142:4">nauang khowng ang kown mih maru amiapaw ang khi dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 142:4">Ang kowh dow nacham powtla kown mih arah uowi dowi bowt chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 142:4">amiapaw nauang lawng ang kown mih tuak dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 142:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 142:5" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, ang dow en tut-e chowtaih uang kar reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 142:5">ang tek mih, “Ang kowh tatung tanimra dow en chowtaih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 142:5">mami lusa kowi ang kowh dawngthawnguan dow en chowtaih,” pakhai.<verse eid="PSA 142:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 142:6" />Ang uang kar mih kowi hawt sünta diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 142:6">tawngplawng kowchow panow ang dow lainowmma ngare khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 142:6">Krawi ang miuüa rut hownia dow lawng ang diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 142:6">Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni dow ang lak-e lang kür chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 142:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 142:7" />Thawngrum kowi cham uowi iawng mih kratra hownia lawng ang diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 142:7">nahanow en ming kowi ang naia tek awmrawm lai kown towbowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 142:7">Thurai kowi ringkaw miuüa dow nauang umta ang lut hanow napiaw kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 142:7">Tawngplawng kowchow panow en dow nape ang iungra kown.<verse eid="PSA 142:7" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 142" />
  <chapter number="143" style="c" sid="PSA 143" />
  <para style="s">Ang kowh sak dow lainowmma sakkrai en khai</para>
  <para style="d">Mami dow David kowh meng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 143:1" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, ang uang lü uang leng mih hawt sünta diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:1">kar se ang uang lü uang leng mih kowi hawt pe param diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 143:1">En kowh kaah sakowmma mih rah hai anowm hown uang klang ang diah.<verse eid="PSA 143:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 143:2" />Ang dow en kowh nar chekhai; hauang chet ang tara diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:2">Tawngplawng kowchow panow en mik kowi dow amiapaw achinawmma nadowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 143:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 143:3" />Ransu-uüa dow uang kawikrawi ang khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:3">amatni dow krawng kowi dita ang naknak khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 143:3">Achük alai khe kowng mih maru-uüa iawng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:3">amatni dow aiiu dawng kowi towta ang hüah khai.<verse eid="PSA 143:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 143:4" />Naiawng rakowi ang dow sak nen khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:4">ang kowh sakkraingra dow tama khai bowt.<verse eid="PSA 143:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 143:5" />Ang dow alai khe kowh lawnguan ang krawi ka tuak khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:5">en changah mih lup lawnguan maten ang krawi tuak khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:5">now en rut hown kowh lup lawnguan kowi ang krawi tuak khai.<verse eid="PSA 143:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 143:6" />En prakowi iawla rut se ang uang lü uang leng khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:6">krawng kangkhawngma mih nau tui iawng ang kowh sak mih sakkrai en khai.<verse eid="PSA 143:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 143:7" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, alenma uang klang ang diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:7">Tawngplawng kowchow panow ang kowh sakowmra chur bowk khowk chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 143:7">Kowng miuüa iawng ang nauowila dowi kownkow</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:7">ang hownia hang cham dangta ang lumowr diah.<verse eid="PSA 143:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 143:8" />Rau towng en kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura laiklow pe sünta ang reng diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 143:8">Tawngplawng kowchow panow ang dow en luk kowi chowtaih neplawng nesak reng;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:8">tawng mih tiama kowi chow namang kown mih uang tüng ang diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 143:8">Tawngplawng kowchow panow ang kowh sak dow en tut-e ang uang ap en khai.<verse eid="PSA 143:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 143:9" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, ransu-uüa rut hownia uang lawng ang diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:9">Tawngplawng kowchow panow ang dow uang tatung tanim kownkow en tut-e uang iowm khai.<verse eid="PSA 143:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 143:10" />En nau iawng nachang lup kown mih sang ang diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:10">Tawngplawng kowchow panow ang kowh Thurai dow en chowtaih.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 143:10">En kowh aiungma mih lümla hown tiama atengma kowi pawla ang diah.<verse eid="PSA 143:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 143:11" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, en kowh ming iung nang iung naia townla reng kownkow pe sing ang diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:11">now krat pusara hownia en kowh iungra hown uang lawng ang diah.<verse eid="PSA 143:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 143:12" />En kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura hown sakrau ang diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:12">ang kowh ransu-uüa kowi piakta diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:12">now amatni kowi mih saita bowk diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 143:12">Tawngplawng kowchow panow ang dow en kowh nar chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 143:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 143" />
  <chapter number="144" style="c" sid="PSA 144" />
  <para style="s">CHAKRAMANG dow ang kowh Singku Huamang hai ang kowh tap</para>
  <para style="d">Mami dow David kowh meng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 144:1" />CHAKRAMANG kowi kiowah diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:1">aia dow ang kowh Singku Huamang chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 144:1">Aia dow sang ang tasen khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:1">aia dow sang ang saidawng dowk khai.<verse eid="PSA 144:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 144:2" />Aia dow ang kowh kaah sakowmma mih khowng mih chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:2">now ang kowh akhawtma mih kangchawngra kim chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 144:2">Aia dow ang kowh alowngma mih tatung tanimra hai lawng miia chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:2">aia dow ang kowh kawngma chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:2">now aia tut-e ang tatung tanim reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 144:2">Aia dow akeng chenchapuüa kowi ang nimkrüa kowi uang pawla reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 144:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 144:3" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, tawngplawng kowchow lusa maru kowi khowt pat en mingkhetah khai?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:3">Tawngplawng kowchow khowt pat lusa maru chauüa kowi en towah sak khai?<verse eid="PSA 144:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 144:4" />Lusa maru dow kawli krowngchow taih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:4">aia kowh chownglawng dow nim tama rürü mih iawng tama reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 144:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 144:5" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, mukuang nitah lang hanow lusa kowi uang iu dowm diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:5">akhük nauang lawt kownkow hungma mawngma kowi uang iu kakah diah.<verse eid="PSA 144:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 144:6" />Ang kowh ransu-uüa kowi uang chin pe pla nowi hanow uang setta plawt diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:6">amatni kowi dow en kowh leba sek hown pe powtah diah.<verse eid="PSA 144:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 144:7" />Mukuang hownia iu towkala ang diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:7">tuikling mangma iawng mih kratra hownia uang pe plai ang diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:7">now akeng chenchapuüa rut hownia uang pe plai ang diah.<verse eid="PSA 144:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 144:8" />Amatni kowh nawr kowi dow dai lai kangowh chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:8">amatni dow hawmlawm rut chawkla se dai lai hown kham sawi reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 144:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 144:9" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, en vüi kowi ang natek en meng sar kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:9">hamüt iang mih tingteng tün hown ang natek en rowsi meng kown.<verse eid="PSA 144:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 144:10" />Manguüa kowi dow en pe awngah tasen reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:10">en kowh nar David kowi dow ransu-uüa kowh saidawng hownia en towkala reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 144:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 144:11" />Akeng chenchapuüa rut hownia uang towkala ang hanow pe plai ang diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 144:11">Amatni kowh nawr kowi dow dai lai kangowh chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:11">amatni dow hawmlawm rut chawkla se dai lai hown kham sawi reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 144:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 144:12" />Anging kowh chapauüa dow ngeuüa hownia akhawtma mih singh pawi iawng pacham iuksown lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:12">now anging kowh chamauüa paw mang kim kowi kowh klangiungma mih kimchüng iawng pacham phaw lah.<verse eid="PSA 144:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 144:13" />Anging kowh cha bawk kowi dow chakkham achap akawm atekma pacham uowi lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:13">anging kowh ruapur hawmh ün paw dowm kowi athawng aiawng pacham pen chah lah.<verse eid="PSA 144:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 144:14" />
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">144:14 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Mami uan kowi kowh laiklow dow Hebrai lai hown chim dowi rakowi akeng Baibul kowi paw alangma kangowh chekhai. </char>
    </note> Anging kowh chiala ün aiuk akauma hai akürma pacham phaw lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:14">naiawngün dow adik adikma mih uanh pacham ia tawn lah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 144:14">Anging kowh tiama lengkawng kowi kar klow nguk klow hangkow pacham ta lah.<verse eid="PSA 144:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 144:15" />Naiawng uowi mih maru-uüa dow prasira uowima chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:15">CHAKRAMANG Thurai kowi owm mih chenchap dow prasira uowima chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 144:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 144" />
  <chapter number="145" style="c" sid="PSA 145" />
  <para style="s">CHAKRAMANG dow kri kraingma</para>
  <para style="d">Mami dow David kowh meng chekhai. Mami dow rowsi meng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 145:1" />Aw ang kowh Thurai, ang kowh mang, en vüi kowi ang natek meng kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:1">chowngchowng saksakma ang natek en rowsi meng kown.<verse eid="PSA 145:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 145:2" />Ang dow ni towng natek en rowsi meng kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:2">now chowngchowng saksakma en ming kowi ang nakiow kown.<verse eid="PSA 145:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 145:3" />CHAKRAMANG dow kri kraingma hai kiowrira kak taing chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:3">aia kowh kri kraingra dow amiapaw nowng tuk dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 145:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 145:4" />En changah mih lup dow krungchak towng amatni kowh chauüa kowi natekla pe kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:4">now en changah mih kri kraingra lup lawnguan kowi amatni dow nacham krawi tek kown.<verse eid="PSA 145:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 145:5" />Ang dow en kowh kraingra hai kiowrira lawnguan kowi nakrawi tuak reng kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:5">now en kowh awdara lup lawnguan kowi paw nakrawi tuak reng kown.<verse eid="PSA 145:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 145:6" />Maru kawmuüa dow en kowh kramra uowi mih lup hai kürra lawnguan nakrawi tek kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:6">now ang dow en kowh kri kraingra ang nakrawi phuang kown.<verse eid="PSA 145:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 145:7" />Amatni dow en kowh iungra lawnguan maten nakrawi tek kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:7">now en achinawmma mih lawnguan kowi natek awmrawm meng büah kown.<verse eid="PSA 145:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 145:8" />CHAKRAMANG dow saksing sana hai pe lawt reng chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:8">aia dow kunmarau naklak dowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:8">now aia kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura dow kri kraingma chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 145:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 145:9" />CHAKRAMANG dow bowkbowk vüi kowi aiungma chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:9">aia dow aia uanh thawp maten luk kowi saksing sana reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 145:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 145:10" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, en thawpah mih uanh maten natek en awmrawm lai kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:10">ringkaw en miuüa maten nakiow en kown.<verse eid="PSA 145:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 145:11" />Amatni dow en pren kri kraing mih lawnguan nalawp kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:11">now en kowh kürra lawnguan natek büah kown.<verse eid="PSA 145:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 145:12" />Nahanow maru-uüa dow en kowh kürra hown en changah mih lup lawnguan natuk kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:12">now en kowh pren kri kraingma mih klangiungra atekma mih amatni natuk kown towbowt.<verse eid="PSA 145:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 145:13" />En kowh pren dow chowngchowng saksakma anikma nauowi reng kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:13">en kowh kruitownra dow chowngchowng saksakma nauowi reng kown.<verse eid="PSA 145:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 145:14" />CHAKRAMANG dow kla phih mih maru kowi lawngah reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:14">now tim mih maru kowi paw aia dow krüngah reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 145:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 145:15" />Maru kawmuüa dow sakowmma hown en prakowi tang mü reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:15">amatni kowi dow akhin now en peah chakkham reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 145:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 145:16" />En dow phat pe rut hanow asak uowi miuüa kowi en peah chakkham reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:16">now amatni kowi dow lakke mih srui peah reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 145:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 145:17" />CHAKRAMANG kowh tiama maten dow anowmma chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:17">now aia dow saksing sanara hown lup maten chang reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 145:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 145:18" />Aia kowi hawah miuüa tut-e dow CHAKRAMANG mih tawi uowila reng;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:18">aia kowi sak hown hawah miuüa tut-e dow atawnchow aia tawi uowila reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 145:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 145:19" />Aia kowi ringkawma hown kram miuüa kowi dow amatni nau mih aia peah reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:19">now amatni uang kar mih klow aia hawt sünta pe hanow aia takhula reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 145:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 145:20" />CHAKRAMANG kowi sakrau miuüa kowi dow aia takhula reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:20">Tawkche maru ngakuüa maten kowi dow aia napiakah kown.<verse eid="PSA 145:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 145:21" />Ang kowh nawr dow CHAKRAMANG kowi narowsi reng kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:21">asak uowi mih maten dow aia ming chimsaima mih kowi chowngchowng saksakma pacham kiow lah.<verse eid="PSA 145:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 145" />
  <chapter number="146" style="c" sid="PSA 146" />
  <para style="s">Maru iukuüa luk kowi hangkow neplawng nesak diah</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 146:1" />CHAKRAMANG kowi kiow büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 146:1">aw ang kowh sak, CHAKRAMANG kowi kiow diah.<verse eid="PSA 146:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 146:2" />Sing uowi sak uowi mowr CHAKRAMANG kowi ang nakiowah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 146:2">ang kowh Thurai kowi dow chownglawng prat ang natek pe rowsi meng kown.<verse eid="PSA 146:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 146:3" />Maru iukuüa luk kowi hang neplawng nesak büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 146:3">amia iawng mih maru luk kowi paw hang neplawng nesak büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 146:3">Tawngplawng kowchow panow naiawngünuüa dow nowng lawng enni dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 146:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 146:4" />Kowng hanow amatni dow tadupra kowi uowi reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 146:4">now amatni kowh sangkrangra maten paw tawi chur reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 146:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 146:5" />Tawkche Jakawb kowh Thurai khowngah reng miuüa dow prasira uowima chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 146:5">aia kowh CHAKRAMANG Thurai luk kowi owmsak miuüa dow prasira uowima chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 146:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 146:6" />CHAKRAMANG dow mukuang hai lusa thawpah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 146:6">now sata hai sata kowi kowh uowi mih maten paw aia thawpah khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 146:6">Aia dow chowngchowng saksakma kaah sakowmma hai uowi reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 146:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 146:7" />Maru changah anowng apowng miuüa kowi aia chet pe tara nowm reng;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 146:7">sakkrai miuüa kowi dow aia peah chakkham reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 146:7" />
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 146:7">Nar kowi takhang miuüa kowi dow CHAKRAMANG lawngah reng chekhai,<verse eid="PSA 146:7" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 146:8" />aia dow mik duma miuüa kowi pe khi-ah reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 146:8">Aia dow tatheu miuüa kowi krüngah reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 146:8">now achinawmma miuüa kowi dow aia sakrauah reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 146:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 146:9" />CHAKRAMANG dow anging pren kowi kowh uowi mih prenlang maru-uüa kowi lawngah reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 146:9">now saratchowuüa hai mamaimowuüa kowi dow aia mingkhetah reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 146:9">Tawkche maru ngakuüa kowi dow aia piakah reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 146:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 146:10" />CHAKRAMANG dow chowngchowng saksakma nachowm mang reng kown,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 146:10">aw Zaiawn, en kowh Thurai dow chowngchowng saksakma nachowm mang reng kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 146:10">CHAKRAMANG kowi kiow büa diah.<verse eid="PSA 146:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 146" />
  <chapter number="147" style="c" sid="PSA 147" />
  <para style="s">CHAKRAMANG dow sak piak miuüa kowi peah iungra reng</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 147:1" />CHAKRAMANG kowi kiow büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 147:1">A-i kowh Thurai kiow meng tek dow lainowmma iung chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:1">aia kowi nakiowah kown mih lainowmma tataing khai.<verse eid="PSA 147:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 147:2" />CHAKRAMANG dow Jerusalem marow mih plan thawpah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:2">now cham taset plawt mih Israeluüa kowi dow nami marow kowi aia uang plan kuala khai.<verse eid="PSA 147:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 147:3" />Sak piakma miuüa kowi dow aia peah iungra reng chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:3">amatni kowh ma dow aia bawm pe reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 147:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 147:4" />Aia dow krek ün rüaah reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:4">naiawngün krek kowi dow aia chap pe ming reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 147:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 147:5" />Anging kowh CHAKRAMANG dow kri kraingma hai akürma chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:5">aia kowh chanlaira dow achur uowi dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 147:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 147:6" />CHAKRAMANG dow khamsum khamdaw miuüa kowi khowngah reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:6">Tawkche maru ngakuüa kowi dow bawn dawng kowi aia theuah reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 147:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 147:7" />CHAKRAMANG vüi kowi tek awmrawm meng büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:7">tepla taraw se a-i kowh Thurai vüi kowi tek rowsi meng büa diah.<verse eid="PSA 147:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 147:8" />Aia dow uangnim hown mukuang kowi tungah reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:8">lusa kowi dow aia uang chin pe uang reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 147:8">Now krawng luk kowi dow pram aia awr pe awmah reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 147:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 147:9" />Aia dow tawncher hawmh kowi peah chakkham reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:9">uaak chauüa lü chakkham khe paw aia peah chakkham reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 147:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 147:10" />Kawrnga akürma mih kowi dow aia awmrawm dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:10">siphai khawk akürma mih kowi paw aia awmrawm dowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 147:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 147:11" />Aia dow aia kowi ringkawma hown kram miuüa kowi chowtaih awmrawm reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:11">aia kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura luk kowi owmsak miuüa kowi chowtaih aia awmrawm reng.<verse eid="PSA 147:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 147:12" />Aw Jerusalem, CHAKRAMANG rowsi meng tek diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:12">aw Zaiawn, en kowh Thurai kowi kiow diah.<verse eid="PSA 147:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 147:13" />Aia dow en kowh tapplawt aklia müa kowi ün akhawtma changah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:13">en marow kowi kowh uowi miuüa kowi dow en peah prasi khai.<verse eid="PSA 147:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 147:14" />En kowh rihi ün kowi aia dow thaulangma towah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:14">now aia dow lang iung mih chakkham hown pe en sak-ihra khai.<verse eid="PSA 147:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 147:15" />Aia dow lusa kowi uang chin ana khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:15">nami ana dow lusa mih alenma chünah khai.<verse eid="PSA 147:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 147:16" />Aia dow ruapur pawi iawng nangkhe uang pe klaah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:16">nami nang dow plawi iawng aia krawi uetah khai.<verse eid="PSA 147:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 147:17" />Aia dow ria klu mih kawmpah sek iawng uang pe klaah khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:17">aia kowh arua kowi amia chow nowng kham?<verse eid="PSA 147:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 147:18" />Aia kowh ana pek hown ria klu ter reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:18">aia uang chin li now nami ria tui dow hawr reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 147:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 147:19" />Aia kowh laiklow dow Jakawb tut-e aia phuangah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:19">now aia kowh ari arow hai ari aiang dow Israel tut-e aia uang phuangah khai.<verse eid="PSA 147:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 147:20" />Aia dow akeng chenchap vüi kowi naiawng chang pe dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:20">amatni dow aia kowh ari arow tuk dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 147:20">CHAKRAMANG kowi kiow büa diah.<verse eid="PSA 147:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 147" />
  <chapter number="148" style="c" sid="PSA 148" />
  <para style="s">Uanh thawp maiow CHAKRAMANG kowi kiowah diah</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 148:1" />CHAKRAMANG kowi kiow büa diah.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 148:1" />
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 148:1">Mukuang hownia CHAKRAMANG kowi kiow büa diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 148:1">kuang dawng kowi hai kuang luk kowi aia kowi kiowah büa diah.<verse eid="PSA 148:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 148:2" />Aw aia kowh kramamu maten, aia kowi kiowah büa diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 148:2">aw aia kowh akürma mih thumchak, aia kowi kiowah büa diah.<verse eid="PSA 148:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 148:3" />Aw sat hai lama, aia kowi kiowah büa diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 148:3">aw krek maten, aia kowi kiowah büa diah.<verse eid="PSA 148:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 148:4" />Aw mukuang pren, aia kowi kiowah diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 148:4">aw kuang luk kowi kowh tui, aia kowi kiowah diah.<verse eid="PSA 148:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 148:5" />Amatni dow bowkbowk CHAKRAMANG kowi pacham kiowah lah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 148:5">Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni dow aia pe ana hanow phaw mih chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 148:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 148:6" />Amatni kowi dow chowngchowng saksakma vüi atowk rah kowi towah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 148:6">aia thawpta mih rirow kowi dow miapaw nowng piak dowi bowt chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 148:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 148:7" />Lusa hownia CHAKRAMANG kowi kiow büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 148:7">sata hai sata thingh kowi kowh uowi miuüa low, aia kowi kiowah büa diah.<verse eid="PSA 148:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 148:8" />Aw pla, ria, nangkhe hai mai, CHAKRAMANG kowi kiow büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 148:8">now aia ana pek chün mih li paw aia kowi kiow diah.<verse eid="PSA 148:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 148:9" />Aw hungma mawngma hai uih mih singh hown sidar singh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 148:9">CHAKRAMANG kowi kiow büa diah.<verse eid="PSA 148:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 148:10" />Aw kaurawng uaramchak hai tawnah mih asadua</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 148:10">CHAKRAMANG kowi kiow büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 148:10">Kam hai sowr mih hown alap uowi miuüa paw</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 148:10">CHAKRAMANG kowi kiow büa diah.<verse eid="PSA 148:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 148:11" />Lusa kowi kowh manguüa hai chenchap kruitown miuüa low,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 148:11">CHAKRAMANG kowi kiow büa diah.<verse eid="PSA 148:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 148:12" />Aw malauüa klanguüa hai lawngtang ngeuüa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 148:12">CHAKRAMANG kowi kiow büa diah.<verse eid="PSA 148:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 148:13" />Amatni dow bowkbowk CHAKRAMANG kowi pacham kiowah lah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 148:13">Tawngplawng kowchow panow lang kri lang kraing mih dow aia chowtaih.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 148:13">Aia kowh dow mukuang hai lusa kowi rowsira uowi chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 148:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 148:14" />Aia dow aia maru-uüa kowi akürma changah khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 148:14">naiawng rakowi amatni dow aia kowi kiowah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 148:14">aia lang sakrauah mih chenchap Israeluüa dow aia kowi kiowah khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 148:14">CHAKRAMANG kowi kiow büa diah.<verse eid="PSA 148:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 148" />
  <chapter number="149" style="c" sid="PSA 149" />
  <para style="s">CHAKRAMANG vüi tek meng sar diah</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 149:1" />CHAKRAMANG kowi kiow büa diah.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 149:1" />
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 149:1">CHAKRAMANG vüi tek meng sar büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 149:1">aia kowh maru-uüa takua talawm khe aia rowsi meng tek büa diah.<verse eid="PSA 149:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 149:2" />Israel dow aia kowi kowh thawpah mih kowi pacham awmrawmah lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 149:2">Zaiawn maru-uüa dow amatni kowh mang kowi pacham awmrawmah lah.<verse eid="PSA 149:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 149:3" />Amatni dow plai se plai se aia kowi pacham kiowah lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 149:3">sawkchow hai taraw tün hown aia vüi pacham tek rowsi meng büah lah.<verse eid="PSA 149:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 149:4" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow CHAKRAMANG dow aia maru-uüa kowi awmrawmah reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 149:4">now khamsum khamdaw miuüa kowi lawngah hanow aia peah ringkawra reng chekhai.<verse eid="PSA 149:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 149:5" />Naiawng ka ringkaw rakowi aia maru-uüa dow pacham awmrawm lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 149:5">phangbek kowi mawk khe paw amatni dow pacham tek awmrawm meng lah.<verse eid="PSA 149:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 149:6" />Amatni nawr kowi dow Thurai kiow meng pacham uowi lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 149:6">now amatni rut kowi dow achukma mih bürdawng sarai pacham uowi lah.<verse eid="PSA 149:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 149:7" />Nahanow akeng chenchapuüa kowi amatni naia sat klai kown towbowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 149:7">naiawngün chenchapuüa kowi amatni naia ripah kown towbowt,<verse eid="PSA 149:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 149:8" />naiawngün manguüa kowi naia khuowkah büah kown towbowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 149:8">naiawngün maru iukuüa kowi lawngha leng hown naia tawmah büah kown towbowt,<verse eid="PSA 149:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 149:9" />now Thurai kowh ana iawng amatni kowi naia ripah kown towbowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 149:9">Naiawngün dow aia kowi kowh ringkaw miuüa kowh kiowrira chekhai.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 149:9" />
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 149:9">CHAKRAMANG kowi kiow büa diah.<verse eid="PSA 149:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 149" />
  <chapter number="150" style="c" sid="PSA 150" />
  <para style="s">Hü sak mih maten CHAKRAMANG kowi kiow diah</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 150:1" />CHAKRAMANG kowi kiow büa diah.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 150:1" />
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 150:1">Thurai chup kim chimsaima mih kowi aia kowi kiowah diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 150:1">aia kür hown thawpah mih mukuang kowi aia kowi kiowah diah.<verse eid="PSA 150:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 150:2" />Aia kowh kri kraingma mih lup rakowi aia kowi kiowah diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 150:2">aia kowh nowngia tukah dowi mih kri kraingra kowi kiowah diah.<verse eid="PSA 150:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 150:3" />Baw tün hown aia kowi kiowah diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 150:3">tingteng hai taraw tün hown aia kowi kiowah diah.<verse eid="PSA 150:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 150:4" />Sawkchow tün hown plai se plai se aia kowi kiowah diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 150:4">tingteng hai prui tün hown aia kowi kiowah diah.<verse eid="PSA 150:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 150:5" />Klingchow tün hown atünma aia kowi kiowah diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 150:5">sawkchow langkhuang tün hown aia kowi kiowah diah.<verse eid="PSA 150:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 150:6" />Hü sak mih maten CHAKRAMANG kowi kiow diah.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 150:6" />
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 150:6">CHAKRAMANG kowi kiow büa diah.<verse eid="PSA 150:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 150" />
</usx>